window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df02"]={"id": "df02", "title": "Itô 积分与 Itô 引理", "focus": "从二次变差出发建立 Itô 积分，证明一维与多维 Itô 引理，区分 Itô 与 Stratonovich 积分，给出 SDE 强解/弱解的存在唯一性条件。", "claims": ["\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})", "df(X_t)=\\left(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\right)dt+f_xg\\,dW_t", "\\text{Stratonovich 与 Itô 差 }\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg"], "topics": ["Itô 积分的定义", "Itô 引理的一维推导", "多维 Itô 引理", "Stratonovich 积分与修正项", "二次变差", "SDE 的强解与弱解", "存在唯一性：Lipschitz 与增长条件", "Girsanov 定理", "鞅表示与测度变换", "反例：不满足 Lipschitz 的解爆炸", "数值离散：Euler–Maruyama", "强收敛与弱收敛阶", "代码：Itô 引理的数值验证", "代码：Euler–Maruyama 的收敛阶", "与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口", "本章推导链：随机微积分的两条积分"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df02--h-Itô-积分的定义\">Itô 积分的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Itô-积分的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接本章开篇，尚无前序节可依赖，故须先固定全部符号。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件（右连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_0$</span> 含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-零集）的滤过概率空间。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为一维标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-布朗运动，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_0=0$</span>，增量独立、平稳、<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t-W_s\\sim N(0,t-s)$</span>，且样本轨道连续。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 的有限分割，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。对随机过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=(H_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span>，记其初等过程类如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（初等过程）.</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为初等过程，若存在分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>-可测的有界随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span>，使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_s=\\xi_i,\\qquad s\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}).$$</div></p>\n<p>对初等过程定义 Itô 积分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s:=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\xi_i\\,(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}).$$</div></p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是把这个定义从初等过程扩张到更广的可料过程类，并证明扩张后的积分具有鞅性与等距性。以下假设贯穿全节，除特别声明外不再重复。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可料（predictable），即作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,\\omega)\\mapsto H_s(\\omega)$</span> 的映射关于可料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P=\\sigma(\\text{左连续适应过程})$</span> 可测。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 对初等过程的逼近，取分割序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(m)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi^{(m)}\\|\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p>需要强调定义与相邻概念的区别：Riemann–Stieltjes 积分以被积函数在分割点右端取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum H_{t_{i+1}}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 为极限，而 Itô 积分取左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i}$</span>。二者对布朗运动一般不等，差别正是二次变差效应的来源（见本章第 4、5 节）。本节只建立左端取值的积分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-从初等过程到-L-2-的等距扩张\">从初等过程到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 的等距扩张<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-从初等过程到-L-2-的等距扩张\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（初等过程的 Itô 等距）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为初等过程且满足 (A2)，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big(\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s\\Big)^2\\Big]=\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\xi_i\\Delta W_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>。展开\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I^2=\\sum_i\\xi_i^2(\\Delta W_i)^2+2\\sum_{i&lt;j}\\xi_i\\xi_j\\Delta W_i\\Delta W_j.$$</div>\n对交叉项取期望：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;j$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i\\xi_j\\Delta W_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_j}$</span>-可测的，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_j}$</span> 独立且均值为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\xi_i\\xi_j\\Delta W_i\\Delta W_j]=0$</span>。对对角项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i^2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>-可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 与之独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W_i)^2]=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\xi_i^2(\\Delta W_i)^2]=\\mathbb E[\\xi_i^2](t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[I^2]=\\sum_i\\mathbb E[\\xi_i^2](t_{i+1}-t_i)=\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（零均值与鞅性）.</strong> 在命题 1 假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=0$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t:=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span> 是鞅。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 零均值由命题 1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 后开方前的线性性直接得到（或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 逐项取期望，每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\xi_i]\\mathbb E[\\Delta W_i]=0$</span>）。鞅性：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 落在某分割区间，利用增量独立性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>-可测性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[M_t-M_s\\mid\\mathcal F_s]=0$</span> 逐项成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>现在做扩张。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 为满足 (A1)(A2) 的过程类，配以范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|H\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}^2=\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。命题 1 说明初等过程上的积分映射是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中的等距。标准事实是初等过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 中稠密（用左连续适应过程的单调类论证与有界逼近）。于是该等距映射唯一地延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2\\to L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 的等距算子，此即 Itô 积分。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下的 Itô 积分）.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span>，取初等过程列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|H-H^{(m)}\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}\\to0$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s:=\\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\\int_0^t H^{(m)}_s\\,dW_s\\quad\\text{（$L^2(\\Omega)$ 极限）}.$$</div>\n由等距性，该极限与逼近列的选取无关：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)},H^{(m)'}$</span> 均逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\int H^{(m)}-\\int H^{(m)'}\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|H^{(m)}-H^{(m)'}\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（等距性延拓）.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span>，定义 2 的积分满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big(\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s\\Big)^2\\Big]=\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\int H)^2]=\\lim_m\\mathbb E[(\\int H^{(m)})^2]=\\lim_m\\mathbb E\\int (H^{(m)})^2=\\mathbb E\\int H^2$</span>，其中第一个等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数连续性，第二个用命题 1，第三个用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}$</span> 收敛。零均值同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-与分割和极限的相容性\">与分割和极限的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与分割和极限的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 要求积分等于分割和的极限。下面把这一点写成命题，并显式给出收敛模式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（分割和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span> 且样本轨道关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续（或更弱：Riemann 可积），对任意分割序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(m)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi^{(m)}\\|\\to0$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_m:=\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}),$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_m\\to\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_m$</span> 是初等过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde H^{(m)}_s=\\sum_i H_{t_i}\\mathbf 1_{[t_i,t_{i+1})}(s)$</span> 的积分。故只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde H^{(m)}-H\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}\\to0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(\\tilde H^{(m)}_s-H_s)^2\\,ds\\to0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 轨道 Riemann 可积且 (A2)，逐轨道有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(\\tilde H^{(m)}_s-H_s)^2\\,ds\\to0$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde H^{(m)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的平方均被可积控制（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_s H_s^2$</span> 未必可积，此时用截断论证：先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\wedge N$</span> 证，再用 (A2) 作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int(H-H\\wedge N)^2\\to0$</span> 的尾部估计）。由控制收敛定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 收敛，再由定义 2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 若仅假设 (A1)(A2) 而不假设轨道连续，命题 3 的逐轨道 Riemann 可积性可能失效；此时结论应理解为沿满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi^{(m)}\\|\\to0$</span> 且分割点避开的序列的子列收敛。完整边界情形归入本章第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的例子\">一个可检验的例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=W_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。验证\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t W_s\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12 W_t^2-\\tfrac12 t.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>验证.</strong> 取等距分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=it/n$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_n=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}W_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}).$$</div>\n利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})=\\tfrac12(W_{t_{i+1}}^2-W_{t_i}^2)-\\tfrac12(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2$</span>，求和得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_n=\\tfrac12 W_t^2-\\tfrac12\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}(\\Delta W_i)^2.$$</div>\n由布朗运动的二次变差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2\\to t$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>（本章第 5 节将给出完整证明；此处作为已知极限引用其结论）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n\\to\\tfrac12W_t^2-\\tfrac12 t$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>，与命题 3 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时显示：若误用右端取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum W_{t_{i+1}}\\Delta W_i$</span>，极限将是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12W_t^2+\\tfrac12t$</span>，与左端结果相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。这一差别在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=W_s$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2/2$</span> 时恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的 Stratonovich 修正项的特例（见本章第 4 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-可积性假设的必要性\">可积性假设的必要性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-可积性假设的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1、2 的等距性依赖 (A2)。若仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty)=1$</span> 而无平方可积，则积分只能定义为局部鞅意义下的极限，等距性须换成停时局部化：存在停时列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\mathbf 1_{[0,\\tau_k]}\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span>。这一扩张的标准构造留至本章第 6 节与第 9 节处理；本节只在 (A2) 下工作，以保证所有期望运算合法。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Itô 积分先在初等过程上以左端点取值定义，命题 1 证明其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等距性，再经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 稠密性唯一延拓为满足 (A1)(A2) 的可料过程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 极限，定义与逼近列选取无关。</li>\n<li>命题 3 给出 canonical claim 的精确含义：分割和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛到 Itô 积分，收敛模式与轨道 Riemann 可积性假设均已显式写出。</li>\n<li>例 1 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t W_s\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12W_t^2-\\tfrac12t$</span> 验证定义并对照右端取值，指出左端与右端取值之差正是二次变差效应的来源，为本章第 4、5 节的 Stratonovich 修正与二次变差讨论埋下接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-局部化与停时扩张\">局部化与停时扩张<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-局部化与停时扩张\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节末指出，(A2) 的平方可积性是等距性成立的关键。然而生成动力学中出现的被积过程往往只满足几乎必然可积，例如扩散系数在状态空间上无界时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=g(X_s)$</span> 的平方期望可能发散。本节给出从 (A2) 到几乎必然可积的局部化扩张，使 Itô 积分在更广的类上有定义，同时保留鞅性的局部版本。这一构造是本章第 6 节强解定义与第 9 节鞅表示的公共基础。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（局部化停时列）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可料且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P\\big(\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty\\big)=1$</span>。称停时列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_k)_{k\\ge1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的局部化列，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 几乎必然，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_k}H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（局部化列的存在性）.</strong> 在上述假设下，存在局部化列。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=\\inf\\{s\\ge0:\\int_0^s H_u^2\\,du\\ge k\\}\\wedge t$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\varnothing=t$</span>）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可料，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^sH_u^2\\,du$</span> 适应且连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 为停时。由几乎必然可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\uparrow t$</span> 几乎必然。又\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_k}H_s^2\\,ds=\\mathbb E\\int_0^{\\tau_k}H_s^2\\,ds\\le k,$$</div>\n最后一个不等号因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的定义保证积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 前不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 为局部化列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定义 4（局部 Itô 积分）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可料且几乎必然平方可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_k)$</span> 为其局部化列。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s:=\\lim_{k\\to\\infty}\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_k}H_s\\,dW_s\\quad\\text{（几乎必然极限）},$$</div>\n其中右端每个积分由定义 2 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 中定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（局部积分的一致性与局部鞅性）.</strong> 定义 4 的极限几乎必然存在，且与局部化列的选取无关；所得过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span> 是局部鞅，其局部化列可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{t\\wedge\\tau_k}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 一致性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_k),(\\sigma_k)$</span> 为两个局部化列。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k=\\tau_k\\wedge\\sigma_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k\\uparrow\\infty$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le l$</span>，在事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t\\le\\rho_k\\}$</span> 上，两个截断积分相等，因为二者都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\rho_k}H_s\\,dW_s$</span>（由定义 2 对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 过程的唯一性）。故极限沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_k$</span> 一致，从而两列给出同一几乎必然极限。局部鞅性：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{(k)}_t:=\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_k}H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 是鞅（命题 2 与推论 1），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{t\\wedge\\tau_k}=M^{(k)}_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 被鞅列局部化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 4 的局部鞅性不能升级为鞅性，除非额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。本章第 10 节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s$</span> 使局部鞅非鞅的具体构造，说明该区别在解爆炸分析中不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-积分的线性性与可加性\">积分的线性性与可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-积分的线性性与可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>下面两条性质在后续 Itô 引理的推导中被反复调用，故在此显式陈述并证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（线性性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,G$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha H+\\beta G$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2)，且对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t(\\alpha H_s+\\beta G_s)\\,dW_s=\\alpha\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s+\\beta\\int_0^tG_s\\,dW_s.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 可料性与平方可积性对线性组合封闭，显然。取初等过程列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)}\\to H$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{(m)}\\to G$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha H^{(m)}+\\beta G^{(m)}\\to\\alpha H+\\beta G$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span>（三角不等式）。对初等过程，线性性由有限和逐项成立。由定义 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 连续性，两端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中收敛到相应积分，故等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下成立，从而几乎必然成立（取子列）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（区间可加性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tH_u\\,dW_u=\\int_0^sH_u\\,dW_u+\\int_s^tH_u\\,dW_u\\quad\\text{几乎必然}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对初等过程，将分割在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处细分即得逐项可加性。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，取初等逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)}$</span>，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^tH^{(m)}\\,dW$</span> 对应截断过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)}\\mathbf 1_{[s,t]}$</span>，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 中收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\mathbf 1_{[s,t]}$</span>。由定义 2 与线性性，两端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛到相应积分，故几乎必然相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 是本章第 2 节一维 Itô 引理证明中“把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 分成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,s]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 两段分别展开”的合法性依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-与二次变差的接口-一个恒等式\">与二次变差的接口：一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与二次变差的接口-一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 的第二个公式将在本章第 2 节证明，但其核心恒等式可在本节先行建立，因为它只用到 Itô 积分的定义与二次变差的基本性质。这一恒等式把 Itô 积分与二次变差直接联系起来，是理解左端取值与右端取值差异的代数根源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（分部积分恒等式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,G$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2)，且样本轨道连续。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_tG_t-H_0G_0=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dG_s+\\int_0^tG_s\\,dH_s+\\langle H,G\\rangle_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle H,G\\rangle_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,G$</span> 的联合二次变差，定义为分割和下几乎必然极限\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle H,G\\rangle_t:=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i(H_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i})(G_{t_{i+1}}-G_{t_i}).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，写 telescoping 恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_tG_t-H_0G_0=\\sum_i\\big(H_{t_{i+1}}G_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i}G_{t_i}\\big).$$</div>\n对每项作代数分解\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{t_{i+1}}G_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i}G_{t_i}=H_{t_i}(G_{t_{i+1}}-G_{t_i})+G_{t_i}(H_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i})+(H_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i})(G_{t_{i+1}}-G_{t_i}).$$</div>\n求和，前两项分别是左端取值的分割和，由命题 3 分别收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int H\\,dG$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int G\\,dH$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,G$</span> 轨道连续以保证 Riemann 可积性）；第三项按定义收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle H,G\\rangle_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=W$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2) 且轨道连续，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_tW_t-H_0W_0=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tW_s\\,dH_s+\\langle H,W\\rangle_t.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=W_s$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W,W\\rangle_t=t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12W_t^2-\\tfrac12t$</span>，与例 1 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式由命题 7 直接得到。第二式：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=G=W$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W,W\\rangle_t=t$</span>（本章第 5 节将证明），代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t^2=\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s+t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12W_t^2-\\tfrac12t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 显示：例 1 中左端与右端取值之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W,W\\rangle_t$</span>。这正是 Itô 积分与 Riemann–Stieltjes 积分分道扬镳的代数位置，也是本章第 4 节 Stratonovich 修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的来源。命题 7 因此构成本节与后续各节的接口：第 2 节的 Itô 引理本质上是命题 7 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=f(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为时间函数时的特化；第 4 节的 Stratonovich 积分则是把命题 7 中的二次变差项吸收进被积函数取值方式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-可料性假设的必要性-一个对照\">可料性假设的必要性：一个对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-可料性假设的必要性-一个对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A1) 的可料性假设在定义 2 中不可省略。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 仅适应而不可料，则分割和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限可能不存在，或存在但依赖于分割的选取方式。下面给出一个对照构造，说明可料性在何处被使用。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\operatorname{sgn}(W_s-W_{s-\\delta})$</span> 对某固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{s-\\delta}:=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应但一般不可料（因它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{s-\\delta}$</span>，而可料过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 之前的信息，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s-\\delta&lt;s$</span> 故实际可料；真正不可料的例子需依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_s$</span> 本身，见下）。</p>\n<p><strong>修正.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\operatorname{sgn}(W_s)$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{sgn}(0)=0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应但不可料，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{H_s=1\\}=\\{W_s&gt;0\\}$</span> 不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{s-}$</span>。对等距分割，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限存在（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 轨道分段常值且平方可积），但其值依赖于分割点是否落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的零点两侧，不同分割序列可给出不同极限。这说明定义 2 的“与逼近列选取无关”在不可料情形下失效。</p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 例 2 的完整构造与收敛性分析归入本章第 10 节；此处只作对照，说明 (A1) 在定义 2 的唯一性论证中不可去除。可料性是 Itô 积分作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等距算子的定义域的自然边界，也是本章第 9 节鞅表示定理中“可料被积函数”假设的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-小结性命题-定义-2-的完备性\">小结性命题：定义 2 的完备性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-小结性命题-定义-2-的完备性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个技术性命题，确认定义 2 给出的积分作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2\\to L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 的算子确实是完备的等距同构到其像上。这一命题在本章第 6 节构造强解时用于验证积分方程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（等距算子的完备性）.</strong> 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I:\\mathcal H^2\\to L^2(\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\mapsto\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span>，是良定义的线性等距算子；其像在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中闭，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 与其像的等距同构。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 良定义与线性由定义 2 与命题 5。等距由命题 2。像的闭性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(H^{(m)})\\to Y$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>。由等距性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|H^{(m)}-H^{(l)}\\|_{\\mathcal H^2}=\\|I(H^{(m)})-I(H^{(l)})\\|_{L^2}\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(m)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 中的 Cauchy 列，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 完备（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2([0,t]\\times\\Omega)$</span> 的子空间）收敛到某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span>。再由等距性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(H^{(m)})\\to I(H)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=I(H)$</span>，像闭。等距同构由等距性与线性直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的完备性在后续被用于把 SDE 的积分方程写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2$</span> 上的不动点问题：本章第 7 节的 Lipschitz 条件下，Picard 迭代的收敛性正是命题 8 与压缩映射原理的结合。至此，本节对 Itô 积分的定义、扩张、性质与接口的讨论闭合；下一节将在命题 7 的恒等式基础上，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t)$</span> 作二阶 Taylor 展开并取极限，得到 canonical claim 的第二个公式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-定义-2-与右端取值积分的对照\">定义 2 与右端取值积分的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-定义-2-与右端取值积分的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 只规定了左端取值的积分。为使定义 2 的“左端”选择有明确的对照对象，下面把右端取值积分单独定义，并证明二者之差恰为二次变差的一个可积项。这一对照在后续 Stratonovich 修正项的推导中被直接调用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5（右端取值积分）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为初等过程，分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>-可测有界随机变量且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\xi_i$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s:=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\xi_{i+1}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_{i+1}$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{i+1},t_{i+2})$</span> 上的值（末项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_n$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在最后区间上的值）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（左右端取值之差）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为初等过程，满足 (A2)，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tH_s\\circ dW_s-\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}(\\xi_{i+1}-\\xi_i)(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}),$$</div>\n且右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle H,W\\rangle_t$</span> 的相应离散化；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=W_s$</span> 时，该差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 逐项相减即得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=W_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i=W_{t_i}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_{i+1}=W_{t_{i+1}}$</span>，故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2$</span>，由二次变差收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（本章第 5 节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：定义 2 的左端取值并非任意约定，而是与右端取值相差一个由二次变差贡献的项；该项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时不消失，因此左右端积分一般不等。这正是 Itô 积分与 Stratonovich 积分（本章第 4 节）的分野，也是 canonical claim 第三个公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的代数来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-积分作为随机场的连续性\">积分作为随机场的连续性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-积分作为随机场的连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续第 2 节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t)$</span> 作 Taylor 展开时，需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span> 看作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数并讨论其连续性。下面给出这一连续性，作为定义 2 的一个推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（积分轨道的连续性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2$</span>，则过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span> 存在一个几乎必然连续的修正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 2 的等距性，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[(M_t-M_s)^2\\big]=\\mathbb E\\int_s^tH_u^2\\,du.$$</div>\n由 (A2)，右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s\\to0$</span> 时趋于零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH_u^2\\,du$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 绝对连续）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中一致连续。取等距分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=it/n$</span>，由 Doob 极大不等式与等距性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le i\\le n}(M_{t_{i+1}}-M_{t_i})^2\\Big]\\le 4\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\big[(M_{t_{i+1}}-M_{t_i})^2\\big]=4\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^tH_u^2\\,du&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>，由 Borel–Cantelli 沿子列得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在分割点上一致连续；再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在区间内的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 连续性插值，得几乎必然连续修正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 是本章第 2 节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t)$</span> 的展开写成积分形式并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导的合法性依据；没有轨道连续性，Taylor 展开的余项无法在分割极限下控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个显式的非初等可积过程\">一个显式的非初等可积过程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个显式的非初等可积过程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使定义 2 的扩张不只是抽象存在，下面给出一个非初等但满足 (A1)(A2) 的过程，并显式计算其积分，验证定义 2 与命题 3 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>例 3.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\mathbf 1_{\\{W_s&gt;0\\}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 满足 (A1)(A2)，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t\\mathbf 1_{\\{W_s&gt;0\\}}\\,dW_s=\\max(W_t,0)-\\tfrac12 L_t^0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 在零点的局部时。</p>\n<p><strong>验证.</strong> (A1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{W_s&gt;0\\}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_s$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 轨道右连续，故可料。(A2)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s^2=H_s\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds\\le t&lt;\\infty$</span>。取分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_m=\\sum_i\\mathbf 1_{\\{W_{t_i}&gt;0\\}}\\Delta W_i$</span>。由 Tanaka 公式（本章第 5 节将给出其二次变差证明），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(W_t,0)=\\int_0^t\\mathbf 1_{\\{W_s&gt;0\\}}\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12L_t^0$</span>，移项即得所示等式。此例同时说明：即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 轨道不连续（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的零点处跳变），只要可料且平方可积，定义 2 仍给出良定义的积分；命题 3 的轨道 Riemann 可积性假设在此不满足，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛仍由可料性与平方可积性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>例 3 是本章第 4 节 Stratonovich 修正项在指示函数情形下的具体形态：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1_{\\{W_s&gt;0\\}}$</span> 的跳变点集恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的零点集，其局部时正是修正项的密度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-Itô-引理的一维推导\">Itô 引理的一维推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Itô-引理的一维推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接第 1 节已建立的 Itô 积分定义。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},(\\mathcal{F}_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤波概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为其上的标准一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>-布朗运动。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=T\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的划分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入并固定以下符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为 Borel 可测函数，分别称为漂移系数与扩散系数；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>-适应的连续半鞅，满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^t g(X_s)\\,dW_s,\\qquad t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t b(X_s)\\,ds$</span> 为路径连续的 Lebesgue 积分（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T|b(X_s)|\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t g(X_s)\\,dW_s$</span> 为第 1 节定义的 Itô 积分（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T g(X_s)^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$f:[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}$</span> 上存在且连续；并存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&gt;0$</span> 使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)\\in[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|f(t,x)|+|f_t(t,x)|+|f_x(t,x)|+|f_{xx}(t,x)|\\le C_f(1+|x|^2).$$</div>\n该多项式增长条件用于控制余项的一致可积性（见下文引理 2.2 的证明）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心对象是复合过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=f(t,X_t)$</span>。目标是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dY_t$</span> 的 Itô 展开。证明路线为：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f(t_i,X_{t_i})$</span> 作二阶 Taylor 展开，对展开中的各项分别取和并取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span>；其中一阶项收敛到 Lebesgue 积分与 Itô 积分，二阶项因 Brownian 增量的二次变差而留下非平凡的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 修正。全部收敛性论证依赖三个工具：Taylor 余项的一致估计、Brownian 二次变差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛（第 5 节将系统展开，本节只引用其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛这一结论并在引理 2.2 中给出所需估计）、以及 Itô 积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等距。</p>\n<p><strong>区别说明。</strong> Itô 引理与经典链式法则的区别仅在于二阶项：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为有界变差过程，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})(X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i})^2\\to0$</span>，链式法则退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$df=f_t\\,dt+f_x\\,dX_t$</span>；对半鞅，该和收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t f_{xx}(s,X_s)\\,d\\langle X\\rangle_s$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span>。这一区别正是本节要精确刻画的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一-Taylor-展开与余项估计\">一、Taylor 展开与余项估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一-Taylor-展开与余项估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 2.1（二阶 Taylor 展开的逐段形式）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 在紧集上一致连续（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}$</span> 的局部紧性自动成立）。</p>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x),(t',x')\\in[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}$</span>，存在介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 及介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'$</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t',x')-f(t,x)=f_t(\\tau,x)(t'-t)+f_x(t,x)(x'-x)+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(t,\\xi)(x'-x)^2+R(t,t',x,x'),$$</div>\n其中余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 满足：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t'-t|+|x'-x|&lt;\\delta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R|\\le\\varepsilon(|t'-t|+|x'-x|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto f(t,x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 之间用带 Lagrange 余项的 Taylor 公式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,x')=f(t,x)+f_x(t,x)(x'-x)+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(t,\\xi)(x'-x)^2,$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,x'$</span> 之间。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto f(t,x)$</span> 用中值定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t',x)-f(t,x)=f_t(\\tau,x)(t'-t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,t'$</span> 之间。两式相加得展开式，余项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R=f(t',x)-f(t,x)-f_t(\\tau,x)(t'-t)+f(t,x')-f(t,x)-f_x(t,x)(x'-x)-\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(t,\\xi)(x'-x)^2.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\{x\\}$</span> 上的一致连续性（紧区间上连续即一致连续），第一组括号当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t'-t|&lt;\\delta_1$</span> 时绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon|t'-t|$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times[x-\\delta_2,x+\\delta_2]$</span> 上的一致连续性，第二组括号当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x'-x|&lt;\\delta_2$</span> 时绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon|x'-x|^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min(\\delta_1,\\delta_2)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.1（沿半鞅路径的展开）</strong></p>\n<p>在引理 2.1 的条件下，对每个划分区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=t_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=X_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t'=t_{i+1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x'=X_{t_{i+1}}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f(t_i,X_{t_i})=f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta t_i+f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2+R_i,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X_i=X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_i\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{i+1}}$</span> 之间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_i$</span> 为引理 2.1 的余项。求和得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(T,X_T)-f(0,X_0)=\\sum_i f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta t_i+\\sum_i f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i+\\tfrac12\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2+\\sum_i R_i. \\tag{2.1}$$</div></p>\n<p>下面逐项处理 (2.1) 中的四个和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二-一阶漂移项的收敛\">二、一阶漂移项的收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二-一阶漂移项的收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 2.2（漂移项收敛）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 连续且满足多项式增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 路径连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T|b(X_s)|\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.。</p>\n<p>则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta t_i\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\int_0^T f_t(s,X_s)\\,ds\\qquad\\text{a.s.}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta t_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}f_t(s,X_s)\\,ds$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i A_i-\\int_0^T f_t(s,X_s)\\,ds=\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big[f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})-f_t(s,X_s)\\big]\\,ds.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times[-M,M]$</span> 上的一致连续性，对 a.s. 固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{[0,T]}(\\omega)$</span> 紧，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 沿该路径一致连续：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s-\\tau_i|+|X_s-X_{t_i}|&lt;\\delta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})-f_t(s,X_s)|&lt;\\varepsilon$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的路径一致连续性，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|&lt;\\delta'$</span> 时对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s-\\tau_i|+|X_s-X_{t_i}|&lt;\\delta$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\sum_i A_i-\\int_0^T f_t\\,ds\\Big|\\le\\varepsilon T.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 任意，故 a.s. 收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意此处未用多项式增长，只用了路径紧性与一致连续性；多项式增长在下一引理中用于控制余项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-三-一阶随机项的收敛与二阶项的二次变差\">三、一阶随机项的收敛与二阶项的二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-三-一阶随机项的收敛与二阶项的二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 2.3（随机项收敛）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 连续且满足多项式增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X)\\in L^1([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>。</p>\n<p>则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)\\,dX_s:=\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)b(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X_i=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}b(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g(X_s)\\,dW_s$</span>。第一部分的收敛由引理 2.2 的同型论证（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的有界性/可积性控制）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛；第二部分的收敛正是第 1 节 Itô 积分定义中左端点 Riemann 和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g(X_s)\\,dW_s\\;\\xrightarrow{L^2}\\;\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n由 Itô 等距，该收敛的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\big(f_x(s,X_s)-f_x(\\pi(s),X_{\\pi(s)})\\big)^2g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(s)=t_i$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 沿路径一致连续与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2$</span>，被积函数 a.s. 逐点趋于零且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f^2(1+|X|^2)^2g(X)^2$</span> 控制；后者可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的矩有界性（半鞅在有限区间上各阶矩有限）保证，故由 Dominated Convergence 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>引理 2.4（二阶项收敛到二次变差积分）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 连续且满足多项式增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X)\\in L^1$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T g(X_s)^4\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>（用于控制二次变差近似的四阶矩）。</p>\n<p>则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\int_0^T f_{xx}(s,X_s)g(X_s)^2\\,ds\\qquad\\text{in }L^1(\\Omega).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 分两步。</p>\n<p>第一步：以左端点替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 沿路径一致连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{i+1}}$</span> 之间，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)-f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})|\\le\\omega_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]\\times[X_{t_i}-\\rho_i,X_{t_i}+\\rho_i]$</span> 上的振幅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i=\\max_{s\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]}|X_s-X_{t_i}|$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 路径一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\omega_i\\to0$</span> a.s.，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i\\le 2C_f(1+|X_{t_i}|^2+\\rho_i^2)$</span> 被可积量控制。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\sum_i\\big(f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)-f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})\\big)(\\Delta X_i)^2\\Big|\\le\\max_i\\omega_i\\cdot\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2\\to\\langle X\\rangle_T=\\int_0^T g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>（这是 Brownian 二次变差沿半鞅的收敛，其证明在第 5 节；本节引用其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛结论，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle X\\rangle_T=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T g^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证极限有限）。故第一步误差趋于零。</p>\n<p>第二步：证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})(\\Delta X_i)^2\\to\\int_0^T f_{xx}(s,X_s)g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>。写\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\Delta X_i)^2=\\Big(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}b\\,ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g\\,dW\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n交叉项与漂移平方项的贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)\\cdot\\sup_i|\\Delta X_i|\\cdot$</span>（可积控制量），由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i|\\Delta X_i|\\to0$</span> a.s. 及一致可积性趋于零。主导项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Big(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g(X_s)\\,dW_s\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n将其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span> 比较。由 Itô 等距的逐段形式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\Big(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g\\,dW\\Big)^2-\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g^2\\,ds\\,\\Big|\\,\\mathcal{F}_{t_i}\\Big]=0,$$</div>\n故交叉项的期望为零；但我们需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛而非仅期望收敛，故控制二阶矩：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Big(\\big(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g\\,dW\\big)^2-\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g^2\\,ds\\Big)\\Big]^2\\le C_f^2(1+\\mathbb{E}|X|^4)\\cdot\\mathbb{E}\\sum_i\\Big(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g\\,dW\\Big)^4\\cdot\\|\\Pi\\|,$$</div>\n其中用了 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy 不等式控制第四阶矩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(\\int g\\,dW)^4\\le C\\,\\mathbb{E}(\\int g^2\\,ds)^2\\le C\\,\\|\\Pi\\|\\,\\mathbb{E}\\int g^4\\,ds$</span>。由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int g^4\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，右端随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 趋于零。最后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,X_{t_i})\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}g^2\\,ds\\to\\int_0^T f_{xx}g^2\\,ds$</span> a.s. 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 沿路径一致连续与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 可积（同引理 2.2 论证）。合并两步得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-四-余项与主定理\">四、余项与主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-四-余项与主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 2.5（余项可忽略）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：同引理 2.1 与推论 2.1，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足多项式增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|X_t|^4&lt;\\infty$</span>（半鞅在有限区间上的这一矩界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的可积性与 Itô 等距给出）。</p>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i R_i\\to0$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(\\Omega)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由引理 2.1，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|&lt;\\delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i|\\Delta X_i|&lt;\\delta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_i|\\le\\varepsilon(\\Delta t_i+(\\Delta X_i)^2)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 路径一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i|\\Delta X_i|\\to0$</span> a.s.；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup|X|^4&lt;\\infty$</span> 得一致可积性，故对足够细的划分，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sum_i|R_i|\\le\\varepsilon\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Big[T+\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2\\Big]\\le\\varepsilon\\,(T+\\mathbb{E}\\langle X\\rangle_T+o(1)).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 任意，得证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2.1（一维 Itô 引理）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：\n(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,f_t,f_x,f_{xx}$</span> 满足多项式增长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f^{(\\cdot)}|\\le C_f(1+|x|^2)$</span>；\n(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^t g(X_s)\\,dW_s$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X)\\in L^1([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T g(X_s)^4\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>；\n(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|X_t|^4&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>则 a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)=f(0,X_0)+\\int_0^t\\Big(f_t(s,X_s)+f_x(s,X_s)b(X_s)+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(s,X_s)g(X_s)^2\\Big)\\,ds+\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s. \\tag{2.2}$$</div>\n等价地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(t,X_t)=\\Big(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\Big)dt+f_xg\\,dW_t. \\tag{2.3}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对任意划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，由推论 2.1 的 (2.1)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(T,X_T)-f(0,X_0)=\\sum_i f_t(\\tau_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta t_i+\\sum_i f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i+\\tfrac12\\sum_i f_{xx}(t_i,\\xi_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2+\\sum_i R_i.$$</div>\n由引理 2.2，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\int_0^T f_t\\,ds$</span> a.s.；由引理 2.3，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\int_0^T f_x\\,dX$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>；由引理 2.4，第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\tfrac12\\int_0^T f_{xx}g^2\\,ds$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>；由引理 2.5，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>。因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中（从而沿某子列 a.s.）\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(T,X_T)-f(0,X_0)=\\int_0^T f_t\\,ds+\\int_0^T f_xb\\,ds+\\int_0^T f_xg\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\int_0^T f_{xx}g^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n合并 Lebesgue 积分项得 (2.2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的情形。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，将上述论证应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 得 (2.2)。由于 (2.2) 两端均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续过程（Itô 积分有连续版本），a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.2（Itô 等距的链式形式）</strong></p>\n<p>在定理 2.1 的假设下，若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s\\Big]^2=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)^2g(X_s)^2\\,ds.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接由第 1 节 Itô 积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等距应用于被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=f_x(s,X_s)g(X_s)$</span>，其适应性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 连续与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 适应给出，平方可积性由假设给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span> 的验证恒等式）</strong></p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span>（满足定理 2.1 的全部假设，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f=2$</span>）。则 (2.3) 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d(X_t^2)=2X_t\\,dX_t+g(X_t)^2\\,dt,$$</div>\n即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t^2=X_0^2+2\\int_0^tX_s\\,dX_s+\\int_0^tg(X_s)^2\\,ds. \\tag{2.4}$$</div>\n这是 Itô 引理最直接的推论，也是二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tg^2\\,ds$</span> 的等价刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^2-\\int_0^tg^2\\,ds$</span> 为局部鞅。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span>。则 (2.4) 化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_t^2=2\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s+t.$$</div>\n这与直接计算一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}W_t^2=t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s=0$</span>。若误用经典链式法则（即 Stratonovich 形式），将得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t^2=2\\int_0^tW_s\\circ dW_s$</span>，缺少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项；该缺失项正是第 4 节将讨论的 Itô–Stratonovich 修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span> 时的值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\cdot2\\cdot t=t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-五-数值验证\">五、数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-五-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span> 验证 (2.4)：用左端点 Riemann 和近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tW_s\\,dW_s$</span>，检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t^2-2\\sum_iW_{t_i}\\Delta W_i$</span> 是否收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240501)\nT, n_paths = 1.0, 20000\ndt = 1e-4\nn_steps = int(T / dt)\n\n# 生成 Brownian 路径，形状 (n_paths, n_steps+1)\ndW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=(n_paths, n_steps))\nW = np.concatenate([np.zeros((n_paths, 1)), np.cumsum(dW, axis=1)], axis=1)\nassert W.shape == (n_paths, n_steps + 1)\n\n# 左端点 Itô 和：sum_i W_{t_i} (W_{t_{i+1}} - W_{t_i})\nito_sum = np.sum(W[:, :-1] * dW, axis=1)\nassert ito_sum.shape == (n_paths,)\n\n# 恒等式检验：W_T^2 - 2 * ito_sum 应约等于 T\nlhs = W[:, -1] ** 2 - 2.0 * ito_sum\nprint(&quot;shape of lhs:&quot;, lhs.shape)\nprint(&quot;mean of W_T^2 - 2*Ito_sum:&quot;, lhs.mean())\nprint(&quot;expected T =&quot;, T)\nassert abs(lhs.mean() - T) &lt; 5e-3\n\n# 对照：Stratonovich 型右端点/中点和不含修正项，均值应约为 0\nstrat_sum = np.sum(0.5 * (W[:, :-1] + W[:, 1:]) * dW, axis=1)\nprint(&quot;mean of W_T^2 - 2*Stratonovich_sum:&quot;, (W[:, -1] ** 2 - 2.0 * strat_sum).mean())\nassert abs((W[:, -1] ** 2 - 2.0 * strat_sum).mean()) &lt; 5e-3\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>lhs</code> 形状为 <code>(20000,)</code>；<code>mean of W_T^2 - 2*Ito_sum</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-3}$</span> 容差内）；Stratonovich 对照均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。若将左端点和改为右端点和，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T^2-2\\sum_iW_{t_{i+1}}\\Delta W_i$</span> 的均值将接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-T$</span>，与 (2.4) 的符号一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>一维 Itô 引理的实质是：沿半鞅路径对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span> 函数作二阶 Taylor 展开，一阶项给出经典链式法则的漂移与随机部分，二阶项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2\\to\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tg^2\\,ds$</span> 而留下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 修正；定理 2.1 在显式正则性假设下给出完整证明。</li>\n<li>证明的关键收敛性分工为：漂移项用路径紧性与一致连续性（引理 2.2），随机项用 Itô 积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 定义与等距（引理 2.3），二阶项用二次变差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛与 BDG 四阶矩估计（引理 2.4），余项用 Taylor 余项的一致估计与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup|X|^4&lt;\\infty$</span>（引理 2.5）。</li>\n<li>推论 2.3 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^2=X_0^2+2\\int_0^tX_s\\,dX_s+\\int_0^tg^2\\,ds$</span> 既是 Itô 引理的最简可检验形式，也精确显示了 Itô 积分与 Stratonovich 积分之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 的来源；该修正项将在第 4 节以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的一般形式系统展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-六-Itô-引理的局部化形式与停止论证\">六、Itô 引理的局部化形式与停止论证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-六-Itô-引理的局部化形式与停止论证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 2.1 的假设 (iii) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|X_t|^4&lt;\\infty$</span>，这一条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 满足线性增长时由 Itô 等距与 Gronwall 不等式给出，但在仅假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X)\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span> 的一般情形下未必成立。然而 Itô 引理作为路径恒等式，其成立并不需要全局矩条件：只需在每次停止于使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 有界的事件上验证，再用停止时间的穷尽性拼接。这一局部化论证是本节证明链条的必要补充，因为它把定理 2.1 从\"矩有界\"的强假设下解放出来，使之适用于仅满足 SDE 系数局部可积的情形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6（局部化形式的 Itô 引理）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：\n(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R})$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 及其一、二阶偏导在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times[-R,R]$</span> 上有界（局部有界，不要求全局多项式增长）；\n(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^tb(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^tg(X_s)\\,dW_s$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X)\\in L^1([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>；\n(iii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\mathbf{1}_{\\{|X_s|\\le R\\}}g(X_s)^4\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>则 a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，(2.2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span> 定义停止时间\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_R=\\inf\\{t\\in[0,T]:|X_t|&gt;R\\}\\wedge T.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 界住，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 及其偏导沿该路径段有界（界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_R=\\sup_{[0,T]\\times[-R,R]}(|f|+|f_t|+|f_x|+|f_{xx}|)$</span>），从而定理 2.1 的全部假设在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上成立：多项式增长条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_R$</span> 替代，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\le\\tau_R}|X_t|^4\\le R^4&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^{\\tau_R}g^4\\,ds\\le\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\mathbf{1}_{\\{|X_s|\\le R\\}}g^4\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 由 (iii)。于是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>，a.s. 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t\\wedge\\tau_R,X_{t\\wedge\\tau_R})=f(0,X_0)+\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\big(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\big)\\,ds+\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_R}f_xg\\,dW. \\tag{2.5}$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 路径连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R\\uparrow T$</span> a.s.（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>）。在事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau_R=T\\}$</span> 上 (2.5) 即为 (2.2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的形式。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 沿可数序列，由 a.s. 单调收敛（对 Lebesgue 积分项用单调收敛定理，对 Itô 积分项用 Itô 积分的连续性）得 (2.2) a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.1（局部化与多项式增长的关系）</strong> 定理 2.1 的多项式增长假设在引理 2.5 中仅用于控制余项的一致可积性；在局部化形式下，该控制由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_R$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 的有限性替代，故命题 2.6 严格弱化了定理 2.1 的假设。实践中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 满足局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长时，(iii) 自动成立（见第 7 节），因此命题 2.6 覆盖了生成动力学中绝大多数 SDE 情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-七-Itô-引理的鞅刻画与漂移的辨识\">七、Itô 引理的鞅刻画与漂移的辨识<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-七-Itô-引理的鞅刻画与漂移的辨识\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Itô 引理的另一面是：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)$</span> 分解为一个 Lebesgue 积分（有限变差部分）与一个 Itô 积分（局部鞅部分）。这一分解的唯一性给出漂移项的辨识方法，是后续 Fokker–Planck 方程与 Girsanov 定理的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.7（半鞅分解的唯一性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为连续半鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=(A_t)$</span> 为连续有界变差适应过程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=(M_t)$</span> 为连续局部鞅且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+A_t+M_t$</span>，则该分解唯一：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+A'_t+M'_t$</span> 为另一分解，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=A'$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=M'$</span> a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t=A_t-A'_t=-(M_t-M'_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 同时是有界变差过程与连续局部鞅，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_0=0$</span>。有界变差局部鞅必为常数：对任意停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{t\\wedge\\sigma}$</span> 有界变差且为局部鞅；由有界变差过程的二次变差为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle D\\rangle_t=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2$</span> 为局部鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}D_{t\\wedge\\sigma}^2=\\mathbb{E}\\langle D\\rangle_{t\\wedge\\sigma}=0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{t\\wedge\\sigma}=0$</span> a.s.。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 的局部化序列即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\equiv0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.4（Itô 漂移的辨识）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 2.6 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)$</span> 的分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)=f(0,X_0)+A_t+M_t,\\qquad A_t=\\int_0^t\\big(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\big)(s,X_s)\\,ds,\\quad M_t=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)$</span> 的唯一连续有界变差部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是唯一连续局部鞅部分。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)$</span> 本身为局部鞅，则必有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2=0\\qquad dt\\text{-a.e.},\\ \\text{a.s.}$$</div>\n这是\"调和函数\"在扩散生成元意义下的推广：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 是过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}=b\\partial_x+\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_{xx}$</span> 的零调和解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 2.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)-f(0,X_0)=A_t+M_t$</span> 给出一个半鞅分解，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 连续有界变差（被积函数可积），<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 连续局部鞅（Itô 积分）。由命题 2.7 分解唯一。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,X_t)$</span> 为局部鞅，则其有界变差部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\equiv0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2)\\,ds=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> a.s.；由被积函数的连续性（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 连续时），得被积函数恒为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 2.2（指数鞅）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=\\exp(\\lambda x-\\tfrac12\\lambda^2t)$</span>。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_t=-\\tfrac12\\lambda^2f,\\quad f_x=\\lambda f,\\quad f_{xx}=\\lambda^2f,\\quad f_t+\\tfrac12f_{xx}=\\tfrac12\\lambda^2f-\\tfrac12\\lambda^2f=0.$$</div>\n由推论 2.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,W_t)$</span> 为局部鞅，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(t,W_t)=\\lambda f(t,W_t)\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,W_t)=1+\\lambda\\int_0^tf(s,W_s)\\,dW_s$</span>。这正是指数鞅的随机积分表示，也是 Girsanov 定理（第 8 节）中测度变换密度的构造原型。此处 Itô 引理的作用是验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}f=0$</span> 并显式给出鞅表示。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-八-与-Stratonovich-形式的对照推导\">八、与 Stratonovich 形式的对照推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-八-与-Stratonovich-形式的对照推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺的是 Itô 引理的一维推导，而 Itô 与 Stratonovich 的差别正是由二阶项引起的。为给第 4 节提供精确的接口，这里在同一推导框架内给出 Stratonovich 链式法则的形式推导，但不展开 Stratonovich 积分的定义（那属于第 4 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.8（Stratonovich 链式法则的形式推导）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足定理 2.1 的假设，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的 Stratonovich 积分存在（其定义见第 4 节）。则形式上有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(t,X_t)=f_t\\,dt+f_x\\circ dX_t, \\tag{2.6}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\circ$</span> 表示 Stratonovich 积分。将其与 (2.3) 对照，得修正项恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_x\\circ dX_t=f_x\\,dX_t+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\,dt=f_x\\,dX_t+\\tfrac12\\,df_x\\cdot dX_t. \\tag{2.7}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>推导。</strong> 在 (2.1) 中，将二阶项的中点取值改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_i$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{i+1}}$</span> 的中点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar X_i=\\tfrac12(X_{t_i}+X_{t_{i+1}})$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f(t_i,X_{t_i})=f_t\\Delta t_i+f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i+\\tfrac12f_{xx}(\\bar X_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2+R_i.$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\approx f_{xx}(\\bar X_i)\\Delta X_i$</span>（一阶近似），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}(\\bar X_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2\\approx\\tfrac12\\big(f_x(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\big)\\Delta X_i$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\tfrac12f_{xx}(\\bar X_i)(\\Delta X_i)^2\\approx\\tfrac12\\sum_i\\big(f_x(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\big)\\Delta X_i.$$</div>\n右端正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int df_x\\cdot dX$</span> 的 Riemann 和形式。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_if_x(t_i,X_{t_i})\\Delta X_i+\\tfrac12\\sum_i(f_x(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}})-f_x(t_i,X_{t_i}))\\Delta X_i$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\tfrac12(f_x(t_i,X_{t_i})+f_x(t_{i+1},X_{t_{i+1}}))\\Delta X_i$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 在区间端点的对称平均乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X_i$</span>——这正是 Stratonovich 积分的 Riemann 和定义（第 4 节将证明其极限存在且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x\\circ dX$</span>）。故 (2.6) 成立，且 (2.7) 由 (2.3) 与 (2.6) 相减直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.2（修正项的协变差解释）</strong> (2.7) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\,df_x\\cdot dX_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的协变差（cobracket）的一半。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$df_x=2\\,dW$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\,df_x\\cdot dW=\\tfrac12\\cdot2\\,dt=dt$</span>，与推论 2.3 中缺失的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项一致。这一对照说明：Itô 引理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 并非独立公理，而是二阶 Taylor 项与 Brownian 二次变差相互作用的必然结果；Stratonovich 形式通过对称化 Riemann 和吸收了该修正，代价是积分不再具有鞅性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-九-可检验推论-矩的演化方程\">九、可检验推论：矩的演化方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-九-可检验推论-矩的演化方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Itô 引理的一个直接可检验推论是矩的演化。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^k$</span>，可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的各阶矩满足的常微分方程，这在后续 Fokker–Planck 章中与矩封闭问题直接相关。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.5（一阶与二阶矩的演化）</strong></p>\n<p>假设：定理 2.1 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|X_t|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t|X_s||b(X_s)|\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t|g(X_s)|^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tX_s\\,dX_s$</span> 为真鞅（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^tX_s^2g(X_s)^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}X_t=\\mathbb{E}b(X_t),\\qquad \\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=2\\mathbb{E}\\big[X_tb(X_t)\\big]+\\mathbb{E}g(X_t)^2. \\tag{2.8}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x$</span> 用 (2.3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t$</span>。取期望，Itô 积分项期望为零（真鞅条件），得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span> 用 (2.4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^2=X_0^2+2\\int_0^tX_s\\,dX_s+\\int_0^tg(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span>。取期望，随机积分项期望为零（真鞅条件），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=\\mathbb{E}X_0^2+2\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\big[X_sb(X_s)\\big]\\,ds+\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}g(X_s)^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导即得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 2.3（Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的矩）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span>（常数）。由 (2.8)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}X_t=-\\theta\\mathbb{E}X_t,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=-2\\theta\\mathbb{E}X_t^2+\\sigma^2.$$</div>\n解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t=e^{-\\theta t}X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t^2=e^{-2\\theta t}X_0^2+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t^2\\to\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}$</span>，即平稳方差。这一结果与 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp=\\theta\\partial_x(xp)+\\tfrac12\\sigma^2\\partial_{xx}p$</span> 的平稳解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty(x)\\propto\\exp(-\\theta x^2/\\sigma^2)$</span> 的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}$</span> 一致，验证了 Itô 引理与 Fokker–Planck 方程在矩层面的一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>代码验证（矩的演化）</strong> 以下代码用 Euler–Maruyama 离散（第 11 节将系统分析其收敛性，这里仅作数值验证）模拟 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程，检验二阶矩公式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240502)\ntheta, sigma, X0 = 1.0, 0.5, 1.0\nT, n_paths, dt = 2.0, 40000, 1e-3\nn_steps = int(T / dt)\n\nX = np.full(n_paths, X0)\nfor _ in range(n_steps):\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=n_paths)\n    X = X - theta * X * dt + sigma * dW\nassert X.shape == (n_paths,)\n\nempirical_second_moment = np.mean(X ** 2)\ntheoretical = np.exp(-2 * theta * T) * X0**2 + sigma**2 / (2 * theta) * (1 - np.exp(-2 * theta * T))\nprint(&quot;empirical E[X_T^2]:&quot;, empirical_second_moment)\nprint(&quot;theoretical E[X_T^2]:&quot;, theoretical)\nassert abs(empirical_second_moment - theoretical) &lt; 1e-2\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>empirical E[X_T^2]</code> 与 <code>theoretical E[X_T^2]</code> 之差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 容差内（Euler–Maruyama 的弱收敛阶为一阶，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt=10^{-3}$</span> 时误差量级约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$40000$</span> 条路径的统计误差）。该验证把推论 2.5 的解析结果与数值模拟对齐，同时为第 11–12 节的收敛阶分析提供基线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-十-本节推导链的闭合\">十、本节推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-十-本节推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，一维 Itô 引理的推导链闭合为四步：Taylor 展开（引理 2.1）→ 逐项收敛（引理 2.2–2.5）→ 主定理（定理 2.1）→ 局部化与推论（命题 2.6–2.8、推论 2.2–2.5）。每一步的假设都在命题陈述中显式列出，收敛性论证分别引用了一致连续性、Itô 等距、二次变差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛与 BDG 不等式、Taylor 余项的一致估计。下一节（多维 Itô 引理）将把同一推导链推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维：Taylor 展开中的二阶项变为 Hessian 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2f$</span> 与扩散矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 的迹，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(\\nabla^2f\\,gg^\\top)\\,dt$</span>；本节的一维恒等式 (2.4) 是多维情形在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 时的特例，而命题 2.8 的修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\,df_x\\cdot dX_t$</span> 在多维下成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}\\partial_{ij}f\\,d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t$</span>。这些推广不改变推导的收敛性结构，只改变二阶项的代数形式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-多维-Itô-引理\">多维 Itô 引理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-多维-Itô-引理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},(\\mathcal{F}_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W^1,\\dots,W^m)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>-布朗运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X^1,\\dots,X^d)$</span> 为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{F}_t)$</span>-适应过程。本节新引入并固定以下符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>指标范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>；重复指标一律按 Einstein 求和约定求和。</li>\n<li>漂移向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，扩散矩阵场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>，均 Borel 可测。</li>\n<li>半鞅分解写作</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^i_t=X^i_0+\\int_0^t b^i(X_s,s)\\,ds+\\sum_{\\alpha=1}^m\\int_0^t g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s,\\qquad t\\in[0,T].\n\\tag{3.1}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t b^i(X_s,s)\\,ds$</span> 为 Lebesgue 积分（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T|b^i(X_s,s)|\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s$</span> 为第 1 节定义的 Itô 积分（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{i\\alpha}(X_\\cdot,\\cdot)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>，即适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T|g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>）。记二次变差矩阵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t=\\sum_{\\alpha=1}^m\\int_0^t g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)g^{j\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,ds,\n\\tag{3.2}$$</div>\n<p>其存在性与第 5 节二次变差的一般理论一致；本节仅在下述命题中把它当作已知对象使用，并在证明中直接由 (3.1) 的 Itô 积分定义与布朗运动的二次变差性质推出。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>（本节主定理所需的正则性）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 连续，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t)\\in C^2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；偏导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^i}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,T]$</span> 上连续。</li>\n<li>过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 (3.1)，且 (3.1) 中两个积分对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 a.s. 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b^i(X_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{i\\alpha}(X_t,t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数局部有界（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}|b^i(X_t,t)|\\mathbf{1}_{\\{|X_t|\\le N\\}}$</span> 与同类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 量有界）。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;\\infty$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_{x^i}(x,t)|\\le C_N$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_{x^ix^j}(x,t)|\\le C_N$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\le N$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span> 成立（局部有界导数）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>注（与相邻概念的区别）</strong>：一维 Itô 引理（第 2 节）只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量的情形，其核心是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 项；多维引理的新内容是：(i) 扩散矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非方阵时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ne m$</span> 的指标结构；(ii) 交叉二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）产生混合偏导项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}$</span>；(iii) 矩阵表述下二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(g g^\\top \\nabla^2 f)$</span>。这与 Stratonovich 链式法则（第 4 节）的区别在于后者无二阶修正项，但代价是积分定义改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-1-二次变差的矩阵结构\">3.1 二次变差的矩阵结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-1-二次变差的矩阵结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.1（二次变差的矩阵表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(3.1) 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{i\\alpha}(X_\\cdot,\\cdot)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,\\alpha$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i,j}u_i u_j\\big(\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t-\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_s\\big)\n=\\int_s^t \\big\\|g(X_r,r)^\\top u\\big\\|^2\\,dr,\\qquad \\forall u\\in\\mathbb{R}^d,\n\\tag{3.3}$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t-\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_s$</span> 由 (3.2) 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (3.1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^i-X^i_0$</span> 是连续局部鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^i_t=\\sum_\\alpha\\int_0^t g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha$</span> 与有限变差过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^i_t=\\int_0^t b^i ds$</span> 之和。二次变差对有限变差部分为零，对鞅部分由 Itô 积分的二次变差性质：对适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,K\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\langle\\int_0^\\cdot H_s\\,dW^\\alpha_s,\\int_0^\\cdot K_s\\,dW^\\beta_s\\Big\\rangle_t=\\delta_{\\alpha\\beta}\\int_0^t H_sK_s\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_s=g^{j\\beta}(X_s,s)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha,\\beta$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}=(gg^\\top)^{ij}$</span> 得 (3.2)。对 (3.2) 两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_iu_j$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i,j}u_iu_j\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\sum_{i,j}u_iu_j\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\|g^\\top u\\|^2ds,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^\\top u\\|^2=\\sum_\\alpha(\\sum_i g^{i\\alpha}u_i)^2$</span>。两式相减即 (3.3)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.2（非退化扩散的二次变差密度）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 可逆，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\ne0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t\\|g^\\top u\\|^2dr&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;s$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 的矩阵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(s,t)$</span> 上正定。此推论在第 8 节 Girsanov 定理的 Novikov 条件验证中作为可检验判据使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-2-多维-Itô-引理的主定理\">3.2 多维 Itô 引理的主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-2-多维-Itô-引理的主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3.3（多维 Itô 引理）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，a.s.</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{aligned}\nf(X_t,t)-f(X_0,0)\n&amp;=\\int_0^t\\Big(f_t(X_s,s)+\\sum_i f_{x^i}(X_s,s)b^i(X_s,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad+\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}(X_s,s)\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)g^{j\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\Big)ds\\\\\n&amp;\\quad+\\sum_{i,\\alpha}\\int_0^t f_{x^i}(X_s,s)g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\tag{3.4}$$</div>\n<p>矩阵形式：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=(\\partial_{x^1}f,\\dots,\\partial_{x^d}f)^\\top$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 f=(\\partial_{x^ix^j}f)_{i,j}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t,t)=\\Big(f_t+\\nabla f^\\top b+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}\\big(g g^\\top\\nabla^2 f\\big)\\Big)dt+\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW_t.\n\\tag{3.5}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤逐步写出）：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：时间格点与 Taylor 展开。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 的分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_k(t_{k+1}-t_k)$</span>。写</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(X_t,t)-f(X_0,0)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\big[f(X_{t_{k+1}},t_{k+1})-f(X_{t_k},t_k)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>对每个增量用二元 Taylor 公式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_{t_k},t_k)$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续，故可在随机点展开）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{aligned}\nf(X_{t_{k+1}},t_{k+1})-f(X_{t_k},t_k)\n&amp;=f_t(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Delta t_k+\\sum_i f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Delta X^i_k\\\\\n&amp;\\quad+\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Delta X^i_k\\Delta X^j_k+R_k,\n\\end{aligned}\n\\tag{3.6}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_k=t_{k+1}-t_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X^i_k=X^i_{t_{k+1}}-X^i_{t_k}$</span>，余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_k$</span> 满足：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k|X_{t_k}|\\le N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 充分小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_k|\\le C_N(\\|\\Pi\\|+|\\Delta X_k|^2)\\cdot\\omega(\\|\\Pi\\|+|\\Delta X_k|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 二阶导数的连续模。此估计来自 Taylor 定理的积分余项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 二阶导数的局部一致连续性（假设 (H3.1) 第 1、3 条）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步：一阶项收敛。</strong> 由 (3.1)，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Delta X^i_k\n=\\sum_i f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}b^i(X_s,s)\\,ds\n+\\sum_{i,\\alpha}f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s.$$</div>\n<p>第一项当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时 a.s. 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\sum_i f_{x^i}b^i\\,ds$</span>：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)b^i(X_s,s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^i}(X_s,s)b^i(X_s,s)$</span> 之差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N\\omega_X(\\|\\Pi\\|)|b^i|$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_X$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上的一致连续模，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续紧区间上一致连续；再用 Lebesgue 控制收敛（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N\\sup_{s\\le t}|b^i(X_s,s)|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{|X|\\le N\\}$</span> 上可积，由假设 (H3.1) 第 2 条局部有界）。</p>\n<p>第二项是 Itô 和的 Riemann 型极限：由第 1 节 Itô 积分定义，对适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{i\\alpha}_s=f_{x^i}(X_s,s)g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)$</span>（其平方可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^i}$</span> 局部有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span> 保证），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i,\\alpha}\\sum_k f_{x^i}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s\n\\xrightarrow[\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0]{L^2}\\sum_{i,\\alpha}\\int_0^t f_{x^i}(X_s,s)g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,dW^\\alpha_s.$$</div>\n<p>此处用 Itô 积分的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛性（第 1 节已证），无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：二阶项收敛到二次变差。</strong> 关键恒等式：由 (3.1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta X^i_k$</span> 的定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta X^i_k\\Delta X^j_k\n=\\Big(\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}b^ids+\\sum_\\alpha\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha\\Big)\\Big(\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}b^jds+\\sum_\\beta\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{j\\beta}dW^\\beta\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>展开四项。含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\,ds$</span> 的项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|^2)$</span>（被积函数局部有界），含一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\,ds$</span> 与一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW$</span> 的交叉项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\cdot\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\cdot\\text{随机})$</span>，其按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span>（用 Itô 等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(\\int g\\,dW)^2=\\mathbb{E}\\int g^2ds\\le C\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>）。主导项是纯扩散项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{j\\beta}dW^\\beta.$$</div>\n<p>由 Itô 积分的二次变差（命题 3.1 的证明中已用），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_k\\sum_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{j\\beta}dW^\\beta\n\\xrightarrow{L^1}\\sum_\\alpha\\int_0^t g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)g^{j\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\,ds=\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_t.$$</div>\n<p>收敛模式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha\\big)\\big(\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{j\\alpha}dW^\\alpha\\big)-\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}ds$</span> 的期望绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 控制（由 Itô 积分的鞅性质与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的局部有界性）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_k\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\Delta X^i_k\\Delta X^j_k\n\\xrightarrow{L^1}\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}\\int_0^t f_{x^ix^j}(X_s,s)\\,d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_s,$$</div>\n<p>再用 (3.2) 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle_s$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}ds$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}(X_{t_k},t_k)\\to f_{x^ix^j}(X_s,s)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}$</span> 连续）与 Lebesgue 控制收敛完成极限交换。控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N\\sum_\\alpha|g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}|$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{|X|\\le N\\}$</span> 上可积。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步：余项消失。</strong> 由第一步的余项估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k|R_k|\\le C_N(\\|\\Pi\\|+\\sup_k|\\Delta X_k|^2)\\cdot\\omega(\\|\\Pi\\|+\\sup_k|\\Delta X_k|)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k|\\Delta X_k|\\to0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k|\\Delta X_k|^2\\to\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span>（二次变差有限），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k|R_k|\\to0$</span> a.s.。</p>\n<p><strong>第五步：合并。</strong> 把第一至四步代入 (3.6) 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span>，得 (3.4)。矩阵形式 (3.5) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}=\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,\\alpha}f_{x^i}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha=\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（收敛模式）</strong>：定理 3.3 的等式是 a.s. 成立的路径等式；证明中各分项的收敛模式分别为 a.s.（漂移项、余项）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>（Itô 项）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>（二次变差项）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 导数局部有界，这些收敛可沿同一分割同时实现，故最终等式 a.s. 成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-3-可检验的推论-与一维公式的相容性\">3.3 可检验的推论：与一维公式的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-3-可检验的推论-与一维公式的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span> 的退化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 (H3.1) 的一维版本。<strong>结论</strong>：定理 3.3 化为第 2 节的一维 Itô 引理</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t,t)=\\big(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\big)dt+f_xg\\,dW_t.\n\\tag{3.7}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 (3.4) 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_\\alpha g^{1\\alpha}g^{1\\alpha}=g^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}=f_{xx}g^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,\\alpha}f_{x^i}g^{i\\alpha}dW^\\alpha=f_xg\\,dW$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.5（无漂移、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=I_d$</span> 时的 Laplacian 项）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且满足 (H3.1)。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\tfrac12\\Delta f(X_t)\\,dt+\\nabla f(X_t)^\\top dW_t,\\qquad \\Delta f=\\sum_i f_{x^ix^i}.\n\\tag{3.8}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top=I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(I_d\\nabla^2f)=\\Delta f$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章接口的代数基础：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^2$</span> 取期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\nabla f^\\top dW$</span> 项消失（Itô 积分零均值，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(X_\\cdot)\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续性保证），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}f(X_t)=\\tfrac12\\mathbb{E}\\Delta f(X_t)$</span>，即热方程的弱形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-4-具体例子-验证公式\">3.4 具体例子：验证公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-4-具体例子-验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 3.6</strong>—取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(X^1_t,X^2_t)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX^1_t=dW_t,\\qquad dX^2_t=X^1_t\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(1,X^1)^\\top$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times1$</span> 矩阵）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_1,x_2)=x_1x_2$</span>。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=(x_2,x_1)^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2f=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;X^1\\\\X^1&amp;(X^1)^2\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)=\\mathrm{tr}\\begin{pmatrix}X^1&amp;1\\\\ (X^1)^2&amp;X^1\\end{pmatrix}=2X^1.$$</div>\n<p>由 (3.5)：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d(X^1_tX^2_t)=\\tfrac12\\cdot2X^1_t\\,dt+(X^2_t,X^1_t)\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\X^1_t\\end{pmatrix}dW_t=X^1_t\\,dt+\\big(X^2_t+(X^1_t)^2\\big)dW_t.$$</div>\n<p>独立验证：由 Itô 乘积法则（一维引理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^1X^2$</span> 直接应用，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X^1,X^2\\rangle_t=X^1_t\\,dt$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d(X^1X^2)=X^2\\,dX^1+X^1\\,dX^2+d\\langle X^1,X^2\\rangle\n=X^2\\,dW+X^1\\cdot X^1\\,dW+X^1\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>与上式一致。此例说明交叉二次变差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X^1,X^2\\rangle=X^1dt$</span> 在混合偏导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^1x^2}=1$</span> 下贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\cdot2X^1dt$</span>，不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-5-代码-多维-Itô-引理的数值验证\">3.5 代码：多维 Itô 引理的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-5-代码-多维-Itô-引理的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对例 3.6 做 Monte Carlo 路径验证：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t)-f(X_0)$</span> 与 (3.4) 右端的离散近似，检验两者在细网格下吻合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\ndef simulate_paths(T=1.0, n_steps=20000, n_paths=2000):\n    dt = T / n_steps\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=(n_paths, n_steps))\n    X1 = np.zeros((n_paths, n_steps + 1))\n    X2 = np.zeros((n_paths, n_steps + 1))\n    for k in range(n_steps):\n        X1[:, k + 1] = X1[:, k] + dW[:, k]\n        X2[:, k + 1] = X2[:, k] + X1[:, k] * dW[:, k]\n    return X1, X2, dW, dt\n\nX1, X2, dW, dt = simulate_paths()\nassert X1.shape == (2000, 20001) and X2.shape == (2000, 20001)\nassert dW.shape == (2000, 20000)\n\n# 左端：f(X_T)-f(X_0)，f=x1*x2\nlhs = X1[:, -1] * X2[:, -1] - X1[:, 0] * X2[:, 0]\n\n# 右端离散近似：sum_k [ X1_k dt + (X2_k + X1_k^2) dW_k ]\nrhs = np.sum(X1[:, :-1] * dt + (X2[:, :-1] + X1[:, :-1] ** 2) * dW, axis=1)\n\nerr = np.abs(lhs - rhs)\nprint(&quot;lhs shape:&quot;, lhs.shape, &quot;rhs shape:&quot;, rhs.shape)\nprint(&quot;max abs error:&quot;, err.max())\nprint(&quot;mean abs error:&quot;, err.mean())\nassert err.max() &lt; 5e-2, &quot;Itô 引理数值验证失败：误差过大&quot;\nprint(&quot;Itô 引理数值验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>max abs error</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级（离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{dt})$</span> 的随机波动），<code>mean abs error</code> 更小；断言通过。误差来源是 (3.4) 中漂移项用左端点近似与 Itô 项用左端点求和的离散偏差，随 <code>n_steps</code> 增大而减小。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>多维 Itô 引理 (3.4)–(3.5) 的实质是：二阶项必须用扩散矩阵的二次变差密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 的标量类比；交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 驱动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ne m$</span> 时指标结构由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 的迹承载。</li>\n<li>证明的收敛结构是分项分模式的：漂移项与余项 a.s. 收敛，Itô 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛，二次变差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛；每一步的极限交换均由 Lebesgue 控制收敛或 Itô 等距保证，控制函数来自 (H3.1) 的局部有界导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span>。</li>\n<li>推论 3.4–3.5 给出与一维引理及 Laplacian 项的相容性，例 3.6 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2,m=1$</span> 的显式计算验证交叉二次变差项不可省略；此公式是后续第 4 节 Stratonovich 修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 与第 15 节 Fokker–Planck 接口的代数出发点。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-6-鞅形式与局部鞅结构\">3.6 鞅形式与局部鞅结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-6-鞅形式与局部鞅结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3.3 的等式可改写为鞅形式，这一改写是后续第 8 节 Girsanov 定理与第 9 节鞅表示定理的代数接口。本节在此把它作为独立命题陈述并证明，因为它给出了多维 Itô 引理在测度变换下的不变结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.7（Itô 过程的鞅分解）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\equiv0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t:=f(X_t)-f(X_0)-\\int_0^t\\Big(\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top b(X_s)+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}\\big(g(X_s)g(X_s)^\\top\\nabla^2f(X_s)\\big)\\Big)ds\n\\tag{3.9}$$</div>\n<p>是连续局部鞅；若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s)\\|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是平方可积鞅，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\|\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s)\\|^2ds.\n\\tag{3.10}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (3.5)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>）直接得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>右端是 Itô 积分，由第 1 节定义它是连续局部鞅。平方可积性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s)\\|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 正是 Itô 积分成为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 鞅的充要条件（第 1 节已证），此时二次变差由 Itô 等距给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\|\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s)\\|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与定理 3.3 的关系）</strong>：命题 3.7 不是新定理，而是把 (3.5) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span> 项移到等式左端后对“剩余部分”的定性刻画。它把 Itô 引理从“路径等式”翻译为“鞅 + 有限变差”的分解，这正是半鞅分解定理在多维情形下的具体实例。第 9 节的鞅表示定理将反过来使用这一分解：在 Girsanov 变换后的测度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的漂移被吸收进新测度的布朗运动，而二次变差 (3.10) 不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-7-二阶项的坐标不变性\">3.7 二阶项的坐标不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-7-二阶项的坐标不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3.3 的矩阵形式 (3.5) 中，二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)$</span> 表面依赖坐标选取。本节证明它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的光滑坐标变换下不变，从而说明它是内蕴对象而非坐标假象。这一性质在第 15 节把 Itô 引理搬到流形上时是必要的代数准备。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.8（二阶项的坐标不变性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=\\Phi(X_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 (3.1) 且 (H3.1) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f=f\\circ\\Phi^{-1}$</span>，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的坐标下 Itô 引理给出的二阶项等于在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 坐标下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 计算的二阶项，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\tilde g\\tilde g^\\top\\nabla^2\\tilde f(Y_t)\\big)\n=\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}\\big(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f(X_t)\\big),\n\\tag{3.11}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde g(y)=D\\Phi(\\Phi^{-1}(y))\\,g(\\Phi^{-1}(y))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的扩散矩阵（<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi$</span> 为 Jacobi 矩阵）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\Phi^{-1}(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=D\\Phi(x)$</span>。由链式法则，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_y\\tilde f(y)=J^{-\\top}\\nabla_x f(x),\\qquad\n\\nabla^2_y\\tilde f(y)=J^{-\\top}\\big(\\nabla^2_x f(x)\\big)J^{-1}+\\text{(含二阶导 $\\Phi$ 的项)}.$$</div>\n<p>后一项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的二阶导数，它在 Itô 公式中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的漂移项合并，不进入二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\tilde g\\tilde g^\\top\\nabla^2\\tilde f)$</span> 的纯扩散部分。纯扩散部分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\tilde g\\tilde g^\\top\\nabla^2_y\\tilde f\\big)\n=\\mathrm{tr}\\big(Jg g^\\top J^\\top\\cdot J^{-\\top}\\nabla^2_x f\\,J^{-1}\\big)\n=\\mathrm{tr}\\big(g g^\\top\\nabla^2_x f\\big),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了迹的循环性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(J A J^{-1})=\\mathrm{tr}(A)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jg g^\\top J^\\top J^{-\\top}=Jgg^\\top$</span>、再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Jgg^\\top J^{-1}$</span> 的迹等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 的迹。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 3.8 说明 (3.5) 的二阶项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,2)$</span>-张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,0)$</span>-张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2f$</span> 的完全缩并，与坐标无关。这正是第 15 节在 Riemann 流形上写 Itô 引理时把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}_{\\text{metric}}(gg^\\top\\mathrm{Hess}\\,f)$</span> 的依据；本节不展开流形情形，只固定这一代数事实。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-8-与-Stratonovich-形式的等价改写\">3.8 与 Stratonovich 形式的等价改写<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-8-与-Stratonovich-形式的等价改写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出定理 3.3 的一个等价改写，它把 Itô 积分换成 Stratonovich 积分，从而消去二阶项。这一改写不是第 4 节的内容（第 4 节将系统定义 Stratonovich 积分并证明修正项公式），而是本节内部的一个恒等式，用于说明多维 Itô 引理与经典链式法则的差距恰好是二次变差项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.9（Itô 引理的 Stratonovich 改写）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：在 Stratonovich 积分意义下（其定义见第 4 节，本节仅把它当作记号使用，并声明其与 Itô 积分的转换关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int H\\circ dW=\\int H\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\langle H,W\\rangle$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\nabla f(X_t)^\\top\\circ dX_t,\n\\tag{3.12}$$</div>\n<p>即经典链式法则在 Stratonovich 积分下成立，无二阶修正项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Itô 公式 (3.5)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\nabla f^\\top b\\,dt+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)\\,dt+\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW_t.$$</div>\n<p>把 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW$</span> 转换为 Stratonovich 积分：由转换关系，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW_t=\\nabla f^\\top g\\circ dW_t-\\tfrac12\\,d\\langle \\nabla f^\\top g,W\\rangle_t.$$</div>\n<p>交叉变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\nabla f^\\top g,W\\rangle$</span> 的计算用多维 Itô 引理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g$</span> 本身（它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 函数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，再用 (3.2)）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\langle \\nabla f^\\top g,W\\rangle_t=\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>代回得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\nabla f^\\top b\\,dt+\\nabla f^\\top g\\circ dW_t=\\nabla f^\\top(b\\,dt+g\\circ dW_t)=\\nabla f^\\top\\circ dX_t.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（本节与第 4 节的边界）</strong>：命题 3.9 只声明“若 Stratonovich 积分按第 4 节定义，则 (3.12) 成立”，不在此展开 Stratonovich 积分的构造与修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的一般公式。第 4 节将把 (3.12) 作为其主定理的推论重新导出，并给出修正项的显式表达；本节只把它作为多维 Itô 引理的一个等价改写，用于说明二阶项的来源是 Itô 积分与 Stratonovich 积分的定义差异，而非链式法则本身失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-9-一个边界情形-退化扩散下的公式\">3.9 一个边界情形：退化扩散下的公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-9-一个边界情形-退化扩散下的公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.10（退化扩散）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在某个开集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;d$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上奇异）。<strong>结论</strong>：定理 3.3 的等式 (3.4) 仍成立，但二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的像空间方向非零；特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内是有限变差过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$df(X_t)=f_t\\,dt+\\nabla f^\\top b\\,dt$</span>，无 Itô 项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：定理 3.3 的证明不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满秩；二次变差 (3.2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 退化时仍良定义（只是矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 奇异）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 时，(3.1) 中 Itô 积分项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为绝对连续过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$df(X_t)=f_t\\,dt+\\nabla f^\\top b\\,dt$</span> 由经典链式法则给出，与 (3.4) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=0$</span> 时的退化一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题的作用是划出定理 3.3 的适用边界：它不要求非退化扩散，但退化时二阶项的信息量减少。第 10 节反例节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 不满足局部有界（假设 (H3.1) 第 2 条失效）时 (3.4) 的二次变差项可能不收敛的具体构造；本节只声明退化秩不破坏公式本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-10-二阶项的显式展开与指标核算\">3.10 二阶项的显式展开与指标核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-10-二阶项的显式展开与指标核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3.8 用迹的循环性证明了二阶项的坐标不变性，但没有把指标逐项写出。本节把 (3.5) 的二阶项按指标完全展开，给出一个可直接用于手算的恒等式，并借此核算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ne m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 的秩与项数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.11（二阶项的指标展开）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>。<strong>结论</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，a.s.</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}\\big(g(X_t,t)g(X_t,t)^\\top\\nabla^2f(X_t,t)\\big)\n=\\tfrac12\\sum_{i=1}^d f_{x^ix^i}(X_t,t)\\sum_{\\alpha=1}^m\\big(g^{i\\alpha}(X_t,t)\\big)^2\n+\\sum_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le d}f_{x^ix^j}(X_t,t)\\sum_{\\alpha=1}^m g^{i\\alpha}(X_t,t)g^{j\\alpha}(X_t,t).\n\\tag{3.13}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)=\\sum_{i,j}(gg^\\top)^{ij}f_{x^ix^j}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)^{ij}=\\sum_\\alpha g^{i\\alpha}g^{j\\alpha}$</span>。把双重和拆成对角部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 与非对角部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i,j}(gg^\\top)^{ij}f_{x^ix^j}\n=\\sum_i(gg^\\top)^{ii}f_{x^ix^i}+\\sum_{i\\ne j}(gg^\\top)^{ij}f_{x^ix^j}.$$</div>\n<p>对角部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f_{x^ix^i}\\sum_\\alpha(g^{i\\alpha})^2$</span>。非对角部分中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,i)$</span> 两项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{x^ix^j}=f_{x^jx^i}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span>，混合偏导对称，假设 (H3.1) 第 1 条）而相等，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i\\ne j}(gg^\\top)^{ij}f_{x^ix^j}=2\\sum_{1\\le i&lt;j\\le d}(gg^\\top)^{ij}f_{x^ix^j}.$$</div>\n<p>把因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 与前面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 合并，得 (3.13)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.12（项数核算）</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span> 时，(3.13) 退化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12\\sum_{i,j}f_{x^ix^j}g^ig^j,$$</div>\n<p>即二阶项是向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(g^1,\\dots,g^d)^\\top$</span> 沿 Hessian 的二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g^\\top\\nabla^2f\\,g$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12d(d+1)$</span> 个独立项（对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 项、非对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12d(d-1)$</span> 项各计一次）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 可逆时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)^{ij}$</span> 一般非对角非零，交叉项全部出现；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为对角矩阵（各坐标独立驱动）时交叉项才消失。此核算说明：多维 Itô 引理相对一维引理的额外代数负担恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12d(d-1)$</span> 个交叉二次变差项，它们不能通过重排指标消去，只能通过命题 3.8 的坐标不变性论证其内蕴性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-11-二阶项的期望形式与-Itô-等距的联合使用\">3.11 二阶项的期望形式与 Itô 等距的联合使用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-11-二阶项的期望形式与-Itô-等距的联合使用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3.3 是路径等式，但在生成动力学中常需要对它取期望以得到漂移算子。本节给出取期望时两个积分项的处理，并显式验证所需可积性条件，为第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口提供代数准备。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.13（Itô 公式的期望形式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>，且额外假设</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\Big(\\big|f_t(X_s,s)\\big|+\\sum_i\\big|f_{x^i}(X_s,s)b^i(X_s,s)\\big|+\\sum_{i,j}\\big|f_{x^ix^j}(X_s,s)\\big|\\sum_\\alpha\\big|g^{i\\alpha}(X_s,s)g^{j\\alpha}(X_s,s)\\big|\\Big)ds&lt;\\infty,\n\\tag{3.14}$$</div>\n<p>以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|\\nabla f(X_s,s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}f(X_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}f(X_0,0)+\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t\\Big(f_t+\\nabla f^\\top b+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\nabla^2f)\\Big)(X_s,s)\\,ds.\n\\tag{3.15}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 (3.4) 两边取期望。右端 Itô 积分项的期望为零：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|\\nabla f^\\top g\\|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，该 Itô 积分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 鞅（第 1 节），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW_s=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ds$</span> 积分项的期望与积分交换：被积函数的期望绝对值由 (3.14) 控制，用 Fubini–Tonelli 定理（非负部分先积分）得可交换，且控制函数可积保证结果有限。左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}f(X_t,t)$</span> 有限由 (3.14) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的连续性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（条件的必要性）</strong>：若去掉 (3.14)，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t(\\cdots)ds$</span> 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty-\\infty$</span> 型不定式，(3.15) 无意义。若去掉 Itô 项平方可积条件，则 Itô 积分仅为局部鞅，其期望一般不为零（局部鞅的期望可以漂移），(3.15) 失效。这两个条件在第 15 节把 (3.15) 写成 Fokker–Planck 弱形式时是必须逐条验证的；本节只把它们显式写出，不展开验证细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-12-一个可手算的恒等式-f-x-x-2-的情形\">3.12 一个可手算的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\|x\\|^2$</span> 的情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-12-一个可手算的恒等式-f-x-x-2-的情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把 (3.5) 的矩阵结构与二次变差 (3.3) 直接对接，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\|x\\|^2=\\sum_i(x^i)^2$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=2x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2f=2I_d$</span>，二阶项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\cdot2I_d)=2\\|g\\|_F^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|_F^2=\\sum_{i,\\alpha}(g^{i\\alpha})^2$</span>。这给出一个不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的具体恒等式，可用于检验任何数值实现是否正确计算了二阶项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.14（平方范数的 Itô 公式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\|x\\|^2$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\|X_t\\|^2=2X_t^\\top b(X_t,t)\\,dt+\\|g(X_t,t)\\|_F^2\\,dt+2X_t^\\top g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t.\n\\tag{3.16}$$</div>\n<p>等价地，取期望并用命题 3.13 的条件，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}\\|X_t\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[X_t^\\top b(X_t,t)\\big]+\\mathbb{E}\\|g(X_t,t)\\|_F^2.\n\\tag{3.17}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(x)=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2f(x)=2I_d$</span>。代入 (3.5)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top b=2X_t^\\top b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top\\cdot2I_d)=\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top)=\\|g\\|_F^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW=2X_t^\\top g\\,dW$</span>。合并得 (3.16)。对 (3.16) 取期望，Itô 项期望为零（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|2X_s^\\top g\\|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (H3.1) 局部有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续在紧区间上有界保证，但全局需额外可积性，故 (3.17) 在命题 3.13 的条件下成立），再用 Fubini 交换期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ds$</span> 积分得 (3.17)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 (3.3) 的对接）</strong>：(3.16) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|_F^2dt$</span> 正是二次变差 (3.3) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=X_t$</span> 时的密度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g^\\top X_t\\|^2=\\sum_\\alpha(\\sum_i g^{i\\alpha}X^i_t)^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|g\\|_F^2=\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 取遍标准基时的和。两者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(gg^\\top)=\\sum_i\\|g^\\top e_i\\|^2$</span> 联系，说明 (3.16) 的二阶项是 (3.3) 在所有坐标方向上的二次变差密度之和，与命题 3.11 的指标展开一致（对角项之和）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-13-二阶项在时间依赖情形下的补充\">3.13 二阶项在时间依赖情形下的补充<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-13-二阶项在时间依赖情形下的补充\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3.3 允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，但 (3.13) 只展开了空间二阶项。时间依赖情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 项与空间二阶项在 Itô 公式中地位不同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\,dt$</span> 是有限变差项，不参与二次变差；而空间二阶项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 驱动。本节把这一区别写成一条独立的核算命题，防止在后续章节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 误并入扩散项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.15（时间依赖项的变差阶）</strong>—<strong>假设 (H3.1)</strong>。<strong>结论</strong>：在 (3.4) 的右端，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(X_s,s)\\,ds$</span> 项的二次变差为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{x^ix^j}d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 项的二次变差为零（它是有限变差项）；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW$</span> 项贡献非零二次变差，且其值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\|\\nabla f(X_s,s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\|^2ds$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：三项分别考察。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\,ds$</span> 是 Lebesgue 积分，绝对连续，二次变差为零（有限变差过程的二次变差为零，第 5 节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{x^ix^j}d\\langle X^i,X^j\\rangle$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ds$</span> 的积分（由 (3.2)），同样绝对连续，二次变差为零。Itô 项由命题 3.7 的 (3.10) 给出二次变差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题的作用是把 (3.4) 的三项按变差阶分层：<span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X\\rangle$</span> 项都是有限变差，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW$</span> 项是鞅部分。第 8 节 Girsanov 定理只改变鞅部分的漂移（通过测度变换吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt$</span> 项），不改变二次变差；命题 3.15 说明这一操作在 Itô 公式层面是良定义的：变换后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 项与二阶项的形式不变，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top b\\,dt$</span> 被重新解释。本节只固定这一分层，不展开 Girsanov 的构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-14-小结性的核算-d-m-2-的完整展开\">3.14 小结性的核算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=2$</span> 的完整展开<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-14-小结性的核算-d-m-2-的完整展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=2$</span> 的完整指标展开，作为本节所有公式的自洽性检验。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=(b^1,b^2)^\\top$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\begin{pmatrix}g^{11}&amp;g^{12}\\\\g^{21}&amp;g^{22}\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 (H3.1)。由 (3.4) 逐项写出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{aligned}\ndf(X_t,t)&amp;=\\Big(f_t+f_{x^1}b^1+f_{x^2}b^2\\Big)dt\\\\\n&amp;\\quad+\\tfrac12\\Big[f_{x^1x^1}\\big((g^{11})^2+(g^{12})^2\\big)+f_{x^2x^2}\\big((g^{21})^2+(g^{22})^2\\big)\\Big]dt\\\\\n&amp;\\quad+f_{x^1x^2}\\big(g^{11}g^{21}+g^{12}g^{22}\\big)dt\\\\\n&amp;\\quad+\\big(f_{x^1}g^{11}+f_{x^2}g^{21}\\big)dW^1+\\big(f_{x^1}g^{12}+f_{x^2}g^{22}\\big)dW^2.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\tag{3.18}$$</div>\n<p>核对：对角二阶项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)^{11}=(g^{11})^2+(g^{12})^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)^{22}=(g^{21})^2+(g^{22})^2$</span>；交叉项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)^{12}=g^{11}g^{21}+g^{12}g^{22}$</span>，由命题 3.11 的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 抵消后系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。Itô 项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 分组：<span class=\"math-inline\">$dW^1$</span> 的系数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的第一列与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 的内积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dW^2$</span> 的系数是第二列与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 的内积。三组系数与 (3.5) 的矩阵乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW$</span> 逐项一致。此展开可直接用于检验任何符号计算实现：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的表达式，把 (3.18) 与自动微分得到的 Hessian 代入，应逐项相等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-Stratonovich-积分与修正项\">Stratonovich 积分与修正项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Stratonovich-积分与修正项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-标准布朗运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应实值过程。前序节已定义 Itô 积分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_{i}H_{t_i}\\bigl(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为适应的、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[H_s^2]\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 的过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>，极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 意义。前序节已证一维 Itô 引理：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,\\infty)\\times\\mathbb R)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b_s\\,ds+\\int_0^t g_s\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 适应、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(|b_s|+g_s^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Bigl(f_t(t,X_t)+f_x(t,X_t)b_t+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}(t,X_t)g_t^2\\Bigr)dt+f_x(t,X_t)g_t\\,dW_t .$$</div>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，均在此处给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对称划分序列</strong>：称划分序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Pi_m)_{m\\ge1}$</span> 为对称的，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_m=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t\\}$</span> 且每个子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 的中点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i^{*}=(t_i+t_{i+1})/2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i^{*}\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span>（显然成立），并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi_m\\|\\to0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>Stratonovich 和</strong>：对适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 与对称划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H,W)=\\sum_{i}H_{t_i^{*}}\\bigl(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\bigr),\\qquad t_i^{*}=\\tfrac{t_i+t_{i+1}}{2}.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>Stratonovich 积分</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Pi_m}(H,W)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中收敛，其极限记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s$</span>，称为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的 Stratonovich 积分。</li>\n<li><strong>修正项</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_t(f,g):=\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)\\,g_s\\,dg_s,$$</div>\n其中右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x g\\,dg$</span> 为 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dW_s$</span> 的简记（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg_s$</span> 在此语境指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_s\\,dW_s$</span> 的 Itô 微分；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数时该项为零）。本节所有命题均在下述假设下陈述：</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,\\infty)\\times\\mathbb R)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x,f_{xx}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]\\times\\mathbb R$</span> 上局部有界；\n<strong>(A2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(|b_s|+g_s^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\le t}\\mathbb E[g_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>；\n<strong>(A3)</strong> 对称划分序列满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi_m\\|\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_m\\|\\Pi_m\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>（保证离散化误差可和，用于逐项估计）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一-Stratonovich-积分的定义与基本性质\">一、Stratonovich 积分的定义与基本性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一-Stratonovich-积分的定义与基本性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 4.1（Stratonovich 积分）</strong> 在 (A2) 下，若对称划分序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Pi_m)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Pi_m}(H,W)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中收敛，则极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s$</span> 称为 Stratonovich 积分。它与 Itô 积分的区别在于被积过程在子区间上的取值点：Itô 取左端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span>，Stratonovich 取中点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i^{*}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.2（中点与左端点之差）</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为连续适应过程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\le t}\\mathbb E[H_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任一对称划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H,W)-\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})=\\sum_i\\bigl(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}\\bigr)\\bigl(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项相减即得，无需额外假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.2 表明两种积分的差异完全由“被积过程在子区间内的增量”与“布朗增量”的乘积决定。下一小节将证明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=f_x(t,X_t)g_t$</span> 时，该乘积的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二-Stratonovich-与-Itô-的修正项恒等式\">二、Stratonovich 与 Itô 的修正项恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二-Stratonovich-与-Itô-的修正项恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 4.3（修正项恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足上式 SDE。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)g_s\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s^2\\,ds+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dg_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中右端第二项为 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t f_{xx}g^2\\,ds$</span> 的 Lebesgue 积分（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2ds$</span> 为有限变差），第三项按符号表定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_xg\\,dg$</span>。等价地，Stratonovich 积分与 Itô 积分之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t f_xg\\circ dW_s-\\int_0^t f_xg\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_{xx}g^2\\,ds+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_xg\\,dg .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=f_x(s,X_s)g_s$</span>。由命题 4.2，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H,W)-\\sum_i H_{t_i}\\Delta W_i=\\sum_i\\bigl(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}\\bigr)\\Delta W_i,\\qquad \\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_i^{*}]$</span> 上用 Itô 引理（前序节已证，适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x(t,X_t)g_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span> 复合，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 适应）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}dH_s\n=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\Bigl(\\partial_t H_s+\\partial_x H_s\\,b_s+\\tfrac12\\partial_{xx}H_s\\,g_s^2\\Bigr)ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\partial_x H_s\\,g_s\\,dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x H_s=f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xx}H_s=f_{xxx}(s,X_s)g_s$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,3}$</span>；若仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span>，则将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xx}H$</span> 理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 的适当导数，或直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 用 Itô 引理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x H=f_{xx}g$</span>，无需三阶导）。为记号简洁，以下设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,3}$</span>，一般情形由局部化与逼近处理（见本节小结第 3 条）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\alpha_s\\,ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=\\partial_tH_s+f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_sb_s+\\tfrac12 f_{xxx}(s,X_s)g_s^3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s$</span>。</p>\n<p>将上式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i})\\Delta W_i$</span>，得两项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\alpha_s\\,ds\\Bigr)\\Delta W_i+\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta W_i .$$</div>\n<p><strong>第一项</strong>：由 (A1) 局部有界与 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\mathbb E[g_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\alpha_s|\\le C$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\bigl|\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\alpha_sds\\bigr|\\le C(t_i^{*}-t_i)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\Delta W_i|^2=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，由 Cauchy–Schwarz，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl|\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\alpha_sds\\Bigr)\\Delta W_i\\Bigr|\\le C(t_i^{*}-t_i)\\sqrt{t_{i+1}-t_i}\\le C\\|\\Pi\\|^{3/2}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\cdot t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sqrt{t_{i+1}-t_i}\\le\\sqrt{n\\sum_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)}=\\sqrt{nt}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le t/\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt{t^2/\\|\\Pi\\|}=t\\|\\Pi\\|^{-1/2}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|^{3/2}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Ct\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>）。故第一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，从而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛，反之不成立；此处直接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|(\\int\\alpha ds)\\Delta W|^2\\le C^2(t_i^{*}-t_i)^2(t_{i+1}-t_i)\\le C^2\\|\\Pi\\|^3$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C^2t\\|\\Pi\\|^2\\to0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二项</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_i=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s$</span>。由 Itô 等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[I_i^2]=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s^2]\\,ds\\le C(t_i^{*}-t_i)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}=(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}})+(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_i$</span> 的鞅部分相关，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i^{*}}$</span> 独立。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_i\\Delta W_i$</span> 拆为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})+I_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}}).$$</div>\n<p>第二项条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[I_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}})\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i^{*}}]=I_i\\cdot0=0$</span>，故其期望为零，且由独立性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|I_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}})|^2=\\mathbb E[I_i^2](t_{i+1}-t_i^{*})\\le C\\|\\Pi\\|^2$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le Ct\\|\\Pi\\|^2\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})$</span>：由 Itô 等距的极化恒等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})\\bigr]=\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\cdot\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}1\\,dW_s\\Bigr]=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]=\\mathbb E[f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s]$</span>。由 (A1) 局部有界与 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\mathbb E[g_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 可积且局部有界。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\bigl[I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})\\bigr]=\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]\\,ds\\xrightarrow{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]\\,ds=\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\int_0^t f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s\\,ds\\Bigr].$$</div>\n<p>更精细地，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的适应性与布朗增量的鞅性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span>（这是 Itô 积分与 Lebesgue 积分之积的二次变差恒等式；严格证明用 Itô 等距对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 的离散近似，见下）。</p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛）</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{(m)}_s=\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}\\mathbf 1_{[t_i,t_i^{*}]}(s)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\beta^{(m)}_sds=\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}(t_i^{*}-t_i)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})=\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}(t_i^{*}-t_i)+o_{L^2}(1)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的连续性与 Itô 等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i})dW_s|^2\\le\\sup_{|s-t_i|\\le\\|\\Pi\\|}\\mathbb E|\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i}|^2\\cdot\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，求和后由一致可积性趋于零）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i I_i(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})\\xrightarrow{L^2}\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds=\\int_0^t f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>综合两项，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H,W)-\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i\\xrightarrow{L^2}\\int_0^t f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i\\xrightarrow{L^2}\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s$</span>（Itô 积分定义）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tf_{xx}g^2\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>但定理 4.3 的陈述中右端含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds+\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 按符号表为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\cdot g\\,dW$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=g\\,dW$</span> 时），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg^2\\,dW$</span>，并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_{xx}g^2ds$</span>。因此需逐项复核：定理 4.3 的修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Itô 微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg_s$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 本身满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg_s=\\gamma_sds+\\sigma_sdW_s$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为扩散系数过程）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=0$</span>，此时定理 4.3 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\circ dW=\\int f_xg\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds$</span>，与上式一致。<strong>故定理 4.3 的第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非平凡时出现，且其系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的二次变差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 的乘积的对称化。</strong> 本节采用符号表定义，不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 SDE；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数的重要情形，修正项退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.4（常数扩散系数的 Stratonovich–Itô 转换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_s\\equiv\\sigma$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)\\sigma\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)\\sigma\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_{xx}(s,X_s)\\sigma^2\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在定理 4.3 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv\\sigma$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=0$</span>，第三项为零，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}\\sigma^2ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span> 的验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0,g=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=2$</span>。Itô 引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(W_t^2)=2W_t\\,dW_t+dt$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t^2=\\int_0^t2W_s\\,dW_s+t$</span>。而 Stratonovich 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t2W_s\\circ dW_s$</span> 由推论 4.4 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t2W_s\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t2\\,ds=\\int_0^t2W_s\\,dW_s+t=W_t^2$</span>。这正是普通微积分基本定理的形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t2W_s\\circ dW_s=W_t^2-W_0^2$</span>。验证了 Stratonovich 积分保持经典链式法则。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-三-Stratonovich-积分保持经典链式法则\">三、Stratonovich 积分保持经典链式法则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-三-Stratonovich-积分保持经典链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 4.6（Stratonovich 链式法则）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足上式 SDE，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)-f(0,X_0)=\\int_0^t f_t(s,X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)\\circ dX_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\circ dX_s$</span> 表示 Stratonovich 微分，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tf_x\\circ dX_s=\\int_0^tf_xb_s\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_xg_s\\circ dW_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Itô 引理（前序节），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)-f(0,X_0)=\\int_0^t\\Bigl(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\Bigr)ds+\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>由推论 4.4（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 情形）推广到变系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int f_xg\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds+\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg_s$</span>。代入上式，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)-f(0,X_0)=\\int_0^t(f_t+f_xb)\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg_s .$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(t,X_t)-f(0,X_0)=\\int_0^t(f_t+f_xb)\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_t\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_x\\circ dX_s .$$</div>\n<p>一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x\\circ dX_s=\\int f_xb\\,ds+\\int f_xg\\circ dW_s$</span>，而 Itô 引理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2ds$</span> 恰被 Stratonovich 修正项吸收，故链式法则成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 4.6 表明：Stratonovich 积分使经典微积分的链式法则对扩散过程成立，代价是积分不再具有鞅性质（Stratonovich 积分一般不是鞅）。这是两种积分体系的根本 trade-off：Itô 积分保持鞅性但破坏链式法则，Stratonovich 积分保持链式法则但破坏鞅性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-四-数值验证-Stratonovich-与-Itô-的差异\">四、数值验证：Stratonovich 与 Itô 的差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-四-数值验证-Stratonovich-与-Itô-的差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在离散层面上验证例 4.5：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=W_t$</span>，比较中点求和（Stratonovich 近似）与左端点求和（Itô 近似）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t2W_s\\,dW_s$</span> 的逼近，并检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t^2$</span> 的恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240501)\nT, n_steps, n_paths = 1.0, 20000, 4000\ndt = T / n_steps\n\n# 生成布朗路径增量，形状 (n_paths, n_steps)\ndW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=(n_paths, n_steps))\nW = np.concatenate([np.zeros((n_paths, 1)), np.cumsum(dW, axis=1)], axis=1)  # 形状 (n_paths, n_steps+1)\n\n# 左端点 Itô 和：sum_i 2 W_{t_i} dW_i\nito_sum = 2.0 * np.sum(W[:, :-1] * dW, axis=1)\n\n# 中点 Stratonovich 和：sum_i 2 W_{t_i^*} dW_i，t_i^* 处 W 取 (W_i+W_{i+1})/2\nW_mid = 0.5 * (W[:, :-1] + W[:, 1:])\nstrat_sum = 2.0 * np.sum(W_mid * dW, axis=1)\n\n# 理论值：Itô 积分 = W_T^2 - T；Stratonovich 积分 = W_T^2\nW_T = W[:, -1]\nito_theory = W_T**2 - T\nstrat_theory = W_T**2\n\n# 断言：两种近似分别逼近各自理论值（容差按路径数放宽）\nassert np.max(np.abs(ito_sum - ito_theory)) &lt; 0.5, &quot;Itô 近似偏离理论值&quot;\nassert np.max(np.abs(strat_sum - strat_theory)) &lt; 0.5, &quot;Stratonovich 近似偏离理论值&quot;\n\n# 断言：两者之差逼近 T（修正项）\ndiff = strat_sum - ito_sum\nassert np.max(np.abs(diff - T)) &lt; 0.5, &quot;修正项未逼近 T&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;dW shape:&quot;, dW.shape)\nprint(&quot;W shape:&quot;, W.shape)\nprint(&quot;Itô 和均值:&quot;, ito_sum.mean(), &quot; 理论均值:&quot;, ito_theory.mean())\nprint(&quot;Stratonovich 和均值:&quot;, strat_sum.mean(), &quot; 理论均值:&quot;, strat_theory.mean())\nprint(&quot;修正项均值:&quot;, diff.mean(), &quot; 预期:&quot;, T)\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>dW shape: (4000, 20000)</code>，<code>W shape: (4000, 20001)</code>，Itô 和均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T^2-T$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），Stratonovich 和均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T^2$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>），修正项均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。断言全部通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-五-与-Itô-引理修正项的关系\">五、与 Itô 引理修正项的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-五-与-Itô-引理修正项的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 4.3 的修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 与 Itô 引理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2dt$</span> 是同一现象的两个侧面：前者是 Stratonovich 积分与 Itô 积分之差的“过程相关”部分，后者是 Itô 引理中二阶导项的“时间累积”部分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=0$</span>，修正项退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds$</span>，恰为 Itô 引理中的二阶项。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 变化时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW$</span> 分量，修正项中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的随机部分，这对应 Stratonovich 积分在变系数下的额外修正。<strong>本节不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 SDE 结构</strong>（该内容属于后续节的 SDE 强解与弱解），仅指出：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数的重要情形（扩散生成模型中的常见设定），Stratonovich–Itô 转换公式闭合为推论 4.4。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Stratonovich 积分定义为对称划分下中点求和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限，与 Itô 积分（左端点求和）的差异由命题 4.2 精确刻画为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i})\\Delta W_i$</span>。</li>\n<li>定理 4.3 证明该差异在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中收敛为修正项：常数扩散系数情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\circ dW=\\int f_xg\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds$</span>（推论 4.4），变系数情形下额外出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>；例 4.5 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span> 验证了 Stratonovich 积分保持经典链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t2W_s\\circ dW_s=W_t^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>两种积分体系的 trade-off 是：Itô 积分保持鞅性但破坏链式法则，Stratonovich 积分保持链式法则但破坏鞅性；定理 4.6 给出 Stratonovich 链式法则的完整陈述，数值代码在离散层面验证了修正项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的恒等式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-六-变系数扩散的修正项-二次变差与对称化\">六、变系数扩散的修正项：二次变差与对称化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-六-变系数扩散的修正项-二次变差与对称化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节将变系数情形下的修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dg_s$</span> 暂时搁置，本节将其补足。核心问题是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 本身是随机过程时，Stratonovich 积分与 Itô 积分之差是否仍能写成“二阶导项 + 过程相关项”的闭合形式。回答这一问题需要显式使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的二次变差，而二次变差的严格处理属于后续第 5 节；本节只使用其定义与一条已在前序节建立的基本性质（连续半鞅的二次变差存在且为连续增过程），并显式列出所依赖的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A4)</strong> 扩散系数过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(g_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-半鞅，具有分解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_t=g_0+\\int_0^t\\mu_s\\,ds+\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma$</span> 适应、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(|\\mu_s|+\\sigma_s^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\le t}\\mathbb E[\\sigma_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle g\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma_s^2\\,ds$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 的作用是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg$</span> 有定义（作为 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\mu\\,ds+\\int f_xg\\sigma\\,dW$</span>），并使下文的对称化恒等式可证。若仅假设 (A2)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 适应、平方可积），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 未必是半鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 无意义，定理 4.3 的第三项应视为形式记号而非已定义对象；这一点在反例节将给出具体边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.7（变系数修正项的对称化恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)g_s\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s^2\\,ds+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_x(s,X_s)g_s\\,dg_s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=f_x(s,X_s)g_s$</span>。由命题 4.2，对对称划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H,W)-\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i=\\sum_i\\bigl(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}\\bigr)\\Delta W_i .$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}$</span> 用 Itô 引理展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,X_t,g_t)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span> 函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 二次连续可微，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 线性），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dH_s=\\Bigl(\\partial_tH_s+f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_sb_s+f_x(s,X_s)\\mu_s+\\tfrac12f_{xxx}(s,X_s)g_s^3+\\tfrac12f_x(s,X_s)\\cdot0\\Bigr)ds\n+\\Bigl(f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s^2+f_x(s,X_s)\\sigma_s\\Bigr)dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>其中交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\partial_{xg}H\\cdot d\\langle X,g\\rangle_s$</span> 为零，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的布朗部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\,dW$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的布朗部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\,dW$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X,g\\rangle_s=g_s\\sigma_s\\,ds$</span>，对应项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}(s,X_s)g_s\\sigma_s\\,ds$</span>——<strong>此处必须显式保留</strong>，它是变系数情形下修正项出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的来源。修正后的展开为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dH_s=\\alpha_s\\,ds+\\beta_s\\,dW_s,\\qquad\n\\alpha_s=\\partial_tH_s+f_{xx}g b_s+f_x\\mu_s+\\tfrac12f_{xxx}g^3+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g\\sigma_s,\n\\quad\\beta_s=f_{xx}g^2+f_x\\sigma_s .$$</div>\n<p>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xxx}g^3$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的三阶项；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 而无三阶导，则该项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的二次变差估计吸收，见下文注。）</p>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i})\\Delta W_i$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\alpha_sds)\\Delta W_i+\\sum_i(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_sdW_s)\\Delta W_i$</span>。第一项与定理 4.3 证明中相同，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中趋于零。第二项由 Itô 等距的极化恒等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta W_i\\Bigr]=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]\\,ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s\\cdot1]\\,ds\\cdot\\mathbf 1_{\\{t_i^{*}\\le t_{i+1}\\}} .$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i=(W_{t_i^{*}}-W_{t_i})+(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i^{*}})$</span>，第二段与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i^{*}}$</span> 独立、条件期望为零；第一段与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_sdW_s$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\mathbb E[\\beta_s]\\,ds$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta W_i\\xrightarrow{L^2}\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\bigl(f_{xx}g^2+f_x\\sigma_s\\bigr)ds .$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tf_{xx}g^2\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_x\\sigma_s\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\mu_s\\,ds+\\int_0^tf_xg\\sigma_s\\,dW_s$</span>，其二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tf_x^2g^2\\sigma_s^2\\,ds$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tf_x\\sigma_s\\,ds$</span> 并不直接等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>。<strong>关键恒等式</strong>：由 Itô 引理作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x(t,X_t)g_t$</span> 的乘积结构，并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle X,g\\rangle_s=g_s\\sigma_s\\,ds$</span>，可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_x\\sigma_s\\,ds=\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s-\\int_0^tf_xg\\mu_s\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\equiv0$</span> 时化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x\\sigma\\,ds=\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=\\sigma\\,dW$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\sigma\\,dW$</span> 的二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x^2g^2\\sigma^2ds$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x\\sigma\\,ds$</span> 的期望相等仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg$</span> 为常数）。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\neq0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_x\\sigma\\,ds$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的差异恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\mu\\,ds$</span> 的漂移部分，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tf_{xx}g^2\\,ds+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s-\\int_0^tf_xg\\mu_s\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>将右端最后两项合并并重新整理，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg=\\int f_xg\\mu\\,ds+\\int f_xg\\sigma\\,dW$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tf_xg\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dW_s+\\int_0^tf_{xx}g^2\\,ds+\\tfrac12\\int_0^tf_xg\\,dg_s .$$</div>\n<p><strong>注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 而无三阶导的情形）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xxx}g^3$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\int\\alpha ds)\\Delta W_i$</span> 的估计中只贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span> 量级，且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 控制，故不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限。因此定理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 成立，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,3}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.7 与定理 4.3 的差别在于：定理 4.3 在 (A1)–(A3) 下陈述，第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 按符号表定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\cdot g\\,dW$</span>（即把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 读作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\,dW$</span>），这仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的漂移为零时与命题 4.7 一致；命题 4.7 在 (A4) 下给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 的完整半鞅分解，是变系数情形的正确闭合形式。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv\\sigma$</span> 常数时重合于推论 4.4。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-七-Stratonovich-积分作为极限的收敛性刻画\">七、Stratonovich 积分作为极限的收敛性刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-七-Stratonovich-积分作为极限的收敛性刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前两小节给出了修正项的代数恒等式，但未回答一个更基本的问题：Stratonovich 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH_s\\circ dW_s$</span> 作为对称划分中点和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限，其收敛性由什么保证？Itô 积分的收敛性由被积过程的适应性与平方可积性保证（前序节已证）；Stratonovich 积分的中点取值破坏了适应性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i^{*}}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{t_i^{*}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i^{*}&gt;t_i$</span>），因此需要额外的光滑性假设。本小节给出收敛性的充分条件，并说明它与 Itô 积分收敛条件的差别。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.8（Stratonovich 和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=h(s,X_s)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in C^{1,2}([0,\\infty)\\times\\mathbb R)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_x$</span> 局部有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 (A2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\le t}\\mathbb E[g_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任一对称划分序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi_m\\|\\to0$</span>，中点和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\Pi_m}(H,W)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中收敛，其极限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^tH_s\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t h_x(s,X_s)g_s^2\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\Pi(H,W)=\\sum_iH_{t_i}\\Delta W_i+\\sum_i(H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i})\\Delta W_i$</span>。第一项由 Itô 积分定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int H\\,dW$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\mathbb E[H_s^2]ds&lt;\\infty$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_x$</span> 局部有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\mathbb E[g_s^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证）。第二项由 Itô 引理展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}=\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}h_xg\\,dW_s+\\int_{t_i}^{t_i^{*}}(\\cdots)ds$</span>，与定理 4.3 证明中相同的估计给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^th_xg^2\\,ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.8 表明：Stratonovich 积分的存在性不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应（中点取值本身非适应），但要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,X_t)$</span> 的光滑函数，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i^{*}}-H_{t_i}$</span> 可由 Itô 引理控制。这与 Itô 积分“只要求适应性 + 平方可积”形成对照：Itô 积分的定义域更宽，但链式法则更复杂；Stratonovich 积分的定义域更窄（需光滑性），但链式法则与经典微积分一致。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.9（Stratonovich 积分的鞅性质失效）</strong> 在命题 4.8 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_xg^2$</span> 不恒为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH_s\\circ dW_s$</span> 一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-鞅。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4.8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH\\circ dW=\\int_0^tH\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\int_0^th_xg^2ds$</span>。第一项是鞅（Itô 积分），第二项是连续增过程（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_xg^2\\ge0$</span>）或一般有限变差过程。有限变差过程除非恒为零，否则不是鞅（鞅的有限变差部分必须为零）。故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_xg^2$</span> 不恒为零时，Stratonovich 积分非鞅。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.9 精确刻画了两种积分体系的 trade-off：Itô 积分保持鞅性（从而期望为零、可用于定价），Stratonovich 积分保持链式法则（从而可用于几何与物理建模），二者不可兼得。在扩散生成模型的语境下，这一 trade-off 对应两种等价的 SDE 表述：Itô SDE 便于用 Fokker–Planck 方程分析边缘分布演化（因漂移项直接进入方程），Stratonovich SDE 便于在流形上做坐标变换（因链式法则保持）。第 15 节将给出这一接口的显式转换公式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-八-具体算例-变系数下的修正项数值验证\">八、具体算例：变系数下的修正项数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-八-具体算例-变系数下的修正项数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为验证命题 4.7 的闭合形式，取一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非常数的显式例子。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad g(x)=1+x^2,\\qquad X_0=0,$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=0$</span>。此时 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t1\\cdot g(X_s)\\,dW_s=\\int_0^tg(X_s)\\,dW_s=X_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=g\\,dW_t$</span>）。Stratonovich 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t1\\circ dX_s$</span> 按链式法则应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t-X_0=X_t$</span>。由命题 4.7，修正项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_{xx}g^2ds+\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg=\\tfrac12\\int g\\,dg$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_t)=1+X_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=2X_t\\,dX_t+d\\langle X\\rangle_t=2X_tg\\,dW_t+g^2\\,dt$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g\\,dg=\\tfrac12\\int g(2X_tg\\,dW_t+g^2\\,dt)=\\int X_tg^2\\,dW_t+\\tfrac12\\int g^3\\,dt$</span>。这一项非零，说明即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 是线性的，变系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 仍产生 Stratonovich–Itô 差异——差异完全来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的二次变差，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的二阶导。</p>\n<p>数值上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=20000$</span> 步，比较左端点 Itô 和与中点 Stratonovich 和：</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-二次变差\">二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-Brownian 运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应过程；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=t\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 的有限分割，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge1$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X\\|_{\\infty,t}=\\sup_{0\\le s\\le t}|X_s|$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节内定义并仅在本节使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>二次变差：对连续适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，若沿分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 的平方和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i})^2$</span> 在概率意义下（或依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 一致地）当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时收敛，则极限记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span>，称为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上的二次变差。</li>\n<li>二次协变差：对两个连续适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X,Y\\rangle_t=\\tfrac14(\\langle X+Y\\rangle_t-\\langle X-Y\\rangle_t)$</span>，等价于极化恒等式下的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i(X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i})(Y_{t_{i+1}}-Y_{t_i})$</span>。</li>\n<li>变差记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_1(X;[0,t])=\\sup_{\\Pi}\\sum_i|X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i}|$</span> 为全变差；本节关心的是二阶量，故不展开全变差的测度论细节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（本节主定理所需）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应过程，且对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|X\\|_{\\infty,t}^p]&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证平方和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛论证中出现的四阶矩有限，从而可用 Dominated Convergence 与 Fubini 交换期望与极限。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（Brownian 二次变差所需）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为标准一维 Brownian 运动，故其增量独立、平稳、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2]=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，且四阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^4]=3(t_{i+1}-t_i)^2$</span>。这些矩由 Brownian 运动的高斯性直接得到，无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（Itô 积分存在所需，本节仅引用不重证）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-循序可测、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。前序节已在该假设下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限，本节用它来计算二次变差。</p>\n<p>下面先给出二次变差的核心定义并与相邻概念作区别，再证明 Brownian 运动的二次变差恒等式，随后给出连续适应过程二次变差的存在性与 Itô 积分二次变差的显式公式，最后给出一个可检验的推论与具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\">定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（二次变差）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应、连续、非降、初值为零的过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle$</span>，使得对任意一列分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(m)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi^{(m)}\\|\\to0$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i}\\bigl(X_{t_{i+1}^{(m)}}-X_{t_i^{(m)}}\\bigr)^2\\;\\xrightarrow{\\;\\mathbb P\\;}\\;\\langle X\\rangle_t,$$</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的二次变差。若上述收敛对某个分割序列依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 成立，则称二次变差依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 存在；本节主定理将在假设 (A1) 下证明依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛，从而依概率收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>与全变差的区别</strong>　全变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_1(X;[0,t])$</span> 是一阶量，对 Brownian 运动几乎必然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（因 Brownian 路径几乎必然不是有界变差）。二次变差是二阶量，对 Brownian 运动几乎必然有限且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。二者不是同一对象的两种范数，而是不同阶的路径泛函：全变差刻画路径的“长度”，二次变差刻画路径的“能量”。Itô 积分之所以不能按 Riemann–Stieltjes 方式用全变差定义，正是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的全变差发散；二次变差有限恰是 Itô 积分得以用平方和极限定义的根本原因。</p>\n<p><strong>与二次协变差的区别</strong>　二次变差是单个过程的二阶泛函；二次协变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X,Y\\rangle$</span> 是两个过程的极化量，满足双线性与对称性。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=Y$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X,X\\rangle=\\langle X\\rangle$</span>。本节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W\\rangle_t=t$</span>，并由此得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W,W\\rangle_t=t$</span>；对一般 Itô 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_t\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span>，将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t g_s^2\\,ds$</span>，这是后文 Itô 引理中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 项的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-Brownian-运动的二次变差\">Brownian 运动的二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Brownian-运动的二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Brownian 二次变差）</strong>　设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为标准一维 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 的分割。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\sum_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2\\Bigr]=t,\\qquad\n\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2-t\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]\\le 2\\|\\Pi\\|\\,t.$$</div>\n<p>从而当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时，平方和依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W\\rangle_t=t$</span> 几乎必然（沿任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 的序列依概率收敛）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>。由 Brownian 增量的独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Delta_i\\}$</span> 相互独立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta_i^2]=\\Delta t_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta_i^4]=3(\\Delta t_i)^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>第一步，计算一阶矩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\sum_i\\Delta_i^2\\Bigr]=\\sum_i\\mathbb E[\\Delta_i^2]=\\sum_i\\Delta t_i=t.$$</div>\n<p>第二步，计算二阶矩。由独立性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i\\Delta_i^2-t\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]\n=\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i^2-\\Delta t_i)^2\\bigr]\n=\\sum_i\\bigl(\\mathbb E[\\Delta_i^4]-(\\Delta t_i)^2\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>其中交叉项因独立性而为零：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta_i^2-\\Delta t_i)(\\Delta_j^2-\\Delta t_j)]=\\mathbb E[\\Delta_i^2-\\Delta t_i]\\,\\mathbb E[\\Delta_j^2-\\Delta t_j]=0$</span>。代入四阶矩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i^2-\\Delta t_i)^2\\bigr]=3(\\Delta t_i)^2-(\\Delta t_i)^2=2(\\Delta t_i)^2.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i\\Delta_i^2-t\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]=2\\sum_i(\\Delta t_i)^2\\le 2\\|\\Pi\\|\\sum_i\\Delta t_i=2\\|\\Pi\\|\\,t.$$</div>\n<p>第三步，由 Chebyshev 不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\Bigl(\\Bigl|\\sum_i\\Delta_i^2-t\\Bigr|&gt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\le\\frac{2\\|\\Pi\\|\\,t}{\\varepsilon^2}\\to0\\quad(\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0).$$</div>\n<p>故平方和依概率收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛蕴含依概率收敛，且极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是确定性常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W\\rangle_t=t$</span> 几乎必然成立（沿所取序列）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>　命题 1 的证明只用了 Brownian 增量的独立性与前两阶矩，未用高斯性；但四阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3(\\Delta t_i)^2$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 来自高斯性。若仅假设增量独立同分布且二阶矩有限，则四阶矩为某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，二阶矩估计变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(C-1)\\|\\Pi\\|t$</span>，收敛性不变。这说明二次变差的存在性比 Brownian 运动的分布细节更稳健，但常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 是高斯情形特有的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-连续适应过程的二次变差存在性\">连续适应过程的二次变差存在性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-连续适应过程的二次变差存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（二次变差存在性）</strong>　设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应过程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|X\\|_{\\infty,t}^p]&lt;\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;2$</span>）。则对任意一列分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(m)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi^{(m)}\\|\\to0$</span>，平方和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(X_{t_{i+1}^{(m)}}-X_{t_i^{(m)}})^2$</span> 依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛到一个极限，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应、连续、非降、初值为零的过程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　证明分三步：先证平方和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 柯西性，再证极限的适应性，最后证非降性与连续性。</p>\n<p>第一步（柯西性）。取两个分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi,\\Pi'$</span>，记其公共加细为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'$</span>。对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi)=\\sum_i(X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i})^2$</span>。关键观察：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi'$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 的加细，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi')\\ge S(\\Pi)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\ge a^2+b^2$</span> 对同号增量不成立，但对平方和有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum(a_j+b_j)^2\\ge\\sum a_j^2+\\sum b_j^2$</span> 仅当交叉项非负；此处需小心）。更稳妥的路径是用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 模控制差：</p>\n<p>对任意两个分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi,\\Pi'$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'$</span> 为公共加细，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(\\Pi\\vee\\Pi')-S(\\Pi)=\\sum_{j}\\bigl[(X_{u_{j+1}}-X_{u_j})^2-(X_{v_{k+1}}-X_{v_k})^2\\bigr]$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_j\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'$</span> 的节点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v_k\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 的节点，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[v_k,v_{k+1}]$</span> 被若干 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[u_j,u_{j+1}]$</span> 细分。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[v_k,v_{k+1}]$</span>，设其细分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 段，增量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{k,1},\\dots,\\delta_{k,m_k}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Bigl(\\sum_{l}\\delta_{k,l}\\Bigr)^2-\\sum_l\\delta_{k,l}^2=2\\sum_{l&lt;l'}\\delta_{k,l}\\delta_{k,l'}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(\\Pi\\vee\\Pi')-S(\\Pi)=2\\sum_k\\sum_{l&lt;l'}\\delta_{k,l}\\delta_{k,l'}.$$</div>\n<p>取期望并用 Cauchy–Schwarz：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl|S(\\Pi\\vee\\Pi')-S(\\Pi)\\bigr|\n\\le 2\\sum_k\\sum_{l&lt;l'}\\mathbb E|\\delta_{k,l}\\delta_{k,l'}|\n\\le 2\\sum_k\\sum_{l&lt;l'}\\bigl(\\mathbb E\\delta_{k,l}^2\\bigr)^{1/2}\\bigl(\\mathbb E\\delta_{k,l'}^2\\bigr)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1) 及 Brownian 型增量的矩估计（对连续适应过程，增量的二阶矩由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|X\\|_{\\infty,t}^p]&lt;\\infty$</span> 控制），存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X_s-X_r)^2]\\le C_t|s-r|$</span>（此即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 模连续性，由 (A1) 与 Kolmogorov 连续性准则的逆用得到；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 Itô 过程则直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的平方可积性得到）。于是每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_t|u_{j+1}-u_j|$</span>，求和得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl|S(\\Pi\\vee\\Pi')-S(\\Pi)\\bigr|\\le 2C_t\\sum_k\\Bigl(\\sum_l|u_{j+1}-u_j|\\Bigr)\\cdot\\|\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'\\|\\le 2C_t\\,t\\,\\|\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对称地控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi')$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|S(\\Pi)-S(\\Pi')|\\le 4C_t\\,t\\,\\|\\Pi\\vee\\Pi'\\|\\le 4C_t\\,t\\,(\\|\\Pi\\|+\\|\\Pi'\\|).$$</div>\n<p>故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|,\\|\\Pi'\\|\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|S(\\Pi)-S(\\Pi')|\\to0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{S(\\Pi)\\}$</span> 依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 为柯西列。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 完备性，存在极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t\\in L^1$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步（适应性）。对每个分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span>-可测的（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 适应）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 极限保持可测性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span>-可测。又对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_s$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,s]$</span> 上的分割定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上的分割定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t-\\langle X\\rangle_s$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的平方和极限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle$</span> 适应。</p>\n<p>第三步（非降性与连续性）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t-\\langle X\\rangle_s=\\lim\\sum_{[s,t]\\text{ 内}}(X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i})^2\\ge0$</span>，故非降。连续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的路径连续性与平方和对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 的一致控制得到：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow s$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的平方和趋于零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上一致连续，平方和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sup|X_u-X_v|\\cdot\\sum|X_{t_{i+1}}-X_{t_i}|$</span>，而全变差在小区间上可被一致连续性控制到任意小；此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的连续性与紧区间上一致连续）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle$</span> 连续。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>　命题 2 的证明中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 模连续性”一步依赖 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;2$</span> 与 Kolmogorov 准则；若仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X_s-X_r)^2]$</span> 可能不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s-r|$</span> 线性控制，柯西性论证需改用更精细的鞅估计。本节采用 (A1) 是为了让证明完整且不引入额外鞅论工具；后文 SDE 节将在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 平方可积下直接构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t g_s^2\\,ds$</span>，无需 (A1) 的高阶矩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-Itô-积分的二次变差\">Itô 积分的二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Itô-积分的二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Itô 积分二次变差）</strong>　设 (A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 循序可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\quad\\text{依概率}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b_s\\,ds+\\int_0^t g_s\\,dW_s$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 循序可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t(|b_s|+g_s^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 几乎必然，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t g_s^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　只证第一式；第二式由第一式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\int b\\,ds\\rangle_t=0$</span>（有限变差部分的二次变差为零）及二次变差的双线性得到。</p>\n<p>对分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i W=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i M=M_{t_{i+1}}-M_{t_i}=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i(\\Delta_i M)^2-\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr].$$</div>\n<p>利用 Itô 等距，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta_i M)^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}]=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\mathbb E[H_s^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}]\\,ds$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}H_s^2\\,ds$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta_i M)^2-A_i\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}]=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta_i M)^2-A_i$</span> 为鞅差。由鞅差的正交性（对不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 条件期望为零），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i(\\Delta_i M)^2-\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]\n=\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^2-A_i\\bigr]^2.$$</div>\n<p>对每项用条件期望与 Itô 等距展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^2-A_i\\bigr]^2\n=\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^4\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}\\bigr]-2A_i\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}\\bigr]+A_i^2\\Bigr].$$</div>\n<p>由 Brownian 积分的四阶矩估计（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 有界时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\int H\\,dW)^4]\\le C(\\int H^2\\,ds)^2$</span>，一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 由有界逼近与 Dominated Convergence 得到），存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^4\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}\\bigr]\\le C\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}H_s^2\\,ds\\Bigr)^2=C A_i^2.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta_i M)^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}]=A_i$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[(\\Delta_i M)^2-A_i\\bigr]^2\\le (C-2+1)\\mathbb E[A_i^2]=(C-1)\\mathbb E[A_i^2].$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i(\\Delta_i M)^2-\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]\\le (C-1)\\sum_i\\mathbb E[A_i^2].$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i\\le\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}H_s^2\\,ds$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i A_i=\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i A_i^2\\le\\|\\Pi\\|\\sum_i A_i=\\|\\Pi\\|\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\sum_i(\\Delta_i M)^2-\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]\\le (C-1)\\|\\Pi\\|\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds\\to0.$$</div>\n<p>由 Chebyshev 不等式得依概率收敛。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（Itô 引理的二次变差项）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b_s\\,ds+\\int_0^t g_s\\,dW_s$</span> 满足命题 3 的条件。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle f(X)\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t f_x(X_s)^2g_s^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 Itô 引理（前序节已证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$df(X_t)=(f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2)\\,dt+f_xg\\,dW_t$</span>。将其写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dY_t=\\tilde b_t\\,dt+\\tilde g_t\\,dW_t$</span> 的形式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=f(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde g_t=f_x(X_t)g_t$</span>。由命题 3 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle Y\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\tilde g_s^2\\,ds=\\int_0^t f_x(X_s)^2g_s^2\\,ds$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>　推论 1 是本节与 Itô 引理一维推导节的接口：Itô 引理中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle f(X)\\rangle$</span> 的“漂移部分”在泰勒展开中的体现。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_{t+\\Delta})-f(X_t)\\approx f_x\\Delta X+\\tfrac12f_{xx}(\\Delta X)^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta X)^2$</span> 的期望主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2\\Delta t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 项来自二次变差。这一恒等式将在数值验证节用 Euler–Maruyama 离散直接检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-具体例子-几何-Brownian-运动的二次变差\">具体例子：几何 Brownian 运动的二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-具体例子-几何-Brownian-运动的二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0\\exp(\\sigma W_t-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2t)$</span> 为几何 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。由 Itô 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sigma X_t\\,dW_t$</span>（漂移为零）。由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma^2X_s^2\\,ds$</span>。另一方面，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^2=X_0^2\\exp(2\\sigma W_t-\\sigma^2t)$</span>，由 Itô 引理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(X_t^2)=2\\sigma X_t^2\\,dW_t+2\\sigma^2X_t^2\\,dt$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^2\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t4\\sigma^2X_s^4\\,ds$</span>。验证极化恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X,X\\rangle_t=\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^2\\rangle_t=4\\langle X\\rangle$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为常数时成立，故此处不构成矛盾——极化恒等式适用于同一过程与自身，不适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^2$</span>。此例说明二次变差是过程特定的二阶泛函，不能跨过程线性外推。</p>\n<p><strong>数值可检验性</strong>　对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=10^4$</span> 步 Euler–Maruyama 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{i+1}}=X_{t_i}(1+\\sigma\\Delta W_i)$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1X_s^2\\,ds$</span> 的离散近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_iX_{t_i}^2\\Delta t_i$</span>，二者应在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2})$</span> 内一致（由命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛速率）。此检验将在代码节实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二次变差与-Itô-等距的对接\">二次变差与 Itô 等距的对接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二次变差与-Itô-等距的对接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（Itô 等距的二次变差表述）</strong>　设 (A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 循序可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]=\\mathbb E\\bigl[\\langle M\\rangle_t\\bigr]=\\mathbb E\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds$</span> 依概率。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为平方可积鞅（(A3) 保证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[M_t^2]=\\mathbb E[\\langle M\\rangle_t]$</span>（平方可积鞅的二次变差与二阶矩的关系，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^2-\\langle M\\rangle_t$</span> 为鞅取期望得到）。代入即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>　命题 7 把 Itô 等距从“定义性公理”降格为“二次变差的推论”：前序节定义 Itô 积分时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等距为构造工具，本节则反过来用二次变差刻画该等距的期望形式。这一对接使后文 Girsanov 定理中测度变换下的二次变差改写（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle$</span> 在等价测度下不变，仅漂移项改变）有了统一的语言。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（二次变差在等价测度下的不变性，仅陈述不证）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb Q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_t)$</span> 上的等价概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为连续适应过程。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb Q$</span> 下几乎必然相等。此推论将在 Girsanov 定理节给出完整证明；本节仅记录其与命题 3 的相容性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tg_s^2\\,ds$</span> 只依赖扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在等价测度下不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二次变差的可加性与停止\">二次变差的可加性与停止<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二次变差的可加性与停止\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（二次变差的可加性）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\langle X\\rangle_s+\\langle X\\rangle_t-\\langle X\\rangle_s,$$</div>\n<p>且右端第二项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的二次变差，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t-\\langle X\\rangle_s=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_{[s,t]\\text{ 内}}\\Delta X_i^2$</span> 依概率。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 的分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，将其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 处加细（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不是节点则插入），得加细分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi'$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi')=S_{[0,s]}(\\Pi')+S_{[s,t]}(\\Pi')$</span>，其中两项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,s]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 内的平方和。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span>，由命题 2 的柯西性与极限的唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{[0,s]}(\\Pi')\\to\\langle X\\rangle_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{[s,t]}(\\Pi')\\to\\langle X\\rangle_t-\\langle X\\rangle_s$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\Pi')\\to\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span>）。故可加性成立。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（停止的二次变差）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-停时。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X^\\tau\\rangle_t=\\langle X\\rangle_{t\\wedge\\tau}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\tau_t=X_{t\\wedge\\tau}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\omega)\\ge t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,t]$</span> 上相同，平方和相同；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\omega)&lt;t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tau,t]$</span> 上为常数，该段平方和为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\tau(\\Pi)=S_{[0,\\tau]}(\\Pi)$</span>。两种情形统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\tau(\\Pi)\\to\\langle X\\rangle_{t\\wedge\\tau}$</span>。由命题 2 的极限唯一性得证。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>　命题 9 是后文 SDE 强解存在性证明中“局部化”步骤的基础：先在紧集上构造解，再用停时拼接，二次变差的可停止性保证拼接后的二次变差与整体一致。若缺少此性质，局部解无法升级为全局解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-二次变差与漂移的分离\">一个可检验的恒等式：二次变差与漂移的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-二次变差与漂移的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（有限变差部分不贡献二次变差）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为连续、适应、有限变差过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_0=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle A\\rangle_t=0$</span> 几乎必然。从而若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+A_t+M_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为连续平方可积鞅，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\langle M\\rangle_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta A_i)^2\\le\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\cdot\\mathrm{Var}_1(A;[0,t])$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta A_i|\\le\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\cdot|\\Delta A_i|^{1/2}$</span> 与 Cauchy–Schwarz）。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 有限变差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_1(A;[0,t])&lt;\\infty$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta A_i)^2\\to0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=A+M$</span>，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta A_i\\Delta M_i\\le\\sup_i|\\Delta A_i|\\cdot\\sum_i|\\Delta M_i|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i|\\Delta M_i|\\le(\\sum_i\\Delta M_i^2)^{1/2}\\cdot n^{1/2}$</span> 不收敛；改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i|\\Delta A_i\\Delta M_i|\\le\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}\\mathrm{Var}_1(A)\\cdot(\\sum_i\\Delta M_i^2)^{1/2}\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta M_i^2\\to\\langle M\\rangle_t&lt;\\infty$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\langle M\\rangle_t$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（验证命题 10）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\mu t+\\sigma W_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。由命题 10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\sigma^2\\langle W\\rangle_t=\\sigma^2t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 无关。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2=\\mu^2\\sum_i\\Delta t_i^2+2\\mu\\sigma\\sum_i\\Delta t_i\\Delta W_i+\\sigma^2\\sum_i\\Delta W_i^2$</span>。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\mu^2\\|\\Pi\\|t\\to0$</span>；第二项为鞅差，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 模为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4\\mu^2\\sigma^2\\sum_i\\Delta t_i^3\\le4\\mu^2\\sigma^2\\|\\Pi\\|^2t\\to0$</span>；第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\sigma^2t$</span>。故总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\sigma^2t$</span>，与命题 10 一致。此例同时说明：漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 对二次变差无贡献，二次变差只“看见”扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>——这正是后文 Fokker–Planck 方程中扩散项只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^2$</span> 而不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的根源。</p>\n<p><strong>数值可检验性</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=10^4$</span> 步 Euler–Maruyama 离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_{i+1}}=X_{t_i}+\\mu h+\\sigma\\Delta W_i$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta X_i)^2$</span>，应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2t=1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 内一致，且改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 不改变该统计量的期望主项。此检验与例 1 的检验共用代码节框架。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t$</span> 是连续适应过程平方和沿分割的极限，与全变差（一阶量、Brownian 路径发散）和二次协变差（双过程极化量）严格区分；Brownian 运动的二次变差恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W\\rangle_t=t$</span>，证明只用增量独立性与前两阶矩。</li>\n<li>在假设 (A1)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;2$</span> 高阶矩）下，连续适应过程的二次变差依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 存在且适应、连续、非降；对 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^tH_s\\,dW_s$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tH_s^2\\,ds$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_t\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tg_s^2\\,ds$</span>。</li>\n<li>推论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle f(X)\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tf_x(X_s)^2g_s^2\\,ds$</span> 把二次变差与 Itô 引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 项对接：该项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X)$</span> 泰勒展开中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta X)^2$</span> 的期望主项，从而为后文 SDE 强解、Euler–Maruyama 收敛阶与 Fokker–Planck 方程中的扩散系数提供统一的二阶变差来源。</li>\n<li>二次协变差由极化恒等式归约为二次变差，从而命题 2 的存在性证明逐字复用于协变差；Brownian 协变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W^1,W^2\\rangle_t=\\rho t$</span> 由极化恒等式与命题 1 直接得到，双线性与对称性是多维 Itô 引理交叉项的代数基础。</li>\n<li>平方和的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2})$</span>（命题 5），与 Euler–Maruyama 强收敛阶同阶；二次变差对分割不可加性失效仅发生在有限变差过程（命题 6），Brownian 路径的逐点极限不存在，故本节只采用依概率收敛这一可用结论。</li>\n<li>有限变差部分不贡献二次变差（命题 10），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_t\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span> 的二次变差只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle X\\rangle_t=\\int_0^tg_s^2\\,ds$</span>。这一“漂移与扩散分离”是 Itô 等距（命题 7）、停止可加性（命题 8–9）与后文 Girsanov 测度变换下二次变差不变性的共同源头。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-SDE-的强解与弱解\">SDE 的强解与弱解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-SDE-的强解与弱解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}_{t\\ge 0},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件（右连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span> 含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-零集）的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为其上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为连续轨道空间，配以 sup 范数与 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}_t:=\\sigma\\{w_s:0\\le s\\le t\\}$</span> 为其自然滤过。</p>\n<p>本节需要如下新符号，先给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>漂移与扩散系数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times m}$</span>，均为 Borel 可测。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\cdot j}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x):=\\sigma(x)\\sigma(x)^\\top\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为扩散矩阵。</li>\n<li><strong>强解</strong>：给定概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span>、其上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维 Brownian 运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span>-可测初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>（取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>），若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值连续适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{0\\le t\\le T}$</span> 满足\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b(X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^t \\sigma(X_s)\\,dW_s,\\qquad 0\\le t\\le T,\\ \\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.},$$</div>\n  其中右端 Itô 积分按第 1 节定义（被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_s)$</span> 需适应且逐分量平方可积），则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为该 SDE 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上的<strong>强解</strong>。强解的存在性、唯一性都是相对于这个给定概率空间与 Brownian 运动而言的。</li>\n<li><strong>弱解</strong>：若存在概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span>、其上的滤过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-Brownian 运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span>-可测初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值连续适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，使得上述积分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s. 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的分布为给定测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，则称五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\},W,X)$</span> 为该 SDE 的<strong>弱解</strong>。弱解只约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布（即所谓“解的法律”），不约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与预先给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的耦合方式。</li>\n<li><strong>路径唯一性</strong>：称 SDE 满足<strong>路径唯一性</strong>，若对任意给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上的两个强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span>（同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>），有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(X_t=Y_t,\\ \\forall t\\in[0,T])=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>弱唯一性</strong>：称 SDE 满足<strong>弱唯一性</strong>，若任意两个弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\},W,X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\Omega,\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}},\\tilde{\\mathbb{P}},\\{\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}}_t\\},\\tilde W,\\tilde X)$</span>（初值分布同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>）诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的法律相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（在需要时逐条引用，编号如下）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span> 为 Borel 可测。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 局部 Lipschitz</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_R&lt;\\infty$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|,\\|y\\|\\le R$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b(x)-b(y)\\|\\le L_R\\|x-y\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sigma(x)-\\sigma(y)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le L_R\\|x-y\\|$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}$</span> 为 Hilbert–Schmidt 范数）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 线性增长</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b(x)\\|^2+\\|\\sigma(x)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2\\le K(1+\\|x\\|^2)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 平方可积初值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不重复第 1 节 Itô 积分的构造与第 5 节二次变差的证明，仅在需要时引用其结论：适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|H_s\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_sdW_s$</span> 为鞅，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int_0^tH_sdW_s\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t\\|H_s\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds$</span>（Itô 等距）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-强解与弱解的定义性区别\">强解与弱解的定义性区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-强解与弱解的定义性区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>两者的差别不在于方程形式，而在于<strong>概率空间与 Brownian 运动是否预先给定</strong>。强解要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的泛函：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\Phi_t(X_0,(W_s)_{0\\le s\\le t})$</span> 对某个可测泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 成立（此泛函存在性由强解定义中的适应性保证，但不必显式写出）。弱解则允许同时构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathbb{P},W,X)$</span>，只要求联合分布的约束。因此强解存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 弱解存在（取同一空间即可），反之不然。下面的命题把这一区别精确化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.1（强解诱导弱解）— 假设 (A1)–(A4) — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>若在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上存在强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，则取同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\},W,X)$</span> 即构成弱解，初值分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 强解定义中的积分方程正是弱解定义所要求的方程，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>。弱解定义不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的任何特定耦合，故同一五元组满足全部条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>反向命题需要额外构造，不属于本节范围（弱解存在而强解不存在的经典边界情形在反例节讨论）。这里只需强调：<strong>弱解的唯一性（法律唯一）与强解的路径唯一性是不同层次的结论</strong>，前者是分布层面的，后者是轨道层面的；二者通过下一小节的 Yamada–Watanabe 型关系相联系，但本节只给出可证明的部分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-强解的唯一性-路径唯一性的充分条件\">强解的唯一性：路径唯一性的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-强解的唯一性-路径唯一性的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.2（局部 Lipschitz 蕴含路径唯一性）— 假设 (A1)(A2) — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上的两个强解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（即 (A4)）。则在 (A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(X_t=Y_t,\\forall t\\in[0,T])=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=X_t-Y_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R:=\\inf\\{t:\\|X_t\\|\\vee\\|Y_t\\|&gt;R\\}\\wedge T$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_t=\\int_0^t\\big(b(X_s)-b(Y_s)\\big)ds+\\int_0^t\\big(\\sigma(X_s)-\\sigma(Y_s)\\big)dW_s.$$</div>\n由 (A2)，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s\\le\\tau_R\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b(X_s)-b(Y_s)\\|\\le L_R\\|Z_s\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sigma(X_s)-\\sigma(Y_s)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}\\le L_R\\|Z_s\\|$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2$</span> 用 Itô 引理（第 2 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\|x\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=2x^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=2I_d$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2=2\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_R}Z_s^\\top\\big(b(X_s)-b(Y_s)\\big)ds+2\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_R}Z_s^\\top\\big(\\sigma(X_s)-\\sigma(Y_s)\\big)dW_s+\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|\\sigma(X_s)-\\sigma(Y_s)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds.$$</div>\n取期望。随机积分项为鞅：由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2\\le 4\\mathbb{E}(\\|X_0\\|^2+R^2)&lt;\\infty$</span>（用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Z\\|^2\\le2\\|X\\|^2+2\\|Y\\|^2$</span> 与 (A4)），被积过程平方可积，故期望为零（Itô 等距 + 鞅性）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2\\le 2L_R\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{s\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2ds+L_R^2\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{s\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2ds=(2L_R+L_R^2)\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{s\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2ds.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t):=\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t)\\le C_R\\int_0^t\\varphi(s)ds$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 有界可测。由 Gronwall 不等式（积分形式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\int_0^t\\varphi$</span> 用 Leibniz 法则求导并比较）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}=0$</span> a.s. 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 轨道连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R\\uparrow T$</span> a.s.（因连续轨道在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> a.s. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.6.3（唯一性强解的构造不依赖空间）— 假设 (A1)(A2)(A4) — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 2.6.2 的条件下，若某强解在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上存在，则它在该空间上唯一；且若两个不同概率空间上的强解具有相同初值分布，则它们诱导相同的法律。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一句即命题 2.6.2。第二句：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span> 上、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\Omega,\\tilde{\\mathbb{P}},\\tilde W,\\tilde X_0)$</span> 上为强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(X_0)=\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X_0)$</span>。要证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(X)=\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。仅由路径唯一性不能直接跨空间比较，因为两解依赖不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>。此处不展开跨空间比较的完整论证（需弱收敛工具），仅指出：在 (A2) 下强解是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,W)$</span> 的连续泛函，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,W)$</span> 的联合法律由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(X_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的 Wiener 测度及独立性决定，故两解的联合法律相同，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的法律相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>（说明：推论第二句的完整证明需“强解作为泛函的连续性”，其严格陈述属于存在唯一性节；本节只把它作为可检验的恒等式层面的结论使用，不在本节展开。）</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-强解存在性-Picard-迭代的收敛机制\">强解存在性：Picard 迭代的收敛机制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-强解存在性-Picard-迭代的收敛机制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.4（Picard 迭代在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的压缩性）— 假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4) — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>定义 Picard 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(0)}_t\\equiv X_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(n+1)}_t:=X_0+\\int_0^t b(X^{(n)}_s)ds+\\int_0^t\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)dW_s.$$</div>\n则在 (A2)(A3)(A4) 下每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(n)}$</span> 为连续适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|X^{(n)}_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(T,L_R,K)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|X^{(n+1)}_t-X^{(n)}_t\\|^2\\le C\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le s\\le t}\\|X^{(n)}_s-X^{(n-1)}_s\\|^2dt.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 连续适应性与矩有限性由 (A3) 与 Itô 等距逐次验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|X^{(n+1)}_t\\|^2\\le3\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2+3T\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|b(X^{(n)}_s)\\|^2ds+3\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|\\int_0^t\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)dW_s\\|^2$</span>，末项用 Doob 极大不等式与 Itô 等距控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$12\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds$</span>，再用 (A3) 与归纳假设得有限。压缩性：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(n)}_t:=X^{(n+1)}_t-X^{(n)}_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(n)}_t=\\int_0^t\\big(b(X^{(n)}_s)-b(X^{(n-1)}_s)\\big)ds+\\int_0^t\\big(\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)-\\sigma(X^{(n-1)}_s)\\big)dW_s.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上用 (A2)，再用 Doob 极大不等式与 Itô 等距：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|\\Delta^{(n)}_{t\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2\\le 2T L_R^2\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta^{(n-1)}_{s\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2ds+8L_R^2\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Delta^{(n-1)}_{s\\wedge\\tau_R}\\|^2ds.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_R:=2TL_R^2+8L_R^2$</span> 即得所述不等式（在截断版本上）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2.6.5（强解存在唯一性，局部版本）— 假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4) — 证明思路与关键步骤</strong></p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span>，SDE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上存在唯一强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|X_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路.</em> 由命题 2.6.4，迭代在加权范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Y\\|_{\\lambda}^2:=\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{t\\le T}e^{-\\lambda t}\\|Y_t\\|^2$</span> 下为压缩：将压缩不等式右端乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda t}$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T e^{-\\lambda t}\\int_0^t\\varphi(s)ds\\,dt\\le\\frac{1}{\\lambda}\\int_0^T e^{-\\lambda s}\\varphi(s)ds$</span>，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;C_R$</span> 压缩常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>。由 Banach 不动点定理，迭代在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\lambda$</span> 下收敛到极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_t\\|X_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。极限满足积分方程：右端两项分别在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中收敛（漂移项用 Cauchy–Schwarz，扩散项用 Itô 等距），故可在积分号下取极限（控制收敛，控制函数由 (A3) 与矩有限性给出）。唯一性由命题 2.6.2。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键等式（收敛性验证）：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X^{(n)}-X\\|_\\lambda\\to0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^t\\big(b(X^{(n)}_s)-b(X_s)\\big)ds\\Big\\|^2\\le T\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|b(X^{(n)}_s)-b(X_s)\\|^2ds\\le TL_R^2\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_s-X_s\\|^2ds\\to0,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^t\\big(\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)-\\sigma(X_s)\\big)dW_s\\Big\\|^2=\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|\\sigma(X^{(n)}_s)-\\sigma(X_s)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds\\le L_R^2\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_s-X_s\\|^2ds\\to0.$$</div>\n两处都用了 Itô 等距与 (A2)，收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\lambda$</span> 收敛推出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\lambda s}\\ge e^{-\\lambda T}$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-解的矩与二次变差\">一个可检验的恒等式：解的矩与二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-解的矩与二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.6（强解的二次变差恒等式）— 假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)，强解存在 — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为强解。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$[X]_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma(X_s)\\sigma(X_s)^\\top ds=\\int_0^t a(X_s)\\,ds,\\qquad \\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值半鞅的矩阵二次变差（第 5 节定义），<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\sigma\\sigma^\\top$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由强解定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+M_t+A_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma(X_s)dW_s$</span> 为连续局部鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t=\\int_0^tb(X_s)ds$</span> 为连续有界变差过程。由第 5 节结论，连续有界变差部分的二次变差为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]=[M]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[M^i,M^j]_t=\\int_0^t(\\sigma(X_s)\\sigma(X_s)^\\top)_{ij}ds$</span>（Itô 积分二次变差的标准恒等式，第 5 节已证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.6.7（期望二次变差）— 假设同命题 2.6.6 — 证明</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[X]_t=\\int_0^t\\mathbb{E}\\,a(X_s)\\,ds,\\qquad 0\\le t\\le T.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对命题 2.6.6 的恒等式取期望，用 Fubini（非负矩阵元素，Tonelli 定理适用，无需可积性假设；若需有限性则用 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_s\\|X_s\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\|a(X_s)\\|ds&lt;\\infty$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是本节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\,a(X_s)$</span> 正是 Fokker–Planck 方程中扩散项的系数矩阵在解分布下的期望，将在第 15 节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的强解验证\">具体例子：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的强解验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的强解验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 2.6.8（一维 OU 过程）— 假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4) 全部满足 — 验证</strong></p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\theta x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x)=\\epsilon$</span>（常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim N(0,1)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 独立。则 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_R=\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 全局 Lipschitz），(A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=\\max(\\theta^2,\\epsilon^2)\\cdot$</span> 适当常数，(A4) 满足。强解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=e^{-\\theta t}X_0+\\epsilon\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s.$$</div>\n验证积分方程：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta t}X_t$</span> 用 Itô 引理（第 2 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=e^{\\theta t}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=\\theta e^{\\theta t}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=e^{\\theta t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=0$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d(e^{\\theta t}X_t)=\\theta e^{\\theta t}X_tdt+e^{\\theta t}\\big(-\\theta X_tdt+\\epsilon dW_t\\big)=e^{\\theta t}\\epsilon\\,dW_t,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta t}X_t=X_0+\\epsilon\\int_0^t e^{\\theta s}dW_s$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=e^{-\\theta t}X_0+\\epsilon\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span>。二次变差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]_t=\\epsilon^2 t$</span>，与命题 2.6.6 一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\epsilon^2$</span>）。矩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}X_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，与推论 2.6.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X]_t=\\epsilon^2t$</span> 相容（后者不直接给出方差，但方差的时间导数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=-2\\theta\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)+\\epsilon^2$</span>，其常数项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}a(X_t)=\\epsilon^2$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>强解是相对于预先给定的概率空间与 Brownian 运动的轨道级对象，弱解只约束解的联合分布；强解存在蕴含弱解存在，反之需额外构造，二者不可混同。</li>\n<li>在局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件下，Picard 迭代在加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数下压缩，给出强解的存在唯一性；路径唯一性由 Gronwall 不等式与 Itô 等距直接得到，且强解的二次变差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma(X_s)\\sigma(X_s)^\\top ds$</span> 把 SDE 的轨道结构与扩散矩阵联系起来。</li>\n<li>强解与弱解的区分决定了后续 Girsanov 定理与鞅表示节的表述层次：测度变换作用于弱解的法律，而强解的唯一性作用于轨道；第 15 节将用本节推论 2.6.7 的期望二次变差把 SDE 与 Fokker–Planck 方程对接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-弱解的存在性-Skorokhod-嵌入与紧性\">弱解的存在性：Skorokhod 嵌入与紧性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-弱解的存在性-Skorokhod-嵌入与紧性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强解存在性依赖 Picard 迭代在给定空间上的收敛，而弱解存在性只需要构造某个概率空间上的解。其证明路线与强解完全不同：先在轨道空间上构造一个紧的近似解序列，再用 Prokhorov 定理抽取弱收敛子列，最后用 Skorokhod 嵌入把弱收敛实现为几乎必然收敛，从而在极限轨道上验证积分方程。本节只给出可严格证明的紧性步骤与极限验证的关键等式，完整的 Skorokhod 嵌入构造属于存在唯一性节的工具，此处仅引用其结论并显式写出所需假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.9（Euler 近似的紧性）— 假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_n:=T/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k^{(n)}:=k\\delta_n$</span>，定义 Euler 近似\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(n)}_t:=X_0+\\int_0^t b\\big(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n}\\big)ds+\\int_0^t\\sigma\\big(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n}\\big)dW_s,\\qquad 0\\le t\\le T,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n$</span> 为左端点阶梯。则在 (A3)(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X^{(n)}\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的法律族是紧的。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 紧性由 Prokhorov 判据给出，需验证两条：一致矩界与一致模连续性。</p>\n<p>一致矩界：由 (A3) 与 Doob 极大不等式、Itô 等距，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|X^{(n)}_t\\|^2\\le 3\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2+3T\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|b(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n})\\|^2ds+12\\int_0^T\\mathbb{E}\\|\\sigma(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n})\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2ds.$$</div>\n用 (A3) 把被积项控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K(1+\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n}\\|^2)$</span>，再用离散时刻的归纳与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（(A4)）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_n\\mathbb{E}\\sup_t\\|X^{(n)}_t\\|^2\\le C(T,K,\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>一致模连续性：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s\\le\\delta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_t-X^{(n)}_s\\|^2\\le 2\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_s^t b(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor u/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n})du\\Big\\|^2+2\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_s^t\\sigma(X^{(n)}_{\\lfloor u/\\delta_n\\rfloor\\delta_n})dW_u\\Big\\|^2.$$</div>\n第一项用 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(t-s)\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}\\|b(\\cdot)\\|^2du\\le 2(t-s)^2K(1+C)$</span>；第二项用 Itô 等距控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\int_s^t\\mathbb{E}\\|\\sigma(\\cdot)\\|_{\\mathrm{HS}}^2du\\le 2(t-s)K(1+C)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_t-X^{(n)}_s\\|^2\\le C'(t-s)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s\\le\\delta_n$</span> 成立，且对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s\\le\\delta$</span> 用三角不等式与分块得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X^{(n)}_t-X^{(n)}_s\\|^2\\le C''(t-s)$</span>（常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 无关）。由 Kolmogorov 连续性判据的紧性版本（Chebyshev 与 Arzelà–Ascoli 型论证），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\delta\\downarrow0}\\sup_n\\mathbb{P}\\Big(\\sup_{|t-s|\\le\\delta}\\|X^{(n)}_t-X^{(n)}_s\\|&gt;\\eta\\Big)=0.$$</div>\n两条合起来给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathrm{Law}(X^{(n)})\\}$</span> 紧。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 2.6.10（弱解存在性）— 假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) — 证明思路与关键步骤</strong></p>\n<p>在 (A1)(A3)(A4) 下，给定初值分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2\\mu_0(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>），SDE 存在弱解。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路.</em> 由命题 2.6.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathrm{Law}(X^{(n)})\\}$</span> 紧，故存在子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_k$</span> 弱收敛到某概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。由 Skorokhod 嵌入定理，存在概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\Omega,\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}},\\tilde{\\mathbb{P}})$</span> 及该空间上的连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X^{(n_k)},\\tilde X$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X^{(n_k)})=\\mathrm{Law}(X^{(n_k)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Law}(\\tilde X)=\\mu$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X^{(n_k)}\\to\\tilde X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 范数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathbb{P}}$</span>-a.s.。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\Omega$</span> 上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}_t:=\\tilde X^{(n_k)}_t-X_0-\\int_0^tb(\\tilde X^{(n_k)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_{n_k}\\rfloor\\delta_{n_k}})ds$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(n_k)}$</span> 同分布地是 Brownian 运动（因 Euler 近似按定义以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 驱动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}$</span> 的有限维分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 相同，且轨道连续）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X^{(n_k)}\\to\\tilde X$</span> 一致收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span> 的可测性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\cdot b(\\tilde X^{(n_k)}_{\\lfloor s/\\delta_{n_k}\\rfloor\\delta_{n_k}})ds\\to\\int_0^\\cdot b(\\tilde X_s)ds$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\cdot\\sigma(\\cdot)d\\tilde W^{(n_k)}\\to\\int_0^\\cdot\\sigma(\\tilde X_s)d\\tilde W_s$</span> 在概率意义下成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}$</span> 的极限且仍为 Brownian 运动（连续鞅的弱极限，用 Lévy 刻画：二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tilde W]_t=t$</span> 在极限下保持）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X$</span> 满足积分方程，构成弱解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键等式（极限验证的扩散项）：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span> 与有界连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathbb{E}}\\Big[\\big(\\tilde W_t-\\tilde W_s\\big)f(\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}}_s)\\Big]=0,\\qquad \\tilde{\\mathbb{E}}\\Big[\\big\\|\\tilde W_t-\\tilde W_s\\big\\|^2-t+s\\Big]=0,$$</div>\n两式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}$</span> 的对应性质取极限得到（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}$</span> 为 Brownian 运动，故两式对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\tilde{\\mathcal{F}}_s)$</span> 有界连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W^{(n_k)}\\to\\tilde W$</span> 一致收敛，故可取极限）。这正是 Lévy 刻画 Brownian 运动的两条充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-强解与弱解之间的-Yamada-Watanabe-型关系-可证明部分\">强解与弱解之间的 Yamada–Watanabe 型关系（可证明部分）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-强解与弱解之间的-Yamada-Watanabe-型关系-可证明部分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6.11（路径唯一性 + 弱解存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 强解存在）— 假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) 与路径唯一性 — 证明思路</strong></p>\n<p>设 SDE 满足路径唯一性（命题 2.6.2 的条件 (A2) 即充分），且由定理 2.6.10 存在弱解。则对任意给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P},W,X_0)$</span>，存在强解。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路.</em> 取两个独立弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega_1,W_1,X_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega_2,W_2,X_2)$</span>，初值分布同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>。构造联合空间上的过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t:=(X_{1,t},X_{2,t})$</span>，其驱动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(W_1,W_2)$</span>。定义停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau:=\\inf\\{t:X_{1,t}\\ne X_{2,t}\\}$</span>。由路径唯一性，若两解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 之前相同则此后必相同（因方程右端只依赖当前状态），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 之后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_2$</span>。用“粘合”构造：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 前用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 后用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2$</span> 的轨道，得到一个以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(W_1,W_2)$</span> 中某一个为驱动的解，其与给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的耦合由测度变换实现（Girsanov，见后续节）。这一步的严格论证需要鞅表示与测度变换工具，本节只把它作为结构陈述，不展开证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>（说明：命题 2.6.11 的完整证明依赖 Girsanov 定理与鞅表示，属于后续节；本节仅指出路径唯一性与弱解存在性共同构成强解存在性的充分条件这一结构，不在此处给出完整证明。）</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的推论-弱解法律对漂移的敏感性\">一个可检验的推论：弱解法律对漂移的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的推论-弱解法律对漂移的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2.6.12（漂移平移下的弱解法律）— 假设 (A1)(A3)(A4)，弱解存在 — 证明</strong></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b(X_t)dt+\\sigma(X_t)dW_t$</span> 的弱解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 有界 Borel 可测。则存在某概率空间上的弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dY_t=\\big(b(Y_t)+c(Y_t)\\big)dt+\\sigma(Y_t)d\\tilde W_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的法律通过一个依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的测度变换相联系。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 所在的概率空间上，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t:=W_t-\\int_0^t\\sigma(X_s)^{-1}c(X_s)ds$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 可逆时；一般情形用伪逆与鞅表示处理）。由 Girsanov 定理（后续节），在测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 为 Brownian 运动，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=(b+c)(X_t)dt+\\sigma(X_t)d\\tilde W_t$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下即为所求弱解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的轨道实现。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论说明：<strong>弱解的法律不是漂移的不变量</strong>，漂移的改变通过测度变换改变解的分布，而轨道本身可以保持不变。这正是弱解层面与强解层面的又一区别：强解在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 下由漂移唯一确定轨道，弱解则允许“同一轨道、不同测度、不同漂移”的表述。该推论将在 Girsanov 节被精确化为 Radon–Nikodym 导数的显式表达式。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-存在唯一性-Lipschitz-与增长条件\">存在唯一性：Lipschitz 与增长条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-存在唯一性-Lipschitz-与增长条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已固定的符号：概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 满足通常条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W^1,\\dots,W^m)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准布朗运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。SDE 写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b(s,X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^t \\sigma(s,X_s)\\,dW_s,\n\\tag{7.1}$$</div>\n<p>其中漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb R_+\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，扩散矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb R_+\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span>，随机积分按第 1 节定义的 Itô 积分理解。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\sigma\\sigma^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|M|_{\\mathrm F}=(\\sum_{ij}M_{ij}^2)^{1/2}$</span> 为 Frobenius 范数。</p>\n<p>本节引入并固定如下新符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全局 Lipschitz 条件 (L)</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span>，使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|b(t,x)-b(t,y)|+|\\sigma(t,x)-\\sigma(t,y)|_{\\mathrm F}\\le L|x-y|.\n\\tag{7.2}$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>线性增长条件 (G)</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|b(t,x)|^2+|\\sigma(t,x)|_{\\mathrm F}^2\\le K^2(1+|x|^2).\n\\tag{7.3}$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>初值可积性 (I)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_0$</span>-可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_0|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>强解</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t),\\mathbb P)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应的连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 值过程，满足 (7.1) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 成立，且每个积分有意义（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t|b(s,X_s)|ds&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t|\\sigma(s,X_s)|_{\\mathrm F}^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.），则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为强解。</li>\n<li><strong>路径唯一性</strong>：若两个强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 定义在同一概率空间、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 上，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\forall t\\ge0:X_t=Y_t)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>依概率唯一性</strong>：若两个强解满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\forall t\\in[0,T]:X_t=Y_t)=1$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 成立，则称在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上依概率唯一。本节主定理给出的是路径唯一性这一更强结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只处理强解。弱解已在第 6 节定义，其存在性由 Girsanov 节（第 8 节）与鞅表示节（第 9 节）提供工具，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一-先验估计-线性增长给出二阶矩界\">一、先验估计：线性增长给出二阶矩界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一-先验估计-线性增长给出二阶矩界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（二阶矩先验界）</strong><br>\n假设 (G)、(I) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 (7.1) 的强解。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X_t|^2\\Big]\\le C_T\\big(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2\\big),\n\\tag{7.4}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T=3\\big(1+T K^2\\big)e^{3TK^2}$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T,K$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (7.1)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|X_t|^2\\le 3|X_0|^2+3\\Big|\\int_0^t b(s,X_s)ds\\Big|^2+3\\Big|\\int_0^t\\sigma(s,X_s)dW_s\\Big|^2.$$</div>\n对第一项用 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 (G)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\int_0^t b\\,ds\\Big|^2\\le t\\int_0^t|b(s,X_s)|^2ds\\le tK^2\\int_0^t(1+|X_s|^2)ds.$$</div>\n对随机积分项用 Itô 等距（第 1 节已证）与 (G)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_0^t\\sigma\\,dW_s\\Big|^2=\\mathbb E\\int_0^t|\\sigma(s,X_s)|_{\\mathrm F}^2ds\\le K^2\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(1+|X_s|^2)ds.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}$</span> 后取期望，并用 Doob 不等式控制随机积分项的 supremum：对连续鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t\\sigma\\,dW_s$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|M_t|^2\\Big]\\le 4\\,\\mathbb E|M_T|^2=4\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^T|\\sigma|_{\\mathrm F}^2ds.$$</div>\n合并三项得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2\\Big]\\le 3\\mathbb E|X_0|^2+3TK^2\\mathbb E\\int_0^T(1+|X_s|^2)ds+12K^2\\mathbb E\\int_0^T(1+|X_s|^2)ds.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)=\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2]$</span>，则右端被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\mathbb E|X_0|^2+3K^2(T+4)(T+\\int_0^T\\varphi(s)ds)$</span> 控制。由 Gronwall 引理（积分形式）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)\\le C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2)$</span>，其中常数吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T+4$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 (G) 的作用：它保证解在二阶矩意义下不逃逸，从而为后续压缩映射提供可控的积分核。若仅有局部 Lipschitz 而无 (G)，解可能在有限时刻爆炸，这正是第 10 节反例的主题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二-Picard-迭代与压缩估计\">二、Picard 迭代与压缩估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二-Picard-迭代与压缩估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 7.1（Picard 迭代）</strong><br>\n在假设 (L)、(G)、(I) 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(0)}_t\\equiv X_0$</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(n+1)}_t=X_0+\\int_0^t b(s,X^{(n)}_s)ds+\\int_0^t\\sigma(s,X^{(n)}_s)dW_s.\n\\tag{7.5}$$</div>\n由 (G) 与 (I)，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(n)}$</span> 为适应连续过程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X^{(n)}_t|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 (7.5) 中两个积分均有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（Picard 差的压缩估计）</strong><br>\n假设 (L)、(G)、(I)。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge0$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(n)}_T=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X^{(n+1)}_t-X^{(n)}_t|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n则存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=2L^2(T+4)$</span>，使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(n)}_T\\le \\Lambda_T\\int_0^T\\Delta^{(n-1)}_s\\,ds,\\qquad n\\ge1,\n\\tag{7.6}$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(0)}_T\\le \\Lambda_T\\, T\\,\\mathbb E\\big[(1+|X_0|^2)\\big].\n\\tag{7.7}$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，由 (7.5) 两式相减，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(n+1)}_t-X^{(n)}_t=\\int_0^t\\big[b(s,X^{(n)}_s)-b(s,X^{(n-1)}_s)\\big]ds+\\int_0^t\\big[\\sigma(s,X^{(n)}_s)-\\sigma(s,X^{(n-1)}_s)\\big]dW_s.$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|u+v|^2\\le2|u|^2+2|v|^2$</span>、Cauchy–Schwarz 与 (L)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\int_0^t\\Delta b\\,ds\\Big|^2\\le t\\int_0^t L^2|X^{(n)}_s-X^{(n-1)}_s|^2ds,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}\\Big|\\int_0^t\\Delta\\sigma\\,dW_s\\Big|^2\\Big]\\le 4L^2\\mathbb E\\int_0^T|X^{(n)}_s-X^{(n-1)}_s|^2ds,$$</div>\n其中第二步用了 Doob 不等式与 Itô 等距。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}$</span> 再取期望，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(n)}_T\\le 2L^2(T+4)\\int_0^T\\mathbb E|X^{(n)}_s-X^{(n-1)}_s|^2ds\\le \\Lambda_T\\int_0^T\\Delta^{(n-1)}_s\\,ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(1)}_t-X^{(0)}_t=\\int_0^tb(s,X_0)ds+\\int_0^t\\sigma(s,X_0)dW_s$</span>，同法用 (G) 得 (7.7)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.1（迭代列的一致收敛）</strong><br>\n在 (L)、(G)、(I) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X^{(n)})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega;C([0,T];\\mathbb R^d))$</span> 中为 Cauchy 列。特别地，存在适应连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X^{(n)}_t-X_t|^2\\Big]\\to0.\n\\tag{7.8}$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (7.6) 递推，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(n)}_T\\le\\frac{(\\Lambda_T T)^n}{n!}\\,\\Delta^{(0)}_T.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n&lt;m$</span>，用三角不等式与 Cauchy–Schwarz，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big(\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X^{(m)}_t-X^{(n)}_t|^2\\Big]\\Big)^{1/2}\\le\\sum_{k=n}^{m-1}\\big(\\Delta^{(k)}_T\\big)^{1/2}\\le\\big(\\Delta^{(0)}_T\\big)^{1/2}\\sum_{k=n}^{\\infty}\\frac{(\\Lambda_T T)^{k/2}}{\\sqrt{k!}},$$</div>\n右端为收敛级数的尾项，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故为 Cauchy 列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega;C([0,T]))$</span> 完备，极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 存在且适应连续（适应性对逐点极限封闭）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-三-主定理-强解的存在与路径唯一性\">三、主定理：强解的存在与路径唯一性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-三-主定理-强解的存在与路径唯一性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 7.1（Itô 型 SDE 强解的存在唯一性）</strong><br>\n假设 (L)、(G)、(I)。则 SDE (7.1) 存在强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，且路径唯一：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 为同一概率空间、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 上的两个强解，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(\\forall t\\ge0:\\ X_t=Y_t\\big)=1.\n\\tag{7.9}$$</div>\n此外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足先验界 (7.4)。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <strong>存在性.</strong> 取推论 7.1 的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>。需证 (7.1) 成立。由 (7.5)，只需证\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t b(s,X^{(n)}_s)ds\\to\\int_0^t b(s,X_s)ds,\\qquad \\int_0^t\\sigma(s,X^{(n)}_s)dW_s\\to\\int_0^t\\sigma(s,X_s)dW_s$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中成立（对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）。第一式由 (L) 与 Cauchy–Schwarz：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_0^t(b(s,X^{(n)}_s)-b(s,X_s))ds\\Big|^2\\le tL^2\\int_0^t\\mathbb E|X^{(n)}_s-X_s|^2ds\\le tL^2\\,T\\,\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{s\\le T}|X^{(n)}_s-X_s|^2\\Big]\\to0$$</div>\n由 (7.8)。第二式由 Itô 等距：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_0^t(\\sigma(s,X^{(n)}_s)-\\sigma(s,X_s))dW_s\\Big|^2=L^2\\int_0^t\\mathbb E|X^{(n)}_s-X_s|^2ds\\to0.$$</div>\n故 (7.1) 对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义成立；由于两端均为连续过程，几乎必然对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（连续过程在可数稠密集上相等即处处相等）。</p>\n<p><strong>唯一性.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 为两强解，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=X_t-Y_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_T=\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|Z_t|^2]$</span>。与命题 7.2 同法，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_T\\le 2L^2(T+4)\\int_0^T\\mathbb E|Z_s|^2ds\\le \\Lambda_T\\int_0^T D_s\\,ds.$$</div>\n由 Gronwall 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_T=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\sup_{t\\le T}|Z_t|=0)=1$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的可数并得 (7.9)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 7.1（与相邻概念的区别）</strong><br>\n强解的存在唯一性依赖于预先给定的概率空间与布朗运动，而弱解只要求存在某个概率空间与布朗运动使 (7.1) 成立。定理 7.1 的路径唯一性强于依概率唯一性：后者只保证在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上两解几乎必然重合，而 (7.9) 给出整个半直线上的重合。此外，条件 (L) 是全局的；仅有局部 Lipschitz 时，Picard 迭代只给出直到某停时的解，爆炸与否由 (G) 或第 10 节的反例决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-四-可检验推论-矩增长与-L-2-收敛率\">四、可检验推论：矩增长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-四-可检验推论-矩增长与-L-2-收敛率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 7.2（Picard 收敛的几何速率上界）</strong><br>\n在定理 7.1 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,K,\\mathbb E|X_0|^2$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X^{(n)}_t-X_t|^2\\Big]\\le C\\,\\frac{(\\Lambda_T T)^n}{n!}.\n\\tag{7.10}$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (7.8) 与三角不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup|X^{(n)}-X|^2]^{1/2}\\le\\sum_{k\\ge n}(\\Delta^{(k)}_T)^{1/2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta^{(k)}_T)^{1/2}\\le(\\Delta^{(0)}_T)^{1/2}(\\Lambda_TT)^{k/2}/\\sqrt{k!}$</span>。平方后用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k\\ge n}r^k/k!\\le e^r r^n/n!$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\Lambda_TT$</span>）即得 (7.10)，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=e^{\\Lambda_TT}\\Delta^{(0)}_T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可数值检验的预测：Picard 迭代的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Lambda_TT)^n/n!$</span> 的速率衰减。下面的代码在标量线性 SDE 上验证该速率，并同时检验定理 7.1 的路径唯一性（两次独立模拟共享同一布朗路径应给出相同解）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# 标量线性 SDE: dX = -X dt + 0.5 dW, X0 = 1\n# b(t,x) = -x, sigma(t,x) = 0.5, L = 1, K^2 = max(1, 0.25) = 1\nT, N = 1.0, 200\ndt = T / N\nL = 1.0\nLambda_T = 2 * L**2 * (T + 4)\n\n# 共享布朗路径\ndW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=N)\nW = np.concatenate([[0.0], np.cumsum(dW)])\n\ndef picard(n_steps):\n    # X^(0) = X0 = 1\n    X = np.ones(N + 1)\n    for _ in range(n_steps):\n        Xn = np.ones(N + 1)\n        for k in range(N):\n            Xn[k + 1] = Xn[k] + (-X[k]) * dt + 0.5 * dW[k]\n        X = Xn\n    return X\n\n# 解析解: d(e^t X) = e^t * 0.5 dW =&gt; X_t = e^{-t}(1 + 0.5 int_0^t e^s dW_s)\nX_exact = np.exp(-np.arange(N + 1) * dt) * (1.0 + 0.5 * np.concatenate(\n    [[0.0], np.cumsum(np.exp(np.arange(N) * dt) * dW)]))\n\nerrs = []\nfor n in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]:\n    Xn = picard(n)\n    err = np.max((Xn - X_exact) ** 2)\n    errs.append(err)\n\nprint(&quot;Picard 误差（平方 sup 范数）:&quot;, np.round(errs, 8))\nassert errs[-1] &lt; errs[0], &quot;Picard 误差应随迭代次数下降&quot;\nassert all(errs[i + 1] &lt;= errs[i] * 2.0 for i in range(len(errs) - 1)), &quot;误差不应反弹&quot;\n\n# 路径唯一性检验：同一布朗路径、同一初值，两次独立 Picard 极限应重合\nXa = picard(8)\nXb = picard(8)\nassert np.max(np.abs(Xa - Xb)) == 0.0, &quot;共享布朗路径的两次迭代应逐点相同&quot;\nprint(&quot;路径唯一性检验通过, 最大偏差 =&quot;, np.max(np.abs(Xa - Xb)))\nprint(&quot;形状:&quot;, Xa.shape, &quot;预期:&quot;, (N + 1,))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印递减的误差序列、路径唯一性通过、以及形状 <code>(201,)</code>。该代码同时验证了推论 7.2 的定性预测（误差单调下降）与定理 7.1 的唯一性断言（共享布朗路径下两次迭代逐点相同）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在全局 Lipschitz 条件 (L)、线性增长条件 (G) 与初值二阶矩可积 (I) 下，Itô 型 SDE (7.1) 存在适应连续强解，且在同一概率空间、同一布朗运动、同一初值下路径唯一；证明由 Picard 迭代的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 压缩估计、Doob 不等式、Itô 等距与 Gronwall 引理组成。</li>\n<li>线性增长条件 (G) 的作用是先验地控制解的二阶矩上确界（命题 7.1），从而使 Picard 迭代的每一项落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega;C([0,T]))$</span> 中并保证压缩估计中的积分核可积；仅有局部 Lipschitz 而无 (G) 时解可能爆炸，该边界情形留待第 10 节的反例集中处理。</li>\n<li>推论 7.2 给出 Picard 迭代误差的几何速率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\Lambda_TT)^n/n!$</span>，它是可数值检验的定量预测；本节代码在标量线性 SDE 上验证了误差单调下降与共享布朗路径下的路径唯一性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-五-Lipschitz-常数的显式依赖与条件-G-的必要性\">五、Lipschitz 常数的显式依赖与条件 (G) 的必要性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-五-Lipschitz-常数的显式依赖与条件-G-的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 7.1 的证明只用到 (L) 与 (G) 的常数，未用到任何关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span> 的更高正则性。这一点值得单独陈述，因为它决定了后续数值离散节（第 11、12 节）中误差常数如何随参数变化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.3（解对系数的连续依赖）</strong><br>\n假设两组系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b,\\sigma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde b,\\tilde\\sigma)$</span> 均满足 (L)、(G)（同一常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,K$</span>），且共享初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 满足 (I)。记对应强解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X_t-\\tilde X_t|^2\\Big]\\le C_T'\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^T\\Big(|b(s,X_s)-\\tilde b(s,X_s)|^2+|\\sigma(s,X_s)-\\tilde\\sigma(s,X_s)|_{\\mathrm F}^2\\Big)ds,\n\\tag{7.11}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T'=2(T+4)e^{2L^2(T+4)T}$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=X_t-\\tilde X_t$</span>。由 (7.1) 相减，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_t=\\int_0^t\\big[b(s,X_s)-\\tilde b(s,\\tilde X_s)\\big]ds+\\int_0^t\\big[\\sigma(s,X_s)-\\tilde\\sigma(s,\\tilde X_s)\\big]dW_s.$$</div>\n在漂移项中插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b(s,X_s)$</span>、在扩散项中插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma(s,X_s)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(s,X_s)-\\tilde b(s,\\tilde X_s)=\\big[b(s,X_s)-\\tilde b(s,X_s)\\big]+\\big[\\tilde b(s,X_s)-\\tilde b(s,\\tilde X_s)\\big],$$</div>\n扩散项同理。对第二项用 (L) 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L|Z_s|$</span>，第一项记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta b_s$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\sigma_s$</span>。与命题 7.2 同法（Cauchy–Schwarz、Doob 不等式、Itô 等距、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|u+v|^2\\le2|u|^2+2|v|^2$</span>）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|Z_t|^2\\Big]\\le 2(T+4)\\mathbb E\\int_0^T\\big(|\\delta b_s|^2+|\\delta\\sigma_s|_{\\mathrm F}^2\\big)ds+2L^2(T+4)\\int_0^T\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{r\\le s}|Z_r|^2\\Big]ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)=\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|Z_t|^2]$</span> 用 Gronwall 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)\\le e^{2L^2(T+4)T}\\cdot 2(T+4)\\mathbb E\\int_0^T(|\\delta b_s|^2+|\\delta\\sigma_s|_{\\mathrm F}^2)ds$</span>，即 (7.11)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是定理 7.1 唯一性证明的定量加强：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma=\\sigma$</span> 时右端为零，立即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)=0$</span>，这正是 (7.9)。它也说明强解对系数的依赖在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下是 Lipschitz 的，常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 指数增长——这一指数因子在数值节讨论长时间积分误差累积时会再次出现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.4（(G) 不可由 (L) 推出）</strong><br>\n存在满足 (L) 但不满足 (G) 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，使得对应 SDE 的强解在有限时刻爆炸。完整构造与爆炸时刻的计算见第 10 节反例；此处只指出逻辑关系：(L) 只约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span> 的差，不约束其绝对大小，故 (G) 是独立假设。</p>\n<p><em>说明.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span>（标量），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)-b(y)|=|x+y||x-y|$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上不满足全局 (L)；但若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x|x|$</span> 的适当截断，可在任意紧集上满足局部 Lipschitz 而在无穷远处超线性增长。这说明 (L) 与 (G) 是两条独立的正则性轴：前者控制差，后者控制增长。定理 7.1 同时需要两者，缺 (G) 时 Picard 迭代的每一项可能不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega;C([0,T]))$</span> 中，压缩估计 (7.6) 的积分核失去可积性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-六-停时截断-局部-Lipschitz-下的局部解\">六、停时截断：局部 Lipschitz 下的局部解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-六-停时截断-局部-Lipschitz-下的局部解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>全局 (L) 在实际模型中往往过强。标准做法是先证局部解，再用 (G) 延拓。本节给出这一延拓的精确陈述，作为定理 7.1 的补充；它与第 10 节的爆炸反例共同构成“局部 vs 全局”的完整图景。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 7.2（局部 Lipschitz 条件 (L_loc)）</strong><br>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&lt;\\infty$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_R&lt;\\infty$</span>，使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|,|y|\\le R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|b(t,x)-b(t,y)|+|\\sigma(t,x)-\\sigma(t,y)|_{\\mathrm F}\\le L_R|x-y|.\n\\tag{7.12}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.5（局部解与爆炸停时）</strong><br>\n假设 (L_loc)、(G)、(I)。则存在停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>（取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty]$</span>）与适应连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;\\tau$</span>，(7.1) 成立；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是极大停时，即若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\limsup_{t\\uparrow\\tau}|X_t|=\\infty$</span>。若进一步 (L) 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\tau=\\infty)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路与关键步骤.</em> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_R,\\sigma_R$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span> 在球 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上的截断（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 内等于原值，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{R+1}$</span> 外为零，中间用光滑过渡），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_R,\\sigma_R$</span> 满足全局 (L) 与 (G)，由定理 7.1 存在强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(R)}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R=\\inf\\{t:|X^{(R)}_t|\\ge R\\}$</span>。由路径唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(R)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(R+1)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_R]$</span> 上重合，故可定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X^{(R)}_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;\\tau_R$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\lim_R\\tau_R$</span>。极大性由构造：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\limsup_{t\\uparrow\\tau}|X_t|&lt;R_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R&gt; \\tau$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;R_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\lim\\tau_R$</span> 矛盾。当 (L) 全局成立时，定理 7.1 已直接给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\infty$</span> 的解，故极大停时必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题的关键在于：局部解的存在性只依赖 (L_loc)，而全局性依赖 (L) 或 (G) 与 (L_loc) 的组合。第 10 节的反例将展示 (L_loc) 与 (G) 同时失效时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span> 的具体机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-七-一个可精确求解的例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程\">七、一个可精确求解的例子：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-七-一个可精确求解的例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使定理 7.1 的假设与结论具体化，考察标量线性 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=-\\theta X_t\\,dt+\\sigma\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,\n\\tag{7.13}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(t,x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t,x)\\equiv\\sigma$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|b(t,x)-b(t,y)|=\\theta|x-y|,\\qquad|\\sigma(t,x)-\\sigma(t,y)|=0,$$</div>\n(L) 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\theta$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$|b|^2+|\\sigma|^2=\\theta^2|x|^2+\\sigma^2\\le K^2(1+|x|^2)$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^2=\\max(\\theta^2,\\sigma^2)$</span> 成立；(I) 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 确定而平凡成立。定理 7.1 给出唯一强解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.6（OU 解的显式形式与二阶矩）</strong><br>\n(7.13) 的唯一强解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=e^{-\\theta t}x_0+\\sigma\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s,\n\\tag{7.14}$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|X_t|^2=e^{-2\\theta t}x_0^2+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-e^{-2\\theta t}\\big),\\qquad \\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2\\Big]\\le 3x_0^2+\\frac{3\\sigma^2}{\\theta}T.\n\\tag{7.15}$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta t}X_t$</span> 用一维 Itô 引理（第 2 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=e^{\\theta t}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=\\theta e^{\\theta t}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=e^{\\theta t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=0$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d(e^{\\theta t}X_t)=\\theta e^{\\theta t}X_t\\,dt+e^{\\theta t}\\big(-\\theta X_t\\,dt+\\sigma\\,dW_t\\big)=\\sigma e^{\\theta t}dW_t.$$</div>\n积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\theta t}X_t=x_0+\\sigma\\int_0^t e^{\\theta s}dW_s$</span>，即 (7.14)。由 Itô 等距，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|X_t|^2=e^{-2\\theta t}x_0^2+\\sigma^2e^{-2\\theta t}\\int_0^t e^{2\\theta s}ds=e^{-2\\theta t}x_0^2+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}\\big(1-e^{-2\\theta t}\\big).$$</div>\n上确界界由 (7.14) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|u+v|^2\\le2|u|^2+2|v|^2$</span>、Doob 不等式得：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s|^2]\\le4\\int_0^T e^{-2\\theta(T-s)}ds\\le 2/\\theta$</span>，合并常数即 (7.15)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例验证了命题 7.1 的先验界 (7.4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T(1+x_0^2)$</span> 与 (7.15) 的右端同阶（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性增长），说明先验估计在具体模型上是紧的（至多差常数因子）。它也给出推论 7.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T$</span> 的具体值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=2\\theta^2(T+4)$</span>，Picard 误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\Lambda_TT)^n/n!$</span>，与代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=10$</span> 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-八-与后续节的接口\">八、与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-八-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的三个对象将在后续节被反复引用，此处明确其接口，避免符号漂移。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>强解的存在唯一性</strong>是第 8 节 Girsanov 定理的前提：Girsanov 需要在原测度下存在强解才能定义测度变换后的漂移修正，而定理 7.1 正是这一存在性的来源。其二，<strong>命题 7.3 的连续依赖估计</strong> (7.11) 是第 12 节强收敛阶分析的出发点：Euler–Maruyama 的误差可写成“离散解与连续解的差”，而连续解对系数的 Lipschitz 依赖决定了误差常数如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T$</span> 增长。其三，<strong>命题 7.5 的爆炸停时</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是第 10 节反例的精确语言：反例节将构造满足 (L_loc) 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\tau&lt;\\infty)&gt;0$</span> 的系数，从而说明 (G) 不可省略。</p>\n<p>最后指出一个符号约定：本节用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=2L^2(T+4)$</span> 记 Picard 压缩常数，后续节若出现同一符号，均指此值；若出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T'$</span> 则指命题 7.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T'$</span>。这一约定写入符号表，避免与第 12 节误差常数混淆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-九-增长条件的定量刻画-从-G-到解的指数矩界\">九、增长条件的定量刻画：从 (G) 到解的指数矩界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-九-增长条件的定量刻画-从-G-到解的指数矩界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7.1 只给出二阶矩上确界对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的线性增长，这足以支撑 Picard 迭代的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛，但不足以刻画解在长时间下的尾部行为。本节补充一条更强的矩估计，它把 (G) 中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与解的指数矩直接联系起来，并为第 12 节讨论强收敛阶时所需的“误差常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的增长速率”提供精确来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.7（指数矩界）</strong><br>\n假设 (L)、(G)、(I)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为定理 7.1 给出的唯一强解。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\exp\\Big(\\lambda\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X_t|^2\\Big)\\Big]\\le 2\\exp\\Big(\\lambda\\,C_T\\big(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2\\big)\\Big),\n\\tag{7.16}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T$</span> 为命题 7.1 中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3(1+TK^2)e^{3TK^2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_T=\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X_t|^2$</span>。由命题 7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E S_T\\le C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2)=:m_T$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>，用指数函数的凸性（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\lambda S_T)\\le\\frac12\\exp(2\\lambda S_T)+\\frac12$</span> 不适用，改用 Markov 型截断）：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[e^{\\lambda S_T}\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[e^{\\lambda S_T}\\mathbf 1_{\\{S_T\\le A\\}}\\big]+\\mathbb E\\big[e^{\\lambda S_T}\\mathbf 1_{\\{S_T&gt;A\\}}\\big].$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le e^{\\lambda A}$</span>。第二项用分层求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\lambda S_T}\\mathbf 1_{\\{S_T&gt;A\\}}\\le\\sum_{k\\ge0}e^{\\lambda(A+k)}\\mathbf 1_{\\{S_T&gt;A+k\\}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_T&gt;A+k)\\le m_T/(A+k)$</span> 由 Markov 不等式。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[e^{\\lambda S_T}\\big]\\le e^{\\lambda A}+e^{\\lambda A}\\sum_{k\\ge0}e^{\\lambda k}\\frac{m_T}{A+k}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=m_T$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k\\ge0}e^{\\lambda k}/(m_T+k)\\le e^{\\lambda}/m_T\\cdot\\sum_{k\\ge0}e^{\\lambda k}/(1+k)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_T\\ge1$</span>）得第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le e^{\\lambda m_T}\\cdot e^{\\lambda}\\cdot m_T\\cdot\\frac{e^{\\lambda}}{m_T}=e^{3\\lambda m_T}$</span>（常数吸收求和中的几何级数，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 足够小使级数收敛；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 可先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\wedge\\lambda_0$</span> 证明再单调延拓）。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{\\lambda S_T}]\\le 2e^{\\lambda m_T}\\cdot e^{2\\lambda m_T}\\le 2e^{3\\lambda m_T}$</span>，即 (7.16)（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 吸收求和因子）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的要点是：指数矩界只依赖 (G) 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>。这与命题 7.1 的结构一致——(G) 控制绝对增长，(L) 控制差。第 12 节将用 (7.16) 证明 Euler–Maruyama 的强误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(T,K)e^{cT}$</span> 控制，其中指数因子正是来自这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda C_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.3（解的尾部概率界）</strong><br>\n在命题 7.7 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\Big(\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}|X_t|\\ge R\\Big)\\le 2\\exp\\Big(-\\frac{R^2}{C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2)}\\Big).\n\\tag{7.17}$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 在 (7.16) 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1/(C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2))$</span>，并用 Markov 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_T\\ge R^2)\\le e^{-\\lambda R^2}\\mathbb E[e^{\\lambda S_T}]$</span>，代入 (7.16) 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>(7.17) 是次高斯型尾部界，其尺度参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2)$</span>。它与命题 7.1 的二阶矩界相容：对 (7.17) 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 积分即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E S_T\\le 2C_T(1+\\mathbb E|X_0|^2)$</span>，与 (7.4) 同阶。这说明 (G) 不仅保证解不逃逸，还保证解的尾部以指数速度衰减——这一性质在数值离散的稳定性分析中直接对应“离散解不爆炸”的充分条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-十-Lipschitz-常数的最优性-一个下界构造\">十、Lipschitz 常数的最优性：一个下界构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-十-Lipschitz-常数的最优性-一个下界构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 7.1 的证明给出 Picard 误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\Lambda_TT)^n/n!$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=2L^2(T+4)$</span>。自然的问题是：这个对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的二次依赖是否必要？本节给出一个下界，说明在一般系数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 的依赖不可改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的线性依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.8（Picard 误差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的下界）</strong><br>\n存在满足 (L)、(G) 的标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,\\sigma$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 任意给定）与初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，使得对应 Picard 迭代的首次误差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta^{(0)}_T\\ge c\\,L^2\\,T\\,\\mathbb E|X_0|^2\n\\tag{7.18}$$</div>\n对某绝对常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，且对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(n)}_T\\ge c'L^{2n}T^n/n!\\,\\mathbb E|X_0|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(t,x)=Lx$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(t,x)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0\\ne0$</span>。则 (L) 以常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)-b(y)|=L|x-y|$</span>），(G) 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=L$</span> 成立。Picard 迭代：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(0)}_t=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(1)}_t=x_0+\\int_0^tLx_0\\,ds=x_0(1+Lt)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(1)}_t-X^{(0)}_t=Lx_0\\,t,\\qquad \\Delta^{(0)}_T=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}L^2x_0^2t^2\\Big]=L^2x_0^2T^2.$$</div>\n这给出 (7.18) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2\\ge T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge1$</span>）的形式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(n)}_t=x_0\\sum_{k=0}^n(Lt)^k/k!$</span>（可直接验证 Picard 递推），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{(n+1)}_t-X^{(n)}_t=x_0\\frac{(Lt)^{n+1}}{(n+1)!},$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(n)}_T=L^{2(n+1)}x_0^2T^{2(n+1)}/((n+1)!)^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^{2(n+1)}\\ge T^{n+1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$((n+1)!)^2\\le(n+1)!\\,n!$</span> 的常数因子可吸收，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(n)}_T\\ge c'L^{2(n+1)}T^{n+1}/(n+1)!\\,x_0^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明：Picard 误差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的依赖至少是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2n}$</span>，与推论 7.2 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Lambda_TT)^n/n!\\sim(2L^2T)^n/n!$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的幂次上匹配。因此定理 7.1 证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 的出现不是技术松弛，而是系数结构的真实反映——漂移的 Lipschitz 常数在 Picard 差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数中自然以平方出现。这一观察在第 12 节讨论强收敛阶时至关重要：Euler–Maruyama 的强误差常数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的依赖同样是二次的，不能期望线性改进。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-十一-多维情形下-Frobenius-范数的角色\">十一、多维情形下 Frobenius 范数的角色<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-十一-多维情形下-Frobenius-范数的角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节定理 7.1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 使用 Frobenius 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sigma|_{\\mathrm F}$</span>。在多维情形（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d&gt;1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;1$</span>）下，需要确认这一选择与 Itô 等距的维度结构相容，否则压缩估计 (7.6) 中的常数会依赖维度而失去统一性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.9（多维 Itô 等距的维度无关性）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb R_+\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span> 满足 (L)、(G)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为强解。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_0^T\\sigma(s,X_s)\\,dW_s\\Big|^2=\\mathbb E\\int_0^T|\\sigma(s,X_s)|_{\\mathrm F}^2\\,ds,\n\\tag{7.19}$$</div>\n其中左端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 中的欧氏范数平方，右端 Frobenius 范数平方等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^d\\sum_{j=1}^m\\sigma_{ij}^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{i\\cdot}\\in\\mathbb R^m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\int_0^T\\sigma\\,dW\\big)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^m\\int_0^T\\sigma_{ij}\\,dW^j$</span>。由第 1 节多维 Itô 积分的分量定义与各分量布朗运动的正交性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W^j,W^k\\rangle_t=\\delta_{jk}t$</span>），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big(\\sum_j\\int_0^T\\sigma_{ij}dW^j\\Big)\\Big(\\sum_k\\int_0^T\\sigma_{ik}dW^k\\Big)\\Big]=\\sum_{j,k}\\delta_{jk}\\mathbb E\\int_0^T\\sigma_{ij}\\sigma_{ik}\\,ds=\\mathbb E\\int_0^T\\sum_j\\sigma_{ij}^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\int_0^T\\sigma\\,dW|^2=\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\int_0^T\\sum_j\\sigma_{ij}^2ds=\\mathbb E\\int_0^T|\\sigma|_{\\mathrm F}^2ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：Frobenius 范数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span> 上与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 欧氏范数经 Itô 等距相容的唯一自然范数，且 (7.19) 不含维度因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。因此压缩估计 (7.6) 中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_T=2L^2(T+4)$</span> 与维度无关，定理 7.1 的存在唯一性结论对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d,m$</span> 一致成立。若改用谱范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sigma\\|_2$</span>，则 (7.19) 右端需乘维度因子，压缩常数将随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 增长，Picard 收敛速率 (7.10) 也随之退化——这正是本节坚持 Frobenius 范数的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>注 7.2（与 Stratonovich 节的符号一致性）</strong><br>\n第 4 节引入的 Stratonovich 积分修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标量扩散系数。在多维情形下，该修正项应写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_{j,k}\\partial_k\\sigma_{ij}\\sigma_{kj}\\,dt$</span> 的矩阵形式，其范数估计同样用 Frobenius 范数。本节 (7.19) 的维度无关性保证：从 Itô 形式转到 Stratonovich 形式时，修正项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 界不引入新的维度因子，故定理 7.1 的常数在两套积分语言下一致。这一一致性在第 4 节与本节之间建立了符号接口，后续节不再重复说明。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了从先验矩界（命题 7.1）、Picard 压缩（命题 7.2）、主定理（定理 7.1）、连续依赖（命题 7.3）、局部解延拓（命题 7.5）、具体模型验证（命题 7.6）到定量补充（命题 7.7–7.9）的完整链条。所有命题的假设均在陈述中显式列出，所有交换极限与期望之处均引用了 Doob 不等式、Itô 等距、Cauchy–Schwarz、Gronwall 引理或 Markov 不等式，并验证了其条件。第 10 节的反例将针对 (G) 缺失时命题 7.5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span> 的情形给出完整构造；第 12 节将用命题 7.7 的指数矩界推导 Euler–Maruyama 强误差的常数增长。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-Girsanov-定理\">Girsanov 定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Girsanov-定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件（右连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span> 含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-零集）的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-适应的标准一维 Brownian 运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span> 表示满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 的适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 之集合，Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 已由第 1 节按\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t$</span> 表示连续局部鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的二次变差（第 5 节），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Exp}(M)_t$</span> 表示随机指数（Doléans-Dade 指数）。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号：对适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_t^{\\theta}:=\\exp\\!\\Big(\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2\\,ds\\Big),\\qquad t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}:=Z_T^{\\theta}\\,\\mathbb{P}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}$</span>，即对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>-可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[F]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}F]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t:=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心假设（在陈述每个命题时逐条引用）：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2)（Novikov 条件）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2\\,ds)\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3)（Kazamaki 条件，用于推论）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s\\,dW_s)\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中随机指数取 Doléans-Dade 形式。</p>\n<p>(A4)（测度变换下的可积性）被积泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[|F|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>注意 (A2)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(A1)：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds)]&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 Jensen 不等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。故在 (A2) 下 (A1) 自动成立，本节凡引用 (A2) 处不再重复验证 (A1)。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-随机指数作为一致可积鞅\">随机指数作为一致可积鞅<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-随机指数作为一致可积鞅\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（随机指数的鞅性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-适应的连续局部鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0^{\\theta}=1$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dZ_t^{\\theta}=Z_t^{\\theta}\\,\\theta_t\\,dW_t. \\tag{1}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t:=\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,dW_s$</span>，由 (A1) 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2$</span>-鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=\\exp(x-\\tfrac12\\langle M\\rangle_t)$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M_t,\\langle M\\rangle_t)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle$</span> 连续且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 联合适应，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=f(M_t,\\langle M\\rangle_t)$</span> 应用第 2 节一维 Itô 引理（其假设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{2,1}$</span> 且二次变差有限，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 光滑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s. 由 (A1) 保证），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dZ_t=Z_t\\,dM_t-\\tfrac12 Z_t\\,d\\langle M\\rangle_t+\\tfrac12 Z_t\\,d\\langle M\\rangle_t=Z_t\\,\\theta_t\\,dW_t.$$</div>\n右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2$</span> 鞅微分，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 为局部鞅；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_t^{\\theta}=1$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 与指数鞅期望恒等式给出（对 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\theta_s dW_s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2$</span> 鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(M_t-\\tfrac12\\langle M\\rangle_t)=1$</span>，此即 Wald 恒等式的指数形式，可用停时逼近与 Fatou 引理验证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Novikov 条件下的真鞅性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_t^{\\theta}\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 是一致可积鞅，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}$</span> 是概率测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：一致可积性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_t^{\\theta}\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中相对弱紧。由 (A2)，对任意停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^\\tau\\theta_s^2ds)\\le\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds)&lt;\\infty$</span>。对停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_\\tau^{\\theta}&gt;c\\}$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[Z_\\tau^{\\theta}\\mathbf{1}_{\\{Z_\\tau^{\\theta}&gt;c\\}}]\\le \\mathbb{E}\\big[Z_\\tau^{\\theta}\\,\\tfrac{Z_\\tau^{\\theta}}{c}\\wedge 1\\big]\\le \\frac{1}{c}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\big[(Z_\\tau^{\\theta})^2\\wedge cZ_\\tau^{\\theta}\\big].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z_\\tau^{\\theta})^2=\\exp(2M_\\tau-\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)=\\exp(2M_\\tau-2\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)\\cdot\\exp(\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(2M_\\tau-2\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)&lt;\\infty$</span> 下为鞅（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M$</span> 用命题 1 的指数公式并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle 2M\\rangle=4\\langle M\\rangle$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(2\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)&lt;\\infty$</span>，这由 (A2) 通过 Cauchy–Schwarz 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau)\\le(\\mathbb{E}\\exp(2\\langle M\\rangle_\\tau))^{1/2}&lt;\\infty$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(2\\langle M\\rangle_T)&lt;\\infty$</span>，而 (A2) 只给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\langle M\\rangle_T)&lt;\\infty$</span>；故此处改用下述标准估计）。标准估计为：对任意停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[(Z_\\tau^{\\theta})^p\\big]\\le\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\exp\\big(\\tfrac{p^2}{2}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds\\big)\\Big]^{1/p}\\cdot(\\text{常数}),$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(2\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds)&lt;\\infty$</span>，强于 (A2)。因此严格论证须走 Novikov 的原始路径：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n=\\inf\\{t:\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds\\ge n\\}\\wedge T$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_n]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta^2ds\\le n$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^{\\tau_n}\\theta^2ds)\\le e^{n/2}&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_n]$</span> 上一致可积；由 (A2) 与 Fatou 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}\\ge\\limsup_n\\mathbb{E}Z_{\\tau_n}^{\\theta}=1$</span>，又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}\\le1$</span>（上鞅性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}=1$</span>，一致可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_{\\tau_n}\\}$</span> 的一致可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\uparrow T$</span> 传递。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的完整证明属标准结果，本节只用到其结论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 为概率测度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 为真鞅。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-Girsanov-定理的陈述与证明\">Girsanov 定理的陈述与证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Girsanov-定理的陈述与证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3（Girsanov）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}$</span> 下，过程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde W_t:=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,ds,\\qquad t\\in[0,T]$$</div>\n是标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-Brownian 运动。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Lévy 刻画（第 5 节已建立：连续局部鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=t$</span> 则为 Brownian 运动），只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下为连续局部鞅且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W\\rangle_t=t$</span>。二次变差在等价测度变换下不变（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限定义，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛在等价测度下保持；严格地，对任意剖分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\widetilde W_{t_{i+1}}-\\widetilde W_{t_i})^2=\\sum_i(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})^2$</span> 逐样本相等，故极限相同），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W\\rangle_t=\\langle W\\rangle_t=t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下成立。</p>\n<p>下证鞅性。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span> 与有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>-可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)]=0$</span>。由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\big[Z_T^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big].$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\theta}=Z_s^{\\theta}\\cdot\\exp(\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du)\\cdot\\exp(\\int_t^T\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_t^T\\theta_u^2du)$</span> 分解，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span> 取条件期望。由 (A2) 与命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 为真鞅，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}\\,|\\,\\mathcal{F}_t]=Z_t^{\\theta}$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\big[Z_T^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\big[Z_t^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big].$$</div>\n（此处用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测，条件期望的塔性质，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T|\\mathcal{F}_t]=Z_t$</span> 的鞅性；可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_t=1$</span> 保证，属 Fubini 型交换，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|Z_T F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F|\\le\\|F\\|_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T=1$</span> 成立。）</p>\n<p>再将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}=Z_s^{\\theta}\\exp(\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du)$</span> 代入，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\big[Z_s^{\\theta}F\\cdot\\exp\\big(\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du\\big)(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big].$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s=(W_t-W_s)-\\int_s^t\\theta_u du$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 条件独立（Brownian 增量独立性），且其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>-条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（命题 1 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的版本，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (A2) 保证）。于是上式等于\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\Big[Z_s^{\\theta}F\\cdot\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\exp\\big(\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u-\\tfrac12\\int_s^t\\theta_u^2du\\big)\\big((W_t-W_s)-\\int_s^t\\theta_u du\\big)\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal{F}_s\\big]\\Big].$$</div>\n内层条件期望中，被积项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 的条件分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的行为。关键恒等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>-条件独立的泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[e^{\\int_s^t\\theta dW-\\frac12\\int_s^t\\theta^2du}\\,H\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal{F}_s\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[H\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal{F}_s\\big]\\ \\text{仅当 } H \\text{ 与指数因子在给定 }\\mathcal{F}_s\\text{ 下独立}.$$</div>\n此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=(W_t-W_s)-\\int_s^t\\theta_u du$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，与指数因子不独立，不能直接拆。正确路径是用 Itô 积分表示：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_t:=\\int_s^t\\theta_u dW_u$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(N_t-\\tfrac12\\langle N\\rangle_t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dZ=Z\\theta dW$</span>（命题 1）。对乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)$</span> 用 Itô 乘积法则（第 2 节），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\big[Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big]=(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\,dZ_t^{\\theta}+Z_t^{\\theta}\\,d\\widetilde W_t+d\\langle Z^{\\theta},\\widetilde W\\rangle_t.$$</div>\n由 (1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\widetilde W_t=dW_t-\\theta_t dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\langle Z^{\\theta},\\widetilde W\\rangle_t=Z_t^{\\theta}\\theta_t\\,d\\langle W\\rangle_t=Z_t^{\\theta}\\theta_t\\,dt$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\big[Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\big]=Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta_t\\,dW_t+Z_t^{\\theta}(dW_t-\\theta_t dt)+Z_t^{\\theta}\\theta_t\\,dt=Z_t^{\\theta}\\big[(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta_t+1\\big]\\,dW_t.$$</div>\n右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2$</span> 鞅微分（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t Z_u^2[(\\widetilde W_u-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta_u+1]^2du&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s,t]$</span> 上的矩有界性保证）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-鞅，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_t^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)\\,|\\,\\mathcal{F}_s]=Z_s^{\\theta}\\cdot 0=0$</span>。结合前面的塔性质，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)]=0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下为鞅。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（漂移的测度变换恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 与 (A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>-可测泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}\\Big[F\\Big(\\int_0^T b_s\\,ds+\\int_0^T\\sigma_s\\,d\\widetilde W_s\\Big)\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\Big[Z_T^{\\theta}F\\Big(\\int_0^T (b_s+\\sigma_s\\theta_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^T\\sigma_s\\,dW_s\\Big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span>。特别地，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_tdt+\\sigma_td\\widetilde W_t$</span> 与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=(b_t+\\sigma_t\\theta_t)dt+\\sigma_tdW_t$</span> 同分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\sigma_s d\\widetilde W_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\sigma_s dW_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下同分布（Itô 积分对 Brownian 运动的分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的适应性与可积性，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下为 Brownian 运动）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T b_s ds$</span> 为路径泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不变。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\widetilde W=dW-\\theta dt$</span> 代入被积泛函，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T b_sds+\\int_0^T\\sigma_s d\\widetilde W_s=\\int_0^T(b_s+\\sigma_s\\theta_s)ds+\\int_0^T\\sigma_s dW_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下几乎必然成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 的定义是逐路径的）。再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[G]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}G]$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=F(\\cdot)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-具体例子-常数漂移的测度变换\">具体例子：常数漂移的测度变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-具体例子-常数漂移的测度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_t\\equiv\\mu$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds=\\mu^2T&lt;\\infty$</span>，(A2) 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\mu^2T)=e^{\\mu^2T/2}&lt;\\infty$</span>）。定理 3 断言：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t=W_t-\\mu t$</span> 为 Brownian 运动，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下为带漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的 Brownian 运动。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 的密度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_T^{\\mu}=\\exp\\big(\\mu W_T-\\tfrac12\\mu^2T\\big).$$</div>\n对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>-可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}}[F]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[e^{\\mu W_T-\\frac12\\mu^2T}F]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\mathbf{1}_{\\{W_T\\in A\\}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}(W_T\\in A)=\\int_A e^{\\mu x-\\frac12\\mu^2T}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi T}}e^{-x^2/(2T)}dx=\\int_A\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi T}}e^{-(x-\\mu T)^2/(2T)}dx$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(\\mu T,T)$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_T=W_T-\\mu T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,T)$</span> 一致。此例同时验证了推论 4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\equiv1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span> 的情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=d\\widetilde W_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\mu dt+dW_t$</span> 同分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-与鞅表示及后续节的接口\">与鞅表示及后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与鞅表示及后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 的证明只用到命题 1 的 Itô 表示 (1) 与命题 2 的真鞅性，二者分别由第 2 节 Itô 引理与第 7 节的可积性条件提供。下一节“鞅表示与测度变换”将把 (1) 反向使用：任一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span>-鞅都可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-Brownian 的随机积分加上漂移修正，其核心恒等式正是本节证明中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d[Z^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)]=Z^{\\theta}[(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta+1]dW$</span>。第 10 节的反例将说明：若放弃 (A2) 仅保留 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\theta}$</span> 可能不是真鞅（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}&lt;1$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 仅为有限测度，定理 3 的鞅性论证在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T|\\mathcal{F}_t]=Z_t$</span>”一步失效。第 15 节将用推论 4 把 Fokker–Planck 方程在漂移变换下的协变性与 Girsanov 密度对应起来。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-多维-Girsanov-定理与坐标表述\">多维 Girsanov 定理与坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-多维-Girsanov-定理与坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一维情形已足以支撑本章后续的得分动力学推导，但扩散生成模型的漂移场通常是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值的，故本节把定理 3 推广到多维并明确指标约定。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W^1,\\dots,W^d)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta^1,\\dots,\\theta^d)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值适应过程，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_t^{\\theta}:=\\exp\\!\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^d\\int_0^t\\theta_s^i\\,dW_s^i-\\tfrac12\\sum_{i=1}^d\\int_0^t(\\theta_s^i)^2\\,ds\\Big).$$</div>\n多维 Novikov 条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\|\\theta_s\\|^2ds)&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\theta_s\\|^2=\\sum_i(\\theta_s^i)^2$</span>。此时对每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dZ_t^{\\theta}=Z_t^{\\theta}\\sum_i\\theta_t^i dW_t^i$</span>，多维 Itô 引理（第 3 节）给出的二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_i(\\theta_t^i)^2Z_t^{\\theta}dt$</span> 恰被指数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\sum_i(\\theta^i)^2$</span> 抵消，故命题 1 与命题 2 逐字成立，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta_s dW_s$</span> 读作内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\int\\theta_s^i dW_s^i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（多维 Girsanov）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：多维 Novikov 条件成立。<strong>结论</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t:=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s ds$</span>（按分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t^i=W_t^i-\\int_0^t\\theta_s^i ds$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动，即各分量独立、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W^i,\\widetilde W^j\\rangle_t=\\delta_{ij}t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：多维 Lévy 刻画要求连续局部鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_0=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W^i,\\widetilde W^j\\rangle_t=\\delta_{ij}t$</span>。交叉二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W^i,\\widetilde W^j\\rangle_t$</span> 在等价测度变换下不变，因为对剖分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k(\\widetilde W^i_{t_{k+1}}-\\widetilde W^i_{t_k})(\\widetilde W^j_{t_{k+1}}-\\widetilde W^j_{t_k})=\\sum_k(W^i_{t_{k+1}}-W^i_{t_k})(W^j_{t_{k+1}}-W^j_{t_k})$</span> 逐样本相等，极限即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ij}t$</span>。鞅性逐分量重复定理 3 的乘积法则论证：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d[Z^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W^i_t-\\widetilde W^i_s)]=Z^{\\theta}[(\\widetilde W^i_t-\\widetilde W^i_s)\\theta_t^i+\\sum_j\\theta_t^j\\delta_{ij}]dW_t^j$</span> 的漂移项为零，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-鞅。分量独立性由联合二次变差对角化与多维 Lévy 刻画给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>坐标表述上，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 视为余切向量场（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的平凡坐标下即向量场），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\cdot dW_s$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 Brownian 微分的自然配对，不依赖坐标选取；测度变换后的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\theta_s ds$</span> 是同一向量场的 Lebesgue 积分。这一无坐标表述在第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口中会用到：漂移变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 恰是把 Fokker–Planck 方程中的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b+\\sigma\\theta$</span> 的测度层面实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测度变换下的期望恒等式与-Radon-Nikodym-导数的可逆性\">测度变换下的期望恒等式与 Radon–Nikodym 导数的可逆性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测度变换下的期望恒等式与-Radon-Nikodym-导数的可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（双向变换恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>-可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[|F|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[|Z_T^{\\theta}F|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 同时成立（后者由前者与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 定义自动满足）。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[F]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}F],\\qquad \\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[F]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}\\big[(Z_T^{\\theta})^{-1}F\\big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z_T^{\\theta})^{-1}=\\exp(-\\int_0^T\\theta_s dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下几乎必然为正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 的定义。第二式由第一式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F'=(Z_T^{\\theta})^{-1}F$</span> 得到，需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[|F'|]&lt;\\infty$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}[|F'|]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}(Z_T^{\\theta})^{-1}|F|]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[|F|]$</span>，故只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[|F|]&lt;\\infty$</span>，这正是第二式成立所需的可积性假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Z_T^{\\theta})^{-1}$</span> 的正性由指数函数值域为正给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的可逆性是第 9 节鞅表示定理的入口：任一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span>-鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=Z_t^{\\theta}\\cdot(\\text{某个 }\\mathbb{P}\\text{-鞅})$</span> 的形式，从而其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-半鞅分解中的漂移项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 显式确定。具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下为鞅，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}M_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下为鞅（这是命题 6 第二式的过程版本，由条件期望的塔性质与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 的真鞅性给出）；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}M$</span> 用 Itô 乘积法则，其漂移项为零的条件恰好给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-分解中漂移与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的关系。这一推导留待第 9 节展开，本节只固定可逆性这一代数事实。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-二次变差的测度不变性\">一个可检验的恒等式：二次变差的测度不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-二次变差的测度不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（二次变差在等价测度下不变）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span> 上等价概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为连续半鞅。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的连续适应增过程，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下几乎必然相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对任意剖分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;\\dots&lt;t_n=T\\}$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\Pi_t:=\\sum_{k:t_{k+1}\\le t}(M_{t_{k+1}}-M_{t_k})^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\Pi$</span> 是仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 样本路径的泛函，不涉及测度，故对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\Pi_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下逐样本相等。二次变差定义为当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\Pi$</span> 在概率意义下的极限（第 5 节），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 等价意味着概率意义下的收敛在两种测度下等价：若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^\\Pi\\to\\langle M\\rangle$</span> 依概率，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(|V^\\Pi_t-\\langle M\\rangle_t|&gt;\\epsilon)\\to0$</span>，由等价性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}\\ll\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\ll\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}(|V^\\Pi_t-\\langle M\\rangle_t|&gt;\\epsilon)\\to0$</span>。故极限过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下同一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 是定理 3 证明中“二次变差不变”一步的独立陈述，它把该步骤从 Girsanov 的具体构造中剥离出来，说明不变性只依赖测度等价性而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的具体形式。这一分离对第 15 节有用：Fokker–Planck 方程的扩散系数由二次变差决定，故在漂移变换下扩散项不变，只有漂移项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\theta$</span> 修正，这正是推论 4 的偏微分方程对应物。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-密度过程的路径性质与-Cameron-Martin-型估计\">密度过程的路径性质与 Cameron–Martin 型估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-密度过程的路径性质与-Cameron-Martin-型估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（密度的对数二次变差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：密度过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 的对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_t^{\\theta}=\\int_0^t\\theta_s dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle\\log Z^{\\theta}\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds,\\qquad \\log Z_t^{\\theta}=\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,d\\widetilde W_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds,$$</div>\n其中第二式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下几乎必然成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 为定理 3 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span>-Brownian 运动）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z^{\\theta}$</span> 的 Itô 微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log Z_t^{\\theta}=\\theta_t dW_t-\\tfrac12\\theta_t^2dt+\\tfrac12\\theta_t^2dt=\\theta_t dW_t$</span> 给出（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\log x$</span> 用一维 Itô 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}&gt;0$</span> 几乎必然，二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12(-1/Z_t^2)\\cdot(Z_t\\theta_t)^2dt=-\\tfrac12\\theta_t^2dt$</span> 与指数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\theta^2$</span> 抵消），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z^{\\theta}$</span> 是 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta dW$</span>，其二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta^2ds$</span>。第二式：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_t=d\\widetilde W_t+\\theta_t dt$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_t^{\\theta}=\\int_0^t\\theta_s dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\theta_s d\\widetilde W_s+\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds=\\int_0^t\\theta_s d\\widetilde W_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的第二式给出 Cameron–Martin 型估计的直接来源：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_T^{\\theta}$</span> 的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 积分的期望为零，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (A2) 与命题 6 给出）。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\log Z_T^{\\theta}=-\\tfrac12\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds$</span> 形成对照，两者之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds$</span>，即测度变换把对数密度的“漂移”从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\int\\theta^2$</span> 翻转为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\tfrac12\\int\\theta^2$</span>。这一符号翻转在第 9 节的鞅表示与第 15 节的 Fokker–Planck 接口中反复出现，是 Girsanov 密度与似然比之间符号约定的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测度变换下的-Itô-积分不变性与鞅性的充分条件\">测度变换下的 Itô 积分不变性与鞅性的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测度变换下的-Itô-积分不变性与鞅性的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的一致可积性论证依赖 Novikov 条件 (A2)，而实际工程中常遇到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 只满足较弱的可积性。本节给出一个可检验的充分条件，把 (A2) 替换为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的逐点界，并显式验证交换期望与积分所用的定理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（有界漂移下的真鞅性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span> 且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|\\theta_t|\\le K$</span> 几乎必然。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上为一致可积鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}=1$</span>，且定理 3 的全部结论成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\theta_t|\\le K$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds\\le K^2T$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds)\\le e^{K^2T/2}&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 (A2) 成立，命题 2 直接给出结论。此处无需交换积分与期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2ds$</span> 是样本路径泛函，其上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^2T$</span> 逐样本成立，故期望的有限性由逐样本有界性直接推出，不涉及 Fubini。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义在于把 (A2) 的验证化归为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的路径一致界，后者在数值实现中可直接检查（第 11 节 Euler–Maruyama 的漂移项若取有界截断，即满足此条件）。与之对照，若仅有 (A1) 而放弃 (A2)，命题 2 的证明中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}\\ge\\limsup_n\\mathbb{E}Z_{\\tau_n}^{\\theta}=1$</span>”一步仍成立（Fatou 引理只要求非负性），但反向不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}\\le1$</span> 只给出上鞅性，真鞅性可能失效；第 10 节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}&lt;1$</span> 的完整构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-定理-3-证明中期望交换的逐条核验\">定理 3 证明中期望交换的逐条核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-定理-3-证明中期望交换的逐条核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 的证明使用了两次期望与条件期望的交换，本节把它们单独列出并核验 Dominated Convergence 与 Fubini 的条件，以满足假设纪律第 3 条。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 10（条件期望的塔性质在测度变换下的可积性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>-可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F|\\le C&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}F\\,|\\,\\mathcal{F}_t]=Z_t^{\\theta}F$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t\\le T$</span> 几乎必然成立，且该等式两端的期望均有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{\\theta}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-真鞅，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}|\\mathcal{F}_t]=Z_t^{\\theta}$</span> 几乎必然。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>-可测而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测，故可提出条件期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}F|\\mathcal{F}_t]=F\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[Z_T^{\\theta}|\\mathcal{F}_t]=FZ_t^{\\theta}$</span>。可积性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|Z_T^{\\theta}F|\\le C\\,\\mathbb{E}Z_T^{\\theta}=C&lt;\\infty$</span>，故条件期望存在且有限；提出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的合法性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\theta}\\in L^1$</span> 保证（条件期望的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测因子的可提出性，无需额外可积性）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 10 覆盖了定理 3 证明中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)]=\\mathbb{E}[Z_t^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)]$</span>”一步：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测但不必有界；此时需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}|Z_T^{\\theta}F(\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F|\\le C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T^{\\theta}|\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证，后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下为 Gaussian（均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_s^t\\theta_u du$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的路径）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\theta}$</span> 的指数矩有限性通过 Cauchy–Schwarz 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T^{\\theta}|\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s|]\\le(\\mathbb{E}(Z_T^{\\theta})^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}|\\widetilde W_t-\\widetilde W_s|^2)^{1/2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(Z_T^{\\theta})^2=\\mathbb{E}\\exp(2\\int_0^T\\theta dW-\\int_0^T\\theta^2ds)=\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\int_0^T\\theta^2ds)$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\int_0^T\\theta^2ds)&lt;\\infty$</span>，强于 (A2)。故严格论证应改用命题 2 证明中的停时逼近：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta^2ds\\le n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(Z_{\\tau_n}^{\\theta})^2\\le e^{n}&lt;\\infty$</span>，Cauchy–Schwarz 可用，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 用控制收敛（被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\cdot$</span> 可积控制项控制）传递。此细节属标准技术，本节只标注所需条件，不在正文展开停时逼近的全部步骤。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-扩散项在测度变换下的显式协变公式\">扩散项在测度变换下的显式协变公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-扩散项在测度变换下的显式协变公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 4 给出了漂移的变换恒等式，但未写出扩散项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下的 Itô 积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下对应积分的逐路径关系。本节补上这一恒等式，它在第 15 节把 Fokker–Planck 方程的生成元与 Girsanov 密度对接时直接使用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（扩散积分的测度变换协变）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}([0,T])$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\,d\\widetilde W_s=\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\,dW_s-\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\theta_s\\,ds\\quad \\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.},$$</div>\n且右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下为半鞅，其有限变差部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\theta_s ds$</span>，二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\sigma_s^2ds$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s ds$</span> 的逐路径定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\widetilde W_s=dW_s-\\theta_s ds$</span>。Itô 积分对半鞅微分的线性性（第 1 节定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^2$</span> 极限对积分变量的线性保持）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\sigma_s d\\widetilde W_s=\\int_0^t\\sigma_s dW_s-\\int_0^t\\sigma_s\\theta_s ds$</span>，其中第二项为 Lebesgue–Stieltjes 积分，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t|\\sigma_s\\theta_s|ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 几乎必然，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma,\\theta\\in\\mathcal{L}^2_{\\mathrm{ad}}$</span> 与 Cauchy–Schwarz 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t|\\sigma_s\\theta_s|ds\\le(\\int_0^t\\sigma_s^2ds)^{1/2}(\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds)^{1/2}&lt;\\infty$</span> 几乎必然。二次变差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\int\\sigma d\\widetilde W\\rangle_t=\\int\\sigma^2ds$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下为 Brownian 运动（定理 3）给出，而二次变差在等价测度下不变（命题 7），故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下同一。有限变差部分的识别由半鞅分解的唯一性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\sigma dW$</span> 为局部鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\sigma\\theta ds$</span> 为连续有限变差过程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 与推论 4 合起来给出完整的协变图景：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下，SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_tdt+\\sigma_td\\widetilde W_t$</span> 的解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=(b_t+\\sigma_t\\theta_t)dt+\\sigma_tdW_t$</span> 的解同分布，而扩散项的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\sigma^2ds$</span> 在两种测度下相同。这正是 Fokker–Planck 方程在漂移变换下扩散系数不变、漂移系数平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\theta$</span> 的随机分析根源：第 15 节将把该平移写成生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathbb{Q}}=\\mathcal{L}^{\\mathbb{P}}-\\sigma\\theta\\cdot\\nabla$</span> 的形式，并用命题 11 验证其对偶方程（Fokker–Planck）的相应平移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个具体例子-线性漂移的得分变换\">一个具体例子：线性漂移的得分变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个具体例子-线性漂移的得分变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_t=\\sigma^{-1}b$</span> 为常数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 常数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sigma d\\widetilde W_t$</span> 为纯扩散，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b\\,dt+\\sigma dW_t$</span> 为带漂移的 Brownian 运动。由推论 4，两者同分布。验证密度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\theta}=\\exp(\\tfrac{b}{\\sigma}W_T-\\tfrac12\\tfrac{b^2}{\\sigma^2}T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T\\sim\\mathcal{N}(\\tfrac{b}{\\sigma}T,T)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=\\sigma W_T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(bT,\\sigma^2T)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=bT+\\sigma W_T$</span> 的分布一致。此例是扩散生成模型中“把漂移吸收进测度”的最小可检验实例：得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 对应的漂移经 Girsanov 变换后被消去，剩余纯扩散的分布与原过程相同，这正是第 15 节将反向 SDE 漂移写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\theta$</span> 形式的动机。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>随机指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{\\theta}=\\exp(\\int_0^t\\theta_s dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2ds)$</span> 在 (A1) 下满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dZ_t^{\\theta}=Z_t^{\\theta}\\theta_t dW_t$</span>，在 Novikov 条件 (A2) 下为一致可积鞅，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}=Z_T^{\\theta}\\mathbb{P}|_{\\mathcal{F}_T}$</span> 为概率测度。</li>\n<li>Girsanov 定理断言：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s ds$</span> 为标准 Brownian 运动；证明路径为 Lévy 刻画（二次变差不变）加 Itô 乘积法则给出的鞅性，关键恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d[Z^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)]=Z^{\\theta}[(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta+1]dW$</span>。</li>\n<li>推论 4 给出漂移的测度变换恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>、扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的 SDE 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b+\\sigma\\theta$</span>、扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的 SDE 同分布；常数漂移例子验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\mu}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T\\sim\\mathcal{N}(\\mu T,T)$</span>，与密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{\\mu}=\\exp(\\mu W_T-\\tfrac12\\mu^2T)$</span> 一致。</li>\n<li>Girsanov 定理断言：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s ds$</span> 为标准 Brownian 运动；证明路径为 Lévy 刻画（二次变差不变，命题 7 独立陈述）加 Itô 乘积法则给出的鞅性，关键恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d[Z^{\\theta}(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)]=Z^{\\theta}[(\\widetilde W-\\widetilde W_s)\\theta+1]dW$</span>；多维版本按分量逐字重复，交叉二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\widetilde W^i,\\widetilde W^j\\rangle_t=\\delta_{ij}t$</span> 保证分量独立。</li>\n<li>推论 4 给出漂移的测度变换恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>、扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的 SDE 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b+\\sigma\\theta$</span>、扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的 SDE 同分布；命题 6 给出 Radon–Nikodym 导数的双向可逆性，命题 8 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z^{\\theta}$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\theta^2ds$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}^{\\theta}$</span> 下对数密度的漂移翻转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\tfrac12\\int\\theta^2ds$</span>，二者共同构成第 9 节鞅表示与第 15 节 Fokker–Planck 接口的代数基础。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-鞅表示与测度变换\">鞅表示与测度变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-鞅表示与测度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号体系，不引入未定义记号。回顾如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb{P})$</span> 为满足通常条件（右连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_0$</span> 含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-零集）的滤波概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为定义于其上的标准一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-Brownian 运动。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span> 的可测过程全体，它是 Hilbert 空间，内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle H,K\\rangle_{\\mathcal{H}^2}=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T H_sK_s\\,ds$</span>。Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(H)_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 在第 1 节已对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 定义，并满足 Itô 等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[I(H)_t^2]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}_T^2$</span> 为平方可积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-鞅全体（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}\\mathbb{E}M_t^2&lt;\\infty$</span>），它是 Hilbert 空间。第 8 节已建立 Girsanov 定理：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int_0^T\\theta_s^2\\,ds)&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=\\exp(\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2\\,ds)$</span> 为一致可积鞅，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 在测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}=Z_T\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下为 Brownian 运动。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设逐条列出，后续命题引用时标明编号：</p>\n<p>(A1) 时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 凡涉及鞅的命题，所论鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathcal{M}_T^2$</span>，即平方可积且右连续。</p>\n<p>(A3) 凡涉及随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 的表示命题，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 凡涉及测度变换的命题，密度过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为非负一致可积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}=Z_T\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 等价。</p>\n<p>(A5) 凡涉及可料表示中被积过程可积性的命题，被积过程属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在 (A1)–(A5) 之下，证明平方可积鞅的 Itô 可料表示定理，给出测度变换下鞅表示系数与漂移的变换恒等式，并用一个具体例子验证公式。以下分四个小节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-鞅表示定理的陈述与证明\">鞅表示定理的陈述与证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-鞅表示定理的陈述与证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（可料表示）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathcal{M}_T^2$</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s\\quad\\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.},$$</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 具有 Itô 可料表示，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 称为表示系数。此定义与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是某个 Itô 积分”的区别在于：后者是构造性陈述（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>），前者是存在性陈述（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 找 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>）；与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span> 适应”的区别在于：适应性只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测，而可料表示要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的全部随机性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的增量经可料权重线性生成，这是强得多的结构约束。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 9.1（Itô 可料表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span>，存在唯一（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 中几乎处处相等意义下）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\xi=\\mathbb{E}\\xi+\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s\\quad\\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.}$$</div>\n<p>等价地，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathcal{M}_T^2$</span> 可唯一表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步：化归到鞅。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\mathbb{E}[\\xi\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]$</span>。由条件 Jensen 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}M_t^2\\le\\mathbb{E}\\xi^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{M_t\\}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span> 是鞅；由 (A2) 的右连续性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span> 满足通常条件，可取右连续版本，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathcal{M}_T^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_T=\\xi$</span>。于是只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 有可料表示。</p>\n<p>第二步：稠密性。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\Omega$</span> 上由形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}h_i\\mathbf{1}_{(t_i,t_{i+1}]}(s)$</span> 的简单可料过程张成的子空间，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_i}$</span>-可测有界随机变量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 中稠密：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span>，由可料过程的逼近定理（可料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数由左连续适应过程生成），存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(n)}\\in\\mathcal{P}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T(H_s-H_s^{(n)})^2\\,ds\\to0$</span>。这一步只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 的定义与可料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数的生成结构，不涉及鞅论。</p>\n<p>第三步：对简单过程验证等距并延拓。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{P}$</span>，直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s)^2]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds$</span>（第 1 节已证 Itô 等距对简单过程成立，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 中过程取极限）。定义线性泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]\\to L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(H)=\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。由 Itô 等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 是保范的，故其像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline{\\Phi(\\mathcal{H}^2)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span> 的闭子空间。要证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 是满射，只需证其像的正交补为零。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span> 满足对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s]=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=h\\mathbf{1}_{(t,T]}(s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s=h(W_T-W_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta h(W_T-W_t)]=0$</span> 对一切这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 成立。由条件期望的塔性质，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t])h(W_T-W_t)]=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]$</span>（有界化后用单调收敛），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t])(W_T-W_t)]=0$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_T-W_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span> 独立且均值为零，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[h(W_T-W_t)]=0$</span>。两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]-\\mathbb{E}\\eta)(W_T-W_t)]=0$</span>，但这并不直接给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]=\\mathbb{E}\\eta$</span>。改用如下论证：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le t\\le T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta h]=\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]h]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\mathbf{1}_A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mathbf{1}_A]=\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[\\eta\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]\\mathbf{1}_A]$</span>，此式恒成立，无信息。关键的一步是：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{P}$</span> 的一般形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 的线性组合张成的空间恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f(W_{t_1},\\dots,W_{t_n}):f\\text{ 多项式，}t_i\\le T\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的闭包，而后者由 Brownian 运动的鞅性知等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span> 中零均值元全体。具体地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 零均值且与一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{P}$</span>）正交。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\mathbf{1}_{(t_i,t_{i+1}]}(s)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})]=0$</span> 对一切分割成立。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 零均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta W_0]=0$</span>，逐段求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_{t_i}$</span>-可测性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta W_{t_j}]=0$</span> 对一切分割节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j$</span> 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，取分割含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\eta W_t]=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{W_t\\}_{t\\le T}$</span> 张成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 闭子空间正交。但由 Brownian 运动的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(W_s:s\\le T)=\\mathcal{F}_T^W\\subseteq\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span> 严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T^W$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 可能非零。此时需用 (A3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span>-可测性并不能保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T=\\mathcal{F}_T^W$</span>。为使定理在一般滤波下成立，须补充假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 生成（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t=\\mathcal{F}_t^W$</span> 加零集）。此假设在扩散生成的应用中总成立（噪声滤波即 Brownian 滤波）。在此假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{W_t\\}$</span> 张成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 闭子空间等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span> 中零均值元全体（由 Wiener 混沌分解或单调类定理），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 满射，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi=\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。</p>\n<p>第四步：唯一性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s=\\int_0^T H'_s\\,dW_s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T (H_s-H'_s)\\,dW_s=0$</span>，由 Itô 等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T(H_s-H'_s)^2\\,ds=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=H'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 定理 9.1 的证明中用到的关键交换是“正交补为零”，其验证依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T=\\mathcal{F}_T^W$</span>（加零集）。若滤波含外生随机性，表示定理失效：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\Omega_W\\times\\Omega_\\xi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 独立的非退化随机变量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi$</span> 与一切 Itô 积分正交但非零。此边界情形归入第 10 节反例节处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测度变换下的鞅表示\">测度变换下的鞅表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测度变换下的鞅表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 9.2（Girsanov 下的表示系数变换）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}=Z_T\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下，过程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde M_t=M_t-\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$$</div>\n<p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-鞅，且其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-Brownian 运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 下的可料表示为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,d\\tilde W_s+\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Girsanov 定理（第 8 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下为 Brownian 运动。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_s=d\\tilde W_s+\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,d\\tilde W_s+\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>右端第一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下是 Itô 积分。需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2_{\\mathbb{Q}}[0,T]$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 (A4) 与 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds=\\mathbb{E}[Z_T\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds]$</span>。由 Hölder 不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可积性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\exp(\\tfrac12\\int\\theta^2)&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_T^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，见第 8 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_T\\int_0^T H_s^2]\\le(\\mathbb{E}Z_T^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}(\\int_0^T H_s^2)^2)^{1/2}$</span>。后者有限当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 有界或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int H^4&lt;\\infty$</span>；在 (A5) 仅给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 时，用截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(n)}=H\\mathbf{1}_{\\{|H|\\le n\\}}$</span> 逼近并取单调收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\int(H^{(n)})^2\\uparrow Z_T\\int H^2$</span>，单调收敛定理适用），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\int H^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。故第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-鞅。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde M_t=M_t-\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-鞅，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,d\\tilde W_s$</span> 给出其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下的可料表示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（漂移的测度变换恒等式）</strong> 在定理 9.2 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下漂移为零，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下其漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下漂移为零，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下其漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>。特别地，表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在两种测度下不变，仅漂移项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 平移。此恒等式与第 8 节 Girsanov 定理中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的漂移平移”是同一事实的两个面：前者作用于被积过程，后者作用于积分器。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 9.2 直接读出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-漂移项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>。反向陈述由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}=Z_T^{-1}\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto-\\theta$</span> 对称得到（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T^{-1}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-可积性，由 (A4) 等价测度保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-具体例子-几何-Brownian-运动的测度变换\">具体例子：几何 Brownian 运动的测度变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-具体例子-几何-Brownian-运动的测度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为标准 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_s\\equiv\\theta$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=\\exp(\\theta W_t-\\tfrac12\\theta^2t)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\exp(\\sigma W_t-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-鞅（几何 Brownian 运动）。由 Itô 引理（第 2 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sigma X_t\\,dW_t$</span>，故表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\sigma X_s$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}=Z_T\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t=W_t-\\theta t$</span> 为 Brownian 运动，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=\\exp(\\sigma\\tilde W_t+\\sigma\\theta t-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2t).$$</div>\n<p>由定理 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下的表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sigma X_t\\,d\\tilde W_t+\\sigma\\theta X_t\\,dt$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\theta X_t$</span>。直接验证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\log x$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-Itô 引理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log X_t=\\sigma\\,d\\tilde W_t+(\\sigma\\theta-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)\\,dt$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\exp(\\sigma\\tilde W_t+(\\sigma\\theta-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)t)$</span>，与上式一致。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}X_1=\\exp(0.5\\cdot1)=e^{0.5}\\approx1.6487$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}X_1=1$</span>。数值上可用 Monte Carlo 验证：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 条路径，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\tilde W_1+0.5-0.5)=\\exp(\\tilde W_1)$</span> 的样本均值，应趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{0.5}$</span>。此例同时验证了“表示系数不变、漂移平移”的恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-鞅表示与测度变换的接口-密度过程的表示\">鞅表示与测度变换的接口：密度过程的表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-鞅表示与测度变换的接口-密度过程的表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.4（密度过程的可料表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A4)(A5) 下，密度过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=1+\\int_0^t Z_s\\theta_s\\,dW_s$</span>，即其表示系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=Z_s\\theta_s$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=1+\\int_0^t Z_s\\theta_s\\,d\\tilde W_s+\\int_0^t Z_s\\theta_s^2\\,ds$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 8 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=\\exp(\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2\\,ds)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=e^x$</span> 用 Itô 引理于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=\\int_0^t\\theta_s\\,dW_s-\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2\\,ds$</span>（其二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\theta_s^2\\,ds$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dZ_t=Z_t\\,dY_t+\\tfrac12 Z_t\\,d\\langle Y\\rangle_t=Z_t\\theta_t\\,dW_t-\\tfrac12 Z_t\\theta_t^2\\,dt+\\tfrac12 Z_t\\theta_t^2\\,dt=Z_t\\theta_t\\,dW_t.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=1+\\int_0^t Z_s\\theta_s\\,dW_s$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_s=d\\tilde W_s+\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：密度过程的表示系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\theta$</span>，而 Girsanov 定理中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，两者通过定理 9.2 的恒等式联系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\theta^2$</span>，正是“表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\times$</span> 漂移”的形式。这一接口在第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的衔接中用于将测度变换下的漂移修正翻译为概率流方程中的源项。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T=\\mathcal{F}_T^W$</span>（加零集）与平方可积性假设下，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span> 可唯一表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=\\mathbb{E}\\xi+\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span>；表示系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e. 意义下唯一。</li>\n<li>Girsanov 测度变换下，Itô 积分的表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 不变，漂移按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\theta$</span> 平移：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-零漂移的鞅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>，反向亦然；密度过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 自身的表示系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\theta$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\theta^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>表示定理的满射性依赖噪声滤波假设；若滤波含外生随机性，正交补非零，表示失效，此边界情形归入第 10 节反例节。测度变换与表示定理的接口为第 15 节 Fokker–Planck 方程中漂移修正项的推导提供代数恒等式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-鞅表示的唯一性与可料性\">鞅表示的唯一性与可料性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-鞅表示的唯一性与可料性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的表示定理在存在性之外还断言了唯一性，但唯一性的证明只用到 Itô 等距，未触及表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的可料性结构。本小节补足这一层：证明表示系数必然可料，并说明“可料”这一要求不是技术性冗余，而是测度变换下系数不变性的结构性前提。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5（表示系数的可料性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-可料过程，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 中唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 1 节 Itô 积分的构造，积分对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 中过程定义时，被积过程须为可料；若给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 仅适应而不可料，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 未必良定义。因此定理 9.1 中“存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span>”一语已隐含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 可料（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 按第 1 节定义即由可料过程组成）。若另有可料 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H'\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，则由 Itô 等距</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T (H_s-H'_s)^2\\,ds=\\mathbb{E}\\Big(\\int_0^T (H_s-H'_s)\\,dW_s\\Big)^2=\\mathbb{E}(M_T-M_T)^2=0,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=H'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e.。可料性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 的定义直接继承，无需额外论证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（可料性与测度变换的相容）</strong> 定理 9.2 的证明中，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_s=d\\tilde W_s+\\theta_s\\,ds$</span> 代入后得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,d\\tilde W_s$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 可料。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 等价，两测度的零集相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-可料与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-可料一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2_{\\mathbb{Q}}$</span> 的可积性由定理 9.2 证明中的截断论证给出。因此表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在测度变换下保持为同一可料过程，这正是推论 9.3 中“系数不变”的精确含义：不是数值不变，而是作为可料过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e. 意义下同一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测度变换下二次变差的刚性\">测度变换下二次变差的刚性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测度变换下二次变差的刚性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>表示定理的另一面是二次变差的测度不变性。这一性质在本节与第 5 节（二次变差）之间建立接口，并为第 15 节 Fokker–Planck 接口中“扩散矩阵不随测度变换改变”提供依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6（二次变差的测度不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下相同，且该等式作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上的适应增过程逐路径成立（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s. 意义下，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-a.s.）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 二次变差由第 5 节定义为沿分割的均方极限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle M\\rangle_t=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i (M_{t_{i+1}}-M_{t_i})^2,$$</div>\n<p>极限在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathbb{P})$</span> 中取。此定义只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的路径增量，不涉及测度；但极限的均方意义依赖测度。需证两测度下极限相同。由定理 9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,d\\tilde W_s+\\int_0^t H_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是半鞅，其二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-Itô 积分项的二次变差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>（有限变差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int H\\theta\\,ds$</span> 对二次变差无贡献，因二次变差只由连续局部鞅部分决定，见第 5 节）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-二次变差亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span>。两测度下同一增过程逐路径相等，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>-逐点定义的 Lebesgue 积分，与测度无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.7（扩散系数的测度刚性）</strong> 在命题 9.6 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_t\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下），则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=(b_t+g_t\\theta_t)\\,dt+g_t\\,d\\tilde W_t$</span>，扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span> 不变。此即 Girsanov 变换只改漂移不改扩散的精确陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b_t\\,dt+g_t\\,dW_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_t=d\\tilde W_t+\\theta_t\\,dt$</span> 直接代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示。扩散系数不变由命题 9.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g_s^2\\,ds$</span> 在两测度下相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 作为二次变差的密度不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 15 节将反向 SDE 的漂移修正与概率流 ODE 速度区分开的代数基础：测度变换只平移漂移，不改变扩散矩阵，因此 Fokker–Planck 方程中的扩散项在测度变换下刚性，只有漂移项（及相应的概率流）随测度改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-表示定理的鞅论形式与可积性边界\">表示定理的鞅论形式与可积性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-表示定理的鞅论形式与可积性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 9.1 陈述于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 终端变量，但扩散生成中常需对仅局部平方可积的鞅作表示。本小节给出局部化版本，并显式标出可积性假设在哪一步失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8（局部鞅的局部表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为连续局部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t=\\mathcal{F}_t^W$</span>（加零集）。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{F}_t\\}$</span>-可料过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，满足对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s.，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s\\quad\\mathbb{P}\\text{-a.s.},\\quad t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取局部化序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\uparrow T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s.），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{\\tau_n}$</span> 为平方可积鞅。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，由定理 9.1 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(n)}\\in\\mathcal{H}^2[0,T]$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{t\\wedge\\tau_n}=\\int_0^{t\\wedge\\tau_n}H^{(n)}_s\\,dW_s$</span>。由唯一性（命题 9.5），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(n)}=H^{(n+1)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\tau_n]\\times\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e.。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=H^{(n)}_s$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le\\tau_n$</span>，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\uparrow T$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\Omega$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}\\otimes ds$</span>-a.e. 良定义且可料。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\ge t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-a.s. 对充分大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=M_{t\\wedge\\tau_n}=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。可积性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{(n)}\\in\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n\\uparrow T$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（可积性边界的失效点）</strong> 命题 9.8 的结论只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^t H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。后者恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span> 的定义，缺失时 Itô 积分只能作为局部鞅而非真鞅存在，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}M_t=0$</span> 可能失效（真鞅才有零期望）。在扩散生成的应用中，这一区别对应“得分匹配损失的可积性”与“样本路径几乎必然有限”之间的差距：前者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}^2$</span>，后者只要求局部化条件。此边界情形归入第 10 节反例节，本节只标出假设 (A5) 在局部化版本中被替换为逐路径平方可积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-表示系数与-Malliavin-导数的关系\">一个可检验的恒等式：表示系数与 Malliavin 导数的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一个可检验的恒等式-表示系数与-Malliavin-导数的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个可数值检验的恒等式，将表示系数与终端变量的变分结构联系起来。此恒等式在本节内只用已建立的 Itô 等距与表示定理，不引入新工具。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.9（表示系数的条件期望恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A3)(A5) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_T=\\mathcal{F}_T^W$</span> 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{P})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为其表示系数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=\\mathbb{E}\\xi+\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 与任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\Big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}[\\xi\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]\\Big)h\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[h\\int_t^T H_s\\,dW_s\\Big]=0,$$</div>\n<p>且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[H_s(W_t-W_s)]=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi\\big)(W_t-W_s)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}[\\xi\\mid\\mathcal{F}_t]=\\int_t^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span>（由表示定理与鞅性），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_t^T H_s\\,dW_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span> 独立（Itô 积分的增量独立性，第 1 节），故与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的乘积期望为零。</p>\n<p>第二式：由表示定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi=\\int_0^T H_u\\,dW_u$</span>。取条件期望于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi\\big)(W_t-W_s)\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\Big(\\int_0^T H_u\\,dW_u\\Big)(W_t-W_s)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>由 Itô 等距的极化形式（对两个积分的协方差），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\int_0^T H_u\\,dW_u)(\\int_s^t 1\\,dW_u)]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du$</span>。右端积分器为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_s^t 1\\,dW_u=W_t-W_s$</span>。故左端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[H_s(W_t-W_s)]=\\mathbb{E}[H_s\\,\\mathbb{E}[W_t-W_s\\mid\\mathcal{F}_s]]=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t-W_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_s$</span> 独立且均值为零。故第二式两端均为零，恒等式成立（此处两端均为零是恒等式的退化形式；非退化形式需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t-W_s$</span> 的相关性，由 Itô 等距的极化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[H_s(W_t-W_s)]$</span> 因独立性为零，故非退化恒等式应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi)(W_t-W_s)]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du$</span>，右端非零当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 非零）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（恒等式的可检验形式）</strong> 命题 9.9 的非退化形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}\\xi\\big)(W_t-W_s)\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du,$$</div>\n<p>它对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=W_T^2-T$</span>（其表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_u=2W_u$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(W_t^2-t)=2W_t\\,dW_t$</span>），则左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(W_T^2-T)W_T]=\\mathbb{E}W_T^3-T\\mathbb{E}W_T=0$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^T 2W_u\\,du=0$</span>，一致。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=W_T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_u\\equiv1$</span>，左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[W_T(W_t-W_s)]=t-s$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t 1\\,du=t-s$</span>，一致。此恒等式可作为表示系数的数值诊断：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 的样本与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的路径，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(\\xi-\\bar\\xi)(W_t-W_s)]$</span> 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_s^t H_u\\,du$</span>，与直接由表示系数计算的积分比较。代码节（第 13 节）将以此恒等式验证 Itô 引理的数值实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测度变换下的表示定理-密度加权形式\">测度变换下的表示定理：密度加权形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测度变换下的表示定理-密度加权形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足一个在扩散生成中反复用到的形式：当终端变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下平方可积时，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下的表示系数与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下的表示系数通过密度过程联系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10（密度加权表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A3)(A4)(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in L^2(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F}_T,\\mathbb{Q})$</span>，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span> 下有表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\xi+\\int_0^T H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s\\,d\\tilde W_s$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\xi=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[\\xi]+\\int_0^T \\Big(H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s+Z_s^{-1}\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[\\xi\\theta_s Z_s\\mid\\mathcal{F}_s]\\Big)\\,dW_s,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为密度过程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为 Girsanov 漂移。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-表示系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示系数之差为密度加权漂移项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\xi=\\int_0^T H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s\\,d\\tilde W_s=\\int_0^T H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s\\,dW_s-\\int_0^T H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s\\theta_s\\,ds$</span>。右端第二项为有限变差，需将其写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-Itô 积分形式以合并。由 Girsanov 定理的逆向形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\xi$</span> 的表示系数可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示经密度加权得到：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_t$</span>-可测有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\Big[\\big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\xi\\big)h\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\Big[Z_T^{-1}\\big(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\xi\\big)h\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\xi=(\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\xi)+(\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{Q}}\\xi-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}\\xi)$</span> 代入，第一项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>-表示，第二项为常数。整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>-表示系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\mathbb{Q}}_s+Z_s^{-1}\\mathbb{E}_{\\mathbb{P}}[\\xi\\theta_s Z_s\\mid\\mathcal{F}_s]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途在第 15 节：反向 SDE 的漂移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{Q}$</span>（生成测度）下由得分给出，转换到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}$</span>（数据测度）时需加密度加权修正项；命题 9.10 给出该修正项的精确代数形式，避免将反向漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-反例-不满足-Lipschitz-的解爆炸\">反例：不满足 Lipschitz 的解爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例-不满足-Lipschitz-的解爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为一维标准 Brown 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为其自然滤子完备化后的概率空间；SDE 写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为 Borel 可测。强解指存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 同适应的连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足上述积分方程；爆炸指存在停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty(\\omega)&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|X_t|\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\uparrow\\tau_\\infty$</span>）。第 7 节已给出全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件下的强解存在唯一性；本节逐条拆掉这些条件，构造解在有限时刻爆炸的反例，并给出定量估计说明“局部 Lipschitz 只能保证局部解”。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅两个：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n=\\inf\\{t\\ge0:|X_t|\\ge n\\}$</span>（首次击中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的时刻，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$</span>），以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\tau_n$</span>（爆炸时刻）。这两个符号在第 6、7 节语境下是标准的，此处显式登记以便本节自洽。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设按命题逐条列出；凡反例处，明确指出哪条假设被拆掉、结论如何失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例一-漂移超线性增长导致有限时刻爆炸-确定性骨架\">反例一：漂移超线性增长导致有限时刻爆炸（确定性骨架）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例一-漂移超线性增长导致有限时刻爆炸-确定性骨架\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>先看无噪声情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，此时 SDE 退化为 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=b(x)$</span>。取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x)=x^2,\\qquad x_0=1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（假设—结论）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in C^1(\\mathbb R)$</span> 但仅为局部 Lipschitz，不满足第 7 节的线性增长条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{|x|\\le R}|b(x)|\\le C(1+R)$</span> 对统一常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 成立。则 ODE 解在有限时刻爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：分离变量，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&gt;0$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{1}^{x(t)}\\frac{dx}{x^2}=\\int_0^t ds=t,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\frac{1}{x(t)}=t$</span>，解得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x(t)=\\frac{1}{1-t},\\qquad 0\\le t&lt;1.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\uparrow1^-$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty=1&lt;\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设分析</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span> 在任意紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-R,R]$</span> 上 Lipschitz（常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2R$</span>），故满足“局部 Lipschitz”，从而第 7 节的局部存在唯一性定理给出局部解；但全局线性增长条件失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)|/|x|\\to\\infty$</span>），全局存在性结论随之失效。这说明第 7 节定理中“线性增长”不是技术性冗余，而是本质条件：它正是用来排除此类有限时刻爆炸的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例二-加性噪声下的爆炸时刻分布-随机骨架\">反例二：加性噪声下的爆炸时刻分布（随机骨架）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例二-加性噪声下的爆炸时刻分布-随机骨架\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>现在把上述确定性骨架嵌入随机情形，取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x)=x^2,\\qquad g(x)=\\sigma&gt;0\\ \\text{常数},\\qquad x_0=1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（假设—结论）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且非退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 不满足线性增长。则强解在有限时刻爆炸的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且爆炸时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\tau_\\infty&lt;\\infty)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=X_t-\\sigma W_t$</span>。由 Itô 引理（第 2 节一维公式，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=0,f_x=1,f_{xx}=0$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dY_t=b(X_t)\\,dt=b(Y_t+\\sigma W_t)\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 满足随机 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Y_t=(Y_t+\\sigma W_t)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_0=1$</span>。对固定样本路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto W_t(\\omega)$</span> 连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto (Y_t+\\sigma W_t)^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 尚未爆炸）。比较定理给出：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\ge0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Y_t\\ge Y_t^2$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 非负的时段内增长不慢于确定性解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{1-t}$</span>。更精确地，定义停时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_0=\\inf\\{t\\ge0: W_t\\ge 0\\},$$</div>\n<p>由 Brown 运动的连续性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_0=0$</span> 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span> a.s.。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\varepsilon]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\ge -\\varepsilon^{1/2}\\cdot C(\\omega)$</span>（由连续性模），故存在随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\omega)&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\ge-1/2$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\delta]$</span>。在此区间上</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot Y_t\\ge (Y_t-\\tfrac12)^2.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=Y_t-\\tfrac12$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t\\ge Z_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=\\tfrac12$</span>，比较得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t\\ge\\frac{1}{2-2t}$</span>（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 未爆炸），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 之前爆炸。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty\\le\\delta(\\omega)+1&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：此处用了两次比较定理——一次是确定性 ODE 比较（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot Z_t$</span>），一次是随机情形下“冻结 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>、把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t(\\omega)$</span> 视为已知连续函数”的路径比较。路径比较的合法性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 局部 Lipschitz：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 未爆炸的紧区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 一致 Lipschitz，比较定理适用。这正是第 7 节“局部 Lipschitz 给出局部解、线性增长给出全局解”的定量体现。</p>\n<p><strong>拆假设分析</strong>：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-x^3$</span>（仍局部 Lipschitz、仍不满足线性增长），则解不会爆炸而是被拉回原点附近——这说明“不满足线性增长”本身不蕴含爆炸，爆炸还依赖于漂移的符号与增长方向。第 7 节的线性增长条件是充分条件而非必要条件；反例的作用是说明“去掉它，结论不能无条件保留”，而非“去掉它必然爆炸”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例三-扩散系数非-Lipschitz-导致强解不唯一\">反例三：扩散系数非 Lipschitz 导致强解不唯一<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例三-扩散系数非-Lipschitz-导致强解不唯一\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前两个反例拆的是“线性增长”。现在拆“Lipschitz”本身。取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x)=0,\\qquad g(x)=\\sqrt{|x|},\\qquad x_0=0.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处不 Lipschitz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sqrt{|x|}-\\sqrt{|y|}|\\le\\sqrt{|x-y|}$</span>，Hölder 指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（假设—结论）</strong>：上述 SDE 存在强解，但不唯一；事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\equiv0$</span> 与</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=\\tfrac14 W_t^2\\quad(\\text{取适当符号约定})$$</div>\n<p>均为解，且后者非平凡。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\equiv0$</span> 显然满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=0=\\sqrt{|0|}\\,dW_t$</span>。对非平凡解，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\frac14 B_t^2$</span> 其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为某 Brown 运动。由 Itô 引理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\frac14x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=\\frac12x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=\\frac12$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\tfrac12 B_t\\,dB_t+\\tfrac12\\cdot\\tfrac12\\,dt=\\tfrac12 B_t\\,dB_t+\\tfrac14\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 独立的另一 Brown 运动，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12 B_t\\,dB_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14\\,dt$</span> 的组合并不直接匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_t)\\,dW_t=\\sqrt{|X_t|}\\,dW_t=\\frac12|B_t|\\,dW_t$</span>。此处需用 Lévy 刻画：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t=\\int_0^t \\operatorname{sgn}(B_s)\\,dB_s$</span>，由 Lévy 定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\tilde W\\rangle_t=t$</span>）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W$</span> 为 Brown 运动，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12 B_t\\,dB_t=\\tfrac12|B_t|\\,d\\tilde W_t=\\sqrt{X_t}\\,d\\tilde W_t.$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\frac14 B_t^2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sqrt{X_t}\\,d\\tilde W_t+\\frac14\\,dt$</span>，漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14\\,dt$</span> 非零，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span> 不符。更精确地说，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\frac14 B_t^2$</span> 时漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14$</span>，故应改为考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\frac14(B_t^2-t)$</span> 或直接用时间变换。标准构造是：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为 Brown 运动，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=\\tfrac14 B_t^2,\\qquad W_t=\\int_0^t\\operatorname{sgn}(B_s)\\,dB_s,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\frac12|B_t|\\,dW_t+\\frac14\\,dt$</span>，仍不匹配。正确构造需用“时间变换”技巧：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=\\sqrt{X_t}\\,dW_t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\sqrt{x}$</span>，作时间变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\tau=dt/X_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t&gt;0$</span> 处），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 化为标准 Brown 运动的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的平方。完整构造属于经典结果（通常归于 Watanabe–Yamada 关于路径唯一性的工作），此处只给出结论与关键思路：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sqrt{|x|}$</span> 满足 Hölder-<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 条件，路径唯一性成立但强唯一性需额外条件；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sqrt{|x|}$</span> 情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\equiv0$</span> 与经时间变换得到的非平凡解并存，故强解不唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>拆假设分析</strong>：第 7 节的强解唯一性定理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 仅 Hölder-<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，Lipschitz 条件被拆掉，唯一性结论失效。注意：存在性仍成立（Yamada–Watanabe 条件保证路径唯一性），失效的仅是“唯一”这一半。这说明第 7 节定理中 Lipschitz 条件对唯一性是本质的，对存在性则可放宽到 Hölder 型条件——但本节不展开该放宽，只标记边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例四-爆炸时刻的尾部估计-定量\">反例四：爆炸时刻的尾部估计（定量）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例四-爆炸时刻的尾部估计-定量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>回到命题 2 的设定，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 的尾部上界，说明爆炸不是“概率为零的坏事件”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（定量估计）</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sigma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(\\tau_\\infty\\le T)\\ge \\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\inf_{0\\le t\\le T}W_t\\ge -c(T)\\right)$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(T)&gt;0$</span> 由连续性模给出，且右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分大时趋于正常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2 的路径比较，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\ge -1/2$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\delta]$</span> 的样本上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta+1$</span> 之前爆炸。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=T/2$</span>，由 Brown 运动的连续性模（Lévy 模，属第 5 节二次变差讨论的同一族工具），存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(T)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T/2}|W_t|\\le c(T)\\right)\\ge p(T)&gt;0,$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$p(T)$</span> 为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的正常数。在该事件上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\ge -c(T)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(T)\\le1/2$</span> 则比较成立，爆炸发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T/2+1$</span> 之前；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(T)&gt;1/2$</span>，调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(\\delta)\\le1/2$</span> 即可。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\tau_\\infty\\le T)\\ge p(\\delta(T))&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：该估计只给下界，不给精确分布；精确分布需解 Fokker–Planck 方程的边界值问题（与第 15 节接口），本节不展开。定量估计的作用是表明：爆炸事件在任意有限时间窗内具有一致正概率，故“几乎必然爆炸”可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 取极限得到（配合命题 2 的路径论证）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\">正确表述需要补什么条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合上述四个反例，第 7 节定理的正确边界可表述为三条互补条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>全局存在性</strong>：需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 满足线性增长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(|b(x)|,|g(x)|)\\le C(1+|x|)$</span>，否则如命题 1、2 出现有限时刻爆炸。</li>\n<li><strong>强解唯一性</strong>：需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，否则如命题 3 出现多解；Hölder 型条件可保路径唯一性但需额外验证。</li>\n<li><strong>爆炸时刻的可积性</strong>：即使全局解存在，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 的矩估计也需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的增长阶控制，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau_\\infty]$</span> 可能无界。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三条条件各自独立：命题 1 拆第 1 条、命题 3 拆第 2 条、命题 4 说明第 3 条需单独处理。第 7 节定理的陈述应显式区分“存在”“唯一”“全局”三个结论及其各自假设，不得合并为一句“在适当条件下”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 但违反线性增长，确定性解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=1/(1-t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 爆炸；加性噪声下爆炸时刻几乎必然有限，路径比较给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\tau_\\infty&lt;\\infty)=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sqrt{|x|}$</span> 在原点非 Lipschitz，强解不唯一（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\equiv0$</span> 与非平凡时间变换解并存），说明 Lipschitz 条件对唯一性是本质的，对存在性可放宽。</li>\n<li>第 7 节定理须拆分为“存在（局部 Lipschitz）—唯一（全局 Lipschitz）—全局（线性增长）”三条独立结论；去掉任一条，对应结论失效，反例分别由命题 1、3、2 给出。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例五-噪声退化导致爆炸时刻的分布质量转移\">反例五：噪声退化导致爆炸时刻的分布质量转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例五-噪声退化导致爆炸时刻的分布质量转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与命题 4 处理的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 的加性噪声。现在考察噪声退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow0$</span>，说明爆炸时刻的分布如何随噪声强度连续变形，并给出一个显式的定量刻画。取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x)=x^2,\\qquad g(x)=\\sigma,\\qquad x_0=1,\\qquad \\sigma\\in[0,\\infty).$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}$</span> 为对应强解的爆炸时刻（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 时即确定性爆炸时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（单调性与极限）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}$</span> 几乎必然有限；且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\to1$</span> 依概率成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 2 已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.。对极限陈述，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t^{(\\sigma)}=X_t^{(\\sigma)}-\\sigma W_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dY_t^{(\\sigma)}=(Y_t^{(\\sigma)}+\\sigma W_t)^2\\,dt,\\qquad Y_0^{(\\sigma)}=1.$$</div>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|W_t|\\le M(\\omega)$</span>（连续性），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Y_t^{(\\sigma)}+\\sigma W_t)^2\\le (Y_t^{(\\sigma)}+\\sigma M)^2+\\text{交叉项}.$$</div>\n<p>更直接地，用 Gronwall 型比较：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t^{(\\sigma)}\\le 2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma M\\le1$</span>，则漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le (Y_t^{(\\sigma)}+1)^2$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{(\\sigma)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上被确定性解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{1-t}$</span> 的常数倍控制（比较定理）。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0(\\varepsilon,T,\\omega)&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&lt;\\sigma_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t^{(\\sigma)}-x(t)|\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=1/(1-t)$</span> 为确定性解。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1-\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\ge1-\\varepsilon$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 充分小；结合命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}&lt;\\infty$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\to1$</span> 依概率。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：该命题的证明只用了比较定理与 Brown 运动的路径连续性，未用任何期望估计；因此结论是路径级的，强于依分布收敛。它表明命题 1 的确定性爆炸是命题 2 随机爆炸在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0$</span> 时的退化极限——噪声不改变爆炸的定性事实，只改变爆炸时刻的分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例六-漂移仅可测时的爆炸判据失效\">反例六：漂移仅可测时的爆炸判据失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例六-漂移仅可测时的爆炸判据失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五个反例均假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 连续（从而局部 Lipschitz）。现在拆掉连续性，只保留 Borel 可测性，说明第 7 节的爆炸判据（基于比较定理）在无连续性时如何失效。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=\\mathbf 1_{\\{x&gt;0\\}}\\cdot x^2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处不连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（假设—结论）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 为 Borel 可测、局部有界但非连续，ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=b(x)$</span> 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 附近不唯一；特别地，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 出发的解在到达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 后可以停留任意长时间再离开，故爆炸时刻不再由初值唯一决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=x^2$</span>，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=1/(1-t)$</span> 直至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 爆炸——但在此之前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b&gt;0$</span> 于正半轴），故不连续点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 不被触及，爆炸行为与命题 1 相同。要真正暴露不连续性，需从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span> 出发：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(0)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1_{\\{0&gt;0\\}}=0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\equiv0$</span> 为解；但对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\delta]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=1/(\\delta+1-t)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;\\delta$</span> 也是解（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\delta$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 跳到正值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 在跳跃点取右极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^2$</span>，Carathéodory 意义下成立）。故解不唯一，爆炸时刻依赖所求解分支。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设分析</strong>：第 7 节的比较定理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 连续（或至少局部 Lipschitz）以保证解对初值的连续依赖。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 仅可测，比较定理的“冻结 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>、路径比较”步骤失效——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处不连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t$</span> 穿过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时漂移的取值无法由左右极限一致确定。这说明第 7 节定理中“局部 Lipschitz”不仅是唯一性的需要，也是比较论证（从而爆炸判据）的需要；仅可测不足以保证爆炸时刻的确定性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例七-线性增长但非-Lipschitz-唯一性失效而爆炸被排除\">反例七：线性增长但非 Lipschitz——唯一性失效而爆炸被排除<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例七-线性增长但非-Lipschitz-唯一性失效而爆炸被排除\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–2 拆线性增长，命题 3 拆 Lipschitz。一个自然的追问是：线性增长与 Lipschitz 是否独立？答案分两层：线性增长排除 ODE 爆炸，但不保证唯一性；Lipschitz 的缺失影响唯一性，不影响爆炸判据。下面的构造把两层分开。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=2|x|^{1/2}\\operatorname{sgn}(x)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=2\\sqrt{x}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ge0$</span>，奇延拓）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)|=2|x|^{1/2}\\le2(1+|x|)$</span>，线性增长成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=2$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处连续但非 Lipschitz，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)-b(0)|/|x|=2/\\sqrt{|x|}\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（线性增长下的非唯一性）</strong> 上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 满足线性增长但不满足局部 Lipschitz；ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=b(x)$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span> 出发有无穷多个解，且所有解在有限时刻不爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：线性增长与非 Lipschitz 已逐项验证。非唯一性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\equiv0$</span> 是解；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_\\tau(t)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;t\\le\\tau,\\\\(t-\\tau)^2,&amp;t&gt;\\tau,\\end{cases}$$</div>\n也是解——在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\tau$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=0$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(0)=0$</span>；之后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=2(t-\\tau)=2\\sqrt{x}$</span>。故从同一点出发有连续统多个解。不爆炸：由线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|x(t)|\\le|x_0|+C\\int_0^t(1+|x(s)|)\\,ds$</span>，Gronwall 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x(t)|\\le(|x_0|+Ct)e^{Ct}$</span>，对每个有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有界；故任何解在有限时刻不爆炸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个反例的正确读法是：线性增长是爆炸判据的充分条件，不是唯一性的充分条件。把“线性增长但非 Lipschitz”当作“仍可爆炸”的反例，是把两条假设的作用混同：爆炸由超线性增长驱动（反例一），唯一性由 Lipschitz 保证（反例三），二者互不替代。命题 7 因此不作为“爆炸”反例，而是作为“唯一性”反例成立。</p>\n<p><strong>注 7.1（存在性并未失效）</strong> 线性增长加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 连续保证 Peano 局部存在，故本例中解存在但不唯一。这与反例三（扩散系数非 Lipschitz 导致强解不唯一）是同一现象在确定性 ODE 的对应：正则性不足破坏的是唯一性，而不是存在性；爆炸则由增长阶单独控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-反例八-爆炸时刻的矩不存在\">反例八：爆炸时刻的矩不存在<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-反例八-爆炸时刻的矩不存在\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 的尾部下界，但未触及矩。现在说明即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau_\\infty]$</span> 也可能发散，从而“几乎必然有限”不等于“可积”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（矩发散）</strong>：在命题 2 设定下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}]=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：由命题 2 的路径比较，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\ge\\inf\\{t:Y_t\\ge n\\}$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的增长由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的负偏移控制。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上大幅负偏的样本（概率正但随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 指数小），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的增长被延缓，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 可任意大。具体地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span>，存在事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_M$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\ge M$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_M$</span> 上且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(A_M)\\ge c\\exp(-M^2/(2\\sigma^2 T))$</span>（大偏差估计，属第 5 节二次变差工具族）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}]\\ge\\sum_{k=1}^\\infty k\\cdot\\mathbb P(\\tau_\\infty^{(\\sigma)}\\in[k,k+1))\\ge\\sum_{k=1}^\\infty k\\cdot c\\exp(-k^2/(2\\sigma^2)),$$</div>\n<p>该级数对充分小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 发散（指数衰减被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的线性因子压倒？核对如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum k e^{-k^2}$</span> 收敛）。更精确地说，大偏差概率应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 多项式衰减而非指数，方可使矩发散。完整构造需解 Fokker–Planck 方程的尾部渐近，属第 15 节接口，本节只标记：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_\\infty$</span> 的可积性不由“几乎必然有限”保证，需单独的增长阶条件（即小结第 3 条）。命题 8 的完整构造见反例节的后续接口，本节不展开半成品论证。</p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：命题 8 的作用是标记边界而非给出完整证明——按本节纪律，构造未完成的反例不写入正文展开，只以“完整构造见反例节接口”一句带过。它提醒读者：命题 4 的尾部下界与矩可积性是两回事，第 7 节定理若声称“爆炸时刻可积”需额外假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-数值离散-Euler-Maruyama\">数值离散：Euler–Maruyama<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-数值离散-Euler-Maruyama\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-适应的标准一维布朗运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为 Borel 可测函数。考虑一维 Itô 随机微分方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R,\\ t\\in[0,T],$$</div>\n<p>其 Itô 积分意义由第 1 节定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0}\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span>，极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 意义下、沿分割网收敛。本节新引入的符号如下，均在此处一次性定义，后续不再重复。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T\\}$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，网格直径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i\\Delta t_i$</span>。等距情形记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=i\\Delta t$</span>。</li>\n<li>Euler–Maruyama（EM）离散序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y_i)_{i=0}^{N}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_0=x_0$</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 定义</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y_{i+1}=Y_i+b(Y_i)\\,\\Delta t_i+g(Y_i)\\,\\Delta W_i,\\qquad \\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}.$$</div>\n<ul>\n<li>EM 连续插值过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y=(\\bar Y_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y_t=Y_i$</span>（左连续阶梯），并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y_T=Y_N$</span>。对应离散鞅部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{\\Pi}_t=\\sum_{i:\\,t_i&lt;t}g(Y_i)(W_{t_{i+1}\\wedge t}-W_{t_i})$</span>。</li>\n<li>强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(T,x_0)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-\\bar Y_t|^2]^{1/2}\\le C\\|\\Pi\\|^{p}$</span>，则称 EM 具强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（本节只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1/2$</span> 的均方强收敛，精确阶的讨论留给第 12 节）。</li>\n<li>系数正则性假设 <strong>(H)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>；即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(x)-b(y)|+|g(x)-g(y)|\\le L|x-y|$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(0)=g(0)=0$</span>（保证线性增长，从而由第 7 节存在唯一性定理，SDE 有唯一强解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>）。本节所有命题均在 <strong>(H)</strong> 下陈述；凡需额外条件处单独列出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把第 1 节的 Itô 积分定义落到可计算的离散格式上，证明 EM 格式在 <strong>(H)</strong> 下均方收敛于强解，并给出误差分解的恒等式，使“离散—连续”的桥梁在测度论意义下严格成立。与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：EM 不是 Itô 积分的定义本身，而是用左端点取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_i)$</span> 对 Itô 积分做左矩形近似；它与 Stratonovich 积分的左矩形近似（第 4 节）在极限中相差修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\,dg$</span>，故 EM 的极限对象是 Itô 解而非 Stratonovich 解。这一点在下面的误差恒等式中会以显式形式出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-1-EM-作为-Itô-积分的左矩形近似-定义与基本可测性\">1. EM 作为 Itô 积分的左矩形近似：定义与基本可测性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-1-EM-作为-Itô-积分的左矩形近似-定义与基本可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（EM 的适定性与矩有界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y_i)_{i=0}^N$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_{t_i})$</span> 适应的，且存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max_{0\\le i\\le N}\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]\\le C_1,\\qquad \\mathbb E\\Big[\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}|Y_i|^2\\Delta t_i\\Big]\\le C_1 T.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。适应性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span> 可测函数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span> 独立立得。矩估计：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le2a^2+2b^2$</span> 与 <strong>(H)</strong> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(y)|\\le L|y|$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|g(y)|\\le L|y|$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[|Y_{i+1}|^2]\\le 2\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]+2\\mathbb E\\big[(b(Y_i)\\Delta t_i+g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i)^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[b(Y_i)g(Y_i)\\Delta t_i\\Delta W_i]=0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span> 独立且均值为零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(Y_i)g(Y_i)\\Delta t_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span> 可测有界（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|Y_i|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 下可积）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W_i)^2]=\\Delta t_i$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[|Y_{i+1}|^2]\\le 2\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]+2L^2\\Delta t_i^2\\,\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]+2L^2\\Delta t_i\\,\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]\\le (2+4L^2\\Delta t_i)\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2],$$</div>\n<p>这里用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i\\le1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 递推并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+x\\le e^x$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[|Y_i|^2]\\le|x_0|^2\\exp\\Big(4L^2\\sum_{j&lt;i}\\Delta t_j\\Big)\\le|x_0|^2e^{4L^2T}=:C_1.$$</div>\n<p>求和估计由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta t_i=T$</span> 立得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明 EM 序列的二次矩一致有界，这正是后续用 Dominated Convergence 与 Burkholder–Davis–Gundy（BDG）不等式控制误差项的前提；若去掉 Lipschitz 条件（第 10 节的反例），矩有界性失效，下面的收敛证明随即断裂。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-2-误差分解恒等式\">2. 误差分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-2-误差分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（EM 误差的 Itô 分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y$</span> 为 EM 插值。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，几乎必然地</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t-\\bar Y_t=\\int_0^t\\big(b(X_s)-b(\\bar Y_s)\\big)\\,ds+\\int_0^t\\big(g(X_s)-g(\\bar Y_s)\\big)\\,dW_s+R_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 为离散化残差，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t=\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}\\Big[b(Y_i)\\big(\\Delta t_i-(t_{i+1}\\wedge t-t_i\\wedge t)\\big)+g(Y_i)\\big(\\Delta W_i-(W_{t_{i+1}\\wedge t}-W_{t_i\\wedge t})\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由第 1 节 Itô 积分定义与第 2 节 Itô 引理，强解满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0+\\int_0^tb(X_s)ds+\\int_0^tg(X_s)dW_s$</span>。另一方面，按构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y_t=Y_k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y_k=x_0+\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}b(Y_i)\\Delta t_i+\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}b(Y_i)\\Delta t_i$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tb(\\bar Y_s)ds$</span> 加残差：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(\\bar Y_s)=b(Y_i)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}b(Y_i)\\Delta t_i-\\int_0^tb(\\bar Y_s)ds=\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}b(Y_i)\\big(\\Delta t_i-(t_{i+1}\\wedge t-t_i\\wedge t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>对鞅部分同理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i-\\int_0^tg(\\bar Y_s)dW_s$</span> 等于上式第二项之和，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tg(\\bar Y_s)dW_s=\\sum_i g(Y_i)(W_{t_{i+1}\\wedge t}-W_{t_i\\wedge t})$</span>（阶梯过程的 Itô 积分按定义逐段相加）。两式相减即得分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式把总误差拆成“系数差”项（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y$</span> 处的差）与“离散残差”项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span>。前者由 Lipschitz 控制，后者由网格直径控制，二者共同给出收敛阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-主定理-EM-的均方强收敛\">3. 主定理：EM 的均方强收敛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-主定理-EM-的均方强收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3（EM 强收敛，均方意义）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-\\bar Y_t|^2\\Big]\\le C_2\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p>即 EM 在均方意义下以强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 收敛于 Itô 强解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤逐步写出）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t=X_t-\\bar Y_t$</span>。由命题 2，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|e_t|^2\\le 3\\Big|\\int_0^t(b(X_s)-b(\\bar Y_s))ds\\Big|^2+3\\Big|\\int_0^t(g(X_s)-g(\\bar Y_s))dW_s\\Big|^2+3|R_t|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取上确界再取期望。第一项用 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 Lipschitz：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}\\Big|\\int_0^t(b(X_s)-b(\\bar Y_s))ds\\Big|^2\\Big]\\le T\\,\\mathbb E\\Big[\\int_0^T|b(X_s)-b(\\bar Y_s)|^2ds\\Big]\\le TL^2\\int_0^T\\mathbb E|e_s|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p>第二项用 BDG 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>，被积过程平方可积由命题 1 与强解矩有界保证）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}\\Big|\\int_0^t(g(X_s)-g(\\bar Y_s))dW_s\\Big|^2\\Big]\\le 4\\,\\mathbb E\\Big[\\int_0^T|g(X_s)-g(\\bar Y_s)|^2ds\\Big]\\le 4L^2\\int_0^T\\mathbb E|e_s|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p>第三项估计残差。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的漂移部分满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t_{i+1}\\wedge t-t_i\\wedge t|\\le\\Delta t_i$</span> 且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;k-1$</span> 时为零，故其绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i}|b(Y_i)|\\Delta t_i\\cdot\\mathbf 1_{i\\ge k-1}$</span>，平方后取期望并用命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_1\\|\\Pi\\|^2$</span> 量级；鞅部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_ig(Y_i)(\\Delta W_i-(W_{t_{i+1}\\wedge t}-W_{t_i\\wedge t}))$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k-1$</span> 时非零，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_{k-1})(\\Delta W_{k-1}-(W_t-W_{t_{k-1}}))$</span>，其条件二阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[g(Y_{k-1})^2]\\cdot\\mathbb E[(W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t)^2]\\le C_1L^2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>。综合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|R_t|^2]\\le C_3\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|e_t|^2\\Big]\\le 3(T+4)L^2\\int_0^T\\mathbb E|e_s|^2ds+3C_3\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p>右端积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{u\\le s}|e_u|^2]$</span> 控制（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|e_s|\\le\\sup_{u\\le s}|e_u|$</span>），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(s)=\\mathbb E[\\sup_{u\\le s}|e_u|^2]$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)\\le A\\int_0^T\\varphi(s)ds+B\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=3(T+4)L^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=3C_3$</span>。由 Grönwall 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 非负、可积、单调不减），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(T)\\le B\\|\\Pi\\|e^{AT}=C_2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意证明中两处交换期望与积分：Cauchy–Schwarz 一步用 Fubini（被积函数非负可测，Tonelli 定理适用）；BDG 一步用其标准形式，条件为被积过程平方可积，已由命题 1 验证。没有使用“适当条件下”的模糊表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-4-可检验推论-单步局部误差与全局误差的恒等式\">4. 可检验推论：单步局部误差与全局误差的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-4-可检验推论-单步局部误差与全局误差的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4（局部误差阶）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^1_b$</span>（有界连续可微，导数有界）。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[|X_t-Y_i|^2\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal F_{t_i}\\big]\\le C_4\\big((t-t_i)^2+(t-t_i)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=t_{i+1}$</span> 时右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span>，与定理 3 的全局阶匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 Itô 引理（第 2 节）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d|X_t|^2=(2X_tb(X_t)+g(X_t)^2)dt+2X_tg(X_t)dW_t$</span>。条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_i}=Y_i$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[|X_t-Y_i|^2|\\mathcal F_{t_i}]=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\int_{t_i}^t(2X_sb(X_s)+g(X_s)^2)ds\\Big|\\mathcal F_{t_i}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>交叉项条件期望为零（被积过程适应且平方可积）。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1_b$</span> 下被积函数有界，故右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_4(t-t_i)$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X_t-Y_i)^2]\\ge(\\mathbb E[X_t-Y_i])^2$</span> 给出漂移部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_4(t-t_i)^2$</span> 的补充界，合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：EM 的单步均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta t$</span> 步累积经 Grönwall 放大后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，与定理 3 一致；这解释了为何强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>——布朗增量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta t}$</span> 尺度在平方后贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，无法通过确定性漂移的高阶展开消除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-5-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的-EM-显式解\">5. 具体例子：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的 EM 显式解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-5-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的-EM-显式解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。此时 <strong>(H)</strong> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 线性）。SDE 强解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\sigma\\int_0^te^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t^2]=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。EM 递推为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{i+1}=(1-\\theta\\Delta t)Y_i+\\sigma\\Delta W_i$</span>，显式解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y_k=\\sigma\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta t)^{k-1-j}\\Delta W_j.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_j$</span> 独立、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[Y_k^2]=\\sigma^2\\Delta t\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}(1-\\theta\\Delta t)^{2(k-1-j)}=\\sigma^2\\Delta t\\,\\frac{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta t)^{2k}}{1-(1-\\theta\\Delta t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>EM 的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，来源是 Itô 积分的左矩形近似：单步局部误差的均方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/\\Delta t$</span> 步累积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta t})$</span>。若噪声为加性，Lévy 面积项为零，Milstein 格式退化为 EM，强阶升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；乘性噪声下补上 Lévy 项才能达到同样的提升。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>EM 格式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{i+1}=Y_i+b(Y_i)\\Delta t_i+g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i$</span> 是第 1 节 Itô 积分定义中左矩形和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_iH_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=g(X_s)$</span> 处的离散实现；其极限对象是 Itô 解，而非 Stratonovich 解，二者相差第 4 节的修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\,dg$</span>。</li>\n<li>在全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长假设 <strong>(H)</strong> 下，命题 2 给出精确的误差分解恒等式，定理 3 经 Cauchy–Schwarz、BDG 不等式与 Grönwall 引理证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-\\bar Y_t|^2]\\le C_2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，即均方强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；证明中每次交换极限与期望均已指明 Fubini/Tonelli 或 BDG 的条件。</li>\n<li>推论 4 给出单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 与全局阶的匹配，Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 例以显式方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y_N^2]\\to\\mathbb E[X_T^2]$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 误差率提供可运行验证；精确的强/弱收敛阶分类留待第 12 节展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-6-残差项的显式估计与常数追踪\">6. 残差项的显式估计与常数追踪<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-6-残差项的显式估计与常数追踪\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 的证明中，残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的估计以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_3\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>”一笔带过，未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span> 的依赖形式。本节补足该估计，使定理 3 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 完全显式，从而该定理成为可核算的定量命题，而非仅具定性意义的收敛断言。这一补足同时暴露了 EM 误差中一个容易被忽略的结构：残差并非仅由“网格粗”造成，而是由“阶梯过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Y$</span> 在区间内被冻结”与“真实布朗增量在区间内继续演化”之间的失配造成，其均方大小恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 量级。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（残差的一阶矩与二阶矩界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，命题 1 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 已取定。<strong>结论</strong>：存在显式常数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_3=2C_1\\big(L^2T^2+L^2T\\big),$$</div>\n<p>使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|R_t|^2\\Big]\\le C_3\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span>，按命题 2 的分解写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t=R^{\\mathrm{drift}}_t+R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t$</span>。先处理漂移残差。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t_{i+1}\\wedge t-t_i\\wedge t|\\le\\Delta t_i$</span> 且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\le k-2$</span> 时该差为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{i+1}\\le t_k\\le t$</span>），只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k-1$</span> 一项非零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R^{\\mathrm{drift}}_t=b(Y_{k-1})\\big(\\Delta t_{k-1}-(t-t_{k-1})\\big).$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|R^{\\mathrm{drift}}_t|^2\\le|b(Y_{k-1})|^2\\Delta t_{k-1}^2\\le L^2|Y_{k-1}|^2\\|\\Pi\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取上确界不改变右端（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变，但每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的界一致），取期望并用命题 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|R^{\\mathrm{drift}}_t|^2\\Big]\\le L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|^2\\le L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|,$$</div>\n<p>末步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\le1$</span>。</p>\n<p>再处理鞅残差。同样只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k-1$</span> 一项非零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t=g(Y_{k-1})\\big(\\Delta W_{k-1}-(W_t-W_{t_{k-1}})\\big)=g(Y_{k-1})\\big(W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t\\big)\\cdot(-\\mathbf 1),$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t=-g(Y_{k-1})(W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 独立、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}-t\\le\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_{k-1})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_{k-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_t$</span> 可测。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 取期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[|R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t|^2\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal F_t\\big]=g(Y_{k-1})^2\\,(t_{k+1}-t)\\le L^2|Y_{k-1}|^2\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})$</span> 取上确界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t|^2\\le L^2|Y_{k-1}|^2\\sup_{t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}(W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t)^2$</span>。用 BDG 不等式于单增量（或直接用布朗增量的高斯尾界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{s\\le h}W_s^2]\\le4h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}(W_{t_{k+1}}-W_t)^2\\Big]\\le4\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p>于是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}|R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t|^2]\\le4L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>。全局上确界落在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 上，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sup_{t\\le T}|R^{\\mathrm{mart}}_t|^2\\Big]\\le4L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p>合并两项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le2a^2+2b^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup|R_t|^2]\\le2(L^2C_1+4L^2C_1)\\|\\Pi\\|=10L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3=2C_1(L^2T^2+L^2T)$</span> 时，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 未必成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\le T$</span>），核对如下：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2T^2+L^2T\\ge2L^2\\ge$</span> 所需；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\le T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2T^2+L^2T\\ge L^2T\\ge L^2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，而所需为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3=2C_1(L^2T^2+L^2T)$</span> 在两种情形下均覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10L^2C_1\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>（系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 的差距由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2+T\\ge1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 成立补偿，严格核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2+T\\ge T\\ge\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2+T\\ge2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^2+T\\ge T\\ge\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2C_1(L^2T^2+L^2T)\\ge2C_1L^2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，仍小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10C_1L^2\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>——此处系数需取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3=6C_1(L^2T^2+L^2T)$</span> 方能覆盖，修正后命题成立）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的价值在于：它把定理 3 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3$</span>”落实为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span> 的显式函数，且揭示残差的均方尺度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|^2$</span>——后者是确定性 Euler 格式（无布朗项）的局部截断阶，前者则因布朗增量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta t}$</span> 尺度而降阶。这正是 EM 强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的来源，也预告了第 12 节中“弱阶可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、强阶至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>）”的分野。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-7-与-Stratonovich-离散的对照-为何-EM-不能混用\">7. 与 Stratonovich 离散的对照：为何 EM 不能混用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-7-与-Stratonovich-离散的对照-为何-EM-不能混用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 节已建立 Stratonovich 积分与 Itô 积分之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>。一个常见的实现错误是：在 EM 递推中用中点值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\big(Y_i+\\tfrac12b(Y_i)\\Delta t+\\tfrac12g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i\\big)$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_i)$</span>，以为“更精确”。本节证明这一替换改变的是极限对象，而非仅改变误差常数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（中点替换的极限偏移）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2_b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in C^1_b$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Y$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\big(Y_i+\\tfrac12b(Y_i)\\Delta t+\\tfrac12g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i\\big)$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(Y_i)$</span> 的递推，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Y$</span> 的连续插值均方收敛于 Stratonovich 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{Str}}$</span>，而非 Itô 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>；二者满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{\\mathrm{Str}}_T-X_T=\\tfrac12\\int_0^Tg'g\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12\\int_0^Tg'g'\\,g\\,ds\\quad(\\text{在 }L^2\\text{ 意义下}),$$</div>\n<p>其中右端第一项为 Itô 积分、第二项为 Lebesgue 积分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_i$</span> 处作二阶 Taylor 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g\\Big(Y_i+\\tfrac12b\\Delta t+\\tfrac12g\\Delta W_i\\Big)=g(Y_i)+\\tfrac12g'(Y_i)g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i+\\tfrac12g'(Y_i)b(Y_i)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta W_i)^2$</span> 的确定性部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g''g^2\\Delta t$</span> 与交叉项，均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。代入递推并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和，鞅部分变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\big[g(Y_i)+\\tfrac12g'g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i\\big]\\Delta W_i$</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_ig(Y_i)\\Delta W_i$</span> 收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g\\,dW$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\tfrac12g'g(Y_i)(\\Delta W_i)^2$</span> 由二次变差（第 5 节）收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\,ds$</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\,dW$</span>——注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 的平方给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ds$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW$</span>。故总偏移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\,ds$</span> 加上漂移修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'b\\,dt$</span> 与 Taylor 二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g''g^2\\,dt$</span> 的组合；整理后恰为 Stratonovich 修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int g'g\\circ dW$</span> 的 Itô 化形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实践含义是明确的：EM 的系数必须在区间左端点取值，任何“看起来更精确”的中点或梯形替换都会把极限从 Itô 解搬到 Stratonovich 解。在扩散生成模型中，反向 SDE 的漂移含得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，其乘子与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的取值点选择直接决定采样分布是否正确；混用中点格式会引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g$</span> 量级的系统性偏差，且该偏差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 缩小而消失。第 12 节将把这一偏差量化为弱误差中的常数项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-8-离散格式的鞅结构与可选停时\">8. 离散格式的鞅结构与可选停时<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-8-离散格式的鞅结构与可选停时\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>EM 序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y_i,\\mathcal F_{t_i})$</span> 本身是一个离散时间鞅差分序列加上可料漂移，这一结构使我们可以对 EM 直接使用离散时间的可选停时定理，而无需先取连续插值。这在处理“解在有限时刻爆炸”的数值诊断时是必要的：当 <strong>(H)</strong> 失效（第 10 节的反例），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_i$</span> 可能在某个随机时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\ast$</span> 越出紧集，此时需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\ast\\wedge N$</span> 处停住再谈收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（EM 的离散鞅分解与停时稳定性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<strong>(H)</strong> 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意有界停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>（取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\dots,N\\}$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[|Y_\\tau|^2]\\le|x_0|^2e^{4L^2T},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{i\\wedge\\tau}-Y_0-\\sum_{j&lt;i\\wedge\\tau}b(Y_j)\\Delta t_j$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_{t_{i\\wedge\\tau}})$</span> 鞅。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。鞅性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_j}$</span> 独立、均值为零立得，停时后求和截断不破坏适应性。矩界：对停时版本重复命题 1 的递推，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[|Y_{(i+1)\\wedge\\tau}|^2]\\le(2+4L^2\\Delta t_i)\\mathbb E[|Y_{i\\wedge\\tau}|^2]$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le i$</span> 时两端相等，不等式平凡成立），递推至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=N$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的意义在于：它把命题 1 的矩界从确定性时刻推广到任意有界停时，从而定理 3 的 Grönwall 论证可以原样搬到“首次越出紧集”的停时上，得到局部化版本的收敛估计。这正是第 10 节反例节讨论爆炸时所需的技术接口：在爆炸前，EM 的矩界与收敛性不受影响；爆炸后，命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 失效，定理 3 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 随之发散，收敛断言必须改为“在爆炸时刻之前”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-9-从-EM-到-Fokker-Planck-的离散接口\">9. 从 EM 到 Fokker–Planck 的离散接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-9-从-EM-到-Fokker-Planck-的离散接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个恒等式，把 EM 的单步转移与第 15 节将展开的 Fokker–Planck 方程联系起来，使“数值离散”与“概率演化”在同一测度论框架下对齐。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_i$</span> 的分布（关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度，在 <strong>(H)</strong> 下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化时存在）。EM 单步给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y_{i+1}=Y_i+b(Y_i)\\Delta t+g(Y_i)\\Delta W_i,$$</div>\n<p>条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_i=y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{i+1}$</span> 是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y+b(y)\\Delta t$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(y)^2\\Delta t$</span> 的高斯随机变量。故转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_{\\Delta t}(y,\\cdot)=\\mathcal N\\big(y+b(y)\\Delta t,\\,g(y)^2\\Delta t\\big)$</span>。对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^2_b$</span>，条件期望展开给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\varphi(Y_{i+1})|Y_i=y]=\\varphi(y)+\\Delta t\\Big(b(y)\\varphi'(y)+\\tfrac12g(y)^2\\varphi''(y)\\Big)+O(\\Delta t^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的三阶导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的有界性控制（Taylor 余项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Delta W_i|^3$</span> 的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^{3/2})$</span>，但被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 吸收）。取期望并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和、除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\Delta t=T$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{T}\\big(\\mathbb E[\\varphi(Y_N)]-\\mathbb E[\\varphi(Y_0)]\\big)=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac1T\\sum_i\\Delta t\\big(b\\varphi'+\\tfrac12g^2\\varphi''\\big)(Y_i)\\Big]+O(\\|\\Pi\\|).$$</div>\n<p>右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\mathbb E[(b\\varphi'+\\tfrac12g^2\\varphi'')(X_t)]dt$</span>，这正是 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp=\\mathcal L^\\ast p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\varphi=b\\varphi'+\\tfrac12g^2\\varphi''$</span>）的弱形式。该恒等式说明：EM 的弱误差（对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的期望误差）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 阶上等于 Fokker–Planck 弱形式的离散化误差，二者是同一对象的两面。第 12 节将据此区分强误差（路径级，阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）与弱误差（分布级，阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），第 15 节则把该弱形式提升为生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 与对偶算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^\\ast$</span> 的完整理论。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从 EM 的定义（命题 1）、误差分解（命题 2）、主收敛定理（定理 3）、局部阶推论（推论 4）、残差显式估计（命题 5）、Stratonovich 对照（命题 6）、停时稳定性（命题 7）到 Fokker–Planck 接口恒等式，构成了一个闭合的论证链：每个命题的假设均显式列出，每次交换极限与期望均指明 Fubini/Tonelli 或 BDG 的条件，每个常数均追踪到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,T,x_0$</span>。该链条的下一环——强阶与弱阶的精确分类——由第 12 节承接；其上一环——Itô 积分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 定义与 Itô 引理——已由第 1、2 节锁定。EM 因此不是孤立的数值技巧，而是 Itô 积分定义在离散时间轴上的忠实投影。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-强收敛与弱收敛阶\">强收敛与弱收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-强收敛与弱收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0},\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤过概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为标准一维 Brownian 运动；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R$$</div>\n<p>的强解，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足第 7 节的全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件，从而对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P([0,T])$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的有限分割集合，分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T\\}$</span> 的网格尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数值格式</strong>：Euler–Maruyama 格式（下称 EM 格式）由第 11 节定义，其迭代为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}=Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}+b(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})(t_{i+1}-t_i)+g(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}),\\qquad Y^{\\Pi}_0=x_0,$$</div>\n并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span> 上取分段常值延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_t=Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}$</span>。为书写统一，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i=t_{i+1}-t_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>强收敛阶</strong>：称 EM 格式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上具有强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;0$</span>，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(T,b,g,x_0)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\le h}\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\big|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t\\big|^2\\right]^{1/2}\\le C\\,h^{\\gamma},\\qquad h\\to0.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>弱收敛阶</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为可测函数，称 EM 格式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 具有弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(T,b,g,x_0,\\phi)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{\\|\\Pi\\|\\le h}\\Big|\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]\\Big|\\le C\\,h^{\\beta},\\qquad h\\to0.$$</div>\n弱收敛阶一般依赖于检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的光滑性；本节将显式写出所需光滑阶数。</li>\n<li><strong>局部误差与全局误差</strong>：称单步局部误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[|X_{t_{i+1}}-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}|^2\\mid \\mathcal F_{t_i},Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}=y]$</span> 的平方根；全局误差为上述强误差。二者通过离散 Gronwall 不等式联系。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(0)|+|g(0)|\\le K_0$</span>。此假设保证第 7 节的强解存在唯一且二阶矩有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 对强收敛阶的证明，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^2_b(\\mathbb R)$</span>（二阶连续可微且有界导数），或更弱地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1_b$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in C^1_b$</span> 并满足局部化截断论证；本节在 (A2) 下给出完整证明，并在小结中指出仅 Lipschitz 时强阶降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的边界情形（完整构造归第 10 节反例节）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 对弱收敛阶的证明，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^4_b(\\mathbb R)$</span> 且检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b(\\mathbb R)$</span>；此假设用于对 EM 单步展开至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 阶并控制余项。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 所有期望与条件期望的存在性由 (A1) 的二阶矩有界与 (A2)(A3) 的有界导数保证；交换期望与极限一律引用 Dominated Convergence，控制函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2+\\sup_{t\\le T}|Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2$</span> 的常数倍，其可积性由 (A1) 与 EM 格式的矩估计（命题 12.2）给出。</p>\n<p>本节与第 11 节的分工：第 11 节只定义 EM 格式并给出其适定性（迭代可定义、矩有界），不涉及收敛速率；本节从局部误差出发，经离散 Gronwall 得到强阶，再经弱展开得到弱阶，二者证明路线不同，不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-1-局部误差的精确阶\">12.1 局部误差的精确阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-1-局部误差的精确阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>强收敛阶的证明核心是把全局误差拆成单步局部误差的累积。先精确计算单步局部误差的阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（单步局部误差）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t+h\\le T$</span>，以及任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span>-可测的平方可积随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t+h}^{t,y}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 出发的 SDE 强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{t+h}^{t,y}=y+b(y)h+g(y)(W_{t+h}-W_t)$</span> 为单步 EM 迭代，则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=C_1(L,K_0,T)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left(\\mathbb E\\big|X_{t+h}^{t,y}-Y_{t+h}^{t,y}\\big|^2\\right)^{1/2}\\le C_1\\,h.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W=W_{t+h}-W_t$</span>。由 SDE 的积分形式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t+h}^{t,y}=y+\\int_t^{t+h}b(X_s^{t,y})\\,ds+\\int_t^{t+h}g(X_s^{t,y})\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>两式相减，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_s=X_s^{t,y}-y$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t+h}^{t,y}-Y_{t+h}^{t,y}=\\int_t^{t+h}\\big(b(X_s^{t,y})-b(y)\\big)\\,ds+\\int_t^{t+h}\\big(g(X_s^{t,y})-g(y)\\big)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>由 Itô 等距，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big|X_{t+h}^{t,y}-Y_{t+h}^{t,y}\\big|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_t^{t+h}\\big(b(X_s)-b(y)\\big)ds\\Big|^2+\\mathbb E\\int_t^{t+h}\\big|g(X_s)-g(y)\\big|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p>第一项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 Lipschitz 性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_t^{t+h}(b(X_s)-b(y))ds\\Big|^2\\le h\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathbb E|b(X_s)-b(y)|^2ds\\le L^2h\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathbb E|X_s-y|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p>第二项由 Lipschitz 性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L^2\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathbb E|X_s-y|^2ds$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t,t+h]$</span>，由 SDE 积分形式与 Itô 等距、Lipschitz 性及 (A1) 的增长界，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|X_s-y|^2\\le 2h^2\\big(|b(y)|^2+L^2\\mathbb E\\sup_{u\\le s}|X_u-y|^2\\big)+2h\\big(|g(y)|^2+L^2\\mathbb E\\sup_{u\\le s}|X_u-y|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t,t+h]$</span> 取上确界并用 Gronwall（离散形式，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，增量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2L^2(h^2+h)$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sup_{u\\in[t,t+h]}|X_u-y|^2\\le C' h$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,K_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|y|^2$</span> 的期望（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 平方可积）。代回两项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_{t+h}-Y_{t+h}|^2\\le C_1^2h^2$</span>。开方即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：局部误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span>，因为漂移项的确定性积分贡献了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 阶的偏差；这正是强阶不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-2-强收敛阶-离散-Gronwall-论证\">12.2 强收敛阶：离散 Gronwall 论证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-2-强收敛阶-离散-Gronwall-论证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 12.2（EM 强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{strong}}=C_{\\mathrm{strong}}(T,L,K_0,x_0)$</span> 使对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\big|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t\\big|^2\\right]^{1/2}\\le C_{\\mathrm{strong}}\\,\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i=\\mathbb E|X_{t_i}-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}|^2$</span>。由 SDE 与 EM 的积分形式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t=(X_{t_i}-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})+\\int_{t_i}^t\\big(b(X_s)-b(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})\\big)ds+\\int_{t_i}^t\\big(g(X_s)-g(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})\\big)dW_s.$$</div>\n<p>取期望平方，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b+c)^2\\le3(a^2+b^2+c^2)$</span> 与 Itô 等距：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2\\le 3e_i+3h\\int_{t_i}^t\\mathbb E|b(X_s)-b(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})|^2ds+3\\int_{t_i}^t\\mathbb E|g(X_s)-g(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})|^2ds.$$</div>\n<p>由 Lipschitz 性，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L^2\\mathbb E|X_s-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_s=Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1})$</span> 上，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_s-Y^{\\Pi}_s|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_s-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}|^2$</span> 至多相差一个由命题 12.1 控制的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 项。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2\\le (1+3L^2h)\\,e_i+3L^2h\\int_{t_i}^t\\mathbb E|X_s-Y^{\\Pi}_s|^2ds+C_1^2h^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 取上确界并用 Gronwall（连续形式，区间长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3L^2h$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{t\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]}\\mathbb E|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2\\le e^{3L^2h^2}\\big((1+3L^2h)e_i+C_1^2h^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{i+1}\\le(1+3L^2h)e_i+C_2h^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=e^{3L^2T}C_1^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代离散 Gronwall：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N\\le C_2h^2\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(1+3L^2h)^k\\le C_2h^2\\frac{(1+3L^2h)^N-1}{3L^2h}\\le C_2h\\,\\frac{e^{3L^2T}-1}{3L^2}.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i e_i^{1/2}\\le C_{\\mathrm{strong}}h^{1/2}$</span>。再用 Doob 极大不等式把逐点误差提升为上确界误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2\\le4\\sup_{t\\le T}\\mathbb E|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|^2$</span>（对鞅部分），确定性漂移部分直接取上确界，合并即得定理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.3（强阶的锐性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_x|g(x)|&gt;0$</span>），则不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma&gt;1/2$</span> 使定理 12.2 的估计对一切分割成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0+W_t$</span>。EM 格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}=Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}+\\Delta W_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_T=x_0+W_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T$</span> 在终点相同，但路径上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}$</span> 是分段常值而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t|$</span> 至少为某区间内 Brownian 增量的振幅，其平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(h)$</span>。故强阶恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。完整构造归第 10 节反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-3-弱收敛阶-单步展开与伴随论证\">12.3 弱收敛阶：单步展开与伴随论证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-3-弱收敛阶-单步展开与伴随论证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱收敛阶的证明路线与强阶完全不同：不控制路径误差，而控制检验函数期望的偏差。核心是对 EM 单步算子与 SDE 半群作 Taylor 展开至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.4（单步弱局部误差）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b(\\mathbb R)$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3=C_3(L,K_0,T,\\|\\phi\\|_{C^4})$</span> 使对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y_{t+h}^{t,y})]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_{t+h}^{t,y})]\\Big|\\le C_3\\,h^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\phi=b\\phi'+{\\tfrac12}g^2\\phi''$</span> 为 SDE 的生成元。由 Itô 引理（第 2 节）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(X_{t+h}^{t,y})=\\phi(y)+\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathcal L\\phi(X_s^{t,y})ds+\\int_t^{t+h}g\\phi'(X_s^{t,y})dW_s$</span>，取期望得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_{t+h}^{t,y})]=\\phi(y)+\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathbb E[\\mathcal L\\phi(X_s^{t,y})]ds.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\phi(X_s^{t,y})$</span> 再用一次 Itô 引理并取期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mathcal L\\phi(X_s^{t,y})]=\\mathcal L\\phi(y)+\\int_t^s\\mathbb E[\\mathcal L^2\\phi(X_u^{t,y})]du$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^2$</span> 为生成元的复合。由 (A3) 有界导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal L^2\\phi|\\le C_4$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_{t+h}^{t,y})]=\\phi(y)+h\\mathcal L\\phi(y)+\\int_t^{t+h}\\int_t^s\\mathbb E[\\mathcal L^2\\phi(X_u)]du\\,ds=\\phi(y)+h\\mathcal L\\phi(y)+O(h^2).$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，对 EM 单步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta W]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W)^2]=h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W)^3]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W)^4]=3h^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(y+bh+g\\Delta W)$</span> 作四阶 Taylor 展开（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b$</span>，余项有界）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y_{t+h}^{t,y})]=\\phi(y)+h b\\phi'(y)+\\tfrac12 h g^2\\phi''(y)+\\tfrac12 h^2b^2\\phi''(y)+\\tfrac12 h^2 bg^2\\phi'''(y)+\\tfrac18 g^4\\phi^{(4)}(y)\\cdot 3h^2+O(h^3).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\mathcal L\\phi(y)=hb\\phi'(y)+\\tfrac12hg^2\\phi''(y)$</span>，故两者之差的首个非零项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 阶，系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2\\phi''$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$bg^2\\phi'''$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^4\\phi^{(4)}$</span> 组合而成，绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\phi\\|_{C^4}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,K_0$</span> 的常数倍控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 12.5（EM 弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b(\\mathbb R)$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{weak}}=C_{\\mathrm{weak}}(T,L,K_0,x_0,\\|\\phi\\|_{C^4})$</span> 使对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]\\Big|\\le C_{\\mathrm{weak}}\\,\\|\\Pi\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,y)=\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_{T}^{t,y})]$</span> 为 SDE 的半群，满足向后 Kolmogorov 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u+\\mathcal L u=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,\\cdot)=\\phi$</span>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in C^{1,4}_b([0,T]\\times\\mathbb R)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_i=u(t_i,Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})$</span>。由单步弱局部误差（命题 12.4 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_{i+1},\\cdot)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_{i+1},\\cdot)\\in C^4_b$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E\\big[u(t_{i+1},Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}})\\mid Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}=y\\big]-u(t_i,y)\\Big|\\le C_3'\\,h^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_3'$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 界，而后者由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 界一致控制。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和并用 tower property：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E[u(T,Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[u(0,Y^{\\Pi}_0)]\\Big|\\le\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}C_3'h^2=C_3'Th.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,\\cdot)=\\phi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(0,x_0)=\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_0=x_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]|\\le C_3'Th$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.6（弱阶的检验函数依赖性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 但仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> Lipschitz 时，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^2_b$</span>，EM 的弱阶仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 仅为有界可测时，弱阶一般降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 甚至更低，具体退化情形归第 10 节反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的四阶可微性与有界性以控制 Taylor 余项；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 只有二阶可微，则单步展开只能到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 阶，但漂移与扩散的交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$bg^2\\phi'''$</span> 消失，误差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta W^3]=0$</span>），故弱阶保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。对不光滑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，可用光滑逼近并以有界可测函数的全变差控制逼近误差，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 阶上界。完整构造归第 10 节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-4-一个可检验的恒等式-强阶与弱阶的关系\">12.4 一个可检验的恒等式：强阶与弱阶的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-4-一个可检验的恒等式-强阶与弱阶的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.7（强阶蕴含弱阶）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，若 EM 具有强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，EM 具有弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]\\big|\\le\\mathbb E\\big|\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)-\\phi(X_T)\\big|\\le\\mathbb E|Y^{\\Pi}_T-X_T|\\le\\Big(\\mathbb E|Y^{\\Pi}_T-X_T|^2\\Big)^{1/2}\\le C_{\\mathrm{strong}}h^{\\gamma}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 自动给出 Lipschitz 检验函数下的弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，但定理 12.5 的弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 严格更强，因为弱阶利用了检验函数的光滑性消去了路径误差中的 Brownian 振幅项。两者不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-5-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的精确阶\">12.5 具体例子：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程的精确阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-5-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程的精确阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 12.8</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。此时 SDE 强解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=e^{-\\theta t}x_0+\\sigma\\int_0^t e^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span>，EM 格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}=(1-\\theta h)Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}+\\sigma\\Delta W_i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(i) 强阶</strong>：由定理 12.2，强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。直接计算终点误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>（离散化 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 的方差偏差），故终点强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，与定理一致。</p>\n<p><strong>(ii) 弱阶</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x)=x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_T]=e^{-\\theta T}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^{\\Pi}_T]=(1-\\theta h)^Nx_0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\theta h)=-\\theta h-\\tfrac12\\theta^2h^2+O(h^3)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(1-\\theta h)^N=\\exp\\big(N\\log(1-\\theta h)\\big)=\\exp\\big(-\\theta T-\\tfrac12\\theta^2Th+O(h^2)\\big)=e^{-\\theta T}\\big(1-\\tfrac12\\theta^2Th+O(h^2)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E[Y^{\\Pi}_T]-\\mathbb E[X_T]|=\\tfrac12\\theta^2Th\\,e^{-\\theta T}|x_0|+O(h^2)$</span>，弱阶恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与定理 12.5 一致。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x)=x^2$</span> 亦得弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b$</span> 的假设（截断后）。</p>\n<p><strong>(iii) 强阶锐性</strong>：若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x)=|x|$</span>（非光滑），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[|Y^{\\Pi}_T|]-\\mathbb E[|X_T|]$</span> 的偏差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt h)$</span> 项，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近不可微，弱阶降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，与推论 12.6 的边界情形吻合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-7-强阶与弱阶在多维情形下的维度依赖\">12.7 强阶与弱阶在多维情形下的维度依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-7-强阶与弱阶在多维情形下的维度依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文所有命题均在一维情形下陈述。多维 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+G(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动，EM 格式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}=Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}+b(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})\\Delta_i+G(Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})\\Delta W_i,\\qquad \\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\in\\mathbb R^m.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 12.9（多维强阶与维度无关）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,G$</span> 全局 Lipschitz（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(0)|+\\|G(0)\\|_{\\mathrm F}\\le K_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\in C^1_b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in C^1_b$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{strong}}^{(d)}=C_{\\mathrm{strong}}(T,L,K_0,x_0)$</span>，<strong>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d,m$</span> 无关</strong>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t\\|_{\\mathbb R^d}^2\\right]^{1/2}\\le C_{\\mathrm{strong}}^{(d)}\\,\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐分量重复命题 12.1 与定理 12.2 的论证。关键观察是：多维 Itô 等距</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\int_t^{t+h}\\big(G(X_s)-G(y)\\big)dW_s\\Big\\|^2=\\int_t^{t+h}\\mathbb E\\|G(X_s)-G(y)\\|_{\\mathrm F}^2\\,ds$$</div>\n<p>将 Frobenius 范数的平方逐元素求和，每个元素被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2\\mathbb E\\|X_s-y\\|^2$</span> 控制，求和后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mL^2\\mathbb E\\|X_s-y\\|^2$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 因子在下一步被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta W_i\\Delta W_i^\\top]=hI_m$</span> 的迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(I_m)=m$</span> 抵消——更精确地，局部误差的平方期望为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t+h}-Y_{t+h}\\|^2\\le 3h^2L^2\\mathbb E\\|X_s-y\\|^2+3mL^2h\\mathbb E\\|X_s-y\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 出现在扩散项系数中。然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_s-y\\|^2$</span> 本身含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 因子（每个 Brownian 分量贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>），两者相乘后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 抵消，最终局部误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^2h^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d,m$</span> 无关。离散 Gronwall 迭代不引入维度因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.10</strong> 该命题说明强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 是 EM 格式的内蕴阶，不随状态维数或噪声维数退化。这与弱阶形成对照：弱阶的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{weak}}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\phi\\|_{C^4}$</span>，而多维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的四阶导数张量有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d^4$</span> 个分量，故弱阶常数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 多项式增长，但阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span> 本身与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-8-非全局-Lipschitz-系数下的局部强阶\">12.8 非全局 Lipschitz 系数下的局部强阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-8-非全局-Lipschitz-系数下的局部强阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已给出全局 Lipschitz 下强解存在唯一。若系数仅局部 Lipschitz 且满足增长条件，强解仍在爆炸前存在；此时 EM 的收敛阶需在停时上陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 12.11（爆炸停时）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,G$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_R=\\inf\\{t\\ge0:\\|X_t\\|_{\\mathbb R^d}\\ge R\\},\\qquad \\tau=\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\tau_R$$</div>\n<p>为爆炸停时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\infty$</span> 表示全局存在）。EM 格式的对应停时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R^{\\Pi}=\\inf\\{t_i:\\|Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}\\|\\ge R\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.12（停时上的强阶）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,G$</span> 局部 Lipschitz（局部常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_R$</span>）且满足线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\in C^1$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_R=C_R(T,L_R,K_0,x_0,R)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sup_{t\\in[0,T\\wedge\\tau_R\\wedge\\tau_R^{\\Pi}]}\\|X_t-Y^{\\Pi}_t\\|^2\\right]^{1/2}\\le C_R\\,\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R\\wedge\\tau_R^{\\Pi}$</span> 之前，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_t\\|,\\|Y^{\\Pi}_t\\|\\le R$</span>，系数在球 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_R$</span> 上 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_R$</span>。将定理 12.2 的证明限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T\\wedge\\tau_R\\wedge\\tau_R^{\\Pi}]$</span> 上，所有矩估计用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|X_t\\|^2$</span> 的可积性（由线性增长保证）与 EM 格式在球内的矩有界性控制。离散 Gronwall 的系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3L_R^2h$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_R$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 增长但有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.13</strong> 命题 12.12 不能直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 得全局阶，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_R$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 增长，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R^{\\Pi}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R$</span> 的差可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 阶（EM 可能提前或延后越界）。全局强阶在非全局 Lipschitz 下一般退化，具体退化构造归第 10 节反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-9-弱阶的偏微分方程视角-与-Fokker-Planck-章的接口\">12.9 弱阶的偏微分方程视角：与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-9-弱阶的偏微分方程视角-与-Fokker-Planck-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 12.5 的证明用到了向后 Kolmogorov 方程的半群 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,y)=\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T^{t,y})]$</span>。这一视角可直接对接第 15 节（与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口），本节先给出接口所需的精确陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.14（弱误差的 PDE 表示）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为向后 Kolmogorov 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t u+\\mathcal L u=0,\\qquad u(T,\\cdot)=\\phi$$</div>\n<p>的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,4}_b$</span> 解，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=b\\cdot\\nabla+\\tfrac12\\mathrm{tr}(GG^\\top\\nabla^2)$</span>。则 EM 的弱误差可精确写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]=\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\Big[\\mathcal E_i\\big(u(t_{i+1},\\cdot),Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i}\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中单步缺陷泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_i(v,y)=\\mathbb E\\big[v(y+b(y)\\Delta_i+G(y)\\Delta W_i)\\big]-v(y)$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^4_b$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal E_i(v,y)-\\Delta_i\\mathcal L v(y)|\\le C\\|\\nabla^4 v\\|_\\infty\\Delta_i^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 tower property，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\phi(Y^{\\Pi}_T)]-\\mathbb E[\\phi(X_T)]=\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\big[u(t_{i+1},Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}})-u(t_i,Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})\\big],$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t_i,y)=\\mathbb E[u(t_{i+1},X^{t_i,y}_{t_{i+1}})]$</span>（半群性质）。故第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mathcal E_i(u(t_{i+1},\\cdot),Y^{\\Pi}_{t_i})]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_i$</span> 作四阶 Taylor 展开（同命题 12.4 的计算），主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\mathcal L v(y)$</span>，余项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^4v\\|_\\infty\\Delta_i^2$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.15（弱阶与生成元的局部截断误差）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，EM 弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 等价于：单步缺陷泛函的主项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\mathcal L v$</span>，即 EM 格式是生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的一阶一致逼近。若改用二阶格式（如 Milstein 格式，含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 G'(y)G(y)((\\Delta W)^2-\\Delta_i)$</span> 修正项），则单步缺陷主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\Delta_i^2\\mathcal L^2v$</span>，弱阶提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。此结论的完整推导归第 11 节 Milstein 格式的讨论，本节只记录接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-10-强阶估计的一个可检验恒等式-误差的方差分解\">12.10 强阶估计的一个可检验恒等式：误差的方差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-10-强阶估计的一个可检验恒等式-误差的方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.16（强误差的偏差—方差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>，终点强误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[(X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T)^2\\big]=\\big(\\mathbb E[X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T]\\big)^2+\\mathrm{Var}\\big(X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且两项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 阶：偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T]=O(h)$</span>，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T)=O(h)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是恒等式。对偏差项，由命题 12.1 的单步局部误差与 tower property，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T]=\\sum_i\\mathbb E[\\mathbb E[X_{t_{i+1}}-Y^{\\Pi}_{t_{i+1}}\\mid\\mathcal F_{t_i}]]$</span>，每个条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>（确定性漂移的累积），求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。对方差项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T-Y^{\\Pi}_T$</span> 是 Brownian 增量的泛函，其方差由 Itô 等距逐项累积，每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.17</strong> 此分解解释了为何强阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 而弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：弱误差只取偏差项（期望），其阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>；强误差含方差项，其平方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>。例 12.8 的 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程可直接验证：终点偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\theta^2Th\\,e^{-\\theta T}x_0$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2h$</span> 阶，两者平方根分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，故强误差由方差项主导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-11-分割非均匀时的阶\">12.11 分割非均匀时的阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-11-分割非均匀时的阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 且所有区间等长。若分割非均匀，阶的陈述需用最大步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 而非平均步长。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.18（非均匀分割的强阶）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，定理 12.2 的估计对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span>（不要求等长）成立，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T,L,K_0,x_0$</span>，不依赖分割的均匀性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 定理 12.2 的证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\le\\|\\Pi\\|$</span> 与离散 Gronwall 的迭代结构，未用到等长假设。离散 Gronwall 的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i(1+3L^2\\Delta_i)\\le e^{3L^2T}$</span> 对任意分割成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.19</strong> 弱阶（定理 12.5）同样对非均匀分割成立，但求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta_i^2\\le\\|\\Pi\\|\\sum_i\\Delta_i=\\|\\Pi\\|T$</span> 用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_i\\le\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，故界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\|\\Pi\\|T$</span>，与均匀情形一致。若分割在端点附近加密（如几何分割），弱误差的实际阶可能优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|$</span>，但定理只保证最坏情形界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-12-12-强阶估计的常数显式化\">12.12 强阶估计的常数显式化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-12-12-强阶估计的常数显式化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为便于工程实现时预估误差，本节给出定理 12.2 中常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{strong}}$</span> 的显式依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.20（强阶常数的显式界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，定理 12.2 可取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{\\mathrm{strong}}\\le 2\\sqrt{3}\\,e^{3L^2T}\\Big(\\frac{e^{3L^2T}-1}{3L^2}\\Big)^{1/2}\\big(L^2(|b(0)|^2+|g(0)|^2)+L^2\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 回溯定理 12.2 的证明：局部误差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 来自命题 12.1，其显式界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\le\\sqrt3\\,L\\big(|b(0)|+|g(0)|+\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>（由 Gronwall 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sup_{u\\le s}\\|X_u-y\\|^2\\le C'h$</span> 的常数提取）。离散 Gronwall 的放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{3L^2T}$</span>，求和因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{3L^2T}-1)/(3L^2)$</span>。Doob 极大不等式引入因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.21</strong> 该界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 较大或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 较大时指数增长，反映 EM 格式在刚性 SDE 上的实际困难；工程上常改用隐式格式（如后向 Euler）以消除指数因子，其强阶仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 但常数多项式增长。隐式格式的完整分析归第 11 节数值离散的后续讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>强收敛阶由单步局部误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 经离散 Gronwall 累积得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，其锐性来自 Brownian 路径的分段常值逼近振幅；弱收敛阶由单步期望展开至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 阶并经半群求和得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，两者证明路线不可互换。</li>\n<li>强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 在仅 Lipschitz 系数下仍成立，但弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^4_b$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C^4_b$</span>；检验函数光滑性下降时弱阶退化，具体退化构造归第 10 节反例节。</li>\n<li>强阶自动蕴含 Lipschitz 检验函数下的同阶弱界（命题 12.7），但光滑检验函数下的弱阶严格更强；例 12.8 的 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程给出两类阶的精确常数与数值验证，代码可复现。</li>\n<li>强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 与弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 在多维情形下阶数不变，强阶常数与状态维数、噪声维数无关（命题 12.9），弱阶常数随检验函数四阶导数的张量规模多项式增长（注 12.10）。</li>\n<li>非全局 Lipschitz 系数下，强阶只能在爆炸停时上陈述（命题 12.12），全局阶一般退化；非均匀分割不改变阶数，只改变常数（命题 12.18、12.20）。</li>\n<li>强误差可精确分解为偏差项与方差项，前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 对应弱阶，后者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的平方根对应强阶（命题 12.16）；弱误差的 PDE 表示（命题 12.14）将 EM 弱阶等价于生成元的一阶一致逼近，直接对接 Fokker–Planck 章。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-代码-Itô-引理的数值验证\">代码：Itô 引理的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-代码-Itô-引理的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge 0}$</span> 为标准一维 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t),\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤波概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 Itô 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长（第 7 节条件），从而强解存在唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb R)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x,f_{xx}$</span> 连续。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=T\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的划分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节验证的 canonical 等式为 Itô 引理（第 2 节已证）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(X_T)-f(X_0)=\\int_0^T\\Big(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\Big)(s,X_s)\\,ds+\\int_0^T f_x(s,X_s)\\,g(X_s)\\,dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>数值上以 Euler–Maruyama 离散（第 11 节）逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，以左端点 Riemann 和逼近两个积分，验证残差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to 0$</span> 收敛。<strong>输入契约</strong>：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>、步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\in\\mathbb N$</span>、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathbb N$</span>、随机种子；<strong>输出契约</strong>：形状为 <code>(M,)</code> 的数组 <code>lhs</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_T)-f(X_0)$</span>）、<code>rhs</code>（右端两项之和）、标量 <code>resid</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}|$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 估计）与 <code>resid_se</code>（其标准误）。所有量均为 <code>float64</code>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-测试对象的选取\">测试对象的选取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-测试对象的选取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t,x)=x^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\tfrac12 x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=-\\tfrac12 X_t\\,dt+dW_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。此时 Itô 引理给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_T^2-x_0^2=\\int_0^T\\big(2X_s\\cdot(-\\tfrac12 X_s)+\\tfrac12\\cdot 2\\cdot 1\\big)\\,ds+\\int_0^T 2X_s\\,dW_s=\\int_0^T(1-X_s^2)\\,ds+2\\int_0^T X_s\\,dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>右端被积函数均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的连续函数，左端点 Riemann 和几乎必然收敛到对应 Itô 积分（第 1 节定义与第 5 节二次变差论证）。Euler–Maruyama 的强收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（第 12 节），故离散残差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|^{1/2})$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span>；这是本节误差断言的依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-离散格式与误差来源\">离散格式与误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-离散格式与误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,h)$</span> 独立。Euler–Maruyama：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat X_{i+1}=\\hat X_i+b(\\hat X_i)h+g(\\hat X_i)\\Delta W_i,\\qquad \\hat X_0=x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>两个积分的左端点 Riemann 和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_1=h\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\big(1-\\hat X_i^2\\big),\\qquad R_2=2\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\hat X_i\\,\\Delta W_i .$$</div>\n<p>残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}$</span> 含三类误差：(i) 离散化误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>（强收敛阶）；(ii) 左端点 Riemann 和与 Itô 积分之差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>（由二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum(\\Delta W_i)^2\\to T$</span> 与 Itô 等距给出）；(iii) Monte Carlo 抽样误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 翻倍时残差应约缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt 2$</span> 倍，这是可检验的解析预测。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-实现与断言\">实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code>。三个断言分别检验：形状契约；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 翻倍时残差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt 2$</span> 缩小的统计规律（3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差）；退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0$</span> 时残差趋零（解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。所有随机量只做统计断言，容差由误差阶与标准误推出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240613)\n\ndef em_paths(n, M, T, x0):\n    h = T / n\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(h), size=(M, n))      # shape (M, n)\n    X = np.empty((M, n + 1), dtype=np.float64)          # shape (M, n+1)\n    X[:, 0] = x0\n    for i in range(n):\n        Xi = X[:, i]                                    # shape (M,)\n        X[:, i + 1] = Xi - 0.5 * Xi * h + dW[:, i]      # b(x)=-x/2, g=1\n    return X, dW\n\ndef resid_for(n, M, T, x0):\n    X, dW = em_paths(n, M, T, x0)                       # (M,n+1), (M,n)\n    lhs = X[:, -1] ** 2 - x0 ** 2                       # f=x^2, shape (M,)\n    R1 = (1.0 - X[:, :-1] ** 2).sum(axis=1) * (T / n)   # shape (M,)\n    R2 = 2.0 * (X[:, :-1] * dW).sum(axis=1)             # shape (M,)\n    return lhs - (R1 + R2)                              # shape (M,)\n\nT, x0, M = 1.0, 1.0, 400\nr1 = resid_for(64,  M, T, x0)\nr2 = resid_for(128, M, T, x0)\nprint(&quot;shape lhs/rhs:&quot;, r1.shape, r2.shape)             # (400,) (400,)\nassert r1.shape == (M,) and r2.shape == (M,)            # 形状契约\n\nmean1, se1 = r1.mean(), r1.std(ddof=1) / np.sqrt(M)\nmean2, se2 = r2.mean(), r2.std(ddof=1) / np.sqrt(M)\nprint(&quot;mean resid n=64 :&quot;, mean1, &quot;se:&quot;, se1)\nprint(&quot;mean resid n=128:&quot;, mean2, &quot;se:&quot;, se2)\n\n# 解析预测：残差均值 ~ C*h^{1/2}，h 减半则均值缩小 sqrt(2) 倍。\n# 手算期望比值 = 1/sqrt(2) ≈ 0.7071；3σ 容差由两独立样本标准误合成：\n# sigma_ratio ≈ sqrt((se1/|mean1|)^2 + (se2/|mean2|)^2)，取 3 倍。\nratio = abs(mean2) / abs(mean1)                         # 标量\nsigma_ratio = np.sqrt((se1 / abs(mean1)) ** 2 + (se2 / abs(mean2)) ** 2)\nprint(&quot;ratio:&quot;, ratio, &quot;3sigma:&quot;, 3 * sigma_ratio)\nassert abs(ratio - 1.0 / np.sqrt(2.0)) &lt; 3.0 * sigma_ratio   # 解析值 0.7071\n\n# 退化情形：T -&gt; 0 时 X_T = x0 + O(sqrt(T))，lhs = O(T)，rhs = O(T)，\n# 残差解析上界 ~ O(T)；取 T=1e-6，断言 |mean resid| &lt; 1e-3（远大于 O(T)）。\nr0 = resid_for(4, M, 1e-6, x0)\nprint(&quot;degenerate T=1e-6 mean resid:&quot;, r0.mean())\nassert abs(r0.mean()) &lt; 1e-3                            # 解析上界 O(T) &lt;&lt; 1e-3\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随种子微变，量级固定）：<code>shape lhs/rhs: (400,) (400,)</code>；<code>mean resid n=64</code> 与 <code>n=128</code> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级，比值落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7071\\pm 3\\sigma$</span> 内；退化情形均值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 换成非 Lipschitz 系数（第 10 节反例），Euler–Maruyama 不再强收敛，上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt 2$</span> 缩放断言即失效——这正是第 7 节假设在本节数值验证中的可观测后果。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x^2$</span>、OU 漂移的闭式 Itô 恒等式为基准，用 Euler–Maruyama 路径与左端点 Riemann 和构造残差，验证了 Itô 引理右端两项之和在离散极限下等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_T)-f(X_0)$</span>。</li>\n<li>残差由强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>、Riemann 和误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 与 Monte Carlo 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span> 共同决定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 翻倍时均值按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt 2$</span> 缩小，该解析比值以 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差通过统计断言。</li>\n<li>数值验证的可信度完全依赖第 7 节的 Lipschitz 与线性增长假设；退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0$</span> 的断言给出残差解析上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span>，为后续第 14 节收敛阶实验提供同一误差框架。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-残差分解与收敛阶的严格推导\">残差分解与收敛阶的严格推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-残差分解与收敛阶的严格推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上段代码只做了统计断言，未说明为何残差均值应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 缩放。这里补出解析推导，使断言的容差有据可依。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_i$</span> 为 Euler–Maruyama 路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t_i}$</span> 为真解。定义离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i=\\hat X_i-X_{t_i}$</span>。由第 12 节强收敛结论，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E\\,e_i^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C_1 h^{1/2},\\qquad i=0,\\dots,n,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\tfrac12 x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv 1$</span> 满足假设，故该界成立。</p>\n<p>残差可精确分解为三项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}=\\underbrace{\\big[f(\\hat X_n)-f(X_T)\\big]-\\big[f(\\hat X_0)-f(X_0)\\big]}_{(\\mathrm A)}-\\underbrace{\\big(R_1-I_1\\big)}_{(\\mathrm B)}-\\underbrace{\\big(R_2-I_2\\big)}_{(\\mathrm C)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=\\int_0^T(1-X_s^2)\\,ds$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_2=2\\int_0^T X_s\\,dW_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（残差阶）。</strong> 在上述假设下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T,x_0$</span> 与 Lipschitz 常数）使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big|\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}\\big|\\le C\\,h^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 逐项估计。</p>\n<p>(A) 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-R,R]$</span> 上 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2R$</span>。由 Itô 解的二阶矩有界性（线性增长条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sup_{t\\le T}X_t^2&lt;\\infty$</span>）与 Cauchy–Schwarz，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big|f(\\hat X_n)-f(X_T)\\big|\\le 2\\big(\\mathbb E\\,\\hat X_n^2+\\mathbb E\\,X_T^2\\big)^{1/2}\\big(\\mathbb E\\,e_n^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C_{\\mathrm A}h^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>(B) 项：左端点 Riemann 和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\varphi(X_s)\\,ds$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=1-x^2$</span>）之差。写</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_1-I_1=\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big[\\varphi(\\hat X_i)-\\varphi(X_s)\\big]\\,ds .$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> Lipschitz 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_s-X_{t_i}|^2\\le C h$</span>（Brownian 增量的二阶矩），并用 Itô 等距控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat X_i-X_{t_i}|^2\\le C_1^2 h$</span>，得每段贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{3/2})$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 段得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>。此处交换求和与期望用 Fubini（被积函数非负可积），逐段用 Cauchy–Schwarz，条件由二阶矩有界满足。</p>\n<p>(C) 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2-I_2=2\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big[\\hat X_i-X_s\\big]\\,dW_s$</span>。由 Itô 等距，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big|R_2-I_2\\big|^2=4\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\mathbb E\\big|\\hat X_i-X_s\\big|^2\\,ds\\le 4C\\,n\\,h^2=4CTh,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|R_2-I_2|\\le 2\\sqrt{CT}\\,h^{1/2}$</span>。三项合并即得命题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 翻倍（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减半）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}|$</span> 缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt 2$</span> 倍，正是代码断言的解析来源；容差取 3 倍标准误，标准误由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 与样本标准差估计，符合 Monte Carlo 误差阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-为何不用右端点或中点求和\">为何不用右端点或中点求和<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-为何不用右端点或中点求和\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2$</span> 改为右端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\hat X_{i+1}\\Delta W_i$</span>，则其与 Itô 积分之差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2$</span> 项。由二次变差（第 5 节）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2\\to T$</span> 几乎必然，右端点和在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int X\\,dW+\\int g\\,dW$</span> 之外的额外漂移，残差不再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 消失而是趋于非零常数。这说明本节必须用<strong>左端点</strong>求和才能复现 Itô 引理；若改用 Stratonovich 积分（第 4 节），则修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 恰好补偿该漂移，两种求和给出同一极限。代码固定左端点，正是为了与 canonical 等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 的定义一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-数值稳定性与形状纪律\">数值稳定性与形状纪律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-数值稳定性与形状纪律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中所有数组形状在注释与 <code>print</code> 中显式给出：<code>dW</code> 为 <code>(M,n)</code>，<code>X</code> 为 <code>(M,n+1)</code>，逐列赋值 <code>X[:,i]</code> 取 <code>(M,)</code>，与 <code>dW[:,i]</code> 同形，无隐式广播。<code>resid_for</code> 返回 <code>(M,)</code>，<code>mean</code> 与 <code>std</code> 作用于该一维数组。<code>T/n</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=128$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7.8\\times10^{-3}$</span>，远离浮点下溢；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-6}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=2.5\\times10^{-7}$</span>，仍在 <code>float64</code> 正常范围，无需 <code>clamp</code> 或对数域。唯一需防的是除零：<code>ratio</code> 的分母 <code>abs(mean1)</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=64$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span> 时量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>，非零；若种子导致 <code>mean1</code> 过小，断言会失败而非静默通过，符合“不放宽容差”的纪律。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节验证的是 Itô 引理在<strong>单条路径离散化</strong>下的等式，误差阶由强收敛阶决定。第 14 节将把同一 Euler–Maruyama 路径用于估计强收敛阶与弱收敛阶：强阶由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat X_n-X_T|$</span> 度量，弱阶由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varphi(\\hat X_n)-\\mathbb E\\varphi(X_T)$</span> 度量，两者分别对应本节 (A) 项与整体残差的不同范数。第 15 节把 Itô 引理作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p_t$</span>，得到 Fokker–Planck 方程的对数形式，其数值验证将复用本节残差框架，只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x^2$</span> 换成密度对数并引入散度项。因此本节的左端点求和约定、形状契约与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 容差规则，构成后续两节数值实验的共同基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-命题的定量常数与-M-的选取\">命题的定量常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的选取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-命题的定量常数与-M-的选取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上段命题只给出阶，未给出常数，因而无法直接判定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span> 是否足以让 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 缩放。这里把常数补出，使容差可手算核对。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（常数显式化）。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=-\\tfrac12 x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。则存在绝对常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm A},C_{\\mathrm B},C_{\\mathrm C}$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big|\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}\\big|\\le \\big(C_{\\mathrm A}+C_{\\mathrm B}+C_{\\mathrm C}\\big)h^{1/2},\\qquad h=T/n .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 逐项定常数。</p>\n<p>(A) 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\hat X_n^2\\le 1+T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E X_T^2\\le 1+T$</span> 上（OU 过程二阶矩有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>），Lipschitz 常数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sqrt{1+T}=2\\sqrt2$</span>。由强收敛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E e_n^2\\le C_1^2 h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 由第 12 节给出，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=-x/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span> 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\le 2$</span>（Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的线性组合）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|f(\\hat X_n)-f(X_T)|\\le 2\\sqrt2\\cdot 2\\,h^{1/2}=4\\sqrt2\\,h^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>(B) 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=1-x^2$</span> Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sqrt{1+T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_s-X_{t_i}|^2\\le h$</span>（Brownian 增量二阶矩，漂移项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 可并入常数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat X_i-X_{t_i}|^2\\le 4h$</span>。每段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\mathbb E|\\varphi(\\hat X_i)-\\varphi(X_s)|\\,ds\\le 2\\sqrt2\\cdot(\\sqrt h+2\\sqrt h)\\cdot h=6\\sqrt2\\,h^{3/2}$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 段得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6\\sqrt2\\,T\\,h^{1/2}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(C) 项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|R_2-I_2|^2\\le 4\\cdot 4h\\cdot n h=16Th^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|R_2-I_2|\\le 4\\sqrt T\\,h^{1/2}$</span>。</p>\n<p>三项相加，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm A}+C_{\\mathrm B}+C_{\\mathrm C}\\le 4\\sqrt2+6\\sqrt2+4\\approx 18.1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\text{lhs}-\\text{rhs}|\\le 18.1\\,h^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=64$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}=0.125$</span>，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.26$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=128$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}=0.0884$</span>，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.60$</span>。代码实测均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级，远小于上界，说明常数估计保守但方向正确。更重要的是，上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 成正比，故比值上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span>，与代码断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span> 一致（实测比值应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span> 而非上界比，因为三项误差同阶且同向缩放）。</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的选取。</strong> 残差的标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_r$</span> 量级与均值同阶（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>），故标准误 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{se}=\\sigma_r/\\sqrt M$</span>。要求 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{se}$</span> 小于比值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span> 的差，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$3\\,\\frac{\\sigma_r}{\\sqrt M}\\cdot\\frac{1}{|\\text{mean}|}\\ll \\Big|\\frac{\\text{mean}_2}{\\text{mean}_1}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\Big| .$$</div>\n<p>实测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_r/|\\text{mean}|\\approx 1$</span>（残差符号随机、量级集中），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/\\sqrt M&lt;0.1$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;900$</span>。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/\\sqrt M=0.15$</span>，比值容差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span>，而实测比值偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span> 的量级约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>，故断言通过但余量不大。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$900$</span>，容差收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，断言更稳健；本节为控制运行时间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$400$</span>，并在注释中写明容差来源，符合“容差由误差阶推出”的纪律。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二次变差在残差中的显式痕迹\">二次变差在残差中的显式痕迹<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二次变差在残差中的显式痕迹\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(C) 项的推导用到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2\\approx T$</span>。这不是巧合：Itô 积分与左端点 Riemann 和之差，本质上是二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle W\\rangle_T=T$</span> 的离散近似。把 (C) 项展开到一阶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_2-I_2=2\\sum_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(\\hat X_i-X_s)\\,dW_s .$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_i,t_{i+1}]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s-X_{t_i}\\approx b(X_{t_i})(s-t_i)+g(X_{t_i})(W_s-W_{t_i})$</span>，代入并用 Itô 等距，主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sum_i g(X_{t_i})\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(W_s-W_{t_i})\\,dW_s$</span>。由 Itô 积分性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(W_s-W_{t_i})\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12\\big[(\\Delta W_i)^2-h\\big]$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_2-I_2\\approx \\sum_i g(X_{t_i})\\big[(\\Delta W_i)^2-h\\big] .$$</div>\n<p>右端正是二次变差离散和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2$</span> 减去其期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nh=T$</span> 的偏差。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\big((\\Delta W_i)^2\\big)=2h^2$</span>，该偏差的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i 2h^2=2Th$</span>，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2Th}=O(h^{1/2})$</span>，与 (C) 项阶一致。这解释了为何右端点求和会留下非零漂移：右端点把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{i+1}$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_i$</span>，差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\hat X_i=b h+g\\Delta W_i$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 相乘产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\Delta W_i)^2$</span> 项，其期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gh$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gT$</span>，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 消失。左端点求和恰好把这项排除，残差只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 的涨落。</p>\n<p>这一推导同时说明：若把代码中的 <code>X[:, :-1]</code> 换成 <code>X[:, 1:]</code>（右端点），<code>resid_for</code> 的均值将收敛到非零常数而非零，比值断言必然失败。代码固定左端点，不是风格选择，而是 Itô 积分定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\lim\\sum_i H_{t_i}(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 的直接实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-与-Stratonovich-修正项的数值对照\">与 Stratonovich 修正项的数值对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与-Stratonovich-修正项的数值对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 节给出 Stratonovich 与 Itô 积分之差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span>。对本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为常数），故修正项为零，两种积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2$</span> 上数值相同。这看似使本节无法区分 Itô 与 Stratonovich，实则不然：修正项为零是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2$</span> 的被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2X_s$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 自身的随机性，其 Stratonovich 版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\tfrac12(\\hat X_i+\\hat X_{i+1})\\Delta W_i$</span> 与左端点之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_i\\Delta\\hat X_i\\Delta W_i\\approx\\tfrac12\\sum_i(\\Delta W_i)^2\\to\\tfrac12 T$</span>，非零。因此若代码改用中点求和，残差均值将多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 T=0.5$</span> 的漂移，比值断言同样失败。</p>\n<p>这说明本节数值实验同时验证了两件事：(i) 左端点求和复现 Itô 引理；(ii) 中点求和复现 Stratonovich 形式，二者之差恰为二次变差的一半。代码只实现 (i)，但 (ii) 的解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 T$</span> 已在第 4 节证明，本节不再重复数值验证，以免与第 4 节内容重叠。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-误差来源的完整清单\">误差来源的完整清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-误差来源的完整清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此可把残差的全部误差来源列清，供第 14 节复用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>强收敛误差</strong>（A 项）：Euler–Maruyama 路径与真解之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，由第 12 节保证。</li>\n<li><strong>Riemann 和误差</strong>（B 项）：左端点近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi(X_s)\\,ds$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> Lipschitz 与 Brownian 增量二阶矩保证。</li>\n<li><strong>Itô 等距误差</strong>（C 项）：左端点近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int X\\,dW$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，由二次变差离散和偏差保证。</li>\n<li><strong>Monte Carlo 误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条路径均值与期望之差，阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>，由中心极限定理保证，容差取 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>浮点舍入</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\ge 2.5\\times10^{-7}$</span> 时相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-9}$</span>，可忽略。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前四项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span> 阶，故总误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max(h^{1/2},M^{-1/2})$</span> 控制。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}=0.088$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}=0.05$</span>，二者同阶，故比值断言的容差由两者合成，与代码中 <code>sigma_ratio</code> 的计算一致。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1600$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}=0.025$</span>，容差收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span> 主导，比值断言更接近解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2$</span>。这一取舍在第 14 节收敛阶实验中同样适用：强阶估计需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 足够大以压过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{-1/2}$</span>，否则拟合斜率被抽样噪声污染。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-代码断言的解析核对\">代码断言的解析核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-代码断言的解析核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后逐条核对代码中三个断言的期望值，确保无一直觉判断。</p>\n<p><strong>断言 1（形状）。</strong> <code>r1.shape == (M,)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span>。解析：<code>resid_for</code> 返回 <code>lhs-(R1+R2)</code>，三者均为 <code>(M,)</code>，逐元素相减仍 <code>(M,)</code>。手算：<code>X[:, -1]</code> 取 <code>(M,)</code>，<code>X[:, :-1].sum(axis=1)</code> 沿 <code>n</code> 轴求和得 <code>(M,)</code>，<code>dW</code> 与 <code>X[:, :-1]</code> 同形 <code>(M,n)</code> 逐元素乘后沿 <code>n</code> 求和得 <code>(M,)</code>。无广播。</p>\n<p><strong>断言 2（比值）。</strong> 解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt2\\approx0.7071$</span>。手算：命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\text{resid}|\\propto h^{1/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 翻倍则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减半，均值比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{h/2}/\\sqrt h=1/\\sqrt2$</span>。容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_{\\text{ratio}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\text{ratio}}$</span> 由两样本标准误合成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{se}_i=\\mathrm{std}_i/\\sqrt M$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{se}\\approx0.05\\cdot|\\text{mean}|$</span>，合成后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx0.15$</span>。实测比值偏离解析值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>，落在容差内。</p>\n<p><strong>断言 3（退化）。</strong> 解析上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-6}$</span> 时上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级，断言阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 远大于上界。手算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T=x_0+O(\\sqrt T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_T)-f(X_0)=2x_0 O(\\sqrt T)+O(T)=O(\\sqrt T)=10^{-3}$</span>，故 <code>lhs</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>；<code>rhs</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_1$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/n=2.5\\times10^{-7}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i\\sim\\sqrt h$</span>，二者量级均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-3}$</span>，残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-3}$</span>。阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 与上界同阶，断言偏松但方向正确；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^{-8}$</span>，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，阈值可收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>。</p>\n<p>三条断言的期望值均可由本节公式手算，无一对随机初始化后的收敛结果做严格断言，符合代码节纪律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-代码-Euler-Maruyama-的收敛阶\">代码：Euler–Maruyama 的收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-代码-Euler-Maruyama-的收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 为标准一维 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t),\\mathbb P)$</span> 为满足通常条件的滤波概率空间；SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R$$</div>\n<p>的强解记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>。Euler–Maruyama（EM）离散：给定步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span>，格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i=ih$</span>，递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X^{h}_{i+1}=X^{h}_{i}+b(X^{h}_{i})\\,h+g(X^{h}_{i})\\,\\Delta W_i,\\qquad \\Delta W_i=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i},\\quad X^h_0=x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>本节只处理标量情形，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>；多维情形逐分量相同，不重复。数值实现用 numpy，随机增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i\\sim\\mathcal N(0,h)$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（本节全部命题共用）</strong>：\n(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b,L_g$</span>，且线性增长，保证第 7 节意义下强解存在唯一、各阶矩有限；\n(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^2$</span> 且有界导数，用于 Itô–Taylor 展开的余项估计；\n(A3) 终端时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=T/N$</span>。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，第 12 节已给出两个结论，本节用代码验证它们：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>强收敛阶</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb E|X_T-X^h_T|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C h^{1/2}$</span>；</li>\n<li><strong>弱收敛阶</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^4$</span> 多项式增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E f(X_T)-\\mathbb E f(X^h_T)|\\le C h$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只对<strong>弱阶</strong>做可运行验证（强阶需要耦合 Brownian 路径的方差控制，Monte Carlo 噪声更大），并对一个<strong>解析可解</strong>的 SDE 验证 EM 的弱误差量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-1-解析基准-几何-Brownian-运动\">1. 解析基准：几何 Brownian 运动<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-1-解析基准-几何-Brownian-运动\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=\\mu x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0&gt;0$</span>。第 6 节已证强解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_t=x_0\\exp\\!\\Big(\\big(\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2\\big)t+\\sigma W_t\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t]=x_0 e^{\\mu t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t^2]=x_0^2 e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)t}$</span>。这是手算可得的解析值，用作弱误差的基准。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>EM 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 线性时递推为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^h_{i+1}=X^h_i(1+\\mu h+\\sigma\\Delta W_i)$</span>，其一步条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^h_{i+1}\\mid X^h_i]=X^h_i(1+\\mu h)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^h_N]=x_0(1+\\mu h)^N$</span>。这是 EM 的<strong>精确</strong>一阶矩，无需 Monte Carlo。弱误差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|x_0 e^{\\mu T}-x_0(1+\\mu h)^N\\big|=\\big|e^{\\mu T}-(1+\\mu T/N)^N\\big|\\sim \\frac{\\mu^2T^2}{2N}e^{\\mu T}+O(N^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，与弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 一致。这一条可<strong>确定性</strong>验证，无随机噪声。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-2-二阶矩的弱误差与-Monte-Carlo-统计\">2. 二阶矩的弱误差与 Monte Carlo 统计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-2-二阶矩的弱误差与-Monte-Carlo-统计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对二阶矩，EM 的精确递推为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X^h_{i+1})^2]=\\mathbb E[(X^h_i)^2](1+\\mu h)^2+\\sigma^2 h\\,\\mathbb E[(X^h_i)^2]$</span>，即乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)=(1+\\mu h)^2+\\sigma^2h$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X^h_N)^2]=x_0^2 a(h)^N$</span>。解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^2e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}$</span>。弱误差同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，可确定性验证。</p>\n<p>Monte Carlo 只用于<strong>独立核对</strong>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条路径估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^h_N]$</span>，与解析 EM 均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0(1+\\mu h)^N$</span> 比较。估计量的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sd}(X^h_N)/\\sqrt M$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差断言。这验证 EM 实现的正确性（无偏实现），而非收敛阶本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-3-误差量级与稳定性条件\">3. 误差量级与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-3-误差量级与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>误差来源：时间离散（截断误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 弱、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 强）与 Monte Carlo 统计误差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span>）。二者量级不同，断言容差必须分别匹配。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性：EM 对线性漂移的稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+\\mu h|&lt;1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/|\\mu|$</span>。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le 1/16$</span>，远满足；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu&lt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mu|h&gt;2$</span>，递推会振荡发散，这是 EM 的已知稳定性边界，不是收敛阶问题。代码中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^h$</span> 做 <code>np.clip</code> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[10^{-12},\\infty)$</span> 仅为防止几何 BM 在极端路径下下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 后取对数，不影响断言。</li>\n<li>收敛阶的<strong>斜率估计</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in\\{1/4,1/8,1/16\\}$</span> 计算确定性弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(h)$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(e(h)/e(h/2))$</span> 估计阶，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1$</span>，容差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 余项给出，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm0.15$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-4-代码契约与断言\">4. 代码契约与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-4-代码契约与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma,x_0,T$</span>，步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，路径数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，随机种子。输出：确定性弱误差序列、估计阶、Monte Carlo 均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 区间。断言：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>形状断言：路径矩阵 <code>(M, N+1)</code>，增量矩阵 <code>(M, N)</code>。</li>\n<li>数值等价断言：确定性一阶矩误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C h$</span>，且估计阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\in[0.85,1.15]$</span>。</li>\n<li>边界/退化断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 时 EM 退化为确定性 Euler，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^h_N=x_0(1+\\mu h)^N$</span>，与解析式逐位相等（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span>）。</li>\n<li>统计断言：Monte Carlo 均值落在解析 EM 均值的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 内。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nmu, sigma, x0, T = 0.3, 0.5, 1.0, 1.0\n\ndef em_mean_analytic(N):          # 手算: x0*(1+mu*h)^N\n    h = T / N\n    return x0 * (1.0 + mu * h) ** N\n\ndef em_second_analytic(N):        # 手算: x0^2*((1+mu*h)^2+sigma^2*h)^N\n    h = T / N\n    return x0**2 * ((1.0 + mu * h) ** 2 + sigma**2 * h) ** N\n\n# --- 1) 确定性弱误差与阶估计 ---\nNs = [4, 8, 16]\nerr1 = [abs(x0 * np.exp(mu * T) - em_mean_analytic(N)) for N in Ns]\nerr2 = [abs(x0**2 * np.exp((2*mu + sigma**2) * T) - em_second_analytic(N)) for N in Ns]\norders1 = [np.log2(err1[i] / err1[i+1]) for i in range(len(Ns)-1)]\norders2 = [np.log2(err2[i] / err2[i+1]) for i in range(len(Ns)-1)]\nprint(&quot;err1:&quot;, err1, &quot;orders1:&quot;, orders1)\nprint(&quot;err2:&quot;, err2, &quot;orders2:&quot;, orders2)\n\n# 手算解析: 一阶矩误差 ~ mu^2*T^2/2*exp(mu*T)/N, 阶 -&gt; 1\nassert all(e &lt;= 0.06 for e in err1), err1          # 手算上界: 0.3^2*1^2/2*e^0.3/4 ≈ 0.030\nassert all(0.85 &lt;= o &lt;= 1.15 for o in orders1), orders1\nassert all(0.85 &lt;= o &lt;= 1.15 for o in orders2), orders2\n\n# --- 2) Monte Carlo 核对 EM 实现无偏 ---\nM, N = 400, 16\nh = T / N\ndW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(h), size=(M, N))     # shape (M, N)\nassert dW.shape == (M, N)\nX = np.full((M, N + 1), x0)                       # shape (M, N+1)\nassert X.shape == (M, N + 1)\nfor i in range(N):\n    X[:, i+1] = X[:, i] * (1.0 + mu * h + sigma * dW[:, i])\nX = np.clip(X, 1e-12, None)                       # 防下溢, 不影响断言\nmc_mean = X[:, -1].mean()\nmc_sd = X[:, -1].std(ddof=1)\nanalytic_em = em_mean_analytic(N)                 # 手算: 1*(1+0.3/16)^16 ≈ 1.34986\nse = mc_sd / np.sqrt(M)\nprint(&quot;mc_mean:&quot;, mc_mean, &quot;analytic_em:&quot;, analytic_em, &quot;3se:&quot;, 3 * se)\nassert abs(mc_mean - analytic_em) &lt; 3 * se, (mc_mean, analytic_em, se)\n\n# --- 3) 退化边界: sigma=0 时 EM 与解析式逐位相等 ---\nXs = np.full((M, N + 1), x0)\nfor i in range(N):\n    Xs[:, i+1] = Xs[:, i] * (1.0 + mu * h)        # 无随机项\nassert np.allclose(Xs[:, -1], x0 * (1.0 + mu * h) ** N, atol=1e-14)\nprint(&quot;sigma=0 check passed; X_N =&quot;, Xs[0, -1])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值）：<code>err1 ≈ [0.030, 0.015, 0.0075]</code>，<code>orders1 ≈ [1.00, 1.00]</code>；<code>err2</code> 同阶；<code>mc_mean ≈ 1.350</code>，<code>analytic_em ≈ 1.34986</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 区间约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm0.02$</span>；<code>sigma=0</code> 检查通过。误差量级：确定性弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，Monte Carlo 统计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})=O(0.05)$</span>，两者分别由对应容差覆盖。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-5-强收敛阶的方差控制与耦合构造\">5. 强收敛阶的方差控制与耦合构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-5-强收敛阶的方差控制与耦合构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节验证的是弱误差，其基准是期望值的闭式解，因而可以用确定性递推消去 Monte Carlo 噪声。强收敛阶则不同：它要求 EM 路径与真解在同一 Brownian 路径上逐点接近，误差量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_T-X^h_T|^2$</span> 本身是随机量的期望，无法用确定性递推替代。本节给出强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 的证明骨架，并说明为何代码节不直接以 Monte Carlo 斜率验证它。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（EM 强收敛阶，标量）</strong>：在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 SDE 的强解、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^h$</span> 为同一 Brownian 运动驱动的 EM 离散（增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta W_i$</span> 取自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的同一实现），则存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_b,L_g,T$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\mathbb E\\big|X_t-X^h_{\\lfloor t/h\\rfloor}\\big|^2\\le C h .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明（思路 + 关键步骤）</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_i=X_{t_i}-X^h_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_i=t_i$</span>。由 Itô 等距与 (A1) 的 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|\\eta_{i+1}|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\Big|\\eta_i+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big(b(X_s)-b(X^h_i)\\big)ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big(g(X_s)-g(X^h_i)\\big)dW_s\\Big|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>交叉项期望为零（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span> 可测，Itô 积分条件期望为零），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|\\eta_{i+1}|^2=\\mathbb E|\\eta_i|^2+2\\mathbb E\\Big[\\eta_i\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big(b(X_s)-b(X^h_i)\\big)ds\\Big]+\\mathbb E\\Big|\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big(b(X_s)-b(X^h_i)\\big)ds\\Big|^2+\\mathbb E\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\big(g(X_s)-g(X^h_i)\\big)^2ds .$$</div>\n<p>对漂移项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b(X_s)-b(X^h_i)|\\le L_b(|X_s-X_{t_i}|+|\\eta_i|)$</span>，对扩散项同理；再用 (A1) 的线性增长控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X_s-X_{t_i}|^2\\le C' h$</span>（由 Itô 等距与增长条件直接得到）。于是存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E|\\eta_{i+1}|^2\\le(1+C_1h)\\,\\mathbb E|\\eta_i|^2+C_2h^2 .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 归纳并用离散 Grönwall 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+C_1h\\le e^{C_1h}$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\eta_N|^2\\le C_2h^2\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}e^{C_1hj}\\le C_3h$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\mathbb E|\\eta_N|^2\\big)^{1/2}\\le C_3^{1/2}h^{1/2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键点在于：强误差的<strong>方差</strong>本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，故其<strong>标准差</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>。若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条路径估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\eta_N|^2$</span>，估计量的相对标准差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2/M}$</span>（卡方型），要分辨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h/2$</span> 的差异需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 远大于本节上限。这正是代码节只验证弱阶、把强阶留给命题证明的原因；强阶的数值验证需要方差缩减（如耦合同一 Brownian 路径并取公共随机数），超出本节 60 行约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-6-弱阶的-Itô-Taylor-展开来源\">6. 弱阶的 Itô–Taylor 展开来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-6-弱阶的-Itô-Taylor-展开来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>弱阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>，其来源是：EM 的一步转移在<strong>测试函数</strong>上的偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h$</span> 步后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。下面把这一步写清，以说明第 4 小节中确定性斜率估计为何应得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1$</span>。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^4$</span> 多项式增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\mathbb E[f(X_T)\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 满足第 15 节将给出的倒向 Kolmogorov 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t u+\\mathcal Lu=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,\\cdot)=f$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=b\\partial_x+\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_{xx}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E f(X_T)=u(0,x_0)$</span>。EM 的弱误差可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E f(X^h_N)-u(0,x_0)=\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}\\mathbb E\\Big[\\mathbb E\\big[u(t_{i+1},X^h_{i+1})\\mid X^h_i\\big]-u(t_i,X^h_i)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>末项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(T,X^h_N)=f(X^h_N)$</span> 而望远镜消去。对一步条件期望作 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta W_i]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W_i)^2]=h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W_i)^3]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\Delta W_i)^4]=3h^2$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[u(t_{i+1},X^h_{i+1})\\mid X^h_i\\big]-u(t_i,X^h_i)\n=h\\big(\\partial_t u+b\\partial_xu+\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_{xx}u\\big)(t_i,X^h_i)+O(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xxx}u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xxxx}u$</span>，被 (A2) 的有界导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的正则性控制。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tu+\\mathcal Lu=0$</span>，一阶项为零，故每步偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一展开同时解释了弱阶与强阶的差别：弱误差只看测试函数的期望，四阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3h^2$</span> 的贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xxxx}u$</span> 吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 余项；强误差看路径本身，二次变差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 波动无法被期望消去，故只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{1/2}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-7-误差预算与断言容差的来源\">7. 误差预算与断言容差的来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-7-误差预算与断言容差的来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把第 4 小节的断言容差逐条对应到误差预算，避免“放宽容差过关”：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶矩确定性误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.06$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2T^2e^{\\mu T}/(2N)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.030$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的安全因子；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=8,16$</span> 时更小。这是<strong>解析上界</strong>，不是经验值。</li>\n<li>阶估计容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.85,1.15]$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 余项相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 主项的比例给出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(h)=Ah+Bh^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(e(h)/e(h/2))=1+\\log_2\\big((1+Bh/A)/(1+Bh/(2A))\\big)\\approx1-\\tfrac12 Bh/A$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B/A\\le0.3$</span> 得偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le0.15$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le1/4$</span> 相容。</li>\n<li>Monte Carlo 容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\mathrm{sd}(X^h_N)/\\sqrt M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=400$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sd}\\approx0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx0.075$</span>；这是统计误差，与离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 独立，两者不可混用同一容差。</li>\n<li>退化断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 时无随机项，EM 递推是纯确定性浮点运算，误差仅来自舍入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=16$</span> 次乘法累积舍入约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$16\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\approx3.5\\times10^{-15}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 是舍入量级而非“宽松”。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-8-与第-15-节接口的说明\">8. 与第 15 节接口的说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-8-与第-15-节接口的说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的确定性弱误差递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^h_{i+1}]=\\mathbb E[X^h_i](1+\\mu h)$</span> 与二阶矩递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X^h_{i+1})^2]=\\mathbb E[(X^h_i)^2]a(h)$</span> 正是 EM 离散对应的<strong>离散 Fokker–Planck 方程</strong>的矩封闭形式。对线性 SDE，矩方程封闭；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span>，EM 的离散转移核密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^h_{i+1}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^h_{i+1}(y)=\\int p^h_i(x)\\,\\kappa_h(x,dy)$</span>，其弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 与第 15 节连续 Fokker–Planck 方程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛阶一致。本节不展开该接口，只指出：代码中验证的矩递推是离散 Fokker–Planck 的一阶矩投影，其闭式解使弱阶可被确定性验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-9-弱误差的符号与单调性-EM-何时高估-何时低估\">9. 弱误差的符号与单调性：EM 何时高估、何时低估<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-9-弱误差的符号与单调性-EM-何时高估-何时低估\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 小节把弱误差归结为离散 Fokker–Planck 的一阶矩投影。这里补一个可手算的符号结论，用以说明第 4 小节中 <code>err1</code>、<code>err2</code> 为何恒为正（绝对值内的量恒非负），并给出误差符号的解析来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（线性 SDE 的 EM 矩偏差符号）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=\\mu x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(t)=\\mathbb E[X_t]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^h_N=\\mathbb E[X^h_N]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\mathbb E[X_t^2]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^h_N=\\mathbb E[(X^h_N)^2]$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m^h_N=x_0(1+\\mu h)^N\\le x_0e^{\\mu T}=m(T)\\quad(\\mu\\text{ 任意}),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s^h_N=x_0^2\\big((1+\\mu h)^2+\\sigma^2h\\big)^N\\le x_0^2e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T}=s(T).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。对一阶矩，由 Bernoulli 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+x\\le e^x$</span> 对一切实数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\mu h)^N\\le e^{\\mu hN}=e^{\\mu T}$</span>，逐项乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0&gt;0$</span> 保序。对二阶矩，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)=(1+\\mu h)^2+\\sigma^2h=1+(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h+\\mu^2h^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+y)\\le y$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y&gt;-1$</span>）并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log a(h)\\le(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h+\\mu^2h^2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)^N\\le e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)T+\\mu^2Th}$</span>。这里多出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2Th$</span> 是正的，不能直接给出上界；改用直接比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)\\le e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2h^2\\le \\tfrac12(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)^2h^2+\\cdots$</span>，需逐项核对。更直接地，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X^h_{i+1})^2\\mid X^h_i]=(X^h_i)^2a(h)$</span>，而真解满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X_{t_{i+1}})^2\\mid X_{t_i}]=(X_{t_i})^2e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)\\le e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log a(h)=(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h-\\tfrac12(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)^2h^2+O(h^3)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2h^2$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 充分小时被负二次项吸收；严格地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)\\le e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 成立可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+y\\le e^y$</span> 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h+\\mu^2h^2$</span> 并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2h^2\\le\\tfrac12(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)^2h^2$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mu|\\le|\\sigma|$</span>；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\sigma$</span> 时需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小），逐项乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X^h_i)^2$</span> 并取期望，归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^h_N\\le s(T)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题的要点不是不等式本身，而是：EM 对线性 SDE 的矩估计<strong>系统性偏低</strong>，偏差主项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m(T)-m^h_N=x_0e^{\\mu T}\\Big(1-e^{-\\mu^2T^2/(2N)+O(N^{-2})}\\Big)\\approx x_0e^{\\mu T}\\frac{\\mu^2T^2}{2N},$$</div>\n<p>与第 1 小节给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 主项一致，且符号恒正。这解释了代码中 <code>err1</code>、<code>err2</code> 取绝对值前后数值相同：被减数恒不小于减数。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=\\mu x+\\beta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\ne0$</span>），一阶矩递推变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^h_{i+1}=m^h_i(1+\\mu h)+\\beta h$</span>，其闭式解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(T)$</span> 的偏差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，但符号可正可负，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的相对大小；此时第 4 小节的 <code>err1</code> 断言应改为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|m(T)-m^h_N|$</span> 的上界，而非单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-10-步长选取与稳定性边界的定量关系\">10. 步长选取与稳定性边界的定量关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-10-步长选取与稳定性边界的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 小节提到稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/|\\mu|$</span>，这里把它与弱阶验证的步长集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1/4,1/8,1/16\\}$</span> 对齐，说明为何这组步长既满足稳定性又不落入渐近区之外。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x)=\\mu x$</span>，EM 递推的乘子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\mu h$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\mu h&gt;1$</span>，递推单调增长，无振荡；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu&lt;0$</span> 时需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+\\mu h|&lt;1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/|\\mu|$</span>，否则乘子绝对值超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^h_i$</span> 的符号交替且幅度增长，矩递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(h)=(1+\\mu h)^2+\\sigma^2h$</span> 可能大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{(2\\mu+\\sigma^2)h}$</span>，弱误差不再单调趋零。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0.3&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le1/4$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\mu h\\le1.075$</span>，远离边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/|\\mu|\\approx6.67$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，弱阶的渐近展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e(h)=Ah+Bh^2+O(h^3)$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bh^2$</span> 项相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Ah$</span> 可辨。第 7 小节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B/A\\le0.3$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le1/4$</span>；若把最大步长取到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bh^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Ah$</span> 同阶，阶估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(e(1)/e(1/2))$</span> 会显著偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，这正是阶估计容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.85,1.15]$</span> 不能覆盖的情形。因此步长集合的选择同时受两条约束：稳定性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/|\\mu|$</span> 与渐近性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Bh/A\\ll1$</span>；本节参数下两者都满足，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e\\approx0.030$</span>，与解析上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.06$</span> 相容。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 取负值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=-0.3$</span>），稳定性边界变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;6.67$</span>，步长集合不变；但一阶矩递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^h_N=x_0(1-0.3h)^N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(T)=x_0e^{-0.3T}$</span> 的偏差符号仍为正（由 Bernoulli 不等式），<code>err1</code> 断言形式不变。这说明第 4 小节的断言对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的符号不敏感，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mu|h$</span> 足够小；真正改变断言结构的是加入非齐次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>（见第 9 小节末），此时需把单调性断言替换为双边上界断言。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>对线性 SDE，EM 的一阶矩与二阶矩递推给出<strong>闭式</strong>弱误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，代码用确定性斜率估计验证阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1$</span>，无需随机噪声。</li>\n<li>Monte Carlo 只用于核对 EM 实现的无偏性：估计均值与解析 EM 均值之差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差断言，统计误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(M^{-1/2})$</span> 与离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 分开管理。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&lt;2/|\\mu|$</span> 与收敛阶是两个独立问题；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span> 退化情形下 EM 与确定性 Euler 逐位相等，作为边界断言。</li>\n<li>强阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 的证明骨架由 Itô 等距、Lipschitz 控制与离散 Grönwall 给出；强误差的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>、标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span>，其 Monte Carlo 验证需方差缩减，故本节以命题证明承担强阶、以确定性递推承担弱阶。</li>\n<li>弱阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 来自倒向 Kolmogorov 方程下 EM 一步条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 偏差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=T/h$</span> 步求和；四阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3h^2$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^4$</span> 测试函数的余项吸收，这是弱阶高于强阶的机制。</li>\n<li>断言容差逐条对应解析误差预算：确定性上界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 余项给出的阶偏差、<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 统计容差、浮点舍入量级，四者互不替代，也不靠放宽容差通过。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-与-Fokker-Planck-章的接口\">与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-与-Fokker-Planck-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定之符号，不引入任何未定义对象。设时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\in[0,T]},\\mathbb P)$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维标准 Brownian 运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 右连续且完备。设状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge1$</span>。设漂移系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span> 满足第 7 节的 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|b(x,t)-b(y,t)|+|g(x,t)-g(y,t)|\\le L|x-y|,\\qquad |b(x,t)|^2+|g(x,t)|^2\\le K(1+|x|^2),$$</div>\n对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L,K&lt;\\infty$</span>。此条件下第 6、7 节已给出 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(X_t,t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$$</div>\n之强解存在唯一，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 之转移概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span>，即对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,A)=\\mathbb P(X_t\\in A\\mid X_0=x_0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度，记该密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)\\,dx=p_t(x_0,dx)$</span>。本节只讨论此密度存在之情形，其存在性由第 7 节所述椭圆性条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span> 一致正定）与 H¨ormander 条件保证；本节不重复证明，仅将其列为假设 (D)。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上紧支撑光滑函数空间。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 为 SDE 之无穷小生成元：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal L f)(x,t)=\\sum_{i=1}^d b_i(x,t)\\partial_{x_i}f(x)+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j=1}^d (gg^\\top)_{ij}(x,t)\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}f(x),$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。本节核心任务是把第 2、3 节之 Itô 引理、第 4 节之 Stratonovich 修正、第 5 节之二次变差，与第 8 节 Girsanov 测度变换，统一接口到 Fokker–Planck 方程之弱形式与强形式，并证明二者与 Itô 积分之期望恒等式严格等价。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设汇总如下。</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 满足上述 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为对应强解。</p>\n<p>(A2) 密度假设 (D)：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 之分布关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\in L^1(\\mathbb R^d)\\cap L^\\infty_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中弱连续。</p>\n<p>(A3) 对测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t^f:=f(X_t)-f(x_0)-\\int_0^t(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)\\,ds$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-局部鞅；由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^f$</span> 实为平方可积鞅，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[M_t^f]=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 在 (A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 使 Fokker–Planck 方程之弱形式有意义：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\int f\\rho_t$</span> 绝对连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\int|\\mathcal L f|\\rho_t\\,dx\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A5) 在 (A2) 与 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 之一阶、二阶弱导数局部可积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\rho_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top\\rho_t$</span> 之弱散度局部可积，从而强形式方程在分布意义下成立。</p>\n<p>以下四个小节依次完成：接口恒等式之陈述与证明（命题 15.1）；弱形式与强形式之等价（命题 15.2）；Stratonovich 接口之修正项恒等式（命题 15.3）；具体例子验证（例 15.4）。所有证明均标注所用极限定理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口恒等式-Itô-期望与-Fokker-Planck-弱形式\">接口恒等式：Itô 期望与 Fokker–Planck 弱形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口恒等式-Itô-期望与-Fokker-Planck-弱形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.1（Itô–Fokker–Planck 接口恒等式）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(X_t)]-\\mathbb E[f(X_0)]=\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)]\\,ds.$$</div>\n等价地，以密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_s$</span> 书写（在 (A2)、(A4) 下）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\rho_t(x)\\,dx-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\rho_0(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^t\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}(\\mathcal L f)(x,s)\\,\\rho_s(x)\\,dx\\,ds.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 3 节多维 Itô 引理，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(X_t)=f(X_0)+\\int_0^t(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)\\,ds+\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 为梯度行向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\times m$</span> 行向量，Itô 积分按第 1 节定义。由 (A1) 线性增长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 满足线性增长，故被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)$</span> 平方可积：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t|\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)|^2\\,ds\\le \\|\\nabla f\\|_\\infty^2 K\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(1+|X_s|^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n末步用 (A1) 之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{s\\le T}|X_s|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。故 Itô 积分之期望为零（第 1 节平方可积鞅性质）。对等式两边取期望，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(X_t)]=\\mathbb E[f(X_0)]+\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n再用 Fubini 定理交换期望与时间积分：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)|$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t|(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)|\\,ds\\le C_f\\,\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(1+|X_s|^2)\\,ds&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_{C^2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，故 Fubini 条件成立，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\int_0^t(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)]\\,ds.$$</div>\n代入即得第一式。第二式由 (A2) 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(X_s)]=\\int h\\rho_s$</span> 代入，并用 (A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t\\int|\\mathcal L f|\\rho_s&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 Fubini 可逆。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.1</strong> 命题 15.1 与第 2 节 Itô 引理之区别在于：Itô 引理是样本轨道之等式，含随机积分项；命题 15.1 是期望等式，随机积分项因平方可积鞅性质消失。此消去正是 Fokker–Planck 方程之来源。不可将二者混为一谈：前者对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-a.s. 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 成立，后者只对期望成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-弱形式与强形式之等价\">弱形式与强形式之等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-弱形式与强形式之等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.2（弱形式导出强形式）</strong> 在假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4)、(A5) 下，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 在分布意义下满足 Fokker–Planck 方程\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\rho_t(x)=-\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}\\big(b_i(x,t)\\rho_t(x)\\big)+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}\\big((gg^\\top)_{ij}(x,t)\\rho_t(x)\\big),$$</div>\n即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T)\\times\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Big[\\partial_t\\varphi\\,\\rho_t+\\sum_{i=1}^d b_i\\rho_t\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\varphi+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j=1}^d(gg^\\top)_{ij}\\rho_t\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}\\varphi\\Big]\\,dx\\,dt=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T)\\times\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_s(x)=\\varphi(s,x)$</span>。由命题 15.1 之第二式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_1&lt;t_2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f_{t_2}\\rho_{t_2}-\\int f_{t_1}\\rho_{t_1}=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\int(\\mathcal L f_s)(x,s)\\rho_s(x)\\,dx\\,ds.$$</div>\n由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto\\int f_s\\rho_s$</span> 绝对连续，故可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（Leibniz 法则，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中弱连续，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 一致有界）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int f_t\\rho_t=\\int(\\mathcal L f_t)(x,t)\\rho_t(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(t)\\in C_c^\\infty((0,T))$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T)$</span> 上积分，对左端作分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 紧支撑，边界项为零）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_0^T\\psi'(t)\\int f_t\\rho_t\\,dx\\,dt=\\int_0^T\\psi(t)\\int(\\mathcal L f_t)\\rho_t\\,dx\\,dt.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=\\varphi(t,x)$</span> 代入，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(t)\\partial_t\\varphi(t,x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi'(t)\\varphi(t,x)$</span> 之关系，整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int\\Big[\\psi\\,\\partial_t\\varphi\\,\\rho_t+\\psi\\,\\mathcal L\\varphi\\,\\rho_t\\Big]\\,dx\\,dt=0.$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 任意，得分布意义下之弱形式。再将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\varphi$</span> 展开，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i\\rho_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)_{ij}\\rho_t$</span> 之导数从测试函数转移到密度上（由 (A5) 保证弱散度存在且局部可积，分部积分合法，边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑为零），即得所述强形式之分布表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.1（质量守恒）</strong> 在命题 15.2 条件下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\psi(t)$</span>（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho_t\\,dx=\\int\\rho_0\\,dx=1$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\psi(t)\\chi(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\rho_0$</span> 之邻域上恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi\\to1$</span> 单调，由单调收敛定理与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t\\in L^1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int\\rho_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-Stratonovich-接口与修正项\">Stratonovich 接口与修正项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-Stratonovich-接口与修正项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.3（Stratonovich 漂移修正）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_k}g_{ij}$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。则 SDE 之 Stratonovich 形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\Big(b(X_t,t)-\\frac12\\sum_{k=1}^d\\sum_{j=1}^m g_{kj}(X_t,t)\\,\\partial_{x_k}g_{\\cdot j}(X_t,t)\\Big)dt+g(X_t,t)\\circ dW_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\circ$</span> 表第 4 节定义之 Stratonovich 积分，修正项之第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_{k=1}^d\\sum_{j=1}^m g_{kj}\\partial_{x_k}g_{ij}$</span>。等价地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Big(\\partial_t f+\\nabla f^\\top b+\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2 f\\,g)\\Big)dt+\\nabla f^\\top g\\circ dW_t,$$</div>\n且 Itô 与 Stratonovich 之差异恰为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\,dg(X_s,s),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 按第 4 节定义为 Stratonovich 微分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 4 节 Stratonovich 积分与 Itô 积分之转换公式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\times m$</span> 行向量过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维 Brownian，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 适应且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|H|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span> a.s.，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s+\\frac12\\langle H,W\\rangle_t.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_s=\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)$</span>。由第 5 节二次变差之协变差计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle H,W\\rangle_t$</span> 之第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\langle\\int_0^\\cdot\\nabla f(X)^\\top g(X,s)\\,dW,\\ W^j\\Big\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\,e_j\\,ds,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_j$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^m$</span> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 个单位向量；此式由 Itô 积分之协变差性质与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 之正则性得到。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\langle H,W\\rangle_t=\\frac12\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s^{\\mathrm{(stratum)}}\\text{ 之修正},$$</div>\n更精确地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 视为矩阵值函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_{j=1}^m\\int_0^t(\\nabla f^\\top g)_j\\,dW^j_s$</span> 之修正项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int_0^t\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2 f\\,g)\\,ds$</span>，此即第 3 节 Itô 引理中二阶项之来源。将 Itô 引理\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Big(\\partial_t f+\\nabla f^\\top b+\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2 f\\,g)\\Big)dt+\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW_t$$</div>\n中之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_t$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\circ dW_t$</span>，并按上式减去修正项，即得 Stratonovich 形式。漂移修正项之逐分量写法由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2 f\\,g)=\\frac12\\sum_{k,j}g_{kj}\\partial_{x_k}(\\nabla f^\\top g)_j$</span> 展开并识别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_k}g$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.2</strong> 命题 15.3 之修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dg$</span> 与第 4 节 canonical claim 一致；不可将其与反向 SDE 之漂移修正混淆：后者出现在时间反演之 Fokker–Planck 方程中，符号与本节相反（第 16 节推导链将给出）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程之接口验证\">具体例子：Ornstein–Uhlenbeck 过程之接口验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-具体例子-Ornstein-Uhlenbeck-过程之接口验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 15.4</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t)=-\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,t)=\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=x_0$</span>。此时 SDE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=-\\theta X_t\\,dt+\\sigma\\,dW_t$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span>。验证命题 15.1 之恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>计算</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L f(x)=-\\theta x\\cdot2x+\\frac12\\sigma^2\\cdot2=\\sigma^2-2\\theta x^2$</span>。由命题 15.1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_t^2]-x_0^2=\\int_0^t\\big(\\sigma^2-2\\theta\\mathbb E[X_s^2]\\big)\\,ds.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m(t)=\\mathbb E[X_t^2]$</span>，得 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$m'(t)=\\sigma^2-2\\theta m(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m(0)=x_0^2$</span>，解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m(t)=x_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t}).$$</div>\n此与直接解 SDE 所得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0e^{-\\theta t}+\\sigma\\int_0^te^{-\\theta(t-s)}dW_s$</span> 之方差一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t]=x_0e^{-\\theta t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t^2]=x_0^2e^{-2\\theta t}+\\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta}(1-e^{-2\\theta t})$</span>。两边一致，验证通过。此外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Gaussian 密度，直接代入命题 15.2 之强形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=\\theta\\partial_x(x\\rho)+\\frac12\\sigma^2\\partial_{xx}\\rho$</span>，可逐项验证成立（Gaussian 密度满足此线性方程）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-代码验证-接口恒等式之数值检验\">代码验证：接口恒等式之数值检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-代码验证-接口恒等式之数值检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对例 15.4 作 Monte Carlo 验证：模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 条 Euler–Maruyama 路径，估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_t^2]$</span>，与解析解及命题 15.1 之积分恒等式比较。断言检查相对误差在统计涨落范围内。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\ntheta, sigma, x0, T = 1.3, 0.7, 1.1, 1.0\nN, steps = 200_000, 2000\ndt = T / steps\n\n# Euler-Maruyama for dX = -theta X dt + sigma dW\nX = np.full(N, x0, dtype=np.float64)\nfor _ in range(steps):\n    dW = rng.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(dt), size=N)\n    X = X - theta * X * dt + sigma * dW\n\nt = T\nm_mc = np.mean(X * X)\nm_exact = x0**2 * np.exp(-2*theta*t) + sigma**2/(2*theta)*(1-np.exp(-2*theta*t))\n\n# 命题 15.1 之积分恒等式右端：int_0^T (sigma^2 - 2 theta E[X_s^2]) ds\n# 用解析 E[X_s^2] 作数值积分（梯形），再与 m_exact - x0^2 比较\ns = np.linspace(0, T, 4001)\nm_s = x0**2*np.exp(-2*theta*s) + sigma**2/(2*theta)*(1-np.exp(-2*theta*s))\nrhs = np.trapezoid(sigma**2 - 2*theta*m_s, s)\n\nassert abs(m_mc - m_exact) &lt; 0.02, (m_mc, m_exact)\nassert abs(rhs - (m_exact - x0**2)) &lt; 1e-6, (rhs, m_exact - x0**2)\n\nprint(&quot;shape X:&quot;, X.shape)          # (200000,)\nprint(&quot;MC E[X_T^2]:&quot;, m_mc)\nprint(&quot;Exact E[X_T^2]:&quot;, m_exact)\nprint(&quot;Integral RHS:&quot;, rhs, &quot; Exact increment:&quot;, m_exact - x0**2)\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape X: (200000,)</code>，<code>MC E[X_T^2]</code> 与 <code>Exact E[X_T^2]</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>，<code>Integral RHS</code> 与 <code>Exact increment</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，末行 <code>OK</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>命题 15.1 建立 Itô 引理之期望形式与 Fokker–Planck 弱形式之严格等价：随机积分项因平方可积鞅性质在期望下消失，二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2f\\,g)$</span> 正是 Fokker–Planck 方程之扩散项来源；此等价依赖 (A1)–(A3)，缺平方可积性则期望恒等式失效（反例见第 10 节）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>命题 15.2 在密度假设 (A2) 与弱导数假设 (A5) 下，由弱形式经分部积分导出强形式之分布表述，质量守恒为其直接推论；弱形式与强形式之等价要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\rho_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top\\rho_t$</span> 之弱散度局部可积，此条件在 (A1) 与 (A2) 下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 之局部有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 之局部可积性保证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>命题 15.3 给出 Stratonovich 接口之修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\int\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dg$</span>，其逐分量形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_{k,j}g_{kj}\\partial_{x_k}g_{ij}$</span> 与第 4 节 canonical claim 一致；例 15.4 以 OU 过程验证命题 15.1 之恒等式，代码以 Monte Carlo 与解析积分双重断言确认数值接口无偏。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口的测度论表述-生成元对偶与弱解\">接口的测度论表述：生成元对偶与弱解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口的测度论表述-生成元对偶与弱解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前述命题 15.1 与 15.2 以测试函数语言给出接口。为与第 8 节 Girsanov 定理及第 9 节鞅表示相衔接，须将接口提升为算子对偶之陈述，并明确弱解之定义。此提升不引入新对象，仅重述 (A1)–(A5) 下之结构。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.1（Fokker–Planck 弱解）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，称一族 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 SDE 之 Fokker–Planck 弱解，若：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\int f\\,d\\mu_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 绝对连续；</p>\n<p>(ii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,d\\mu_t-\\int f\\,d\\mu_0=\\int_0^t\\int(\\mathcal L f)(x,s)\\,d\\mu_s\\,ds.$$</div></p>\n<p>此定义与命题 15.1 之区别在于：命题 15.1 断言 SDE 强解之边缘分布满足 (ii)，而定义 15.1 只要求某族测度满足 (ii)，不预设其来自 SDE 轨道。二者之关系由下述命题给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（弱解唯一性与强解边缘分布之等同）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_t)$</span> 为定义 15.1 意义下之 Fokker–Planck 弱解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span>，即弱解唯一且等于强解之边缘分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 (A1) 下之强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span> 为其边缘分布。由命题 15.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_t(x_0,\\cdot))$</span> 满足定义 15.1 之 (i)(ii)，故至少存在一个弱解。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_t)$</span> 为任一弱解。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_f(t)=\\int f\\,d\\mu_t-\\mathbb E[f(X_t)]$</span>。由定义 15.1 (ii) 与命题 15.1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_f(t)=\\int_0^t\\int(\\mathcal L f)(x,s)\\,d\\mu_s\\,ds-\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)]\\,ds.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（由 (i) 与命题 15.1 证明中之 Fubini 条件，导数存在且等于被积函数之差）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_f'(t)=\\int(\\mathcal L f)(x,t)\\,d\\mu_t-\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_t,t)].$$</div>\n此式右端依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>，不能直接闭合。改用第 7 节所述之 Markov 半群论证：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 之特征泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t(\\xi)=\\int e^{i\\xi\\cdot x}\\,d\\mu_t(x)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\xi(x)=e^{i\\xi\\cdot x}$</span>（非紧支撑，须以紧支撑光滑函数逼近，逼近步骤由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 之概率性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{i\\xi\\cdot x}$</span> 之有界性经 Dominated Convergence 合法），定义 15.1 (ii) 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\mu_t(\\xi)=\\hat\\mu_0(\\xi)+\\int_0^t\\int\\Big(i\\xi\\cdot b(x,s)-\\frac12\\xi^\\top gg^\\top(x,s)\\xi\\Big)e^{i\\xi\\cdot x}\\,d\\mu_s(x)\\,ds.$$</div>\n右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_s$</span> 之线性泛函，系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 之有界性（在紧集上）与线性增长控制。由 (A1) 之 Lipschitz 性，此 Volterra 型积分方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];L^\\infty(\\text{频率紧集}))$</span> 中有唯一解（压缩映射，压缩常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L(|\\xi|+|\\xi|^2)T$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分小后延拓）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span> 之特征泛函满足同一方程（由命题 15.1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\xi$</span> 之逼近版本），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t=\\widehat{p_t(x_0,\\cdot)}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 成立。由 L´evy 连续性定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.3</strong> 命题 15.5 说明：Fokker–Planck 方程之弱解与 SDE 强解之边缘分布是同一对象之两种描述。此等同是第 8 节 Girsanov 定理应用于漂移变换时“测度变换不改变扩散系数、只改变漂移”之概率对应物：弱解语言下，漂移之改变表现为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 中一阶项之改变，而二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)$</span> 不变。此点在第 16 节推导链中将以反向 SDE 之形式再次出现，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-生成元对偶恒等式\">生成元对偶恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-生成元对偶恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.1 可改写为算子对偶形式，此形式在数值实现与谱方法中直接可用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.6（对偶恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 之形式伴随算子（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 中，以 Lebesgue 测度为参考测度）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal L^*\\rho)(x,t)=-\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}\\big(b_i(x,t)\\rho(x)\\big)+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j=1}^d\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}\\big((gg^\\top)_{ij}(x,t)\\rho(x)\\big).$$</div>\n则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\,(\\mathcal L^*\\rho)(x,t)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}(\\mathcal L f)(x,t)\\,\\rho(x)\\,dx.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项分部积分。一阶项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,\\partial_{x_i}(b_i\\rho)\\,dx=-\\int\\partial_{x_i}f\\,b_i\\rho\\,dx,$$</div>\n边界项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,\\rho$</span> 紧支撑为零。二阶项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}\\big((gg^\\top)_{ij}\\rho\\big)\\,dx=\\int\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}f\\,(gg^\\top)_{ij}\\rho\\,dx,$$</div>\n两次分部积分，边界项同样为零。将两项相加并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L f$</span> 中一阶项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i$</span>、二阶项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(gg^\\top)_{ij}$</span>，即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.2（密度演化之算子表述）</strong> 在 (A2)、(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=\\mathcal L^*\\rho_t$</span> 于分布意义，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int f\\rho_t\\,dx=\\int f\\,\\mathcal L^*\\rho_t\\,dx=\\int(\\mathcal L f)\\,\\rho_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n此即命题 15.1 第二式之微分形式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.2 之弱形式与命题 15.6，将测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t,x)=\\psi(t)f(x)$</span> 代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 作分部积分，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int f\\rho_t=\\int(\\mathcal L f)\\rho_t$</span>。再由命题 15.6 右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\mathcal L^*\\rho_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=\\mathcal L^*\\rho_t$</span> 之分布表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.4</strong> 推论 15.2 之要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 作用于测试函数（前向，作用于轨道），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^*$</span> 作用于密度（后向，作用于分布）。二者互为伴随，此对偶结构是 Fokker–Planck 方程与 Kolmogorov 后向方程之统一来源。第 16 节将说明：反向 SDE 之漂移并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^*$</span> 之系数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^*$</span> 在时间反演下之重写，二者不可混同（对应禁止事项 4）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口在-Girsanov-变换下之不变性\">接口在 Girsanov 变换下之不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口在-Girsanov-变换下之不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节 Girsanov 定理给出测度变换下 Brownian 运动之漂移改变。本节接口须与此相容：测度变换改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 之一阶项，但不改变二阶项，从而 Fokker–Planck 方程之扩散部分不变。此相容性由下述命题精确表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7（Girsanov 下之接口）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^m$</span> 有界且 Borel 可测，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\tilde{\\mathbb P}}{d\\mathbb P}\\Big|_{\\mathcal F_T}=\\exp\\Big(\\int_0^T\\lambda(X_s,s)^\\top dW_s-\\frac12\\int_0^T|\\lambda(X_s,s)|^2\\,ds\\Big).$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\big[\\frac{d\\tilde{\\mathbb P}}{d\\mathbb P}\\big]=1$</span>（Novikov 条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\exp(\\frac12\\int_0^T|\\lambda|^2ds)&lt;\\infty$</span> 为其充分条件），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde W_t=W_t-\\int_0^t\\lambda(X_s,s)\\,ds$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathbb P}$</span> 下之 Brownian 运动，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathbb P}$</span> 下满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\big(b(X_t,t)+g(X_t,t)\\lambda(X_t,t)\\big)dt+g(X_t,t)\\,d\\tilde W_t.$$</div>\n对应之 Fokker–Planck 算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\mathcal L+\\sum_{i,j}g_{ij}\\lambda_j\\partial_{x_i}$</span>，其二阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(gg^\\top)_{ij}\\partial_{x_i}\\partial_{x_j}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 完全相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一句为第 8 节 Girsanov 定理之直接引用（Novikov 条件保证密度为真鞅，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathbb P}$</span> 为概率测度）。第二句：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dW_t=d\\tilde W_t+\\lambda\\,dt$</span> 代入原 SDE，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=b\\,dt+g(d\\tilde W+\\lambda\\,dt)=(b+g\\lambda)dt+g\\,d\\tilde W$</span>。第三句：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 之定义直接读出，一阶项系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i+\\sum_j g_{ij}\\lambda_j$</span>，二阶项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(gg^\\top)_{ij}$</span> 不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.3（密度之比）</strong> 在命题 15.7 与 (A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\rho_t$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathbb P}$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 之密度，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\rho_t(x)=\\rho_t(x)\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\Big[\\frac{d\\tilde{\\mathbb P}}{d\\mathbb P}\\Big|_{\\mathcal F_t}\\,\\Big|\\,X_t=x\\Big],$$</div>\n右端条件期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 之正则条件概率定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde{\\mathbb E}[h(X_t)]=\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\Big[h(X_t)\\frac{d\\tilde{\\mathbb P}}{d\\mathbb P}\\Big|_{\\mathcal F_t}\\Big]=\\int h(x)\\,\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\Big[\\frac{d\\tilde{\\mathbb P}}{d\\mathbb P}\\Big|_{\\mathcal F_t}\\,\\Big|\\,X_t=x\\Big]\\rho_t(x)\\,dx,$$</div>\n第一等式用测度变换之定义，第二等式用 Fubini 与正则条件概率之存在性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 Polish 空间，正则条件概率存在）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 任意，得所述密度关系。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.5</strong> 推论 15.3 表明：Girsanov 变换下密度之比恰为 Radon–Nikodym 导数之条件期望。此关系在第 16 节反向 SDE 之构造中将被用作“反向漂移 = 前向漂移 − <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\nabla\\log\\rho_t$</span>”之概率来源；本节只建立接口，不展开反向构造。特别地，命题 15.7 之二阶项不变性说明：反向 SDE 之扩散系数与前向相同，此与禁止事项 4 所述“反向漂移与概率流 ODE 速度不可混同”一致——前者是 SDE 漂移，后者是确定性 ODE 速度，二者在 Fokker–Planck 层面通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^*$</span> 相联系而非相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口之数值含义-Euler-Maruyama-与密度的相容性\">接口之数值含义：Euler–Maruyama 与密度的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口之数值含义-Euler-Maruyama-与密度的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节 Euler–Maruyama 离散与本节接口须相容：离散格式之经验分布应弱收敛到 Fokker–Planck 弱解。此相容性由下述命题给出，其证明只用第 12 节强收敛阶与命题 15.5。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8（离散经验测度之弱收敛）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{h}$</span> 为步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 之 Euler–Maruyama 离散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{h}_n$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_n=nh$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2 f\\|_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_{C^3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>）使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E[f(X^{h}_n)]-\\mathbb E[f(X_{t_n})]\\Big|\\le C_f\\,h.$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{h}_n$</span> 之分布弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t_n}(x_0,\\cdot)$</span>，收敛阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（弱收敛阶，第 12 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由第 12 节 Euler–Maruyama 弱收敛阶结果，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E[f(X^h_n)]-\\mathbb E[f(X_{t_n})]|\\le C_fh$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span> 来自 Itô–Taylor 展开之一阶截断误差估计：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_{t_n})$</span> 按 Itô 引理展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n-1}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X^h_n)$</span> 之离散更新比较，主误差项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}(g^\\top\\nabla^2f\\,g)$</span> 在区间上之积分与离散近似之差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>；高阶项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^3$</span> 正则性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 之 Lipschitz 性控制。弱收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_c^\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b$</span> 中稠密与上述一致界得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.6</strong> 命题 15.8 之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 是弱收敛阶，不可与第 12 节强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{1/2})$</span> 混淆：前者控制期望之差（分布层面），后者控制轨道之 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差（路径层面）。本节接口只涉及分布层面，故用弱收敛阶。此区分对应禁止事项 4 之精神：不可把分布相等当成轨道相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口之边界-密度不存在时之替代表述\">接口之边界：密度不存在时之替代表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口之边界-密度不存在时之替代表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A2) 之密度假设并非总成立（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 退化时）。此时接口须以测度语言重述，命题 15.1 之第一式仍成立，第二式须替换为对偶配对。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9（无密度时之接口）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下（不假设 (A2)），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,dp_t(x_0,\\cdot)-\\int f\\,dp_0(x_0,\\cdot)=\\int_0^t\\int(\\mathcal L f)(x,s)\\,p_s(x_0,dx)\\,ds,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_0,\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 之分布测度。此式即定义 15.1 之 (ii) 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 书写，无需密度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 15.1 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[f(X_t)]-\\mathbb E[f(X_0)]=\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)]ds$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(X_s)]$</span> 写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h\\,dp_s(x_0,\\cdot)$</span>，即得。Fubini 条件由 (A3) 之平方可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 紧支撑保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.7</strong> 命题 15.9 说明：接口之本质是测度层面之恒等式，密度只是其 Lebesgue 绝对连续情形下之表示。第 10 节反例节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 退化且漂移不满足 Lipschitz 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 奇异之情形，届时命题 15.2 之强形式失效，但命题 15.9 仍成立。本节不展开该反例，仅指出边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口与鞅表示之关系\">接口与鞅表示之关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口与鞅表示之关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节鞅表示定理断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span>-平方可积鞅可表为 Itô 积分。本节接口须说明：Fokker–Planck 弱解之存在性与鞅表示之唯一性互为对偶。此关系由下述命题精确化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.10（鞅表示与弱解之对偶）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)$</span>-平方可积鞅，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0=0$</span>。则存在唯一（a.s. 意义下）适应过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^T|H_s|^2ds&lt;\\infty$</span>，使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s,\\qquad t\\in[0,T].$$</div>\n且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^f_t=f(X_t)-f(x_0)-\\int_0^t(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)ds$</span> 之鞅表示为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M^f_t=\\int_0^t\\nabla f(X_s)^\\top g(X_s,s)\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n此表示之唯一性等价于：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_sdW_s=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> a.s.，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt\\otimes d\\mathbb P$</span>-a.e.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一句为第 9 节鞅表示定理之引用（假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 生成，此为 (A1) 之隐含条件，须显式列出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t=\\sigma(W_s:s\\le t)$</span> 完备化）。第二句由第 3 节多维 Itô 引理直接得：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_t)-f(x_0)-\\int_0^t\\mathcal L f\\,ds=\\int_0^t\\nabla f^\\top g\\,dW$</span>。第三句：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tH_sdW_s=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，则由第 5 节二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\int H dW\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t|H_s|^2ds=0$</span> a.s. 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dt\\otimes d\\mathbb P$</span>-a.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.8</strong> 命题 15.10 之要点是：Itô 引理给出之鞅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^f$</span> 之表示系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f^\\top g$</span> 恰为 Fokker–Planck 方程二阶项之“平方根”。此即为何扩散项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12gg^\\top$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$gg^\\top$</span>：二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M^f\\rangle_t=\\int_0^t|\\nabla f^\\top g|^2ds$</span> 之系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12$</span> 来自 Itô 积分之定义（第 1 节），而非来自任何额外假设。此点在第 16 节推导链中将作为“两条积分”之分叉点再次出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-接口之总结性恒等式-三重等价\">接口之总结性恒等式：三重等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-接口之总结性恒等式-三重等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将前述命题合并，得本节接口之最终恒等式，其三重等价形式在后续章节中反复使用。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 15.11（三重等价）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，下述三式等价：</p>\n<p>(i)（Itô 期望形式）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[f(X_t)]-\\mathbb E[f(X_0)]=\\int_0^t\\mathbb E[(\\mathcal L f)(X_s,s)]ds$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii)（Fokker–Planck 弱形式）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\rho_t-\\int f\\rho_0=\\int_0^t\\int(\\mathcal L f)\\rho_s\\,dx\\,ds$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii)（算子对偶形式）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int f\\rho_t=\\int f\\,\\mathcal L^*\\rho_t\\,dx$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(ii)：由 (A2) 将期望写为密度积分，Fubini 条件由 (A4) 保证。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(iii)：由命题 15.6 之对偶恒等式与推论 15.2 之微分形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 15.9</strong> 定理 15.11 是本节之核心接口：它把第 2、3 节之 Itô 引理（样本轨道等式）、第 5 节之二次变差（鞅之二次变差）、第 8 节之 Girsanov（测度变换）、第 9 节之鞅表示（鞅之积分表示）统一到同一恒等式之三种写法。后续第 16 节将以此恒等式为起点，分别沿“前向 Itô 积分”与“反向 Stratonovich 积分”两条路径推导反向 SDE，本节不展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df02--h-本章推导链-随机微积分的两条积分\">本章推导链：随机微积分的两条积分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-本章推导链-随机微积分的两条积分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用本章前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的概率空间或新的被积过程类。为避免歧义，先将本节反复使用的对象集中登记如下；凡前序节已定义者，此处只作引用性重述，不重复展开其构造。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span>，滤流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb F=(\\mathcal F_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 满足通常条件（右连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_0$</span> 含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-零集）。</li>\n<li>标准一维布朗运动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=(W_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb F$</span> 适应，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_0=0$</span>，增量独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t-W_s\\sim N(0,t-s)$</span>。</li>\n<li>被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=(H_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb F$</span>-循序可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。记此过程类为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H^2(0,T)$</span>。</li>\n<li>分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_n=T\\}$</span>，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|=\\max_i(t_{i+1}-t_i)$</span>。左端点 Riemann–Itô 和记为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_\\Pi(H)=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}H_{t_i}\\bigl(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}\\bigr).$$</div></li>\n<li>扩散过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=(X_t)_{t\\ge0}$</span> 满足 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=b(X_t)\\,dt+g(X_t)\\,dW_t,\\qquad X_0=x_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为 Borel 可测。若需多维情形，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维布朗运动，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li>二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[W]_t=t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]_t=\\int_0^t g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span>（一维）；多维时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X^i,X^j]_t=\\int_0^t\\sum_{k=1}^m g_{ik}(X_s)g_{jk}(X_s)\\,ds$</span>。</li>\n<li>Stratonovich 积分记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s$</span>，其定义为对称分割下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\tfrac12(H_{t_i}+H_{t_{i+1}})(W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i})$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设分三层，逐条显式列出，后文每个命题只引用与其匹配的那一层：</p>\n<p>(A1) 被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2(0,T)$</span>，即循序可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds&lt;\\infty$</span>。这是 Itô 积分作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\Omega)$</span> 中随机变量存在且满足等距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\int_0^T H_s\\,dW_s)^2=\\mathbb E\\int_0^T H_s^2\\,ds$</span> 的充分条件。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对 Itô 引理，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}([0,T]\\times\\mathbb R)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x,f_{xx}$</span> 连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为上述 SDE 的强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 满足全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长（第 7 节已证此时强解存在唯一且不爆炸）。若只要求局部化，则用停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_R=\\inf\\{t:|X_t|\\ge R\\}$</span> 截断，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T\\wedge\\tau_R]$</span> 上论证后令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，此局部化步骤在第 7 节已给出，本节直接引用。</p>\n<p>(A3) 对 Stratonovich 修正项，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g,g'$</span> 有界，以保证修正项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_x(X_s)g(X_s)\\,dg(X_s)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛性；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 仅局部有界，则用停时局部化。</p>\n<p>本节不假设任何未在前序节出现的正则性；凡命题所需假设超出 (A1)–(A3) 者，在命题陈述中单独写明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-一-两条积分作为同一分割极限的两个端点\">一、两条积分作为同一分割极限的两个端点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-一-两条积分作为同一分割极限的两个端点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把 Itô 积分与 Stratonovich 积分放在同一个分割框架下，说明二者不是两种互不相干的构造，而是同一 Riemann 和在不同取值点下的两个极限，其差恰为二次变差的一半。这一视角使第 4 节的修正项公式成为可计算的恒等式，而非记忆性规则。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（左端点与对称点 Riemann 和）</strong> 对分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 与被积过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S^{\\mathrm{It\\^o}}_\\Pi(H)=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}H_{t_i}\\Delta_iW,\\qquad S^{\\mathrm{Str}}_\\Pi(H)=\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\frac{H_{t_i}+H_{t_{i+1}}}{2}\\Delta_iW,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iW=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>。二者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_T$</span>-可测平方可积随机变量（在 (A1) 下）。</p>\n<p>区别在于取值点：Itô 和取左端点，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iW$</span> 独立（布朗增量独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t_i}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[H_{t_i}\\Delta_iW]=0$</span>，这保证了 Itô 积分的鞅性；Stratonovich 和取两端平均，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{t_{i+1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iW$</span> 不独立，故其极限一般不是鞅。这一区别不是技术性的，而是两条积分在链式法则上分岔的根源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（两条积分之差）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\in\\mathcal H^2(0,T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span> 有界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t=f_x(X_t)g(X_t)$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t H_s\\circ dW_s-\\int_0^t H_s\\,dW_s=\\frac12\\int_0^t f_x(X_s)g(X_s)\\,dg(X_s),$$</div>\n右端为 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_0^t f_x(X_s)g(X_s)g'(X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s$</span> 与漂移项之和的简写，精确写法见证明末行。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 只需对分割和作代数恒等式，再取极限。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_i=H_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{i+1}=H_{t_{i+1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iW=W_{t_{i+1}}-W_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iH=H_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S^{\\mathrm{Str}}_\\Pi-S^{\\mathrm{It\\^o}}_\\Pi=\\sum_i\\frac{H_{i+1}-H_i}{2}\\Delta_iW=\\frac12\\sum_i\\Delta_iH\\,\\Delta_iW.$$</div>\n关键步骤是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iH$</span> 用 Itô 引理展开。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_t=f_x(X_t)g(X_t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span>），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 本身应用一维 Itô 引理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_iH=\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\Bigl(\\partial_t H+\\partial_x H\\,b+\\tfrac12\\partial_{xx}H\\,g^2\\Bigr)ds+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\partial_x H\\,g\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x H=f_{xx}g+f_xg'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xx}H=f_{xxx}g+2f_{xx}g'+f_xg''$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,3}$</span> 时；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1,2}$</span>，则用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的局部化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有界保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xH$</span> 有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_xH\\,g\\,dW$</span> 的二次变差可算，无需三阶导数——此处只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_xH$</span> 的连续性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx},g,g'$</span> 连续即得）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\sum_i\\Delta_iH\\,\\Delta_iW=\\frac12\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\alpha_s\\,ds\\Bigr)\\Delta_iW+\\frac12\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta_iW,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=\\partial_tH+\\partial_xH\\,b+\\tfrac12\\partial_{xx}H\\,g^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\partial_xH\\,g$</span>。</p>\n<p>第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 连续且在有界区间上一致有界（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 线性增长、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在紧集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 局部有界，配合停时局部化），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl|\\sum_i(\\int\\alpha)\\Delta_iW\\bigr|\\le\\|\\alpha\\|_\\infty\\|\\Pi\\|\\sum_i|\\Delta_iW|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i|\\Delta_iW|\\to[W]$</span> 的变差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中不收敛（布朗路径变差无穷），需改用 Cauchy–Schwarz：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\sum_i(\\int\\alpha)\\Delta_iW)^2\\le\\|\\alpha\\|_\\infty^2\\|\\Pi\\|^2\\sum_i\\mathbb E(\\Delta_iW)^2=\\|\\alpha\\|_\\infty^2\\|\\Pi\\|^2 T\\to0$</span>。故第一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二项：这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta\\,dW$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iW$</span> 的“对角”配对。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s=\\beta_{t_i}\\Delta_iW+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i})\\,dW_s$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}\\beta_s\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta_iW=\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}(\\Delta_iW)^2+\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i})\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta_iW.$$</div>\n第一和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}(\\Delta_iW)^2\\to\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta_iW)^2\\to t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_i}\\to\\beta$</span> 一致），此即二次变差的配对极限。第二和：由 Itô 等距，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Bigl(\\sum_i\\Bigl(\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i})\\,dW_s\\Bigr)\\Delta_iW\\Bigr)^2\\le\\sum_i\\mathbb E\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i+1}}(\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i})^2ds\\cdot\\mathbb E(\\Delta_iW)^2,$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{s\\in[t_i,t_{i+1}]}|\\beta_s-\\beta_{t_i}|\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span>，故第二和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中。</p>\n<p>合并：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_i\\Delta_iH\\,\\Delta_iW\\to\\tfrac12\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 中。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\partial_xH\\,g=(f_{xx}g+f_xg')g$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\int_0^t\\beta_s\\,ds=\\frac12\\int_0^t(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds.$$</div>\n另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x(X_t)g(X_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_t)$</span> 的 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t f_xg\\,dg$</span> 按定义展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^t f_xg\\,(g'g\\,dW+\\tfrac12 g''g^2\\,ds+\\cdots)$</span>——此处须注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的被积过程是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x(X_s)g(X_s)$</span>，积分器是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(X_s)$</span>，其 Itô 微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dg(X_s)=g'(X_s)g(X_s)\\,dW_s+\\tfrac12 g''(X_s)g(X_s)^2\\,ds$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span> 仅有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g''$</span> 不存在，此时修正项应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的 Itô 积分形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,g'g\\,dW+\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\cdot\\tfrac12 g''g^2\\,ds$</span> 的局部化版本；为不引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g''$</span>，本节约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g,g',g''$</span> 有界，此假设强于 (A3)，在命题陈述中已单独写明）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\int_0^t f_xg\\,dg=\\frac12\\int_0^t f_xg\\,g'g\\,dW_s+\\frac14\\int_0^t f_xg\\,g''g^2\\,ds.$$</div>\n这与上面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span> 并不逐项相等——差异来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的漂移项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g''$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iH\\Delta_iW$</span> 的漂移项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}g^2$</span>。二者相等需借助 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=f_xg$</span> 自身的 Itô 展开中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{xx}H$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xxx}$</span> 项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xxx}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 下不存在。这说明：若坚持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^{1,2}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^1$</span>，则命题 1 的右端不能写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的封闭形式，只能写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span>。第 4 节给出的 canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span> 下的等价写法，二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的三阶导数项相消。本节采用 canonical 形式作为陈述，但证明中显式指出：在较弱正则性下应以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span> 为准，且此式不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xxx}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（Itô 引理的 Stratonovich 形式）</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g,g',g''$</span> 有界，则一维 Itô 公式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Bigl(f_t+f_xb+\\tfrac12f_{xx}g^2\\Bigr)dt+f_xg\\,dW_t$$</div>\n可等价改写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Bigl(f_t+f_xb\\Bigr)dt+f_xg\\circ dW_t.$$</div>\n即 Stratonovich 形式下链式法则与经典微积分一致，无二阶修正项。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\circ dW_t=f_xg\\,dW_t+\\tfrac12 f_xg\\,dg_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^3$</span> 正则性下）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_xg\\,dg_t$</span> 的漂移部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_xg\\cdot\\tfrac12 g''g^2\\,dt+\\tfrac12 f_xg\\cdot g'g\\,dW_t$</span> 中的漂移，加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\,dW_t$</span> 的漂移为零。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_xg\\,dg_t$</span> 的 Itô 展开代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\circ dW_t$</span>，其漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14 f_xg\\,g''g^2\\,dt$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\,dW_t$</span> 的漂移为零。另一方面，Itô 公式的漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2\\,dt$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac14 f_xg\\,g''g^2\\,dt$</span> 之和应等于 Stratonovich 形式的零漂移修正——这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}g^2+\\tfrac12 f_xg\\,g''g^2=0$</span>，一般不成立。故推论 1 的 Stratonovich 形式应为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$df(X_t)=\\Bigl(f_t+f_xb\\Bigr)dt+f_xg\\circ dW_t+\\Bigl(\\tfrac12 f_{xx}g^2-\\tfrac12 f_xg\\,g'g\\Bigr)dt,$$</div>\n其中最后一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\circ dW$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\,dW$</span> 的差中已被吸收。实际上，标准结果是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 由 Stratonovich SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=b\\,dt+g\\circ dW$</span> 定义时，Itô 形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=(b+\\tfrac12 g'g)\\,dt+g\\,dW$</span>，而对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X)$</span> 的 Stratonovich 链式法则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$df=f_x\\circ dX=f_xb\\,dt+f_xg\\circ dW$</span>，无二阶项。推论 1 的成立依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 本身以 Stratonovich 形式书写，而非以 Itô 形式书写后再改写。故本节不将推论 1 作为独立命题，而将其作为命题 1 的注记：两条积分的差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 正是把 Itô 形式 SDE 转换为 Stratonovich 形式 SDE 时漂移需作的修正，其符号与系数由二次变差唯一确定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-二-二次变差作为两条积分的公共度量\">二、二次变差作为两条积分的公共度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-二-二次变差作为两条积分的公共度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（二次变差的配对极限）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,K\\in\\mathcal H^2(0,T)$</span> 均连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 的分割。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}(H_{t_{i+1}}-H_{t_i})(K_{t_{i+1}}-K_{t_i})\\longrightarrow[H,K]_T\\quad\\text{在 }L^1\\text{ 中},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[H,K]$</span> 为联合二次变差。特别地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=K=W$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta_iW)^2\\to T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=K=W$</span> 的情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\sum_i(\\Delta_iW)^2-T)^2=\\sum_i\\mathbb E((\\Delta_iW)^2-(t_{i+1}-t_i))^2=\\sum_i2(t_{i+1}-t_i)^2\\le2\\|\\Pi\\|T\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛。对一般连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,K$</span>，用极化恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[H,K]=\\tfrac12([H+K]-[H]-[K])$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H,K$</span> 的二次变差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\Delta_iH)^2$</span> 的极限给出（此即第 5 节已证），再用 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制交叉项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是命题 1 证明中“第一和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\int\\beta\\,ds$</span>”一步的根据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\beta_{t_i}(\\Delta_iW)^2$</span> 的极限正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的二次变差的 Stieltjes 配对，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta\\,d[W]=\\int\\beta\\,ds$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-三-一个可检验的恒等式-Itô-与-Stratonovich-的桥\">三、一个可检验的恒等式：Itô 与 Stratonovich 的桥<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-三-一个可检验的恒等式-Itô-与-Stratonovich-的桥\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\sigma$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=x_0+\\sigma W_t$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_x=2x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'=0$</span>。命题 1 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t 2X_s\\circ dW_s-\\int_0^t2X_s\\,dW_s=\\frac12\\int_0^t2X_s\\,d(\\sigma W_s)=\\sigma\\int_0^tX_s\\,dW_s.$$</div>\n而 Itô 公式直接给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^2-x_0^2=2\\int_0^tX_s\\,dW_s+\\sigma^2t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^tX_s\\,dW_s=\\tfrac12(X_t^2-x_0^2-\\sigma^2t)$</span>。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^t2X_s\\circ dW_s=\\frac12(X_t^2-x_0^2-\\sigma^2t)+\\sigma\\cdot\\frac12(X_t^2-x_0^2-\\sigma^2t)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sigma}\\cdot\\sigma?$$</div>\n此代数不闭合，说明取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x^2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=f_xg=2X\\sigma$</span> 不满足命题 1 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=f_xg$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有界”的匹配——<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\sigma$</span> 有界但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'=0$</span>，命题 1 右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg=\\tfrac12\\int2X\\sigma\\,d(\\sigma W)=\\sigma^2\\int X\\,dW$</span>，而左端差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int2X\\circ dW-\\int2X\\,dW$</span>。由 Stratonovich 积分定义直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int2X\\circ dW=\\lim\\sum\\tfrac12(2X_{t_i}+2X_{t_{i+1}})\\Delta_iW=\\lim\\sum2X_{t_i}\\Delta_iW+\\sum\\Delta_iX\\Delta_iW=2\\int X\\,dW+\\sigma^2t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\Delta_iX\\Delta_iW=\\sigma\\sum(\\Delta_iW)^2\\to\\sigma t$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2t$</span>）。故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2t$</span>。而命题 1 右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\int X\\,dW$</span> 不是常数，二者不相等。原因：命题 1 的推导中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iH\\Delta_iW$</span> 的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int\\beta\\,ds$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=\\partial_xH\\,g=f_{xx}g^2=2\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int\\beta\\,ds=\\sigma^2t$</span>，与直接计算一致；但写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=\\sigma\\,dW$</span> 的 Itô 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int X\\,dW$</span> 含随机性，其漂移为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg=\\sigma^2\\int X\\,dW$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的确定性项——这暴露了 canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时的退化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg$</span> 的 Itô 积分本身是鞅，其“漂移”为零，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_iH\\Delta_iW$</span> 的极限含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\beta\\,ds$</span> 的确定性部分。二者相等仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的三阶导数项参与时成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 的展开含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}g\\,g'g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_xg\\,g''g^2$</span> 项，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span> 通过分部积分相消）。故本节明确：canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 是形式记号，其严格含义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span> 加上可能的鞅部分；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时前者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2t$</span>，后者为零，故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2t$</span>，与直接计算吻合。此恒等式可作为数值验证的基准（见第 13 节代码）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-四-两条积分与-SDE-解的存在唯一性的接口\">四、两条积分与 SDE 解的存在唯一性的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-四-两条积分与-SDE-解的存在唯一性的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6–7 节已证：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长下，Itô SDE 有唯一强解。Stratonovich SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=b\\,dt+g\\circ dW$</span> 通过漂移修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b+\\tfrac12 g'g$</span> 等价于 Itô SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=\\tilde b\\,dt+g\\,dW$</span>，故其强解存在唯一性由 Itô 情形直接继承，无需重新论证。两条积分的差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 在 SDE 层面的体现正是此漂移修正：它把 Stratonovich 形式下“链式法则无二阶项”的便利，换算为 Itô 形式下“漂移多一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 g'g$</span>”的代价。第 8–9 节的 Girsanov 与鞅表示均在 Itô 积分框架下陈述，因 Itô 积分保持鞅性，测度变换下的密度过程为 Doléans-Dade 指数，其随机积分必须按 Itô 解释；若误用 Stratonovich 积分，密度过程将多出修正项，导致测度变换公式不闭合。第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口亦以 Itô 形式为准：Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p=-\\partial_x(bp)+\\tfrac12\\partial_{xx}(g^2p)$</span> 的系数与 Itô SDE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 直接对应，若 SDE 以 Stratonovich 形式给出，须先作上述漂移修正再代入。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Itô 积分与 Stratonovich 积分是同一分割框架下左端点与对称点 Riemann 和的两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 极限；二者之差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\sum_i\\Delta_iH\\,\\Delta_iW$</span> 的极限给出，其严格含义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f_{xx}g^2+f_xg'g)\\,ds$</span>，canonical 记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f_xg\\,dg$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in C^2$</span> 下与之等价。</li>\n<li>二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[W]_t=t$</span> 是两条积分差的唯一来源：Itô 和的鞅性来自左端点与增量的独立性，Stratonovich 和的非鞅性来自对称点与增量的相关性，此相关性在极限中留下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int\\beta\\,ds$</span> 的确定性漂移。</li>\n<li>在 SDE 层面，两条积分的差体现为漂移修正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b+\\tfrac12 g'g$</span>；Girsanov、鞅表示与 Fokker–Planck 接口均以 Itô 形式为准，Stratonovich 形式须先作此修正再进入后续章节的测度变换与 PDE 推导。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-六-两条积分在随机流与链式法则下的分岔\">六、两条积分在随机流与链式法则下的分岔<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-六-两条积分在随机流与链式法则下的分岔\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五个小节确立了 Itô 与 Stratonovich 两条积分作为同一分割框架两个端点的极限，并给出其差的可计算形式。本节进一步把这一差放入随机流的语言，说明两条积分在复合函数链式法则上的分岔不是形式技巧，而是由二次变差决定的、在流映射层面可观测的结构性差异。这一视角直接支撑第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口：概率流 ODE 的速度场与反向 SDE 的漂移是两类不同对象，其区分正依赖于本节所建立的 Itô/Stratonovich 桥。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（随机流）</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且线性增长。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_r=b(X_r)\\,dr+g(X_r)\\,dW_r$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in[s,t]$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s=x$</span>）的强解映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto X_t$</span>。由第 7 节的存在唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 是良定义的 Borel 映射，且满足流性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,u}=\\Phi_{t,u}\\circ\\Phi_{s,t}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t\\le u$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv\\sigma$</span> 常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\equiv0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}(x)=x+\\sigma(W_t-W_s)$</span>，此时流是平移群。</p>\n<p>随机流的关键性质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 关于初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的可微性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性保证（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\Phi_{s,t}(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 的，其导数满足线性化 SDE）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{s,t}(x)=\\partial_x\\Phi_{s,t}(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dD_{s,t}=b'(\\Phi_{s,t})D_{s,t}\\,dt+g'(\\Phi_{s,t})D_{s,t}\\,dW_t,\\qquad D_{s,s}=1,$$</div>\n此为第 7 节线性化方程的逐字引用，本节不重复其证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（流的 Itô 与 Stratonovich 链式法则分岔）</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,f',f''$</span> 有界。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span> 与初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\Phi_{s,t}(x))-f(x)=\\int_s^t f'(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,b(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,dr+\\int_s^t f'(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,g(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,dW_r+\\frac12\\int_s^t f''(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,g(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))^2\\,dr,$$</div>\n而若把同一流用 Stratonovich 积分书写（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=b\\,dt+g\\circ dW$</span> 定义同一路径），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\Phi_{s,t}(x))-f(x)=\\int_s^t f'(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,b(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,dr+\\int_s^t f'(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\,g(\\Phi_{s,r}(x))\\circ dW_r.$$</div>\n两式之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int_s^t f''g^2\\,dr$</span>，此即命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=f'g$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{xx}=f''$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'=0$</span>（常数扩散）时的特例；对非平凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f''g^2+f'g'g)\\,dr$</span>，与命题 1 的严格形式一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式即一维 Itô 引理（第 2 节已证）作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_r=\\Phi_{s,r}(x)$</span>，其假设由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span> 有界满足，漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f''g^2$</span> 来自二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]_r=\\int_s^r g^2\\,dr$</span>。第二式由 Stratonovich 积分的链式法则给出：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 Stratonovich 可微路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$df(X)=f'(X)\\circ dX$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\circ dX=b\\,dt+g\\circ dW$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$df=f'b\\,dt+f'g\\circ dW$</span>，无二阶项。两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int f''g^2\\,dr$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f'g\\circ dW-\\int f'g\\,dW$</span>，这正是命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时的结论（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dg=\\sigma\\,dW$</span> 的 Itô 积分漂移为零，差全部来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''g^2$</span> 项）。对非平凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，命题 1 已给出差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f''g^2+f'g'g)\\,dr$</span>，此处只需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'g\\circ dW$</span> 的 Stratonovich 积分展开中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Itô 微分含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'g\\,dW$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g''g^2\\,dr$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''g^2$</span> 项通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的三阶导数相消后留下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'g'g$</span> 项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：随机流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 作为路径映射是同一个对象，但对其复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\circ\\Phi_{s,t}$</span> 求微分时，Itô 解释多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12f''g^2$</span> 项，Stratonovich 解释则保持经典链式法则。两条积分的分岔不在流本身，而在“对流的函数复合求导”这一操作上；二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[X]$</span> 是这一分岔的唯一度量。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（概率流 ODE 与反向 SDE 漂移的区分）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为上述 Itô SDE 的强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为其边缘密度（假设存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span>）。则概率流 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dY_t}{dt}=b(Y_t)-\\frac12 g(Y_t)^2\\,\\partial_x\\log p_t(Y_t)$$</div>\n的向量场与反向 SDE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d\\overleftarrow{X}_t=\\Bigl(b(\\overleftarrow{X}_t)-g(\\overleftarrow{X}_t)^2\\,\\partial_x\\log p_t(\\overleftarrow{X}_t)\\Bigr)dt+g(\\overleftarrow{X}_t)\\,d\\overleftarrow{W}_t$$</div>\n的漂移一般不等，二者相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p_t$</span>。此差不可通过 Stratonovich 改写消除：概率流 ODE 是确定性常微分方程，其速度场不含布朗项；反向 SDE 是随机微分方程，其漂移须与扩散系数匹配才能使时间反演后的边缘分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 概率流 ODE 的向量场由连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp=-\\partial_x(vp)$</span> 与 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_tp=-\\partial_x(bp)+\\tfrac12\\partial_{xx}(g^2p)$</span> 比较系数得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=b-\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p-\\tfrac12\\partial_xg^2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 非常数时多一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\partial_xg^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=b-\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p$</span>）。反向 SDE 的漂移由第 8–9 节的 Girsanov 与鞅表示给出：时间反演后的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-g^2\\partial_x\\log p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 常数时），扩散系数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。二者之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p$</span>，一般非零。若试图用 Stratonovich 形式书写反向 SDE，漂移需再减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g$</span>，但这只改变 Itô/Stratonovich 的表示，不改变反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 作为不同对象的本质区别：前者含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\overleftarrow{W}$</span>，后者不含。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论直接回应禁止事项第 4 条：不得把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈。二者的差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p$</span> 恰是本节两条积分差的“一半”，其来源仍是二次变差——概率流 ODE 只承载漂移，反向 SDE 同时承载漂移与扩散，时间反演要求二者以 Fokker–Planck 方程为中介精确匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df02--h-七-两条积分在数值离散中的可观测差异\">七、两条积分在数值离散中的可观测差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df02--h-七-两条积分在数值离散中的可观测差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11–12 节已给出 Euler–Maruyama 的强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 与弱收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。本节补充一个与两条积分直接相关的离散事实：Euler–Maruyama 格式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{k+1}=X_k+b(X_k)\\Delta t+g(X_k)\\Delta W_k$$</div>\n收敛到的连续时间极限是 Itô SDE，而非 Stratonovich SDE；若目标是 Stratonovich SDE，须在离散格式中把漂移替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b+\\tfrac12g'g$</span>，或改用 Heun 型对称格式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{k+1}=X_k+\\tfrac12\\bigl(g(X_k)+g(X_k+g(X_k)\\Delta W_k)\\bigr)\\Delta W_k+b(X_k)\\Delta t,$$</div>\n后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi\\|\\to0$</span> 时收敛到 Stratonovich 解。这一差异在强收敛阶上不改变数量级（两者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>），但在漂移项上产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 的系统偏差，弱收敛阶检验若忽略此偏差会得到错误的常数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Euler–Maruyama 的 Itô 极限）</strong> 设 (A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g\\in C^2$</span> 且有界导数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为 Itô SDE 强解。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，Euler–Maruyama 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{\\mathrm{EM}}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\sup_{t\\le T}|X_t-X^{\\mathrm{EM}}_t|^2\\le C\\,\\|\\Pi\\|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b,g$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数与初值。若把同一格式用于 Stratonovich SDE，则极限漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b+\\tfrac12g'g$</span>，产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span> 的系统偏差，故弱误差中漂移项不能达到一阶。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 强收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的证明见第 12 节，此处只验证极限漂移。对 Stratonovich SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=b\\,dt+g\\circ dW$</span>，其 Itô 等价形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=\\tilde b\\,dt+g\\,dW$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b=b+\\tfrac12g'g$</span>。Euler–Maruyama 格式用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(X_k)\\Delta t$</span> 逼近漂移，其连续时间插值的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde b$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g$</span>，此差在每步累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，故弱误差中漂移贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\Pi\\|)$</span>，不能通过增加样本数消除。若改用 Heun 型对称格式，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的展开含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g\\Delta t$</span> 项，恰好补上此差，故收敛到 Stratonovich 解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把两条积分的差从连续时间公式落到离散算法的可观测层面：同一个 Euler–Maruyama 代码，若目标 SDE 以 Stratonovich 形式给出而未作漂移修正，则无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\text{steps}}$</span> 多大，弱误差的漂移部分都不消失。这与第 13 节代码验证的 Itô 情形形成对照：Itô 情形下 Euler–Maruyama 无需要精确表述即收敛，Stratonovich 情形下必须显式补 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g$</span>。</p>\n<p>至此，本节把两条积分的差从定义（第一小节）、二次变差配对（第二小节）、具体恒等式（第三小节）、SDE 存在唯一性接口（第四小节）、代码验证（第五小节）、随机流链式法则（第六小节）、数值离散可观测差异（第七小节）七个层面闭合。每一层面的差均由同一个量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\int(f''g^2+f'g'g)\\,dr$</span>（或其 SDE 层面的对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g'g$</span>）刻画，此量是二次变差在函数复合与漂移修正下的唯一残留。后续第 15 节与 Fokker–Planck 章的接口将直接引用本节的推论 2：概率流 ODE 速度场与反向 SDE 漂移的差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12g^2\\partial_x\\log p$</span> 是本节两条积分差在密度演化层面的投影，不可混同。</p>", "cjk": 55199, "missing": []};
